window.FWN_LADY_GU_TOO_WEAK_CHAPTERS=(window.FWN_LADY_GU_TOO_WEAK_CHAPTERS||[]).concat([{"number":301,"title":"Chapter 301 - Spend A Billion Yuan First!","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Madam Yao’s face darkened. “Mengqing, the violin! It’s going to be auctioned soon. You have to take it. Otherwise, not only will our Yao family not be able to give that out as a gift but we’ll also lose all our reputation!”","Yao Mengqi also became serious. “Yes, we have to. We’ve already said that we’ll give Xue Liang a gift. If we don’t get it, Xue Liang will definitely be angry!”","Yao Mengqing was instantly on guard. Her mind was filled with the violin.","Her expression was gloomy. “Qiao Xi is obviously going against me. As long as I make a bid, she’ll definitely bid higher. She has Gu Zheng behind her, so it doesn’t matter how much she spends. But how can the Yao family’s wealth compare to Ah Zheng’s?”","Madam Yao’s face turned pale. She did not expect her gentle daughter to look so vicious.","Yao Mengqing could tell that Madam Yao was shocked. She took a deep breath and forced herself to calm down. “Mom, it looks like I won’t be able to bid for the violin anymore. I can only donate 20 million yuan in the name of the Yao family after the auction.”","“No matter what the next auction item is, Qiao Xi will definitely compete with me. Of course, our wealth can’t compare to the Gu family’s financial resources, but I can’t let others think that we’re not bidding because we can’t bear to part with the money. If we donate 20 million yuan after this, it won’t be embarrassing even if news of this gets out. However, we’ll have no chance of compensating Xue Liang.”","Yao Mengqing’s gaze was vicious as she said in a low voice, “However, I’ll make Qiao Xi pay a painful price this time!”","Qiao Xi targeted her in public and caused her to lose all her dignity. How could she swallow this?","Didn’t that b*tch like to snatch her things? Then she would let Qiao Xi snatch them!","Over 100 million was nothing to Gu Zheng. He would help Qiao Xi pay.","What about 200 million and 300 million, then? Would Gu Zheng be willing to be a spendthrift?","If Qiao Xi spent 200 million on this 5 million yuan violin, Gu Zheng would definitely think that she was stupid and start to hate her.","Yao Mengqing curled her lips and smiled coldly.","‘Qiao Xi, just wait and see! Our game has just begun!’","...","On the other side, Gu Yao muttered softly, “Gu Zheng said you like this violin? You even have such a hobby?”","Qiao Xi glanced indifferently at him. “...”","Gu Yao said, “Wow, do you really know how to play? You look uneducated, but you can even play the violin?”","Qiao Xi rolled her eyes at him. “I’m not bidding for this violin.”","Gu Yao was a little stunned as he asked in surprise, “Why? I heard that the Yao family is going to bid for this violin to give to Xue Liang. If he accepts it, it’ll mean that he has forgiven the Yao family and the others will look up to the Yao family as well.”","Gu Yao frowned. “You’ve already snatched everything else. Why miss out on this one? You have to snatch it!”","Gu Zheng glanced at Gu Yao casually.","Qiao Xi said slowly, “I’ve spent all my money.”","Gu Yao immediately shouted, “Gu Zheng! Your wife likes this violin. Aren’t you going to buy it for her? It turns out that she’s been spending her own money. You’re too petty!”","Without waiting for Gu Zheng’s reply, Gu Yao said righteously, “Qiao Xi! Just raise the placard and I’ll pay! Just take it as a gift from me. No matter how much the Yao family bids, snatch it from them! I’m so rich, so why should I be afraid of the Yao family?”","Qiao Xi looked at him in surprise.","“Are you sure?”","Gu Yao was stunned. He initially did not have any money, but his scumbag father had asked Lu Yan to inherit the Gu family’s shares. When the time came, he would inherit the shares of Gu Corporation.","However, if that was the case, the Gu family would no longer belong to Gu Zheng. The Gu family would chase Gu Zheng out and not leave him with a single cent.","Hence, Gu Yao decided that from now on, he would be a spendthrift. He would squander all the Gu family’s money and not leave anything for Lu Yan. He would first spend a billion yuan to liven things up!","Gu Yao was silent. After a moment, he said, “Don’t worry about spending it! I have money! Don’t worry!”","Gu Zheng sneered.","Gu Yao was about to retort when he suddenly held back, his heart aching.","Sob, sob, sob. Gu Zheng was so pitiful. The family business that he had worked hard for all these years was going to be snatched away by someone else. He was still so calm as if everything had nothing to do with him.","This fool!"]},{"number":302,"title":"Chapter 302 - Crazy Increase In Price","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Gu Zheng was calm. He hated Huang Lilan very much, but at this moment, he was glad that Huang Lilan was around because she had given birth to Gu Yao.","Gu Zheng asked, “You don’t want the violin?”","Qiao Xi had an indifferent expression. “I do want to bid for it, but I won’t pay for it. In the end, this violin will still belong to me.”","Gu Zheng’s expression was amused. Qiao Xi had said that she would not pay, so the person paying would probably not be Xue Liang. In that case, it could only be Yao Mengqing.","Yao Mengqing would pay for it, but the violin would be given to Qiao Xi in the end?","Gu Zheng was sure that Yao Mengqing was not that kind-hearted. He had already understood the situation.","The starting bid for the violin was 5 million. Everyone was uninterested, but they still successfully increased the bid to 10 million.","At this moment, Yao Mengqing started raising her placard.","Qiao Xi specially raised her eyes to stare at Yao Mengqing. Everyone knew that Miss Qiao and Miss Yao were in conflict.","In next to no time, Qiao Xi started bidding as well. “20 million!”","The entire venue was silent.","As expected, the bid went up to 20 million!","Did Qiao Xi think that saying a few more numbers would tire everyone else out? Did she really have to increase the number by that much?","Violin was indeed a priceless treasure for musicians, but for ordinary people, it was just a decoration.","Although the violin was worth collecting, be it the materials or the meaning, it was at most worth 15 million yuan. 20 million was already beyond expectations.","Furthermore... if the two of them were to compete, the price would be even higher.","Everyone put down their placards and stared fixedly at Yao Mengqing and Qiao Xi.","Qiao Xi had an indifferent expression but the corners of her mouth were curled up into a smile. She seemed as if she was determined to succeed.","Everyone thought that Yao Mengqing had given up because she thought that the price was too high, just like before.","The next second...","Yao Mengqing said, “30 million!”","Everyone was dumbfounded!","Unexpectedly, Yao Mengqing was willing to spend so much money for a violin?","Qiao Xi was stunned for a moment as well, and her face was filled with disbelief.","Immediately after, Yao Mengqi said loudly, “My sister is bidding for this violin because she wants to give it to Xue Liang! Hence, she definitely won’t give it up!”","Yao Mengqing said gently, “Qi Qi, don’t be like this. If Xi Xi likes it, we’ll continue bidding. The highest bidder will get it. It’s just that there’s a misunderstanding between Xue Liang and me. I heard that he likes this violin, so I want to bid for it to give it to him.”","Yao Mengqi snorted. “It’s all because of Qiao Xi that we offended Xue Liang. It was she and that man who harmed our Yao family!”","Qiao Xi raised her eyes to glance at them and paid no attention to them at all as she continued bidding. “40 million!”","50 million?","Yao Mengqing revealed a sinister smile.","As expected, Qiao Xi continued to raise the price. She wanted to get this violin at all costs.","Anyway, she was spending Gu Zheng’s money, so she would not care about the gains or losses.","Yao Mengqing narrowed her eyes. She was not in a rush to raise the bid. She was thinking about how to increase the price.","It was because everything Qiao Xi bid for was originally hers. She was deliberately targeting her!","Yao Mengqing smiled. Even if she directly called out a price of 300 million, Qiao Xi would continue to raise the price. Then, she would withdraw safely. As a result, Qiao Xi would have to get the violin at an astronomical price.","Seeing how stupid she was, Ah Zheng would definitely loathe her. He might not even pay for her anymore.","Yao Mengqing pretended to be troubled. “50 million.”","She looked apologetic. “Xi Xi, I’m sorry. I really need this violin.”","Qiao Xi’s brows raised. “Then it depends on who’s more capable. 60 million.”","Everyone widened their eyes at this scene. Following that, Yao Mengqing increased the bid to 70 million.","Qiao Xi frowned. “100 million.”","Damn! This woman had gone mad!","Qiao Xi must be crazy to directly increase the bid by 30 million!","Yao Mengqing looked at the situation before her and was extremely proud in her heart. She wanted Qiao Xi to faint.","Her tone was gentle. “Xi Xi, in that case, I can only risk my life to play this game with you. 120 million!”","Utter shock!","So much money? Just for a violin?","Immediately after, Qiao Xi raised her bid again. “200 million..”"]},{"number":303,"title":"Chapter 303 - Sky-high Price Of 300 Million","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Gu Yao could not sit still anymore.","Earlier, didn’t Qiao Xi say that she was not interested? Now, the bid had increased to 200 million.","Yao Mengqing curled the corners of her lips. She was sure that Qiao Xi had gone mad. In her eyes, money was just a number. She wanted to get this violin no matter what the price was!","Since that was the case, then she would increase the price one last time and push Qiao Xi to the edge of the abyss before she stopped.","At that time, if Qiao Xi said no, it would mean that she was disrespecting the charity auction. She would also be mocked by the entire upper-class society. She would not be able to raise her head in Li City.","If Qiao Xi was smart, she could only grit her teeth and endure it. She would have to obediently take out this enormous sum of money.","Seeing that the gavel was about to fall, Yao Mengqing raised her placard. “300 million!”","At this moment, everyone held their breaths as their gazes moved between Qiao Xi and Yao Mengqing.","Yao Mengqing also looked at Qiao Xi. She did not raise her placard but smiled meaningfully.","The venue was silent. The exclamation of ‘300 million’ was still reverberating in the hall.","The competition between Yao Mengqing and Qiao Xi was truly astounding.","Although both families were not short of money, it was really scary for them to raise the price to 300 million just for a violin.","Everyone felt that 300 million was not the end. According to Qiao Xi’s performance earlier, she would continue to increase the bid. Yao Mengqing thought so too.","The auctioneer even forgot to hit the gavel as he stared at Qiao Xi, waiting for her to raise the bid.","She remained silent and sat there quietly, ignoring the burning gazes of the crowd.","Everyone was anxious. Why was Miss Qiao not raising her placard?","Yao Mengqing’s heart thumped as if she had fallen into an ice cellar.","She looked at Qiao Xi’s nonchalant appearance and felt very uneasy.","After a while, Qiao Xi still did not speak.","Yao Mengqi immediately reacted and questioned loudly, “Qiao Xi! You’re not bidding anymore?”","Everyone’s gaze landed on the Yao family again. Yao Mengqing’s face was pale, and her heart was beating furiously.","Qiao Xi calmly took a sip of tea and said unhurriedly, “Of course, I want it...”","Yao Mengqing’s expression eased up for a moment. She knew that Qiao Xi would continue to increase the bid. So long as Qiao Xi increased the bid, she would immediately give up and show a regretful expression.","However, Qiao Xi’s next words caused her hair to stand on end!","“But the price is too high. I... don’t have that kind of money.”","Qiao Xi seemed to be very regretful and sighed. “I already spent a lot of money earlier, so I can’t spend more than 300 million this time. I originally thought that I would get it at 200 million, but who knew that Miss Yao would raise it to 300 million?","“You must really want this violin, Miss Yao. I’ll give it to you, then.”","Yao Mengqing felt her mind buzz and she instantly went blank.","Her mind was filled with the words, ‘She’s not bidding for it anymore?’","If Qiao Xi really did not want to continue, then she had to fork out 300 million to buy this violin!","That was 300 million!","The Yao family was already in a precarious situation now. They could not fork out 300 million yuan at all. Even if they could, the Yao family would definitely suffer.","Yao Mengqing’s body trembled uncontrollably. Her eyes were empty.","Qiao Xi smiled indifferently. Yao Mengqing was still too inexperienced to play tricks with her.","Did she really think she was stupid and could not tell what Yao Mengqing was thinking?","This 300 million yuan blow on the Yao family would be enough to make Yao Mengqing stop bothering her for a period of time.","Everyone’s eyes were on the Yao family. Madam Yao also realized the seriousness of the matter.","No! They could not take this 300 million!","Madam Yao suddenly stood up. “No! I don’t—”","Before she could finish, Qiao Xi stood up and applauded loudly. “Miss Yao, you’re really a beautiful and kind person. In order to donate to the children, you didn’t hesitate to spend 300 million on a violin. It’s really touching! I’m really unable to compare to you in terms of magnanimity. Miss Yao, you’re the model among the daughters of rich families! I hope everyone can be as selfless as you, Miss Yao!”","She even kicked Gu Yao. “Hurry up and clap!”","Gu Yao quickly stood up and shouted, “You’re right! The Yao family is really a role model for the rich!”","With the Gu family taking the lead, the others also stood up and applauded as well."]},{"number":304,"title":"Chapter 304 - Giving It To Someone Else","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","“Miss Yao, you’re really kind-hearted. You donated 300 million yuan. I’m really ashamed of my inferiority.”","“Miss Qiao has already donated more than 100 million. I’m sure Miss Yao won’t shirk her responsibility. They’re both so kind!”","At this moment, Gu Yao finally realized that Yao Mengqing was deliberately fighting with Qiao Xi for this bid.","If Qiao Xi had continued to raise the price, then she would have to spend over 300 million.","Gu Yao’s tone was cold. “Qiao Xi donated more than 100 million, while Sister Mengqing donated 300 million. Those children who are going to be saved will definitely remember your kind deeds.”","Yao Mengqing’s body was limp. She did not even have the strength to stand up.","If she went back on her word in public, she would definitely be mocked by everyone and her reputation in the upper-class society would be ruined.","No! She could not be hated!","300 million was indeed a very huge figure, but the Yao family’s reputation was also very important.","Yao Mengqing’s heart ached. However, she still forced out a smile and said with difficulty, “I’m very happy to be able to help the sick children.”","However, she was extremely regretful. This violin was worth 20 million at most, but she had spent 300 million to buy it. It was equivalent to throwing away 200 million for nothing!","Yao Mengqing never expected that Qiao Xi would trick her instead.","At this moment, she finally realized that this was all Qiao Xi’s scheme!","Yao Mengqing was so anxious that she was going crazy. She thought that she had to find someone to fork out this sum of money for her. She would pay as much as she could. The Yao family could not shoulder this huge sum of money alone.","At this moment, there was a commotion outside.","Everyone looked in the direction of the voice. The door was pushed open and a group of bodyguards rushed in. A man in a suit slowly walked in.","“It’s Xue Liang!” someone exclaimed.","“Painter Xue! I heard that he really wanted that violin! Unfortunately, it has already been taken by Miss Yao.”","Everyone said helplessly, but Gu Yao said loudly, “What’s there to pity? Sister Mengqing bought that violin for Xue Liang. Didn’t Yao Mengqi say so just now?”","Yao Mengqi had indeed said that they would give this violin to Xue Liang, but were they really going to spend 300 million to buy it for someone else?","Yao Mengqing’s expression was stiff and ugly.","Gu Yao continued to watch the show as he said, “Sister Mengqing said she likes Mr. Xue and his paintings very much. She knows that he likes this violin, so she bid for it at all costs just to give it to Mr. Xue.”","Gu Yao hurriedly walked forward and greeted Xue Liang. “Mr. Xue, you’re here at the right time.”","Yao Mengqing gritted her teeth with a ferocious expression.","Words were like water that had been poured out. If she denied it just like that, wouldn’t everyone laugh their heads off?","If she were mocked by the people of the upper-class society, how could she marry Gu Zheng in the future? She was the future Mrs. Gu and had to take care of her image. Otherwise, the Gu family and Gu Zheng would not accept her.","Yao Mengqing suppressed the anger in her heart and walked forward calmly. She smiled gently and said, “Hello, Mr. Xue.”","Xue Liang glanced at her and did not say anything.","At this point, Yao Mengqing had no way out. She could only use this 300 million to buy her reputation and let the entire Li City know that she was kind-hearted. She wanted to pretend to be a big shot.","Hence, she smiled. “Mr. Xue, the Yao family offended you in the past. I heard that you like this violin very much, so I took the initiative to bid for it and want to give it to you...”","Xue Liang had a calm expression. “Miss Yao, I can’t accept this violin that costs 300 million. If news of this gets out, they’ll think that I have a special relationship with the Yao family.”","Yao Mengqing looked at her surroundings. She had to give this violin away no matter what. It would not only earn her a good reputation but also make Xue Liang the backer of the Yao family.","This was the only way she could recover the Yao family’s losses.","Yao Mengqing gritted her teeth. “Mr. Xue, please accept it as a token of our Yao family’s appreciation. My younger sister offended your family previously, so we have to compensate you.","“Furthermore, we spent 300 million yuan to donate the money to the sick children, not for you. Please don’t feel pressured and accept this violin. Our Yao family has already apologized.”","Xue Liang smiled.. “Miss Yao, you’re really kind-hearted!”"]},{"number":305,"title":"Chapter 305 - You Know Qiao Xi?","paragraphs":["At this moment, Gu Yao said loudly, “Actually, Sister Mengqing just wanted to donate some money and bought a violin. There’s no need to feel pressured. Just take it as a toy and accept it! Sister Mengqing, those sick children will definitely remember you!”","From the beginning till the end, Gu Zheng, who was by his side, remained silent and expressionless.","Qiao Xi glanced at him and thought.","‘Gu Yao is really a quick-witted person! He knows how to praise Yao Mengqing. In this way, Yao Mengqing wanting to gift the violin is just an excuse. He made it seem as if her real motive is to donate, so Fourth Brother will naturally accept it. There would be no burden.","‘Gu Yao is so obedient! They’re both brothers, why isn’t this one saying anything?","‘The Yao family has been mocking me time and again. If Gu Zheng bought a few things and gave them to me in public, he would immediately shut them up!","‘But it doesn’t matter now. After all, I’ve dealt with the Yao family myself!’","Gu Zheng smirked.","It was not that he did not want to give these things to her, but he had been waiting.","The items auctioned were all arranged from low to high. The more valuable and rarer the items were, the more interested everyone was.","Moreover, he was here today for that mysterious item.","At this moment, Xue Liang nodded. “To be honest, I really want this violin. In that case, thank you, Miss Yao.”","Yao Mengqing was relieved.","Although she had lost a lot of money today, she could at least get Xue Liang’s forgiveness. It could be said that she had not made a wasted trip here. In the future, the Yao family’s future would be brighter, and it might even involve the arts.","The 300 million was not wasted after all. She would definitely be able to make up for it with Xue Liang.","As Yao Mengqing was thinking, Xue Liang suddenly said, “Miss Yao, if I may ask, can I give this violin to someone else?”","Yao Mengqing replied without hesitation, “No problem. Since I’ve given it to you, Mr. Xue, it’s yours. You can decide who you want to give it to. I heard that you’re giving it to your younger sister, right?”","Xue Liang’s eyes were filled with mockery. “Yes.”","At this moment, everyone was praising Yao Mengqing for being generous, selfless, and sincere. They even lamented how powerful the Yao family was. Even though they had spent 300 million to buy a violin, their expressions remained unchanged.","Hearing everyone’s praise, Madam Yao and Yao Mengqi finally smiled.","Although the family would definitely scold her when they got home tonight, they did not spend the 300 million yuan in vain. At least, they had gained something.","Yao Mengqi started feeling proud again and mocked loudly, “Qiao Xi! My sister won this violin at all costs to give it to Mr. Xue. What were your efforts for?”","Qiao Xi said unhurriedly, “I just like it. I’m indeed not as generous as you, Miss Yao. You gave away the violin you got for 300 million just like that.”","Yao Mengqing had a proud expression. It looked like Qiao Xi was ashamed of her inferiority as well.","However, the next second, Xue Liang said in surprise, “You know Qiao Xi?”","Previously, during the incident in the mall, Yao Mengqi thought that Qiao Xi was being kept as a mistress by Liang Pingchuan. Then, Xue Liang stood up for Liang Pingchuan and chased the Yao family out of the art exhibition.","At that time, Yao Mengqing did not believe that Xue Liang was Qiao Xi’s elder brother. She thought that Xue Liang only said that to defend Liang Pingchuan’s reputation.","Now that she was Xue Liang’s friend, if she could step on Qiao Xi, perhaps...","Yao Mengqing had a subtle expression. “Yes, but...”","Xue Liang’s eyes were calm. “Miss Yao, feel free to speak your mind. Just say what you’re thinking.”","When Yao Mengqi heard this, she was sure that Xue Liang definitely had a grudge against Qiao Xi.","Yao Mengqi finally found a chance to take revenge on Qiao Xi. Without thinking, she said, “Mr. Xue, Qiao Xi is not a good person! She’s always targeting my sister!”","“Qi Qi, don’t spout nonsense. Xi Xi...” Yao Mengqing pretended to stop her.","“Mr. Xue, Qi Qi is a straightforward person. Don’t mind her. Xi Xi is indeed a little wilful and naughty, but as the older one, it’s only right for me to give in to her.”","Xue Liang nodded, his expression unreadable.."]},{"number":306,"title":"Chapter 306 - Gift Ceremony","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Yao Mengqi was secretly delighted. Now that the Yao family had connections with Xue Liang, it meant that they had become allies with Imperial Capital’s Xue family. She was immediately confident.","“Qiao Xi! You’re extremely jealous, right? My sister and Xue Liang are friends! What about you?”","Qiao Xi said calmly, “Xue Liang and I are indeed not friends.”","Yao Mengqi looked proud. “It’s good that you know your own limits. Be more polite when you see my sister in the future and know your place!”","“Sister, we’ll go to the Gu family later and tell Uncle Gu and Aunt Lan about what happened today. We’ll let everyone see that you’re the one who’s most qualified to be Mrs. Gu!”","Yao Mengqing pouted playfully. “Qi Qi, don’t spout nonsense. Xi Xi will misunderstand. It’s also reasonable that she doesn’t know Painter Xue. She might not like paintings.”","Everyone nodded. They heard that Qiao Xi grew up in the countryside, so she was definitely not very classy.","With Xue Liang’s support, it was really hard to say who would be Mrs. Gu in the future.","“Mr. Xue, please take a seat. There’s another item being auctioned later,” Yao Mengqing said gently.","“No rush.” Xue Liang shook his head. “Since you don’t mind, I’ll give the violin to my sister now.”","Yao Mengqing froze abruptly, her face filled with disbelief.","Xue Liang’s thin lips moved. “My sister is here at the auction. I want to give this to her now.”","He paused for a moment and asked again, “You won’t mind, right?”","The entire venue was silent, and even the sounds of breathing had stopped.","Xue Liang’s younger sister was also present? They had not heard that the Xue family’s eldest daughter was here, though?","Yao Mengqing’s body was cold. Her heart was pounding furiously, and her voice was trembling. “Y-Your sister... is here?”","Earlier, only Qiao Xi was competing with her for the violin. Could it be that it was really Qiao Xi?","Impossible! Qiao Xi had already admitted that she and Xue Liang were not friends. Moreover, Xue Liang did not retort. Since they were not related, why would he give such a valuable gift to Qiao Xi?","That person was absolutely not Qiao Xi!","Yao Mengqing was relieved, and her expression returned to normal. “Of course not, Mr. Xue. This violin belongs to you. You can decide who to give it to.”","Xue Liang smiled. “Thank you, Miss Yao. I’ll bring her over to thank you later.”","Yao Mengqing nodded generously. “Originally, I wanted to give this violin to you to apologize. It’s fine as long as you don’t blame me. There’s no need to thank me.”","The nearby Qiao Xi could not help but laugh because she was truly unable to hold it in anymore.","Yao Mengqing looked up aggrievedly, and Lin Jie immediately glared at Qiao Xi. “What do you mean by that? Mengqing is kind and generous, so why are you laughing? Do you think the violin will be given to you?”","Madam Yao assumed the posture of an elder. “Miss Qiao, it’s fine that you’ve targeted my daughter time and again, but it’s too much to mock her in public now. Are you laughing at my Yao family for spending 300 million on a violin and giving it to someone else? How can someone like you understand my daughter? She doesn’t care about this bit of money at all as long as Mr. Xue is happy.”","Yao Mengqi also roared, “What’s there to laugh about? I think you’re just jealous of my sister!”","Yao Mengqing had an innocent face and said weakly, “Xi Xi, if you want to get to know Mr. Xue, I can introduce you.”","As soon as she finished speaking, she turned around and said, “Mr. Xue, this is Qiao Xi.”","Xue Liang’s expression was subtle. He turned around and whispered something to his assistant, who understood and walked to the staff to say something.","After a while, the person in charge walked out. “Miss Yao, Mr. Xue said that it would be best if we held a ceremony to give away such a valuable violin. What do you think?”","Yao Mengqing nodded without hesitation.","Of course, she would not refuse. The bigger this matter was, the more beneficial it would be for her. She wanted to let more people know that she was kind and generous. She even got herself acquainted with a big figure like Xue Liang.","What made her even prouder was that after she introduced Qiao Xi, Xue Liang completely ignored her.. This meant that he did not like Qiao Xi at all."]},{"number":307,"title":"Chapter 307 - In the End, It Still Belongs To Me","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Then, Xue Liang and Yao Mengqing went on stage with the staff escorting them. Yao Mengqing stood in front of the stage and said in a sweet voice, “I’m very happy to be able to bid for this precious violin. I’m also very honored to be able to donate 300 million to charity.”","She turned her head and looked at Xue Liang gently. “I’ll take this opportunity to give this violin to Mr. Xue. I hope that the Golden Foundation can also include Mr. Xue’s name. After all, I’m giving this violin to Mr. Xue as a gift.”","The person who donated the most to this charity auction would receive the naming rights. Now that Yao Mengqing had already donated 300 million, naturally, no one would be donating more than her. Hence, the naming rights of the foundation would go to her. She wanted to add Xue Liang’s name because she wanted to rope him in.","This way, everyone would know that she was close to Xue Liang.","Xue Liang smiled. “Thank you, Miss Yao, for your violin. I’ll take this opportunity to give you two things.”","At this moment, Qiao Xi was sitting on a chair and lazily sipping her tea, looking extremely indifferent.","Yao Mengqi had a face full of disdain. “Tsk! You want to compete with my sister? You’ve overestimated yourself!”","Madam Yao’s tone was gentle. “Miss Qiao, Mengqing can give you anything else but she must have this violin. After all, it’s for Mr. Xue. I hope you don’t mind.”","Qiao Xi glanced at them with an indifferent expression. “Sure.”","Her nonchalant reply infuriated Madam Yao and Yao Mengqi.","The Yao family had spent over 200 million yuan for nothing this time because of Qiao Xi’s schemes. At this moment, Qiao Xi still had a nonchalant expression.","Madam Yao glared at her viciously and roared, “Qiao Xi, you just said that the highest bidder wins! Mengqing spent 300 million on that violin. Could it be that you’re unconvinced?”","At this moment, Xue Liang’s voice came from the microphone. “The violin will be gifted to...”","When everyone heard Madam Yao’s angry roar, they could not help but look over.","The anger that Madam Yao had been suppressing finally erupted. “No matter how much you want the violin, Mengqing has already gotten it. You’re the one who has no money, so you can’t blame anyone else. What’s with your cold face?”","Yao Mengqi chimed in, “Do you even need to ask? She’s jealous of my sister. Some people just can’t stand to see others doing well. She already snatched a few of the things that my sister liked, but my sister only snatched the violin. Even so, she’s pulling a long face.”","Madam Yao snorted. “Now that Mengqing has already given the violin to Mr. Xue, it’s useless even if you hold a grudge. Are you going to hold a grudge against Mr. Xue too?”","Xue Liang’s words slowly sounded. “It’ll be given to...”","Madam Yao paid no attention to him at all and was anxious to vent the flames of rage in her heart. “Qiao Xi, you must apologize to Mengqing and let this matter go. Otherwise, if news of this spreads, everyone will say that you’re petty and seek revenge for the smallest grievance. You—”","Before she could say anything more, Xue Liang said the person’s name.","“Qiao Xi.”","The corners of Qiao Xi’s mouth curled up.","Madam Yao was instantly stunned. Who called out Qiao Xi? Was she hallucinating?","That voice seemed to be Xue Liang’s voice?","The people who were originally watching the fight all came back to their senses and looked at Xue Liang in shock before looking at Qiao Xi.","Wait!","Had they heard wrongly?","Xue Liang... wanted to give the violin to... Qiao Xi?","Everyone was dumbfounded.","Qiao Xi put down the teacup and slowly stood up, then she smiled meaningfully. “Madam Yao, please repeat what you just said.”","“You... are jealous of Meng Qing, so...”","Madam Yao was instantly speechless. Her body went limp, and she took a few steps back.","She looked at Qiao Xi in horror, her voice trembling. “You... Impossible! Xue Liang... Impossible...”","At this moment, the person in charge of the auction repeated Qiao Xi’s name, shattering Madam Yao’s final doubt.","“Mr. Xue has decided to give the violin to Miss Qiao Xi. Let’s invite her to the stage.”","Madam Yao instantly felt weak and fell onto the chair.","Xue Liang was giving the violin to Qiao Xi?","That b*tch!","Qiao Xi straightened her skirt and glanced at the Yao family.","“Madam Yao, I’m really sorry. The violin... still belongs to me in the end.”","Qiao Xi walked past everyone and walked up to the stage with her head held high.."]},{"number":308,"title":"Chapter 308 - We Are Siblings!","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Qiao Xi stood by Yao Mengqing’s side and said softly in her ear, “I’m worried that you didn’t hear it clearly just now. Let me repeat it for you. He wants to give the violin to me.”","When Xue Liang said that name, Yao Mengqing was stunned on the spot. The expression on her face gradually stiffened, and her blood seemed to have frozen.","Xue Liang rubbed Qiao Xi’s head with a gentle expression. “Don’t be naughty. You’ve liked this violin for a long time. Now that you’ve finally gotten it, aren’t you going to thank Miss Yao?”","Qiao Xi revealed a sweet smile and said in a gentle voice, “Thank you, Miss Yao.”","Yao Mengqing felt as if she had been struck by lightning. Her mind was buzzing. She could not believe what she had just heard.","How could he possibly give it to Qiao Xi?","She clenched her fists tightly, and her long nails dug into her palms. If there were not so many people at the auction, she would definitely strangle this b*tch, Qiao Xi, to death!","Why did Xue Liang give this violin to her? He even seemed to be very close to her.","Originally, everyone had praised her for being kind and generous, but now, she had become the biggest fool in the auction. She was mocked by everyone.","She spent 300 million yuan only to give the violin to her competitor?","Qiao Xi looked at Xue Liang with a helpless expression. “I initially wanted to rely on my own strength to bid for the violin, but Miss Yao, you insisted on spending the money yourself. Unfortunately, you ended up spending 300 million yuan on this.","“I thought that I wouldn’t be able to get this violin. I didn’t expect Miss Yao to give it to you, Brother.","“Looks like this violin is destined to be mine.”","Xue Liang smiled meaningfully.","At this moment, Yao Mengqing finally understood that it was Qiao Xi’s scheme from the beginning until the end. It was for the sake of watching her make a fool of herself.","She was so angry that she was about to vomit blood. She wanted to reach out and slap Qiao Xi a few times. It would be best if she could beat this b*tch to death.","That was 300 million!","She paid a bloody price only to help this b*tch Qiao Xi succeed!","What made her even angrier was that Qiao Xi was even deliberately angering her. She had a wretched smile on her face and was definitely laughing at her in her heart. ‘Miss Yao, you spent 300 million on the violin but still gave it to me in the end. Thank you so much.’","Yao Mengqing felt like she had fallen into an ice cellar. Her body trembled uncontrollably. The unwillingness and anger in her heart gathered together and filled her mind.","She suppressed the emotions in her heart and bit her lip tightly.","After calming down for a moment, she gritted her teeth and asked, “Qiao... Xi Xi, you clearly said that you and Xue Liang are not friends.”","As soon as these words were spoken, everyone stared at Qiao Xi.","If Qiao Xi and Xue Liang were not friends, why would he give such a valuable gift to Qiao Xi?","Xue Liang had accepted Yao Mengqing’s violin but gave it to Qiao Xi. He was clearly pushing Yao Mengqing’s face against the floor!","Yao Mengqing’s eyes were filled with resentment. “Since you’re not his friend, what right do you have to accept such a valuable gift from him?”","Gu Zheng’s expression was cold.","Qiao Xi said slowly, “Why don’t I have the right? We’re indeed not friends, but that doesn’t mean our relationship can only be friendship!”","Everyone had puzzled expressions when they saw Qiao Xi holding Xue Liang’s hand intimately. “We’re...”","“We’re siblings!”","...","After a few seconds of silence, everyone could not help but exclaim.","Was she kidding? The sister Xue Liang was talking about was Qiao Xi?","Yao Mengqing looked at Xue Liang and Qiao Xi in confusion.","Siblings?","Qiao Xi was amused. “Miss Yao, do you still remember how the Yao family offended Xue Liang?”","Yao Mengqing suddenly looked up, her eyes bulging.","Qiao Xi curled the corners of her lips. “Looks like you understand now, Miss Yao! Previously, the Yao family publicly slandered my relationship with Uncle, making me out to be a mistress. After Xue Liang found out about this, he chased you all out of the art exhibition.","“I remember that Xue Liang had long said that the Yao family had offended his uncle and sister. Why didn’t you believe him? You even asked foolishly about my relationship with Xue Liang.”","Yao Mengqing was dumbfounded.","Impossible!","At that time, the Yao family had only offended Liang Pingchuan. It had nothing to do with Qiao Xi!","“Miss Yao, you’re really stubborn. Fourth Brother, tell her.” Qiao Xi spread her hands helplessly.","Xue Liang held Qiao Xi’s hand and said indifferently, “Miss Yao, Madam Yao, I had already said that you offended my sister and uncle, but you didn’t take it to heart and even continued to make things difficult for my sister.”"]},{"number":309,"title":"Chapter 309 - Spitting Blood From Anger?","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","“If you’re unwilling to give me this violin, I don’t mind. I’ll spend 300 million to buy this violin. My assistant will transfer the money to your account later.”","Xue Liang shot a glance at the assistant, who nodded and said, “Fourth Young Master, I’ll do it now. 300 million will be transferred to Miss Yao’s account in two hours.”","As soon as she finished speaking, everyone looked at Yao Mengqing in disdain.","At this moment, Gu Yao pretended to be shocked. “Oh my God! I’ve really learned something today. You just held the gifting ceremony, yet you still have the cheek to ask others for money?”","Everyone scoffed and discussed loudly.","“Mr. Xue has already asked Miss Yao twice if he could give it to someone else. Miss Yao agreed readily at that time but she’s unwilling now. What kind of character is this?!”","“Moreover, Yao Mengqing originally gave the violin to Xue Liang because the Yao family offended Liang Pingchuan and Qiao Xi, so they wanted to use the violin to apologize.”","“Miss Qiao wanted to bid for it herself, but Yao Mengqing insisted on raising the price. Even now, she’s still unwilling to give the violin to Miss Qiao! How exactly does the Yao family raise their children?”","“They said it’s for donation but I think Yao Mengqing just doesn’t want to spend money and wants a good reputation.”","Hearing everyone’s curses, Yao Mengqing’s body swayed and she almost fell on the stage.","No! They absolutely could not accept this 300 million. Otherwise, the Yao family would be mocked for the rest of their lives.","However... She really could not stand Qiao Xi’s vile character.","Yao Mengqing took a deep breath and forced herself to calm down. Forget it, she would endure it this time. She would not let Qiao Xi off next time!","She was the eldest daughter of the Yao family and the future Mrs. Gu. She would not fight with a bastard from the countryside.","Yao Mengqing gritted her teeth and gulped. She squeezed out a smile. “Mr. Xue... You’ve misunderstood. How could I not be willing? The violin... I’ll give it to Xi Xi. Mr. Xue, you don’t have to pay.","“Xi Xi, this violin is very precious. You must take care of it well.”","As soon as she finished speaking, Yao Mengqing’s eyes rolled back, and she collapsed.","“Mengqing! Mengqing!”","Madam Yao cried out in surprise and hurriedly rushed onto the stage. “Qiao Xi! You made my daughter faint from anger!”","She hugged Yao Mengqing and shook her.","Yao Mengqing slowly opened her eyes and said weakly, “Mom... Don’t scold Xi Xi. I...”","Immediately after, she spat out a mouthful of blood. Yao Mengqing’s face was as pale as paper. “Mom, Xi Xi is Ah Zheng’s... She’s President Gu’s woman. No matter what she does, I won’t blame her. Mom, don’t say anymore...”","After saying those words with difficulty, she closed her eyes and fainted.","Madam Yao was so scared that she screamed, “Mengqing! We’re going to the hospital right now!”","“Qiao Xi! Just you wait!”","The Yao family swarmed over and hurriedly carried Yao Mengqing out.","Lin Jie’s face was ferocious. “Qiao Xi! I’ll remember what happened today. I’ll take revenge for Mengqing!”","With that, Lin Jie left with the Yao family.","At this moment, the atmosphere in the auction house was very awkward. Everyone did not know what to say.","Qiao Xi held Xue Liang’s arm and cried. “Fourth Brother, I’m so scared! Why don’t I just give up on this violin? Miss Yao probably doesn’t want to give it to me. Look, she even fainted.”","Xue Liang said, “Don’t be afraid. Keep the violin. She humiliated you and Uncle in public previously. I thought that she already knew her mistake. Unexpectedly, the Yao family even cursed you in public this time, so you deserve this apology gift.”","A voice suddenly sounded from the crowd. “Is there something wrong with Yao Mengqing’s brain? She was clearly the one who took the initiative to give the violin to Xue Liang. She also agreed to let Xue Liang give it to Qiao Xi. How is Qiao Xi to blame here?”","“This incident started because Yao Mengqing publicly humiliated Qiao Xi for being a mistress. She hasn’t admitted her mistake yet, so why did she faint first?”","“It couldn’t be that she was pretending, right? Does she want to use everyone’s sympathy to deal with Qiao Xi? Yao Mengqing looks weak but she’s so scheming!”","When Madam Yao reached the door, she heard the crowd’s discussion and gritted her teeth in anger.","Her daughter was vomiting blood, yet these people still said that she was pretending?","It was all because of that b*tch, Qiao Xi. What good methods!","She would let this b*tch laugh for a few days first. Sooner or later, she would make Qiao Xi kneel in front of her daughter and kowtow to apologize to her!"]},{"number":310,"title":"Chapter 310 - The Real Fight Between The Wealthy!","paragraphs":["“Ah!” Madam Yao felt a sharp pain in her back. “Who... Who pricked me?”","Everyone rolled their eyes. Madam Yao was still acting?","There was no one beside her at all. Who could prick her? Did she not think before coming up with lies?","The person in charge quickly got the staff to close the door so that the Yao family would not disturb the auction anymore.","Qiao Xi put the silver needles back into her sleeve, and the corners of her mouth curled into a smile.","Xue Liang lowered his eyes. “Little Six, there are so many people here. You should restrain yourself.”","Qiao Xi was filled with confidence. “No one saw it at all. Don’t panic!”","Below the stage, Gu Zheng looked at her cufflinks with deep eyes.","Xue Liang: “...”","She still could not escape his eyes.","...","After the Yao family left, the entire auction venue instantly fell silent.","Qiao Xi returned to her seat. “Gu Zheng, what’s the last item? I’m very curious.”","Everyone was also very curious about what the last item would be because there was no information on it at all.","However, Qiao Xi was sure that Gu Zheng knew what it was. Moreover, he didn’t say anything throughout the entire auction. He was probably here for the mysterious item, right?","Gu Zheng curled his finger. “Come closer, I’ll tell you.”","Qiao Xi immediately leaned forward and pressed her little head into his embrace.","Gu Zheng’s voice was low. “Qiao Xi.”","“Yes?”","“Don’t use concealed weapons in public.” Gu Zheng gently stroked her hair. “If others see it, there’ll be trouble.”","Fourth Brother’s strange expression from earlier suddenly appeared in Qiao Xi’s mind. It turned out that Gu Zheng had noticed it.","She had been practicing using concealed weapons since she was young and was confident that she would not be seen by outsiders. Unexpectedly, Gu Zheng spotted it at a glance.","Qiao Xi was unwilling to give up. This man must have spotted her by chance.","Hence, she took out a silver needle and was about to flick it out—","“Gu Zheng!”","Gu Zheng grabbed her wrist and pulled her into his arms.","His other hand moved to her palm and the silver needle fell into his hand in the blink of an eye.","Qiao Xi leaned against his chest as his hot breath sprayed over her. “Little girl? You want to use your concealed weapons on me, huh?”","She struggled hard, but Gu Zheng did not move. For the first time, she felt the difference between her and Gu Zheng.","Gu Zheng controlled her effortlessly, but in the eyes of outsiders, Gu Zheng was just supporting her.","However, she knew very well that her life was in Gu Zheng’s hands right now.","Gu Zheng hugged her waist and gently lifted her back to the chair. “Do you want to know what the mysterious item is?”","Qiao Xi: “...”","‘Bastard! You’re having fun, huh?’","Gu Zheng’s expression did not change as the corners of his mouth twitched. “I think you’ll like it.”","Hearing this, Qiao Xi was even more curious.","‘He’s not going to give me the last item, is he?","‘Tsk! Don’t think that you can bribe me just by giving me a gift. Just now, you even humiliated me for being weak! Do you think that if you give me something I’ll forgive you? Impossible!’","Qiao Xi thought arrogantly. She would not lower her head so easily.","Gu Zheng turned his head, his eyes smiling.","At this moment, the door of the auction house opened again and a man walked in while surrounded by people.","Gu Yao gasped.","Someone exclaimed, “Lu Yan! He’s here too. I thought that the Lu family wouldn’t come!”","“President Gu didn’t raise his placard just now. He must be waiting for the last item. Lu Yan is probably here for this item as well. If they want to compete, that’ll be the true fight between the wealthy!”","Another person asked in confusion, “I heard that Lu Yan is going to acknowledge his elders. If that’s the case, he doesn’t represent the Lu family anymore. He represents... the Gu family.”","With that said, everyone lowered their heads, not daring to look at Gu Zheng’s cold face.","Most of the people in the upper circle knew Lu Yan’s identity. He was the legitimate eldest young master of the Gu family, while Gu Zheng was just an illegitimate child brought by Madam Gu.","Gu Weiming’s first wife was Lu Qingyun from the Lu family.","Back then, Lu Qingyun gave birth to a son. The son went missing. A month later, Lu Yan was abandoned at the Lu family’s door.","Hence, everyone thought that Lu Yan was Lu Qingyun’s child. It was just that the Lu family had already cut ties with the Gu family, so Lu Yan had never returned to the Gu family.."]},{"number":311,"title":"Chapter 311 - Your Competitor Is Gu Zheng","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Now that Lu Qingyun’s son, Lu Yan, had grown up, should he take revenge for his biological mother? Should he return to the Gu family and take revenge on the mistress and illegitimate child?","No matter what, Lu Yan was the true heir of the Gu family.","Among the two of them, one was the eldest son of the Gu family, while the other was an illegitimate child with immense power. Who would be the final winner?","If the two of them were to fight, it would be like heaven and earth exploding!","Lu Yan slowly walked in front of Qiao Xi and asked gently, “Miss Qiao, do you know what the last item is?”","He had a smile on his face and looked very gentle. “If you don’t mind, I’d like to bid for the last item. How about I give it to you?”","Everyone gasped.","Qiao Xi frowned.","Gu Zheng also looked at her.","Everyone present knew the relationship between Gu Zheng and Lu Yan.","Although they did not know who Qiao Xi was to Gu Zheng, she was, after all, a woman brought here by President Gu. It would be awkward if she accepted Lu Yan’s gift.","Qiao Xi cursed Lu Yan in her heart. Was this person crazy? Did he think that Gu Zheng was easy to bully? He was clearly provoking Gu Zheng by wanting to give her a gift.","She did not care about Gu Zheng’s reaction. She couldn’t take it anymore.","Lu Yan said gently again, “Miss Qiao.”","Gu Zheng narrowed his eyes. Those who knew him well knew that he was already unhappy.","President Gu usually did not lose his temper. If he really lost his temper, the consequences would be very serious.","The person in charge of the auction was just about to step forward when Gu Zheng heard the words in Qiao Xi’s heart.","‘Are you crazy? You want me to accept the things you give me? Do I know you?","‘Gu Zheng has a good temper and won’t scold him, but I can’t let Gu Zheng suffer!’","Gu Zheng turned to look at Qiao Xi with a slightly puzzled gaze.","Qiao Xi... Why did she think he had a good temper?","Her expression was gloomy, and her voice was cold and distant. “Mr. Lu, do you know what the final item is?”","Lu Yan did not hesitate. “Of course. President Gu knows as well.”","Qiao Xi sneered. “Mr. Lu, you said you want to give me a gift?”","Everyone widened their eyes.","Could it be that... Qiao Xi really wanted to accept it?","Then wouldn’t Gu Zheng lose his reputation?","The air around Gu Zheng was cold. Everyone held their breaths, afraid to anger this God of Death.","Song Shiyu was the only one who looked calm. Why would Young Madam side with outsiders?","Lu Yan was interested. “If you’re willing to accept my gift, I’ll be very happy, of course.”","Qiao Xi turned to look at the person in charge behind her. “What’s the final item?”","The person in charge originally wanted to reveal it later to arouse everyone’s interest, but judging from the current situation, he could not hide it anymore.","He could only say in a trembling voice, “The final item is the sovereignty of an island. It’s surrounded by the sea, and the scenery is pleasant. It’s pure and natural.”","As soon as the person in charge finished speaking, there was a commotion.","It turned out that the final item was not an item but the ownership of an island.","Buying this island was equivalent to having one’s own territory and a space that completely belonged to one. The scenery and climate there were definitely good. If a man gave this island to any woman, they would probably be very tempted.","The women present all looked at Qiao Xi with envy.","However, Qiao Xi was not surprised in the slightest. “So it’s an island. I really want it.”","Lu Yan smiled. “Miss Qiao... are you willing to accept it?”","Gu Zheng’s expression was dark, and his eyes were deep. They exuded waves of coldness.","Qiao Xi stroked her hair with a sweet smile on her face.","“Of course, why wouldn’t I want a free gift?”","She smiled evilly. “But Gu Zheng said that he’ll bid for the last item for me just now. He hasn’t even raised his placard today. He must’ve been waiting for the last item.","“Gu Zheng said that he wants to give it to me. Mr. Lu, you also said that you want to give it to me. Who between you can bid for it in the end?”","Qiao Xi smiled meaningfully. “I do want to accept your gift, Mr. Lu! But... are you sure you can win?","“After all, your competitor is Gu Zheng!”","The smile on Lu Yan’s face gradually vanished.","Everyone also understood that this island was dispensable to Qiao Xi.. She was deliberately making things difficult for Lu Yan."]},{"number":312,"title":"Chapter 312 - Lu Yans Psychological Quality Is Not Bad","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Everyone present knew very well that the Gu family’s current glory was all because of Gu Zheng. It had nothing to do with Gu Weiming and Lu Yan.","Although Lu Yan was Lu Qingyun’s son, he could not destroy everything that others had worked hard for just because he was the first wife’s son.","Gu Yao also could not stand Lu Yan’s pretentious appearance, but because of his identity, he could only persuade him in a low voice. “Brother... Lu, if Qiao Xi accepts your gift, Gu Zheng will be very angry. He’ll definitely do his best to compete with you. He has so much money that he has nowhere to spend it. Are you sure you can beat him?”","Veins popped out on Lu Yan’s forehead.","Gu Yao said, “If Qiao Xi doesn’t accept your gift, it’s also because she’s thinking about you. If she really wants it, it’ll be really embarrassing if you can’t get it!”","Lu Yan gritted his teeth.","Gu Zheng’s expression was indifferent as if this had nothing to do with him. It made Lu Yan angry.","Why was Gu Zheng so lucky? He did not need to say anything, yet so many people were standing up for him?","Whether it was Gu Yao or Qiao Xi, they should belong to him!","Although Gu Yao’s voice was not loud, everyone heard him and nodded.","It was absolutely wishful thinking for Lu Yan to want to snatch it from Gu Zheng!","He calmed down and said gently, “Miss Qiao.”","Qiao Xi raised her eyes and arched her brows.","“Since you like it, I’ll do my best.”","Qiao Xi sighed in her heart.","‘Lu Yan’s psychological quality is quite good! At this time, he’s still so calm like a noble.","‘Actually, he should know very well whose territory this is. As long as Gu Zheng gives him a look, no matter if Lu Yan is the young master of the Lu family or not, he’ll be immediately chased out. No matter how powerful the Lu family is, they don’t have as much power as Gu Zheng.","‘The people around him are all mocking him, but he can still remain calm. People who achieve great things don’t care about trivial matters!’","Gu Zheng’s gaze turned cold.","Was this woman praising Lu Yan in her heart?","It was just a few mocking laughs. He had been used to it since he was young.","After all, he had suffered thousands of times more pain when he was young.","‘How much effort did Gu Zheng put in to have his career where it is today? What right does Lu Yan have to snatch everything away with just his identity?","‘Poor Gu Zheng. Sigh! Why are they doing this to him?’","Gu Zheng’s heart ached, and a trace of warmth seemed to flow into his dark and cold heart.","Soon, Lu Yan sat down. He was calm as if nothing had happened.","Everyone knew in their hearts that the competitors for the last item were Lu Yan and Gu Zheng, so they all gave up on competing.","The starting price of this island was 1 billion.","Gu Zheng raised his placard, and Lu Yan followed closely behind.","Unknowingly, it had reached 3 billion. Lu Yan was a little hesitant as he looked at Gu Zheng. “President Gu, why don’t you ask if she’s even willing to accept your gift?”","Qiao Xi’s face sank. Nonsense! Was he trying to sow discord between her and Gu Zheng?","Gu Zheng did not even raise his eyes, regarding Lu Yan as invisible.","Lu Yan was calm enough as he muttered to himself, “If she’s unwilling, will you do it by force just like back then?”","Back then? What did that mean?","Qiao Xi was slightly bewildered.","However, Lu Yan did not say anything else and continued to raise the bid to 5 billion.","At this moment, everyone was nervous. They were all curious about who would be the winner of this island.","The only people present who could fork out 5 billion and not go bankrupt were the two of them.","Gu Zheng’s net worth was immeasurable, while Lu Yan held the precious elements of the world. Of course, he was not lacking in money.","When everyone saw this scene, they muttered softly, “From the looks of it, this island must be worth more than 10 billion. We don’t understand the world of the rich.”","“President Gu’s net worth is hundreds of billions. To him, this is just a small amount of money. Moreover, after he bids for that island, he can develop it into a tourist attraction. He’ll be able to recover his capital sooner or later.”","When Gu Zheng called for 7 billion, Lu Yan paused for a moment. “President Gu, you’re richer than I thought!”"]},{"number":313,"title":"Chapter 313 - 3 Billion Is Enough","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Qiao Xi’s face instantly turned cold.","What did he mean? Was he saying that the money would be his in the future? Was he deliberately provoking Gu Zheng?","Qiao Xi was just about to speak when Gu Zheng said indifferently, “Mr. Lu, perhaps your thoughts are too limited.”","Qiao Xi: “...”","She was so angry that she was about to faint. Gu Zheng had a vicious tongue. How could he be bullied?","Lu Yan’s expression was calm as he directly increased the price to 8 billion. “It seems that President Gu is determined to win this island?”","Gu Zheng sneered and raised the placard again.","It was about to reach 10 billion. As expected.","Unexpectedly...","Gu Zheng said, “9.3 billion.”","Everyone: “???”","What was going on? What was with the decimal point? This was not Gu Zheng’s character at all!","Lu Yan’s expression darkened.","Qiao Xi was slightly puzzled as well. She thought that Gu Zheng would directly raise it to 10 billion. What was up with this 9.3 billion?","However, when she saw Lu Yan’s ugly expression, Qiao Xi knew that Gu Zheng had won.","It did not need to be raised to 10 billion. It only needed to be 9.3 billion.","Lu Yan suppressed the emotions in his heart and sighed helplessly. “President Gu, since you like this island so much, I won’t compete anymore.”","Everyone heaved a sigh of relief. This battle had finally come to an end.","“It’s not that you don’t want to compete anymore.” However, Gu Zheng suddenly said, “It’s because you can’t win.”","Lu Yan could not win?","A trace of mockery flashed past Gu Zheng’s eyes.","Lu Yan was not his match at all. This was the truth.","“You only have 9.2 billion yuan in assets, so 9.3 billion is enough for you to admit defeat.”","Gu Zheng’s expression was indifferent as he said slowly, “You still want to give her a gift?”","Lu Yan’s expression was calm, but his eyes were filled with coldness.","Everyone could not help but sigh. “Lu Yan only has 9.2 billion yuan in assets, but President Gu...”","The person paused for a moment and continued, “9.3 billion is nothing to President Gu.”","Indeed, it was nothing.","Looking at Gu Zheng’s indifferent expression, they knew that this money was just a number to him.","Lu Yan suppressed the anger in his heart. He had taken out all his assets but they were not even half of Gu Zheng’s.","This difference made Lu Yan feel powerless. His eyes were filled with gloom.","...","After Gu Zheng bought the island, Song Shiyu went to pay for it.","Song Shiyu suddenly said, “Our president has also paid for Miss Qiao’s 100 million yuan. The president said that the name of the foundation should be ‘Xi Zheng’ or ‘Gu Qiao’. We have to choose between these two names.”","Everyone: “???”","Xi Zheng?","This was clearly a combination of Gu Zheng and Qiao Xi’s names! So what was their relationship?","At this moment, Xue Liang happened to walk over. The few of them muttered softly, “Do you know Qiao Xi and Qin An’s relationship?”","“I don’t.”","“I heard that after Qiao Xi was chased out of the family when she was young, she was adopted by the Qin family. She’s known as Qin An’s sister. Qin An and Xue Liang are brothers with different surnames, so it’s reasonable for Xue Liang to treat Qin An’s sister as his own.”","Everyone was enlightened.","The person continued, “So President Gu and Qiao Xi are so close because of Qin An?”","The others echoed, “That’s right! Qin An is Qiao Xi’s elder brother, so he has always been protecting her. Xue Liang also takes good care of Qiao Xi and is her elder brother, so it must be the same with President Gu!”","...","After paying, Song Shiyu returned to the auction house. “President, it’s done.”","Gu Zheng nodded, took out his phone, and showed Qiao Xi a few photos of the island before introducing the surrounding scenery to her.","Suddenly, a few people walked over with obsequious expressions. “President Gu, I didn’t know about your relationship with Miss Qiao before this. Please don’t take offense.”","Gu Zheng looked up, and the few of them said one after another, “Miss Qiao, we were confused by Yao Mengqing before this and misunderstood you. If we had known about your relationship with President Gu, we definitely wouldn’t have thought too much about it.”","Qiao Xi widened her eyes.","Oh no! Had their marriage been exposed?","Qiao Xi’s heart turned cold when she saw their hypocritical expressions.."]},{"number":314,"title":"Chapter 314 - Guess Which Brother I Like Most?","paragraphs":["At that time, the Yao family mocked her for being a plaything and they lost the qualification to enter the auction house. These people knew now that she was Mrs. Gu, so they immediately rushed over to apologize?","Seeing that Qiao Xi wasn’t saying anything, the women looked embarrassed. “Miss Qiao, it’s not our fault for not knowing. We didn’t expect you and President Gu to...”","They leaned over slightly. “It’s also because of what the Yao family said that we thought like that.”","Qiao Xi’s face was slightly red as she hurriedly waved her hand. “It’s fine, but how did all of you find out?”","Hearing Qiao Xi’s words, everyone was even more certain of her relationship with Gu Zheng.","Their expressions were solemn. They had to get Qiao Xi to forgive them today. Otherwise, it would bring a devastating blow to their respective families.","The few of them wanted to kneel on the floor. “We guessed it. If you and President Gu had told us earlier, we wouldn’t have dared to offend you. Miss Qiao, if you don’t want outsiders to know, we won’t say a word!”","Qiao Xi raised her eyes to look at Gu Zheng.","He sat beside her with one hand on the chair, looking very lazy yet domineering.","Everyone saw that President Gu wasn’t saying anything, which meant that he had tacitly acknowledged the two’s relationship. They had to build a good relationship with Qiao Xi in the future!","President Gu’s younger sister... That meant she was the daughter of a truly wealthy family! It was the greatest honor.","Even though Yao Mengqing was President Gu’s childhood friend, for the sake of his younger sister, he wouldn’t care about his friend.","It was obvious who was closer between a sister and a friend.","The ladies started fawning over them. “President Gu is so nice to Miss Qiao!”","Qiao Xi blushed and lowered her head shyly.","How did this matter get out? How embarrassing!","Qiao Xi said shyly, “We just got married...” They hadn’t been married for long, so they had yet to make any official announcements. She hoped nobody would spread the news.","Before she could finish his sentence, she heard a woman’s voice—","“Although the two of you aren’t biological siblings, President Gu only has you as his sister. He’s really good to you. It’s such a blessing to have an older brother like President Gu!”","Qiao Xi: “...”","She swallowed the words that came out of her mouth, then coughed violently as her cheeks started flushing.","She looked at her in shock and asked in disbelief, “What? Gu Zheng and I are siblings?”","Everyone exclaimed, “Yes! We all know that President Gu is your brother. Miss Qiao, you don’t have to hide it anymore. Qin An is your brother and Xue Liang is your brother. So of course, President Gu is also your brother!”","“...”","Qiao Xi gulped and was forced to nod under the confident gazes of everyone. “Right... We’re... siblings.”","After everyone left, Qiao Xi’s heart that was hanging in the air finally relaxed.","Unexpectedly, a faint voice came from beside her. “Siblings?”","Qiao Xi’s heart thumped as she slowly turned around.","Gu Zheng smirked. “You have quite a number of brothers.”","Qiao Xi instantly felt a chill run down her spine. Gu Zheng was truly too terrifying. He seemed to be smiling, but in reality, his smile didn’t reach his eyes.","Yes, she had many brothers. There was nothing wrong with that!","No!","Qiao Xi looked at him with slight bewilderment.","‘Is Gu Zheng jealous? Why is he so jealous?","‘Are you jealous of my brothers?’","Gu Zheng blushed and turned his face away.","Qiao Xi squeezed out a fawning smile and moved in front of him, speaking in a coquettish voice, “Gu Zheng, you’re my older brother as well, but you’re different from them.”","Gu Zheng’s body instantly heated up as he suppressed the restlessness in his heart.","Her elegant breath landed on him, while her delicate body was pressed against his. She even spoke in such a soft voice. What was she trying to do?","Gu Zheng’s eyes darkened as his voice turned hoarse. “I’m not your brother.”","Qiao Xi pouted shyly, her eyes filled with temptation. “Actually, I have a favorite brother. Do you want to know who he is?”","Gu Zheng felt a wave of anger rush to his head.","Those brothers of hers grew up with her. Thinking of those men who were not related to her by blood but spent time with her, Gu Zheng felt frustrated.","Qiao Xi sighed.. “I thought you’d surely know the answer to that!”"]},{"number":315,"title":"Chapter 315 - President Gu Has Good Luck With Women!","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Gu Zheng pursed his thin lips and was about to leave.","If Qiao Xi said that man’s name, he would not be able to control himself and might end up killing that man.","Qiao Xi was stunned. She didn’t expect Gu Zheng’s temper to be so bad. He was behaving like a wife who had been bullied.","She hurriedly got up and chased after him. “Gu Zheng, you really don’t know?","“Then don’t you want to know which brother I like the most?”","The man furrowed his brows as his breathing became heavier.","Although they had known each other since ten years ago, they had always contacted each other through the internet. They had never met before. Whenever she was in trouble, he could not be by her side.","Meanwhile, those brothers were all there for her and always kind to her.","Gu Zheng did not know who she liked the most, but no matter who it was, he would be jealous.","The man closed his eyes and said indifferently, “Which brother you like the most has nothing to do with me.”","Qiao Xi had an innocent expression.","‘This man is so amusing. Does he think that I’ll say it’s one of the four brothers?’","Gu Zheng suddenly opened his eyes.","Did she have other brothers besides those four?","Gu Zheng felt his heart ache. He didn’t want to know who that man was.","‘Hey! Wait for me! Why is he walking so fast?","‘Of course, he’s my best brother. Senior is also my brother!’","Gu Zheng suddenly stopped in his tracks. Qiao Xi couldn’t react in time and crashed into his back.","Qiao Xi’s nose hurt from the collision, and she was instantly infuriated.","She just wanted to express her love. If Gu Zheng didn’t want to hear it, he could just say it. Why was he leaving her behind?","What a wretched man!","The words ‘Senior is also my brother’ were still echoing in Gu Zheng’s ears. The anger in his heart was swept away, and a warm current surged into his heart.","He turned around, wanting to pull Qiao Xi toward him.","Qiao Xi grunted coldly. “Don’t touch me. Leave by yourself. I’ll go look for Big Brother!”","‘Hmph! If you don’t try to get me back, I’ll ignore you forever.’","Gu Zheng chuckled as he held her wrist and pulled her into his embrace.","The little girl was angry.","Gu Zheng’s voice was gentle. “Go and look for him.”","Qiao Xi instantly choked. What was Gu Zheng laughing about?","Wasn’t he jealous just now? Why did his mood suddenly recover and he was even asking her to look for her brother?","What move was this?","Qiao Xi didn’t care what he wanted to do. She grunted angrily. “I’ll go look for him right now. I’ll go look for my favorite older brother and infuriate you to death! If you have the ability, you should go look for a younger sister!”","As soon as she finished speaking, Gu Zheng loosened his grip slightly and stared at her deeply.","Qiao Xi instantly became nervous.","‘Damn! Does Gu Zheng really have a younger sister he likes?","‘Gu Zheng, I’m warning you. If you say that you have a younger sister you like, I’ll divorce you! That just won’t do!’","Qiao Xi stared at him, only to hear Gu Zheng say slowly, “Mm.”","“??”","Did Gu Zheng respond just now, or did she hear wrongly?","Afraid that Qiao Xi didn’t hear him, Gu Zheng repeated, “I have a younger sister too.”","Qiao Xi’s expression stiffened, and the calmness she took pride in instantly vanished.","‘He has a younger sister? He actually has another woman! Which little b*tch is it? Is it Yao Mengqing? Or Meng Wan? No, there must be other women too!","‘He has a fiancee, a childhood sweetheart, and a younger sister. President Gu’s luck with women is quite good!","‘Gu Zheng doesn’t have a biological sister, and the Gu family doesn’t even interact with him. Where did he get a younger sister? I’m going to ask Gu Yao. He definitely knows!’","Gu Zheng could clearly hear her inner thoughts, and his lips curled up slightly.","He didn’t expect Mrs. Gu to be so jealous!","Qiao Xi was burning with anxiety, but she still remained calm. “So be it. What does it have to do with me?”","“Ah ah ah! I’m going to die! Who is his younger sister? I’m going crazy!’","Gu Zheng: “...”","He chuckled and hugged her tightly. He lowered his head and whispered into her ear, “I’ll go look for her now?”","Qiao Xi felt sad, and her eyes stung.","However, she still refused to admit that she cared. Her tone was full of grievances.","“Go! You’re showing off that you have a younger sister, huh?! Well, I have an older brother!”","Gu Zheng guided her slowly. “Guess who my sister is?”"]},{"number":316,"title":"Chapter 316 - Birthday Present For Qiao Xis 10th Birthday","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Qiao Xi was exasperated. “I won’t guess! It has nothing to do with me no matter who it is. Just go look for her!”","Xue Liang, who was standing at the side, was speechless. ‘Little Six, your brain is useless!’","Gu Zheng hugged her tightly, making her entire body lean into his embrace. “I only have one younger sister.”","Qiao Xi’s head was filled with sour thoughts when she heard this.","Gu Zheng even emphasized that he only had one younger sister? He did not care about her feelings at all!","Tears welled up in Qiao Xi’s eyes, and the more she thought about it, the more aggrieved she felt. “Let’s go! I’ll go look for her with you! I want to see exactly who she is!”","“Okay.”","The man had only said a faint ‘okay’, but he held onto her body and didn’t let her leave.","Qiao Xi raised her eyes. “Let go of me! You’ve already agreed to go look for your younger sister, haven’t you? Could it be that you intend to go back on your word?”","Gu Zheng’s eyes were deep as he stared fixedly at her, causing Qiao Xi’s entire body to tremble.","The man suddenly approached her, his voice gentle and low. “She’s right in front of me.”","Qiao Xi blurted out, “Where is she?”","“In my arms.”","In his arms?","Qiao Xi instantly came to an understanding, and her mind went blank.","Wait! Gu Zheng said that his sister was in his arms. Wasn’t that her, then?","“My junior is also my younger sister. I only have one younger sister.”","The jealousy and rage in Qiao Xi’s heart instantly vanished into thin air, and waves of happiness surged into her heart.","She lowered her head shyly. “Senior... Gu Zheng...”","“I’m here.”","Qiao Xi opened her mouth and felt her nose sting. She almost cried.","The two of them looked at each other and only had each other in their eyes. Lu Yan, on the other hand, stood not far away. His eyes were vicious as he clenched his fists.","Qiao Xi leaned against him obediently. Gu Zheng picked up his phone and found a few photos of the island. “Do you like this gift?”","The island was completely natural and free of pollution. It had clear waters and a blue sky. The environment was beautiful. Any woman would be tempted.","Qiao Xi nodded shyly. “Yes, I like it! I’ll turn it into a tourist attraction in the future. I’ll be able to earn back the 9.3 billion sooner or later!”","Developing an island would require several billion dollars, and the initial investment would definitely be larger. However, with Gu Zheng’s methods, she believed that it wouldn’t be long before he could make this island a well-known tourist spot.","Qiao Xi was already thinking about how to construct it in her heart, yet Gu Zheng smiled lightly. “I won’t develop it.”","Qiao Xi was puzzled. “Why? Could it be that this island has other values? Mineral resources or oil?”","“No.”","Gu Zheng put down his phone and looked at her affectionately. “This is your island. No one else is allowed to come here.”","Qiao Xi’s heart shook.","Gu Zheng said slowly, “I don’t need this 10 billion, nor do I need to earn this money back. From now on, this island will belong to you alone.”","As he spoke, Gu Zheng passed a document to her. It clearly stated the transfer of this island, and her name appeared on it, stating that she was the owner.","“You spent 9.3 billion just to give it to me?”","Gu Zheng nodded.","Qiao Xi was shocked. It was a gift to her, but she couldn’t figure it out.","Gu Zheng suddenly said, “I’ll fulfill whatever requests you want.”","Qiao Xi suddenly thought of something. When she was ten years old, Xu Mei had brought her to attend the birthday banquet of a rich young lady.","The daughter of a wealthy family was a year younger than her, but they had the same birthday. She wore a cheap dress with a cheap hair clip, while the daughter wore a dress that cost more than 10,000 dollars with a diamond crown. Her parents had given her an island on that day.","At that time, Qiao Xi wiped her tears when no one was looking and told her senior brother about it.","It turned out... he had always remembered.","While she was still in a daze, Gu Zheng gently put a diamond crown on her.","His voice was gentle. “I was going to give it to you on your birthday, but I was afraid...” He was afraid that he wouldn’t be able to be around on that day, so he gave it to her in advance.","“Little Qiao Xi, happy 10th birthday. I’ve been absent for so many years, so I’ll make up for it now.”","As soon as he finished speaking, Qiao Xi’s vision instantly turned blurry.","It had been ten years, not ten days or ten months. She had forgotten all about it, but he had not.","It was not that she envied the rich girl for having the island and the crown. She was just sad that no one remembered her birthday and her family didn’t give her presents. She could only hide in a corner and cry silently.","It was painful to be born and not be cared for."]},{"number":317,"title":"Chapter 317 - Gu Zheng Isnt Her Senior","paragraphs":["Qiao Xi took down the diamond crown and held it in her hand. She was choked up. “Thank you.”","She did not expect to receive her birthday present meant for when she turned 10 years old when she was 20 years old.","Gu Zheng went to attend the donation ceremony while Qiao Xi stood there holding the diamond crown.","“Miss Qiao.”","At this moment, a gentle male voice sounded.","Lu Yan walked over in a light-colored suit with a warm smile on his face. He handed the box to her. “Miss Qiao, this is for you.”","Qiao Xi’s brows were knitted together tightly.","Another gift?","She really could not understand why Lu Yan would take the initiative to approach her when he knew that she and Gu Zheng were husband and wife.","“Mr. Lu, there’s no need.”","Lu Yan was not angry. His expression remained indifferent. “Qiao Xi, you know my identity.”","Qiao Xi’s heart tightened.","Lu Yan smiled. “Your brother should have told you who I am.”","Qiao Xi choked. Third Brother did tell her that she had a fiancé, and that person was Lu Yan.","Lu Yan smiled deeply. “Miss Qiao, to be honest, I really like you and won’t hurt you, so there’s no need for you to keep a distance from me.”","Qiao Xi’s face was filled with vigilance. “No matter what your objective is, I shouldn’t have any contact with you!”","Lu Yan was silent for a moment. His eyes were filled with disappointment, but he still insisted on handing the box to her. His voice carried a hint of pleading. “Open it and take a look.”","Seeing that Qiao Xi didn’t do anything, Lu Yan opened the box for her. A diamond crown was quietly placed in the box. It was decorated with gold foil and gems that glittered under the light.","Qiao Xi was a designer herself, so she understood the value of this crown. This crown was the work of a famous designer, Wright. He had only designed this piece, and it disappeared after an auction a few years ago. Its value was immeasurable.","Lu Yan smiled bitterly. “This crown has been left there for ten years as I hadn’t found its owner. It’s a little old now. You might not like it anymore, but I still hope that you’ll accept it. If you can’t accept it, then you can throw it away.”","As soon as he finished speaking, he passed the box to Qiao Xi before turning around and leaving resolutely.","Qiao Xi’s face was covered in shock while her heart was filled with bewilderment.","Why did Lu Yan give her this crown that he said had been left alone for ten years? Did it mean that Lu Yan had kept it for ten years after buying it?","Lu Yan stopped in his tracks and turned around slightly. “I’m sorry I didn’t manage to bid for the island. I originally decided to give it to you even if I had to go bankrupt. Unfortunately... my ability is limited. I’ll definitely work hard next time. I’ll do my best to give you whatever you like.”","Qiao Xi’s heart twitched. “Lu Yan, how did you know?”","How could Lu Yan be so clear about her birthday wish as a ten-year-old back then?","Lu Yan’s eyes were filled with loneliness. “I know everything, but all of this is meaningless. I only hope that I can do my best to treat you well in the future.”","He sighed sadly and strode away.","Qiao Xi stood silently on the spot, yet her heart was in chaos.","She had only told her senior about her wish back when she was ten years old. Even her brother and grandfather did not know, so how did Lu Yan know?","Moreover, Lu Yan bought this crown ten years ago. What kind of secret was this?","Who was Lu Yan?","...","Gu Zheng told Song Shiyu to return to the Longwan Residential first. When Qiao Xi got into the car, she realized that Gu Zheng was already waiting in the car.","Qiao Xi was unable to calm down for a long time, and she lowered her head.","“What did Lu Yan say?”","Gu Zheng’s voice was cold as if he was suppressing something.","Qiao Xi silently held the box Lu Yan gave her.","As Gu Zheng looked at the box, anger gradually rose in his heart.","Lu Yan was good at scheming. He must have said something to make Qiao Xi so unhappy.","With Qiao Xi’s attitude, did she believe Lu Yan and was now suspecting Gu Zheng?","Qiao Xi was slightly hesitant. “He gave me a diamond crown and said... He said many things that confused me.”","Gu Zheng clenched his fists tightly, his expression dark.","Qiao Xi took a deep breath. “He seems to be reminding me that he’s my senior.”","When Lu Yan was competing for the island, he had laid the groundwork. Now, he even gave her a crown. She had only told her senior about these things. How did Lu Yan know?","Everything Lu Yan did was to remind her that Gu Zheng was not her senior.."]},{"number":318,"title":"Chapter 318 - Never Forgive You!","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Qiao Xi started to understand Lu Yan’s methods after calming down. Could it be that in Lu Yan’s eyes, she was a fool? Did he think she would believe in anyone’s words?","The only thing that puzzled her was who told Lu Yan about these past events? She did not believe that there was such a coincidence in the world.","Qiao Xi played with the diamond crown. “How did he know about what happened ten years ago?”","Gu Zheng did not utter a word as he drove with a dark expression.","How did Lu Yan know about these past events? Lu Yan also gave her a diamond crown that he had bought ten years ago. Lu Yan was gentler than him. Could it be that she liked Lu Yan more?","Qiao Xi looked at him curiously. Why was Gu Zheng’s face so gloomy? Hence, she asked, “Gu Zheng, I’m asking you a question. You...”","Screech—","The car braked and Qiao Xi’s body leaned forward uncontrollably.","Just as she was about to flare up, she saw Gu Zheng gripping the steering wheel tightly. The veins on the back of his hands were bulging, and his body was trembling slightly.","Qiao Xi’s eyes sank. “Gu Zheng, you don’t believe me?”","He took a few breaths and asked, “You took the crown.”","Qiao Xi’s heart ached as she looked at him with disbelief.","She did not know where Lu Yan got this news from that allowed him to put on such an act. His motive was obvious. It was to sow discord between her and Gu Zheng.","However, she did not expect Gu Zheng to take the bait. He really thought that she would believe Lu Yan!","A wave of rage instantly gushed out of Qiao Xi’s heart. They had known each other for 10 years, and even though they’d never met before, this sort of intimate feeling couldn’t be replaced. How could she doubt Gu Zheng?","But he did not believe her!","The image of Lu Yan and her standing together appeared in Gu Zheng’s mind. Lu Yan had once said that he wanted to snatch everything that belonged to him, including Qiao Xi.","Right when he was feeling confused, Qiao Xi unlocked the door and was about to get out of the car.","‘Gu Zheng actually doesn’t believe me! He doesn’t even trust me? Bastard! I’ll beat you to death!","‘Lu Yan is nothing! Does he think that I’ll believe Lu Yan just because he gave me a crown and put on a show of affection? I must be crazy if I believe that!","‘This is infuriating! Gu Zheng is such a jerk!’","After cursing in her heart, Qiao Xi snorted coldly and slammed the car door before storming into the villa.","She ran in a hurry as if her whole body was filled with anger.","Sitting in the car, Gu Zheng seemed to have heard something—","‘I won’t forgive you even if you try to coax me today!’","Gu Zheng sat there in a daze.","She did not believe Lu Yan’s words and was not suspecting Gu Zheng?","The anger and unease in Gu Zheng’s heart instantly vanished. A wave of wild joy surged into his heart. His body was trembling, clearly displaying his excitement.","A moment later, he reacted and hurriedly got out of the car to chase after her.","Just as he was about to enter, he realized that there was a flash of light in the grass by the roadside. The diamond crown that Lu Yan had given her was mercilessly thrown to the grass.","Gu Zheng was stunned for a moment before the butler walked over. “Sir, is this Young Madam’s?”","The man did not hesitate. “Throw it away.”","The butler was puzzled, but he still followed the instructions.","After entering, Qiao Xi was fuming. She had never thought that Gu Zheng would not believe her.","Coincidentally, she bumped into Song Shiyu. He quickly greeted, “Young Madam, you...”","Before he could finish, Qiao Xi walked past him and went upstairs angrily.","Song Shiyu was confused.","Who made Young Madam angry? How scary!","Then, Gu Zheng hurried in as well. Song Shiyu went up to greet him again. “President, um...”","However, Gu Zheng acted as if he did not see him and walked past him to go upstairs.","By the time Song Shiyu realized what had happened, Gu Zheng was gone.","Song Shiyu: “...” Did I master the art of invisibility? Am I that inconspicuous?","On the other side, after Qiao Xi returned to her room, she lay on the bed and hid under the covers.","Gu Zheng knocked on the door and said in a gentle voice, “Qiao Xi, open the door.”","Qiao Xi was even angrier when she heard this. The man didn’t trust her earlier and even lost his temper at her. Now, he was ordering her to open the door?","She would not? She covered herself with the blanket, put on her headphones, and turned the volume to the maximum."]},{"number":319,"title":"Chapter 319 - My Husband Is Furious","paragraphs":["Even so, the knocking sounds still penetrated her ears.","She lifted the blanket in frustration and suddenly thought of something. She picked up her phone and clicked on an application.","Outside the door.","Gu Zheng waited anxiously, but there was still no movement inside. It seemed like Mrs. Gu was really angry.","He knew that he was in the wrong. Mrs. Gu had never believed in Lu Yan, but he did not trust Mrs. Gu. He should know that no matter what, his little junior would trust him unconditionally.","However, the most important thing now was how to appease Mrs. Gu.","His eyes were filled with loneliness. Just as he was about to speak, he heard a piercing sound from inside.","Beep—","Gu Zheng was slightly nervous. “Qiao Xi, what’s wrong?”","Feeling uneasy, he knocked on the door anxiously.","Immediately after, a familiar female voice came from inside. It said without any emotions, “After interacting with you for a long time, I’ve come to like dogs more and more.”","Gu Zheng: “...”","These words sounded a little familiar!","Gu Zheng explained, “I was wrong. I shouldn’t have doubted you. There won’t be a next time. Please forgive...”","Before he could finish speaking, a mechanical female voice sounded from inside.","“I don’t believe you!”","Gu Zheng felt helpless.","He was very familiar with this thing. It was an automatic arguing application that Qiao Xi had asked him to help develop.","However, Qiao Xi was actually using the application he had developed for her.","The veins on his forehead twitched as he said helplessly, “Turn it off first. We...”","The robotic female voice spoke again, “You’re telling me to turn it off, but I won’t. It can’t be switched off in the first 20 minutes.”","Gu Zheng pursed his lips.","As long as this application was activated, it could not be switched off within 20 minutes. He had indeed set it up like this.","Qiao Xi lay on the bed and sent Gu Zheng a message in an extremely pleased manner.","The moment the man’s phone rang, he immediately took it out.","[Senior, you developed a very good arguing application. My husband is fuming!]","Gu Zheng smiled helplessly.","Even at dinner time, Qiao Xi had yet to open the door. Hence, the butler sent some food over.","When the butler went out, he bumped into Song Shijing.","Qiao Xi was hungry and was about to eat when she heard the butler and Song Shijing whispering at the door.","“Assistant Song, what happened?”","Qiao Xi thought that the two of them were going to talk about her, so she instantly became interested and leaned against the door to eavesdrop.","Song Shijing said helplessly, “Lu Yan went to the Gu family’s residence again.”","The butler asked again, “What did he do this time?”","Song Shijing’s face darkened. “He accused the president in front of the elders of the Gu family. He’s the best at pretending to be innocent. Everyone believed him, but in truth, he was the one who provoked Gu Zheng first!”","The butler was furious as well. “It’s all because those people are biased toward him. Even if he does something wrong, they won’t blame him. As long as our president makes the slightest mistake, they’ll obsess over it. Our poor president...”","Qiao Xi’s heart ached.","Song Shijing and the butler said that Lu Yan had always been good at putting on airs and using the Gu family to deal with Gu Zheng. The Gu family would also believe him unconditionally, so their relationship with Gu Zheng was getting worse.","When Gu Zheng saw that Lu Yan had given Qiao Xi a gift, Gu Zheng was afraid that their relationship would be affected. He was afraid that Qiao Xi would be bewitched by Lu Yan like the rest of the Gu family.","It was because he had always been abandoned and criticized, that was why...","Qiao Xi leaned against the door and slid down softly. Was she being too unreasonable? Actually, Gu Zheng didn’t lose his temper at all. He just felt uneasy, but she was unwilling to forgive him.","Gu Zheng had that thought because too many similar things had happened before.","After the noise outside the door disappeared, Qiao Xi quietly pushed the door open and bumped into Song Shiyu who was passing by.","Qiao Xi asked, “Song Shiyu, where’s Gu Zheng?”","Song Shiyu hesitated, his eyes flickering. “In... In the dining room.”","Qiao Xi rushed downstairs and Song Shiyu said hurriedly, “Wait, Young Madam...”","He smiled awkwardly and hinted by saying, “Don’t trust men so easily.”","Unexpectedly! The all-powerful President Gu, in order to beg his wife for forgiveness, even got someone to put on a show.."]},{"number":320,"title":"Chapter 320 - Men Are Creatures Who Lie","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Song Shiyu had listened to the conversation between the butler and his brother from the side. They were speaking the truth, but it was a little too deliberate to say it out loud in front of Young Madam’s room.","This must have been the president’s order to make Young Madam worry.","Song Shiyu didn’t dare to say anything for fear that the president would take it out on him, so he said meaningfully, “Anyway, don’t believe what men say so easily. All men are liars and only know how to act pitiful to gain sympathy! Young Madam, you understand what I mean, right?”","Qiao Xi: “?”","‘Aren’t you a man too?’","...","When Qiao Xi arrived at the dining room, she saw several lit candles on the table. Dim lighting was better than nothing to Gu Zheng.","The man’s vision was dark, and his eyes were lifeless. He sat quietly on the chair.","Qiao Xi’s heart ached, and it hurt to the point her entire body trembled.","She hurried forward. “Where’s the butler? Gu Zheng, why didn’t you switch on the lights?”","The man looked up and followed the voice, but his eyes were unfocused. His face was pale as he frowned in pain.","“There you are.”","Qiao Xi pursed her lips tightly. “Why aren’t you eating? Gu Zheng, I’m actually not angry anymore. I...”","“It’s fine.”","The corners of Gu Zheng’s lips twitched. He said indifferently but with a hint of sadness, “I’m used to it.”","Song Shiyu: “...”","‘F*ck! The president is so scheming! He’s trying to gain sympathy!’","Gu Zheng was so fragile at this moment that it made Qiao Xi’s heart ache. Qiao Xi said gently, “I’ll turn on the lights and eat with you.”","The instant Qiao Xi turned around, the corners of Gu Zheng’s mouth curled up.","Song Shiyu saw this and understood that one should be more shameless. There were not many men as honest as him.","When he married a wife in the future, he had to be as thick-skinned as the president!","...","Gu Zheng ate a few mouthfuls of food with difficulty. His eyes were empty and weak. “When I was young... Grandma was the only one who cared about me. After that, she fell sick and couldn’t help me anymore. But when she was lucid, she would hug me and coax me to sleep.”","Qiao Xi felt a dull pain in her heart.","Gu Zheng’s face was filled with sorrow. “Other than Grandma, everyone else bullied me, tortured me, and even wanted to kill me.”","Qiao Xi was overflowing with sympathy and said without even thinking, “I’ll coax you to sleep.”","After she said that, she was surprised by her own words and felt that they were inappropriate. Just as she was about to correct herself, she saw Gu Zheng suddenly looking up.","There was finally a ripple in his eyes. “Really?”","Gu Zheng had always been domineering and cold, exuding the aura of a king. But right now, he was so fragile that it made one’s heart ache.","If she went back on her words, Gu Zheng would probably be very disappointed, right? He would feel that there was no one in this world who cared about him.","After hesitating for a moment, Qiao Xi nodded. “Yes.”","Song Shiyu was petrified by what he saw. How could this be?","After Qiao Xi helped Gu Zheng upstairs, he rushed to Song Shijing. “The president is acting a little weird!”","Song Shijing looked at him indifferently.","Song Shiyu was curious. “The president doesn’t know how to date at all. Why would he come up with such a method to beg for Young Madam’s forgiveness? There must be someone behind this! Brother, do you know who it is? Tell me, who is it?”","Song Shijing looked away and said unhurriedly, “I got a raise.”","“What?” Song Shiyu was furious. “Why am I having my salary deducted every day while you get a raise?! This is injustice!”","Song Shijing smiled. “Why? Because in the president’s eyes, you and I are of different values to him.”","Song Shiyu always came up with bad ideas, but his suggestions had helped the president coax Young Madam.","They were both brothers. Why were their IQs so different?!","...","The next morning.","Qiao Xi slowly woke up. As she looked at the slightly unfamiliar environment before her, she recalled that she’d slept in Gu Zheng’s room last night.","It was unknown when Gu Zheng had left, but Qiao Xi sat on the bed with a dumbfounded expression.","That wasn’t right!","It was clearly Gu Zheng who made her angry. Why was she the one who coaxed him to sleep in the end?","Did Gu Zheng have an expert guiding him?","Suddenly, her phone rang. It was Xue Yi.","After Qiao Xi answered the call, Xue Yi said anxiously, “Little Six, do you know that someone donated a school building to Li City University?”","“I know.” This matter had long spread throughout Li City University.. Of course, she knew about it too."]},{"number":321,"title":"Chapter 321 - Something Must Be Wrong","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Xue Yi sounded shocked. “Then do you know who the donor is?”","Qiao Xi knew that Xue Yi must know this person.","Who was it?","Before she could guess, Xue Yi said, “It’s Gu Moling.”","Gu Moling?","Qiao Xi sneered. “He’s so generous?”","“Of course, it’s for Qiao Rou!” Xue Yi’s tone was full of disdain.","“After Qiao Rou’s identity as an illegitimate daughter was exposed, the university blew up. Some people even asked her to withdraw from the university, so Gu Moling sponsored the construction of a building. This way, no matter what Qiao Rou’s identity is, she’s still the future Mrs. Gu. Naturally, no one would gossip about her anymore.”","Qiao Xi smiled. “I see...”","Xue Yi sneered. “The university is going to hold a donation ceremony to thank Gu Moling and Qiao Rou. Qiao Rou told the university leaders that she hopes you can participate too. The chancellor will call to invite you soon.”","Qiao Xi didn’t care about this. The only thing she was curious about was that building should cost a lot of money. When did Gu Moling become so rich?","...","Shortly after the call ended, the chancellor called and invited her to attend the donation ceremony at three in the afternoon.","Qiao Xi agreed, but she wasn’t in a hurry to get out of the house. Instead, she turned on her computer and did an operation. The computer screen was filled with complicated letters and symbols.","She glanced at it and smiled.","“Butler!”","The butler immediately rushed over. “Young Madam.”","Qiao Xi sneered. “Give Gu Yao a call and tell him to rush to Li City University as soon as possible. He’s already so old, yet he doesn’t even know that someone stole a huge sum of money from his bank account!”","There must be something wrong with the donation. Where did Gu Moling get so much money from? It turned out it was stolen from Gu Yao’s account!","...","Song Shiyu watched Qiao Xi leave in a hurry and reminded him, “President, aren’t you going with Young Madam?”","Gu Zheng took a sip of coffee and said calmly, “She can handle such a small matter.”","Song Shiyu was confused. “It’s just the Qiao family. You can crush them with one finger. Why...”","Gu Zheng waved his hand.","The Qiao family was Qiao Xi’s childhood nightmare. She suffered the greatest malice from their bullying and the cruel human world.","When she was bullied by the illegitimate daughter, her biological father and his mistress would hit and scold her. They even almost killed her. The darkness and fear she once suffered from had gathered into strong hatred.","Because of this, she would not easily get rid of the Qiao family.","Gu Zheng’s expression turned cold. After a moment of silence, he ordered, “Get Song Shijing to follow Gu Yao.”","Song Shiyu was speechless. Second Young Master was going too? Did Gu Moling...","Damn! Who gave Gu Moling the guts to touch Gu Yao’s money? He must be crazy!","Wait, that wasn’t right!","Song Shiyu looked at Gu Zheng in confusion.","Gu Zheng smiled meaningfully. “They’re all going to Li City University. I’m going to the Gu family’s old residence to visit my mother.”","...","Li City University.","The news of Gu Moling investing 80 million yuan to donate a building for the university had spread everywhere. Hence, the university decided to hold a donation ceremony to thank Gu Moling and Qiao Rou for their generosity.","Qiao Rou was from the entertainment industry, after all. When many media outlets heard this news, they all rushed over.","As soon as Qiao Xi entered the hall, she heard people discussing...","“Isn’t Qiao Rou an illegitimate daughter? Why is the son of the Gu family still getting engaged to her? And they even spent so much money to donate a building for her?”","“I heard that Qiao Rou is already engaged to Young Master Gu. Young Master Gu probably wants to support her, so he donated so much money!”","“I’m so envious! Whether Qiao Rou is an illegitimate daughter or not, having a man who loves her so much is enough.”","“The two of them look so compatible standing together!”","Qiao Xi looked at the two people in the crowd. One was the vicious illegitimate daughter of the mistress, while the other was a thief who illegally stole someone else’s money. They were indeed a good match!","The donation ceremony’s venue was packed with people. The media, teachers, and students were all in the hall.","Qiao Xi smiled. Qiao Rou really knew how to find an excuse for herself.","Previously, her Weibo account was a mess.. She didn’t even come forward to clarify things, but now, she and Gu Moling were attending the donation ceremony in a high-profile manner."]},{"number":322,"title":"Chapter 322 - Inviting Her To The Wedding?","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Actually, the things from the past didn’t matter. As long as the donation ceremony went smoothly, Qiao Rou would be praised by the entire university and no one would mention her past mistakes.","At this moment, the chancellor invited Gu Moling and Qiao Rou on stage. Qiao Rou said gracefully,","“Thank you all for attending the donation ceremony. Brother Moling and I just want to help our alma mater as much as we can, but we also have some selfish motives...”","Qiao Rou paused and looked around before smiling. “My sister and I are both in Li City University, so this building was donated for us both.”","Everyone looked puzzled.","They all knew that the news of Qiao Rou being the illegitimate daughter was exposed because of Qiao Xi.","Now, Qiao Rou said that she donated a building for her sister.","These two sisters seemed to have a good relationship. Could it be that everything that had happened before was a misunderstanding?","Qiao Xi heard the people around her mutter, “Although Qiao Rou is an illegitimate daughter, I feel that her relationship with her sister is not bad!”","“It’s not her fault that she’s an illegitimate daughter. Rou Rou treats her sister very well. Why would Miss Qiao hate her?”","“That’s right. She’s indeed an illegitimate daughter, but Young Master Gu still acknowledges their relationship in front of everyone and even donated a building for her. If Qiao Rou is really not a good person, why would the Gu family allow her to join their family?”","“Qiao Rou is really fortunate to be able to marry into a wealthy family like the Gu family. No one will remember her identity as an illegitimate daughter in the future. On the other hand, Miss Qiao is in trouble. I heard that someone came to ask for her hand in marriage. After she left the Qiao family, that person said that he would never marry Miss Qiao even if he were to be single for the rest of his life! What kind of personality does Miss Qiao have? How could she scare someone to this extent?”","“She grew up in the countryside. Her behavior must be terrible!”","The reporters at the scene were live-streaming the event. These unintentional words were quickly spread.","Qiao Rou already had millions of fans. Although her identity as an illegitimate daughter was exposed and she lost a portion of her fans, there were still many brainless fans supporting her.","Not long after, a bunch of fans rushed into the live-stream broadcast.","Qiao Rou slowly walked down the stage and walked toward Qiao Xi. “Sister, come on stage with me.”","In an instant, everyone’s eyes and cameras were on the two of them.","Qiao Rou’s eyes were filled with worry. “Sister, what happened before is in the past. I’m very worried about you being alone outside.”","Then, she faced the media and said, “My relationship with my sister is very good. What happened before was just a misunderstanding. Some people exaggerated and spread the news. Actually, my sister and I didn’t go against each other.”","Everyone was stunned.","Qiao Rou said helplessly, “Sister, I actually donated the building this time to meet you. We’re sisters, after all.","“Brother Moling and I are getting married. You’ll attend our wedding, right?”","Everyone widened their eyes.","It turned out that this wasn’t just a donation ceremony. Qiao Rou and Gu Moling wanted to use this opportunity to announce their marriage in a high-profile manner.","At this moment, Zhao Lili rushed forward and said, “Our Rou Rou is beautiful and kind. Why would she do those despicable things? It was Qiao Xi who spread the rumors because she’s jealous of Rou Rou’s beauty and the fact that Rou Rou is getting married to Young Master Gu!”","Qiao Rou stopped her gently. “Lili, don’t talk nonsense. My sister didn’t mean it. Although there’s a misunderstanding between us sisters, our relationship is still very good. My sister will definitely attend the wedding.”","Everyone looked at Qiao Xi and waited for her answer.","After a moment of silence, she chuckled.","Did Qiao Rou think that she was still infatuated with Gu Moling?","Previously, Gu Moling was her fiance. They were about to get married, but the bride was switched to Qiao Rou.","Qiao Rou must be very happy that she snatched away the man who originally belonged to her. Qiao Rou was even about to get married to him now.","Qiao Xi suddenly said, “You and Gu Moling are getting married, so you want to invite me to your wedding?”","Qiao Rou looked down, feeling wronged. “Sister, are you unwilling? We’re sisters...”","Xu Mei had sent someone to investigate Qiao Xi. For the sake of shares, she had secretly gotten married. Qiao Rou heard that the man was just a random passerby.","Passerby? His one month’s salary was not even enough for her to buy some clothes. How could he compare to Brother Moling?"]},{"number":323,"title":"Chapter 323 - You Are The Witness To Our Love","paragraphs":["Qiao Xi definitely still liked Brother Moling but she was just unwilling to admit it out of consideration for her dignity.","Everyone knew that Qiao Xi was the one who contributed to Brother Moling’s company’s current glory. However, these things would be Qiao Rou’s in the future.","How could Qiao Xi not be angry at all? She was probably close to spitting out blood!","Qiao Rou had a gentle expression and pretended to be very intimate. “Sister, I really hope that you can come to my wedding. Just promise me, okay?”","At that moment, the fans watching the live-stream broadcast were all envious.","If only Rou Rou could invite them to the wedding too. That would be such an honor!","Everyone was waiting for Qiao Xi to agree. Although Qiao Rou was an illegitimate daughter, she was still Qiao Xi’s younger sister. Moreover, she was the future Mrs. Gu. How could Qiao Xi not give her some face?","Qiao Rou’s eyes were filled with smugness and sinisterness. “Sister, if it weren’t for you, I’m afraid Brother Moling and I wouldn’t have gotten together. You’re the witness of our love. If you don’t attend our wedding, I’ll be very regretful—”","“I’m not going!” Qiao Rou said coldly, directly interrupting Qiao Rou.","Everyone stared at her in disbelief.","Qiao Xi said indifferently, “I have to go just because you invited me? Is there such a rule?”","Qiao Rou’s face was full of grievances. She bit her lip as tears trickled down her face.","“Sister, why are you unwilling?”","Her weak and delicate appearance made everyone’s heart ache.","Zhao Lili immediately rushed over and roared, “Qiao Xi! What do you mean? Rou Rou personally invited you, but you refused! You’re too much!","“It’s just that our Rou Rou is beautiful and kind. She doesn’t care about what happened in the past and even invited you to attend the wedding! Back then, you were jealous of Rou Rou and Moling being together. You felt resentful and even found someone to almost rape Rou Rou. This matter—”","“Lili!” Qiao Rou interrupted her in a panic and hurriedly stopped her. “Lili, don’t say anymore. Sister...”","Zhao Lili was indignant. “Rou Rou! If you keep covering up for her, she won’t remember your kindness. Instead, she’ll bully you even more!","“Today, I’ll let everyone see just what kind of person this sl*t is! I believe everyone remembers Rou Rou’s disappearance back then, right? It was this woman who hired people to rape Rou Rou. She even had the intention to kill Rou Rou. Fortunately, Rou Rou was lucky and managed to escape. However, she also became traumatized because of this and has been having nightmares since. She only recovered after resting for a long time!","“A vicious woman like Qiao Xi should just die! Rou Rou disregarded the past and invited you to the wedding, yet you’re still making excuses! Your skin is really thicker than the city’s walls!”","Everyone heard what Zhao Lili said.","“Damn! This is big news!”","“I remember that Qiao Rou did disappear for a period of time, and Qiao Xi didn’t come to university either. So it was Qiao Xi... I never expected that! She actually treated her younger sister like that!”","Qiao Xi was calm. “Qiao Rou, is that so?”","“No! Don’t misunderstand.” Qiao Rou shook her head helplessly with tears in her eyes.","“Lili, stop it. This is all a rumor. Sister wouldn’t have done that to me. This... This is fake news! Sister, don’t listen to Lili’s nonsense. I really just want to invite you to the wedding. Without you, Brother Moling and I wouldn’t have been able to get together. I’m really grateful to you...”","Qiao Xi was instantly speechless.","That’s right. Without her, Qiao Rou and Gu Moling wouldn’t have been able to get together.","Qiao Rou would think of ways to snatch away everything that belonged to her. Moreover, without this engagement, Qiao Rou wouldn’t have known Gu Moling.","Qiao Rou looked so weak at this moment. Her voice trembled slightly. “Sister, I beg you. What... What must I do for you to come to my wedding? What should I do... How...”","Zhao Lili was livid.","“Rou Rou, why are you begging her? She’s the one who’s been scheming to harm you! She even wanted to snatch your man away. You’re already giving her enough face by inviting her to attend your wedding.. Since she’s unwilling, then forget it!”"]},{"number":324,"title":"Chapter 324 - Sister Xue Is Here","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","“In the future, the Qiao family will belong to Rou Rou. It won’t have anything to do with you. It’s better if you don’t attend!”","The moment Zhao Lili finished speaking, a cold female voice came from the door.","“What does it have to do with you who the Qiao family belongs to? I haven’t heard that the inheritance will be handed to an illegitimate daughter, yet the eldest miss was already chased out of the house!”","Xue Yi rushed in with a gloomy expression. She patted Qiao Xi’s shoulder and glanced at Zhao Lili coldly.","“You’re just a lackey of Qiao Rou’s! Do you have the right to teach Xi Xi a lesson? Qiao Rou is a b*tch and the daughter of a mistress. Why does Qiao Xi have to attend her wedding? The Qiao family’s assets have all been snatched away by this pair of mother and daughter. Can’t Eldest Miss Qiao show a trace of dissatisfaction?”","Zhao Lili did not know Xue Yi’s identity and thought that she was Qiao Xi’s scoundrel friend. When she heard this, she immediately retorted,","“You’re the lackey! What I said is the truth! Qiao Xi was jealous that Rou Rou has the love of a man like Young Master Gu, so she doesn’t want to attend the wedding. Otherwise, what other reason could there be?”","Xue Yi’s eyes were filled with danger as she asked word by word, “I’m a lackey?”","Her eyes were filled with coldness. “Qiao Rou, are you happy to see someone standing up for you?”","Qiao Rou’s body trembled as she explained helplessly, “Sister Xue, you... You’ve misunderstood. Lili is a little straightforward, but she doesn’t have any ill intentions. I just wanted to invite Qiao Xi to the wedding. I didn’t mean anything else.”","Thinking of the pain Little Six had suffered when she was young, Xue Yi looked at Qiao Rou’s pretentious behavior and instantly burned with anger.","“You even have the cheek to invite Xi Xi to the wedding? Zhao Lili doesn’t know anything, but you know very well! Gu Moling’s original fiancee is—”","Before she could finish, Gu Moling happened to walk over. “What’s wrong?”","Seeing this, Qiao Rou’s body immediately went soft. She weakly fell into Gu Moling’s arms and sobbed softly.","“Brother Moling, I’m fine. It’s just that my sister isn’t willing to attend our wedding. Sister Xue scolded me a few times. Don’t be angry. It’s all my fault...”","Gu Moling’s expression darkened. “Xi Xi, it’s such an important occasion today. Can you stop fooling around?”","Qiao Xi glanced coldly at him.","She was really blind to have fallen for Gu Moling back then!","“Xi Xi is fooling around?” Xue Yi’s face was filled with ridicule. “Gu Moling, when did you see Xi Xi fooling around? Qiao Rou invited Xi Xi to the wedding in public. Do you think she has the right to invite her?”","Xue Yi looked coldly at Qiao Rou. “Don’t pretend to be pitiful in front of me. I’m disgusted by your acting! You look innocent, but you’ve done many vicious things! You know this very well!”","Everyone widened their eyes.","Xue Yi was the Xue family’s daughter, after all. She was actually so... shrewish?","Gu Moling was unhappy and said coldly, “Miss Xue, it’s true that you’re the daughter of the Xue family, but this isn’t your Xue family’s territory. Our matters have nothing to do with you! Our marriage...”","He looked at Qiao Rou.","Qiao Rou immediately became nervous. Her tears fell as she looked pitiful. “Brother Moling, I don’t have any ill intentions. I just... I hoped that Sister could attend...”","Gu Moling was slightly helpless. Rou Rou only had this one sister, so it was reasonable for her to want Qiao Xi to attend the wedding. It was just that their relationship with Qiao Xi was slightly complicated.","Gu Moling did not think too much about it. His voice was stiff. “Xi Xi, since Rou Rou has invited you, come and attend our wedding!”","Then, his attitude softened. “Xi Xi, about what happened before... We’ll talk about it later. It’s the donation ceremony now. There are so many media outlets here. You don’t want to make things too awkward, right?”","At this moment, all the cameras were aimed at Qiao Xi.","Qiao Xi sneered.","She ran her fingers through her hair and said indifferently, “You want me to attend the wedding and give you my blessings?”","Qiao Rou bit her lip aggrievedly.","Qiao Xi said disdainfully, “If I don’t give you my blessings, will you not get married?”","Gu Moling choked. “You!”","Qiao Rou’s body trembled slightly. “Sister, it’s all my fault.. Since you don’t want to attend our wedding, forget it.”"]},{"number":325,"title":"Chapter 325 - Who Is The Mistress?","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","“Qiao Xi! You really don’t know what’s good for you! Could it be that we have to expose the dirty things you did in front of everyone before you lower your head and admit your mistake?”","Zhao Lili said generously, “Previously, there were rumors that Rou Rou’s image was destroyed and Madam Qiao wanted to sell Qiao Xi. This is all a misunderstanding!”","Qiao Rou quickly stopped her. “Stop talking!”","“Rou Rou, if you won’t tell everyone, I’ll do it for you. I want everyone to know how vicious Qiao Xi is!”","Everyone held their breaths.","They heard that Qiao Rou was kind-hearted and had a good relationship with Qiao Xi. How could she just watch as Xu Mei abused Qiao Xi and almost sold her?","Did Qiao Rou not know about this, or did she abuse Qiao Xi with Xu Mei?","If Qiao Rou had really done these things, why would Gu Moling still be willing to marry Qiao Rou after he found out?","Hearing Zhao Lili’s words, everyone’s eyes burned.","Qiao Xi sneered. Oh, she was prepared to use her ultimate move.","Zhao Lili was extremely arrogant. This time, she would definitely ruin Qiao Xi’s reputation!","“Qiao Xi is a mistress!","“She ruined Rou Rou and Young Master Gu’s relationship and wanted to climb up the social ladder herself. That’s why she’s unwilling to attend the wedding, much less give them her blessings.”","Zhao Lili’s words made Qiao Xi seem like a mistress, and everyone’s gazes fell on Qiao Xi.","If Qiao Xi had deliberately harmed Qiao Rou and stole her fiance, it was reasonable for Xu Mei to make a move against Qiao Xi.","After all, Qiao Rou had humbly invited Qiao Xi to the wedding just now, but Qiao Xi had rejected it heartlessly.","Qiao Xi previously seduced Young Master Gu, yet Qiao Rou disregarded the past and invited her to the wedding. How could she not go?","Zhao Lili looked proud. “Rou Rou invited you to the wedding because you’re her sister! It’s not enough that you’re fooling around outside, but you even want to ruin your sister’s relationship. She didn’t expose you because of our relationship, but you actually joined hands with others to scold Rou Rou. You’re really vicious!”","At this moment, Qiao Rou’s friends stood up and said sarcastically.","“I was wondering why Rou Rou looked so sad when she saw Qiao Xi and Young Master Gu together. So that’s how it is!”","“Qiao Xi tried to seduce Young Master Gu but Rou Rou took her sister’s reputation into consideration and didn’t expose her.”","Zhao Lili continued, “A year ago, this b*tch targeted Young Master Gu. I even saw her holding Young Master Gu’s hand. Young Master Gu knew that she was Rou Rou’s sister and was embarrassed to make things worse, so he endured it. Rou Rou could only cry secretly behind his back.”","Everyone was dumbfounded.","The cameras of the media were all focused on Qiao Xi as they recorded everything.","They did not come here in vain today. The two sisters were fighting over a man, and one of them was even the current popular star, Qiao Rou. This news was shocking enough.","Zhao Lili looked at Qiao Rou and said gently, “Rou Rou, this b*tch won’t disturb you anymore.”","Qiao Xi’s eyes narrowed slightly. Who was harassing whom? It was Qiao Rou who kept provoking her, alright?!","Among the crowd, only Gu Moling had a subtle expression. As he knew the inside story, he looked at Qiao Rou in disbelief. “You told Zhao Lili this?”","Qiao Rou’s expression froze. She had almost forgotten about Gu Moling.","She lowered her head, and the smile on her face suddenly vanished. Tears trickled down her face as she said helplessly, “I... I don’t know... Brother Moling, Lili must have misunderstood something. I know that I’ve let my sister down, so I wanted to beg her for forgiveness, but she...","“Ever since I got together with you, I’ve always wanted to beg my sister for forgiveness. However, no matter what I do, she doesn’t appreciate my kindness and hates me even more. Why would I slander her?”","Gu Moling’s tightly furrowed brows relaxed.","He knew that with Rou Rou’s character, she would not do such a thing.","Qiao Rou looked helpless. “But I don’t know why things became like this. My sister has been called a mistress. Even if I explain, no one will believe me. Brother Moling, what should I do...”","Qiao Rou cried helplessly, her eyes filled with self-reproach."]},{"number":326,"title":"Chapter 326 - The Adulterous Couple Will Be Punished Sooner Or Later","paragraphs":["“It’s all my fault. I’ll admit it now. I’m the mistress. My sister isn’t! Brother Moling! As long as I can be with you, I can give up my future and career as a celebrity. I’d rather everyone scold me. It’s okay...”","As soon as she finished speaking, Qiao Rou reached out to take the microphone.","Gu Moling quickly stopped her and said in a low voice, “Rou Rou!”","He knew very well that if this matter was exposed, it would be a huge blow to him. He would be labeled as a scumbag and the company’s interests would be affected. Hence, he could only hide the truth.","Gu Moling held Qiao Rou’s hand and said in a gentle voice, “I know that this wasn’t your intention and it’s really not good to wrong her like this. You have to apologize to her later. I can only let Qiao Xi suffer today.","“If you tell the truth, your celebrity career will be ruined. Moreover, these people won’t let you off. Rou Rou, how can I bear to let you suffer?”","Qiao Rou leaned against her chest shyly. “Brother Moling, thank you, but Sister...”","She lowered her eyes and smiled to herself. “Sister can only bear the reputation of being a mistress for now. I feel really guilty!”","Gu Moling sighed helplessly. He did not want to do this to Qiao Xi either. Actually, he still had feelings for Qiao Xi. After all, it was Qiao Xi who had accompanied him through his most difficult years back then and even helped him establish his current company.","However, this gratitude was not love. The woman he really liked was Rou Rou!","Xi Xi’s character was too strong and she was too dazzling. Everyone would only think that his current accomplishments were all because of Qiao Xi and he had not put in enough effort.","Rou Rou was a gentle woman who was willing to support him from behind.","Gu Moling hugged Qiao Rou and confessed gently, “Rou Rou, I don’t regret being with you. You’re the woman I truly love. Back then, it was Xi Xi who was in an ambiguous relationship with a client, while you were innocent and were willing to give up your career for me... After that, Qiao Xi even found someone to bully you. If you hadn’t gone against her with your life, how could you have escaped? All of this proves that you love me, and I love you too.”","As he spoke, Gu Moling was even more sure of his feelings for Qiao Rou. “Our mistake was that we didn’t meet at the right time. If I had met you first, everything might not have happened.”","Qiao Rou’s eyes were red as she shed tears. “Brother Moling.”","“Forget it. In any case, we’ve already completely offended Xi Xi, so this matter won’t matter anymore. We’ll compensate her a little more after this and beg her to forgive us.”","Gu Moling looked at Qiao Xi and said worriedly, “Chancellor, Rou Rou has a headache. I’ll bring her to the lounge first.”","His lack of explanation, coupled with his show of concern for Qiao Rou, had already proven everything. Qiao Xi was a mistress.","Qiao Rou left weakly. Gu Moling turned around and looked at Qiao Xi with a warning gaze.","Qiao Xi understood that Gu Moling was warning her not to spout nonsense.","After Gu Moling and Qiao Rou left, the reporters rushed up and surrounded Qiao Xi. “Miss Qiao, you seduced Young Master Gu and interfered with your biological sister’s relationship. Why exactly did you do that?”","“I heard that in order to seduce Young Master Gu, you often went to the Gu family’s residence and even threatened your younger sister. Is this true?”","Xue Yi gritted her teeth and called for the bodyguards to protect Qiao Xi as she left the scene.","However, Xue Yi knew very well that doing this was equivalent to escaping in the eyes of everyone. The live-stream broadcast was filled with Qiao Rou’s fans, and they had probably gone on a cursing spree with Qiao Xi as the target.","Xue Yi frowned. “You’ll admit it just like that?”","Qiao Xi watched as Gu Moling and Qiao Rou left. The corners of her mouth slowly curled up. “Admit it? Do you think that’s possible?”","She was in no rush. This adulterous pair would suffer sooner or later. Now was not the time.","Qiao Xi asked, “Uncle and Aunt will be here soon, right?”","Xue Yi nodded. “I just sent a message. They’re almost here.”","Qiao Xi had an indifferent expression. “Uncle and Aunt are coming soon, and Gu Yao is coming too. How long do you think those two can laugh for?”","Xue Yi immediately realized that Little Six had not started fighting back yet!"]},{"number":327,"title":"Chapter 327 - A Storm Of Public Opinion","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Looking at the reporters behind them, Xue Yi pulled Qiao Xi into a lounge. There was a group of bodyguards guarding the door. Not even a fly could get in.","...","Soon, a topic quickly spread online. The Qiao family had bought a trending topic. The topic was ‘Qiao Rou was slandered. It turns out the mistress is someone else’. Qiao Rou’s fans started reposting it.","The media had also edited the video at the scene. It showed Gu Moling admitting that Qiao Xi seduced him and almost ruined his relationship with Qiao Rou.","There was also news about Zhao Lili. She accused Qiao Xi of snatching a man from her younger sister. She revealed some photos of Qiao Xi and Gu Moling together, confirming the fact that she previously tried to seduce her younger sister’s man.","At this moment, Gu Zheng was sitting on the sofa and clicking open those photos.","There was a scene of Qiao Xi and Gu Moling holding hands as they got into the car. There was also a photo of Qiao Xi and Gu Moling standing opposite each other with smiles on their faces. In another photo, the two of them were on a date.","Gu Zheng narrowed his eyes. How could the woman he treasured tolerate their slander?","His long fingers tapped on the table, then he picked up his phone to call Gu Yan.","After Gu Yan picked up the call, his voice trembled slightly. “President... President Gu?”","...","In the lounge on the other side, Qiao Xi looked at the comments online with interest. Most of them were posted by Qiao Rou’s fans.","[The elder sister seduced her brother-in-law! She’s really shameless! She even wronged Rou Rou previously. This woman is too scheming!]","[Our Rou Rou is so pitiful! She has been bullied by that b*tch for so many years. If it weren’t for Young Master Gu’s firm character and persistence in being with Rou Rou, Rou Rou would be so sad.]","[I finally understand why Xu Mei sold Qiao Xi to President Qian. Qiao Xi has done so much to Rou Rou. As Rou Rou’s mother, she definitely couldn’t sit idly by. This kind of woman deserves to die!]","Xue Yi snorted. “Qiao Rou’s fans are really the same as her. They’re all brainless!”","Qiao Xi smiled. “What’s strange about that? Her fans almost killed me! They even said that killing me for Qiao Rou was an honor.”","At this moment, footsteps came from outside.","Qiao Xi raised her eyebrows. They were finally here.","...","Qiao Rou and Gu Moling were in the lounge. They picked up their phones and watched the news online.","Gu Moling looked helpless. “Rou Rou, stop crying. You won’t look good if you cry. A reporter will come to interview you later.”","Qiao Rou wiped her tears. “I don’t know how things ended up like this. Sister will definitely hate me. What should I do?! But if I tell the truth, the companies under your name will be affected and my endorsements will be canceled. After all, the company’s interests are the most important.”","“That’s why it’s best to let Qiao Xi shoulder this crime. This wasn’t our intention at all. It’s just that public opinion has already fallen to one side. If we step out and clarify things now, no one will believe us.”","Gu Moling pulled her into his arms. “This isn’t your fault. It was Zhao Lili who said it in front of everyone. It’s better if you don’t keep in contact with her in the future. She’s not a good person to malign Qiao Xi like this.”","Qiao Xi nodded, but her eyes were filled with viciousness.","Zhao Lili had only said a few words to Qiao Xi before Brother Moling stopped her from interacting with Zhao Lili. It seemed that he still cared about Qiao Xi.","How detestable!","However, so what if that was the case? Now that Qiao Xi’s reputation was ruined and everyone was cursing at her, she would probably have to hide her identity from now on.","Moreover, Qiao Rou was about to marry Brother Moling. She would be Mrs. Gu, while Qiao Xi would be a lowly mistress!","Just then, someone knocked on the door.","The assistant said, “Sir, Chairman Xue, Madam Xue, and the second young master of the Gu family, Gu Yao, are here. The chancellor wants you to go over.”","Gu Moling stood up and straightened his clothes. “Alright, I’ll go out now!”","He had donated 80 million this time not only for Qiao Rou but also to enter high society.","If he could build a good relationship with Chairman Xue, it would be very helpful to his future career.","Gu Moling instructed softly, “Rou Rou, you haven’t met Chairman Xue and Madam Xue before. Don’t spout nonsense later. The couple is famous in high society. I believe they won’t make things difficult for you.”","Qiao Rou wiped her tears and nodded obediently."]},{"number":328,"title":"Chapter 328 - Young Master Gu Changed Fiancees?","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Gu Moling and Qiao Rou quickly arrived at the hall.","When the reporters saw the two of them come out, they immediately picked up their cameras and started taking photos.","Gu Moling walked in front and was filled with joy. Other than the Xue couple, there were also a few other famous businessmen in the industry. They had all donated money to Li City University.","The chancellor’s face was red. “Everyone, this is Young Master Gu, the donor.","“Everyone here has contributed to Li City University, so I suggest we take a photo together as a memento.”","Everyone stood up and shook Gu Moling’s hand warmly.","“What a young hero! Young Master Gu is so magnanimous at such a young age. He donated 80 million yuan in one go. He’s the second person to donate this much in history. First place is naturally President Gu, Gu Zheng. Back then, he donated 200 million yuan!”","When they took the photo together, Gu Moling and Qiao Rou were standing at the side. Everyone then realized that Gu Moling had brought a female companion.","The person beside Chairman Xue looked at Qiao Rou and asked in confusion, “Young Master Gu, who’s this?”","Gu Moling looked obsequious. “It’s my fiancee, Qiao Rou. This building was donated by us husband and wife. She’s a student of Li City University and a popular celebrity too.”","Although the Qiao family was not as great as the Gu family, Qiao Rou was a celebrity, after all. These people would definitely show her some face.","Unexpectedly, everyone’s expressions were a little strange.","Gu Moling was a little uneasy, while Qiao Rou pursed her lips.","Could it be that they were looking down on celebrities? That shouldn’t be the case! Madam Xue was also an actress and was filming a movie.","At this moment, a businessman said, “Why isn’t your fiancee the same person as before?”","Madam Xue frowned. “Previously, I heard that Young Master Gu was about to marry his fiancee. Why did he suddenly change fiancees?”","Their voices were not loud and Gu Moling and Qiao Rou did not hear them clearly. However, the sharp-eared reporters heard them.","At the same time, this scene was recorded and transmitted to the live-stream broadcast.","The comments paused for a moment, then someone asked: [Gu Moling’s fiancee isn’t the previous one? In other words, Qiao Rou is the second fiancee?]","Qiao Rou’s brainless fans immediately stepped out: [They must have remembered wrongly. Rou Rou is Young Master Gu’s fiancee!]","If these words were said by someone else, they would naturally be suspicious. However, who was Madam Xue? Did she have to malign Qiao Rou and Gu Moling?","After taking the photo, an angry roar suddenly came from afar. “Qiao Xi! You still dare to come?!”","Zhao Lili pointed at Qiao Xi’s nose and cursed, “You b*tch, you’re really shameless! Young Master Gu doesn’t like you at all, yet you’re still pestering him! Can’t you live without a man?”","Everyone looked at the door with disdain.","Qiao Xi was wearing a long dress as she walked over slowly with an indifferent expression. She looked at Gu Yao, then at Madam Xue.","At this moment, the few of them suddenly reacted. “Miss Qiao, I think we’ve met before?”","Zhao Lili instantly snorted coldly. “Qiao Xi! You’re really awesome! You tried to seduce Young Master Gu but you weren’t satisfied, so you even seduced President Chen. You b*tch!”","Chairman Chen looked pensive. “Where have I seen Miss Qiao before?”","Madam Chen nodded as well. “That’s right, I’ve seen her too.”","Zhao Lili said noisily, “Rou Rou, you don’t have to cover for your sister anymore. She only has eyes for men and money. She seduces every man she sees!”","Qiao Rou stopped her. “Lili, stop talking.”","“I’m going to say it! Qiao Xi is a mistress and seduced Young Master Gu. Why are you hiding it for her? In the past few years when you were with Young Master Gu, she has always been interfering in your relationship. If it weren’t for Young Master Gu liking you—”","“Lili, don’t say that about my sister,” Qiao Rou interrupted.","“Sister indeed likes Brother Moling and wanted to marry him on my behalf, but she’s definitely not a casual woman. Don’t spout nonsense.”","Qiao Rou faced the cameras and silently shed tears. “My sister is really not that kind of person. Actually, she’s not wrong either. She just fell for a man. Unfortunately, Brother Moling already has me. It’s impossible for him to marry her..”"]},{"number":329,"title":"Chapter 329 - Who’s The Third Party?","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Qiao Rou’s explanation proved that Qiao Xi was a mistress and pushed Qiao Xi to the edge of the cliff.","Gu Moling also chimed in, “Xi Xi isn’t that kind of woman. Moreover, Rou Rou and I don’t blame her anymore. Please stop spreading rumors.”","As soon as she finished speaking, Madam Chen suddenly realized something. “I remember now!”","Everyone looked at her while she said to her good friend beside her, “A few years ago, we were always working with the Gu family. At that time, Young Master Gu and the Gu family brought Miss Qiao Xi along. Moreover, Miss Qiao Xi represented the Gu family for a few of their businesses and attended the meetings to discuss them.”","Qiao Rou’s expression froze.","Everyone was extremely puzzled as well. What right did Qiao Xi, a mistress, have to attend meetings on behalf of Young Master Gu?","Before everyone could think about it, Madam Zhou said word by word, explaining the doubts in everyone’s hearts.","“At that time, the Gu family clearly told us that Miss Qiao Xi is Gu Moling’s fiancee!”","...","After the last few words were said, the entire venue fell silent.","Qiao Xi was Gu Moling’s fiancee, so who was Qiao Rou?","Everyone’s burning gazes landed on Qiao Rou.","Qiao Rou lowered her head and trembled nervously.","“No, it’s not like that...” Qiao Rou was flustered as tears trickled down her face.","Madam Chen snorted. “Miss Qiao Rou, are you saying that I’m wrong? I wasn’t the only one who heard what the Gu family said.”","Qiao Rou’s voice trembled. “Madam Chen, that’s not what I meant. Brother Moling and I...”","She was so nervous that she could not say anything. She clenched her fists tightly.","Gu Moling’s heart ached. “Madam Chen! Please don’t make things difficult for Rou Rou.”","Zhao Lili immediately defended the injustice. “Nonsense! Rou Rou is crying from anger because of you, yet you’re still talking? Rou Rou is Young Master Gu’s fiancee. Who does Qiao Xi think she is?! She’s a shameless mistress!”","Madam Chen glanced at her coldly with disdain. “Miss Qiao Rou, Young Master Gu, am I talking nonsense, or...”","She paused and looked at them meaningfully.","Qiao Rou’s face was pale, and her body trembled. Her legs went weak and she fell weakly into Gu Moling’s arms.","“Madam Chen, you’re not spouting nonsense.” At this moment, a dignified female voice sounded.","Madam Xue’s eyes were filled with ridicule. “If everyone doesn’t believe me, you can ask those who once discussed business with the Gu family. Everyone knows that Qiao Xi is Young Master Gu’s fiancee. Moreover, most of the company’s projects were negotiated by Qiao Xi. It can even be said that without Qiao Xi, the Gu family’s company wouldn’t exist today.","“Now that the company is growing bigger and bigger, they’ve forgotten about their former hero and Young Master Gu even changed fiancees?”","Everyone gasped.","It turned out that Gu Moling’s achievements today were all thanks to Qiao Xi! Now that he had taken a liking to that small celebrity, he abandoned his fiancee and was prepared to marry a mistress?","At this moment, Chairman Xue also said, “I remember that Young Master Gu’s parents publicly acknowledged Qiao Xi as the daughter-in-law of the Gu family. Moreover, when we were eating at the same table, Young Master Gu even said that he would marry Miss Qiao Xi in July this year. Now...”","He dragged out his voice a little, saying, “Young Master Gu isn’t getting married anymore and has changed his fiancee. What I don’t understand is how did Miss Qiao Xi become a mistress?","“I heard that you and Qiao Xi were childhood sweethearts. This marriage contract was set by the older generation. You and Qiao Rou only got to know each other two years ago. It’s obvious who the third party is.”","Zhao Lili was Qiao Rou’s lackey. How could she easily acknowledge Qiao Xi’s identity?","“Chairman Xue, I’m afraid you’re mistaken. Young Master Gu’s fiancee is Rou Rou. It has nothing to do with Qiao Xi at all. Looks like you’re old and have a bad memory!”","Chairman Xue’s expression was cold. “Back then when we were eating together, we even took a photo together. Why don’t we show it to everyone? Miss Zhao, you’re a junior, yet you’re so unreasonable when talking to your elders. You’re indeed the friend of an illegitimate daughter. Your behavior is so horrible.”","Hearing this, Qiao Rou was so angry that she almost vomited blood. Did Chairman Xue mean that being friends with her was not a good thing?!","Madam Xue snorted.. “Hubby, why waste your breath on someone like her?!”"]},{"number":330,"title":"Chapter 330 - May You Never Conceive","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Madam Xue took out her phone and found a photo. “Everyone, take a good look. This is Young Master Gu attending the banquet with Xi Xi last August. Miss Zhao, if Xi Xi is really a mistress, could Young Master Gu so brazenly bring her to attend high society banquets?","“Moreover, the people of high society all know that Qiao Xi is Gu Moling’s fiancee. This is a marriage that was arranged years ago!”","In the photo, Qiao Xi was standing with the other entrepreneurs. She was wearing a light-colored dress and had light makeup on. She looked elegant. If she was really a mistress, why would the people of high society discuss business with her?","Earlier, everyone was slightly doubtful, but now, they completely believed that Qiao Xi was Gu Moling’s original fiancee.","Madam Xue glanced coldly at Qiao Rou. “This is a donation ceremony. Miss Qiao Rou, isn’t it a little inappropriate for you to lean into a man’s arms without caring about your image?”","Madam Chen was used to these methods and sneered. “Some men like such weak women. It seems Miss Qiao Rou has learned a lot of seduction techniques from her mother who’s a mistress.”","At this moment, a wave of surprise came from the crowd. “Qiao Rou even publicly invited Qiao Xi to the wedding just now!”","As soon as these words were spoken, the surroundings instantly seethed with excitement.","“So that’s how it is! Qiao Rou is really a scheming b*tch! She stole Qiao Xi’s fiance and even ran in front of Qiao Xi to show off. She invited her to the wedding and even wanted to get her blessings! Is she suffering from brain damage?!”","The students of Li City University all started cursing. “Qiao Rou is very smart. She guessed that Qiao Xi wouldn’t go, so she pretended to be pitiful. She said that Qiao Xi didn’t give her any respect.”","“Moreover, Madam Chen has already said that everyone in high society knows that Gu Moling’s original fiancee is Qiao Xi. Now that she has been replaced by Qiao Rou, there’ll definitely be people who think too much.”","“If Qiao Xi agreed to attend the wedding, everyone will think that Qiao Xi and Gu Moling broke up peacefully and it had nothing to do with Qiao Rou. This way, it’ll be able to stop everyone from talking.”","“Qiao Rou stole her sister’s man and even accused Qiao Xi of being a mistress. How shameless!”","After scolding Qiao Rou for a while, everyone turned their anger to Zhao Lili.","“Some people even called Qiao Xi a b*tch just now. Now it would seem that the mistress tried to force the original fiance to attend the wedding and showed off her status. Who’s the b*tch now?”","“B*tch! You two should get married quickly and not bring harm to others! Qiao Rou said that she hopes to get her sister’s blessings. Well, dream on!”","“A b*tch and a dog. May you never conceive.”","Qiao Rou was so angry that her body was trembling and her head was buzzing.","No! It was not like that!","Gu Moling looked at Qiao Xi with eyes that were filled with anger and resentment.","Qiao Rou cried sadly, “Brother Moling, I... What should I do? I just like you. I didn’t want this to happen...”","Gu Moling comforted her gently, then sighed.","“Madam Xue, Madam Chen, Rou Rou is not a mistress. We’re truly in love and are going to be husband and wife. Moreover, Qiao Xi and I have already broken up peacefully. It’s not a problem for me to find another girlfriend.”","Madam Xue mocked, “Broke up peacefully? Your so-called peaceful breakup is accusing Qiao Xi of being a mistress? How shameless!”","Qiao Rou’s face was as pale as paper. Her mind was filled with the thought that it was over. The live-stream broadcast was definitely filled with curses by now.","Her fans were initially helping her scold Qiao Xi. Their criticisms could even drown Qiao Xi!","Now that she had become someone who was despised, everyone would call her a mistress and the consequences she had to face after this would be horrible!","[Rou Rou and Young Master Gu are truly in love. Qiao Xi is not worthy of Young Master Gu at all!]","[I wonder what Qiao Xi did to make Young Master Gu so disgusted. Rou Rou just wants to be with the man she likes. She’s not wrong!]","[Get lost, Qiao Rou’s brainless fans! Just now when Qiao Xi was treated as a mistress, you said that mistresses deserved to die. Now that Qiao Rou has become a mistress, you’re saying that Qiao Rou is right. It’s just for true love. If you don’t know how to form logical arguments, then shut up!]","[I say Qiao Rou, you say b*tch. Qiao Rou—]","[B*tch!]"]},{"number":331,"title":"Chapter 331 - Peaceful Break Up","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Qiao Rou cried helplessly. Her eyes were swollen like peaches, and her face was pale. Her voice was trembling. “Brother Moling, I’m going crazy. I might as well die!”","Gu Moling’s heart ached as he walked in front of Qiao Xi angrily.","“Xi Xi, tell everyone that we broke up peacefully. When Rou Rou and I were together, I even told you about it.”","Qiao Xi was speechless. This man’s face was thicker than the soles of her shoes.","Gu Moling was extremely nervous as he warned her in a low voice, “Xi Xi, no matter what, Rou Rou is your younger sister. If news of her being a mistress gets out, the Qiao family’s reputation will be affected as well. Her future will be ruined. I know we’ve let you down. You just have to tell everyone that we broke up peacefully. You don’t have to explain the rest. I’ll handle it.”","Qiao Xi raised her eyebrows. “You want me to explain it for Qiao Rou?”","“Xi Xi...”","“When Qiao Rou said that I was the mistress just now, why didn’t you explain things for me?”","Qiao Rou quickly explained, “Brother Moling, I wanted to explain things just now, but Lili didn’t listen to me. I...”","Gu Moling naturally believed Qiao Rou and advised, “Xi Xi, as long as you admit that we broke up peacefully, you can ask for anything and I’ll agree.”","Qiao Xi raised her eyes coldly. “Ask for anything?”","Gu Moling was a little nervous.","Qiao Xi sneered. “Forget it. I’ll take it as feeding my efforts all these years to the dogs. I admit that we broke up peacefully.”","Qiao Rou immediately heaved a sigh of relief.","Gu Moling’s expression softened as he turned to look at the two of them. “Madam Xue, Madam Chen, Xi Xi admitted that we broke up peacefully. I only got together with Rou Rou after I broke up with Xi Xi.","“So Rou Rou is not a mistress. The sisters are very close. Don’t spread rumors.”","Madam Xue looked at Qiao Xi with pity.","Qiao Xi smiled lightly with an indifferent expression.","Madam Xue immediately understood that this child was not someone who could be bullied. She definitely had other tricks up her sleeve.","Qiao Xi frowned, and her eyes were filled with sorrow. She choked up and said, “That’s right, we... broke up peacefully.”","As soon as she finished speaking, Qiao Rou raised her eyes and met Qiao Xi’s smiling eyes. Her heart instantly thumped.","Qiao Rou’s heart jumped.","Gu Moling slowly said, “Since—”","“Brother Moling!” Qiao Rou grabbed Gu Moling’s hand. “Since the misunderstanding has been resolved, let’s go. I’m a little dizzy.”","Gu Moling saw that her face was pale and her body was trembling, so he nodded. “Alright...”","“Quick! Let’s go! Leave with me!”","Qiao Rou knew what Qiao Xi’s smile meant. Qiao Xi would not let her off easily.","No! She could not let Qiao Xi succeed!","Her reputation was already very poor when she got together with her sister’s fiance. If others found out that she was a mistress, who knew what the consequences would be?","Qiao Rou broke out in a cold sweat, and her eyes were filled with horror. “Let’s go!”","She pulled Gu Moling and was about to leave.","“Oh! How lively!”","The hedonistic son’s voice sounded in everyone’s ears.","Gu Yao slowly walked into the hall. Everyone knew that he was the most favored young master in the Gu family, so they quickly made way.","“It’s Young Master Gu!”","“This Young Master Gu is the most favored young master in the Gu family. He’s President Gu’s younger brother!”","Qiao Rou stopped in her tracks as if she had fallen into an ice cellar.","Gu Yao saw Qiao Rou in the crowd and disgust appeared on his face.","“What’s going on? How did Qiao Rou get in?”","Someone was curious. “Second Young Master Gu, you know Qiao Rou. She’s Gu Moling’s fiancee. Today—”","Qiao Rou came to a sudden realization. She finally knew Qiao Xi’s plan. She was using Gu Yao to expose everything.","She wanted to rush over and cover Gu Yao’s mouth, but Gu Yao ignored her and said, “Of course, we know each other. Isn’t this the famous mistress, Qiao Rou?”","Damn!","The turn of events today made everyone shudder in fear.","Gu Moling’s face darkened, while Qiao Rou was about to faint from anger.","A wave of doubt came from the crowd. “But Young Master Gu Moling said just now that Qiao Rou isn’t a mistress. He and Qiao Xi broke up peacefully.”","“That’s not right.. My brother clearly told me about this!” Gu Yao retorted."]},{"number":332,"title":"Chapter 332 - Not Ashamed But Proud","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Gu Yao said in confusion, “My brother previously called Gu Moling and Qiao Rou to Longwan Residential. At that time, Qiao Rou said tearfully that she really liked Gu Moling, so she became a mistress.","“She even said a lot of bad things about Qiao Xi in front of my brother. However, who’s my brother? He saw through her tricks and exposed her on the spot! Gu Moling, are you blind? Do you like such a vicious two-faced b*tch?”","Everyone was silent and looked at Qiao Rou in disdain.","Gu Yao asked in surprise, “What’s with your expressions? Did Qiao Rou say something else?”","Madam Xue sneered. “Second Young Master Gu, you just came so you don’t know the whole story. Qiao Rou and Gu Moling first accused Qiao Xi of being a mistress. After they were exposed, they forced Qiao Xi to admit that they broke up peacefully to prove that Qiao Rou isn’t a mistress.”","Gu Yao had a shocked expression. “Oh my God! How can there be such a shameless person! Qiao Rou, it’s fine that you’re a mistress, but you’re even accusing Qiao Xi of being a mistress? You’re really shameless!","“Get this straight! Back then, it was Gu Moling’s father and Qiao Xi’s grandfather who arranged the marriage between the two of them. At that time, they said that they wanted to marry the eldest daughter of the Qiao family’s first wife.","“Are you the eldest miss? Are you worthy? Not only did you ruin Eldest Miss Qiao’s marriage but you also refuse to admit your mistake. I think you’re even proud of yourself instead of being ashamed!”","Gu Yao’s eyes were filled with innocence, but every word was filled with accusation. “You can lie to others, but you dare to lie to me? Do you want to die?!”","Second Young Master Gu was indeed domineering!","The Gu family was definitely the party most in the loop regarding Qiao Xi’s marriage with the Gu family!","The marriage contract was arranged by the elders back then. Even if the two were not compatible, they should have announced the withdrawal of the engagement. Unexpectedly, the bride was changed to an illegitimate daughter.","Qiao Rou’s face was pale, and she was about to faint.","Her lips trembled. “No, it’s not like that.”","Qiao Xi, that b*tch!","She deliberately pretended to be weak and admitted that they had broken up peacefully. She then let Gu Yao tell the truth in public. This way, this matter would be confirmed.","Everyone’s burning gazes landed on her. Qiao Rou wished for nothing more than to find a hole to bury herself in.","“What engagement? I don’t know about it! Sister never told me. I didn’t know! Don’t malign me.”","“My head hurts! I’m going to faint...","Qiao Xi looked at Qiao Rou’s helpless appearance with some amusement.","“Shut up, mistress! How shameless!”","At this moment, a reporter cursed loudly, “Why are you pretending to be a pure and innocent woman? You’re clearly a b*tch who seduced your sister’s fiance. You even framed your sister for being a mistress!","“After being exposed, you even forced your sister to clear your name. Why are you so vicious?! I feel disgusted just looking at you!”","Qiao Rou’s face turned ashen. “No...”","“You still dare to retort? Other than saying no, what else can you say? I think you’re just guilty!”","“Yeah, not only are you a mistress, but you even deliberately invited Qiao Xi to attend the wedding. You wanted to show off in front of her, then you framed her for being a mistress. You’re really good at pretending!”","“You say you’re on good terms with your sister, but you framed her behind her back. It’s only because Qiao Xi isn’t stooping to your level to bicker with you. Otherwise, I would’ve ripped your face off a long time ago. It’s really nauseating to look at!”","The people who were cursing her were originally her fans, but now, they were all her anti-fans. Hearing the angry curses around her, Qiao Rou wished she could die on the spot.","Xue Yi snorted. “Gu Moling, only a blind person like you would abandon Qiao Xi and treat that b*tch, Qiao Rou, as a treasure!”","The students also muttered softly, “Qiao Rou is a mistress, and her mother is also a mistress. Eldest Miss Qiao has really been harmed by the mother and daughter!”","“No wonder Qiao Rou seduced Young Master Gu. It’s all because she learned it from her mother!”","“Eldest Miss Qiao is the legitimate eldest daughter of the first wife. How could she have played such a dirty trick on Qiao Rou? After all, Qiao Rou knew how to seduce men from a young age.”","Madam Xue held Qiao Xi’s hand and said gently, “Xi Xi, back then, Qiao Rou stole Young Master Gu from you and wronged you... Why didn’t you explain things?”"]},{"number":333,"title":"Chapter 333 - Mother And Daughter Are Both Mistresses!","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Madam Chen also asked, “That’s right, Xi Xi. Even outsiders like us are already so angry upon knowing the truth. If your father and grandmother find out, they’ll definitely not let these two off.”","Everyone looked at Qiao Xi.","Qiao Rou held her breath and trembled. “Sister, you can’t. You’re from the Qiao family, you can’t...”","Qiao Xi lowered her eyes, which were filled with sorrow as she smiled helplessly.","“Ever since Xu Mei joined the family, I’ve been sleeping in the basement in the Qiao family’s house. I have to give Qiao Rou whatever she wants unconditionally, so...”","“When she wanted my fiance, I had no right to refuse.”","When everyone heard that, their hearts ached.","“Xu Mei and her daughter stole everything from Qiao Xi. Her room, her assets, and even her fiance. It’s impossible for the Qiao family not to know about this. It looks like they agree with Xu Mei’s actions.”","“The Qiao family’s upbringing is really an eye-opener. Back then, Qiao Xi’s mother left behind a large amount of inheritance under Qiao Xi’s name. The Qiao family is now using what Qiao Xi’s mother left behind for her, yet they still have the cheek to treat her daughter like this?”","“Yes! Qiao Xi’s mother’s assets are all in the hands of Qiao Zhenguo and Xu Mei now.”","“The Xi Ling Corporation that Qiao Xi founded is also in the hands of Gu Moling and Qiao Rou. That mistress and her daughter are really shameless. They like to snatch other people’s things!”","Everyone kept saying the words ‘mistress’ and ‘sl*t’. Qiao Rou’s face turned pale.","This was a scheme set up by Qiao Xi to use everyone to suppress her. How could no one see through her scheme?","Qiao Xi, that b*tch, was going to kill her this time!","The few madams hurriedly pulled Qiao Xi to sit down and told her not to be sad. They would make the decision for her.","Gu Yao walked to a corner and said softly into the phone, “Gu Zheng, you heard what I said, right? I definitely didn’t let Qiao Xi suffer.”","Gu Zheng smiled. “Very good.”","Gu Yao looked up proudly. “Then I’ll leave first? My friend is looking for me...”","“Wait.” Gu Zheng’s voice turned cold. “There’s something else I need you to solve. Don’t be in a rush to leave. You’re a donor of Li City University and a future shareholder of Li City University.”","Gu Yao: “?”","He was a donor?","Wasn’t today Gu Moling’s donation ceremony?","Why did Gu Zheng say that he was the donor?","...","Qiao Xi sat on the chair obediently and used the excuse of going to the bathroom to avoid being seen. “Gu Zheng!”","Gu Zheng held her hand and patted it gently. “Be good.”","At this moment, the rumble of a car came from outside. Qiao Xi looked up and saw the Qiao family’s car quickly entering the university’s gate.","Qiao Xi’s eyes narrowed. Qiao Zhenguo and Old Madam Qiao had arrived at the right time.","If it were not for Madam Xue and Gu Yao’s explanation, she would have long been labeled as a mistress. The moment Qiao Zhenguo and Old Madam Qiao appeared, they would definitely scold her in public and even chase her out of the house. They would naturally take over her company.","Qiao Xi sneered. “How laughable!”","At this moment, Gu Zheng’s phone rang. Qiao Xi glanced at it and realized that it was Lin Jie.","Previously, when Lin Jie left Longwan Residential angrily, they thought that he would never look for Gu Zheng again.","Gu Zheng only glanced at it and did not intend to pick it up. Lin Jie could only send a voice message.","Gu Zheng was a little impatient. Actually, after the incident in Longwan Residential, he had wanted to delete Lin Jie’s contact number. However, the two of them were childhood friends, after all. When they were young, Lin Jie had still treated him quite well. Even so, Gu Zheng would absolutely not forgive him for bullying Qiao Xi.","He picked up his phone and thought about it before deciding to delete the voice message. However, he accidentally pressed the wrong button and the voice message started playing.","“Ah Zheng, have you seen the news? Qiao Xi was engaged to Gu Moling before this and only got together with you after they broke up. Now, she even cut off all ties with the Qiao family. This woman is too heartless!”","Qiao Xi sneered. This Lin Jie was really stubborn!","“No matter what, Qiao Rou is a popular celebrity now. Half of her fans have abandoned her, and the netizens are all scolding her now.. Qiao Xi is her biological sister. Did she have to force Qiao Rou to her death? How could you marry such a woman?!”"]},{"number":334,"title":"Chapter 334 -Fish Begins To Stink At The Head","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Gu Zheng’s eyes turned cold as he slowly said, “Don’t worry, I won’t let any of these people off.”","Qiao Xi raised her eyes and their gazes met.","Gu Zheng stroked her cheek gently. “Xi Xi, with me around, I won’t let anyone bully you.”","He agreed for her to deal with the Qiao family herself, but he would not let the Qiao family climb over Qiao Xi’s head.","Qiao Xi watched as Qiao Zhenguo’s car stopped and smiled lightly. “They don’t have the ability. Wait for my good news.”","Gu Zheng nodded. “Alright.”","Qiao Xi stood on tiptoes and gently kissed his cheek. She then turned around and left with a red face.","Gu Zheng was delighted as he stood on the spot and watched Qiao Xi’s departing figure.","Then, he took out his laptop. Complicated symbols and letters appeared on it. His long fingers quickly typed a few times and pressed the enter button.","After a while, he picked up his phone. “Proceed.”","...","Actually, Qiao Zhenguo and Old Madam Qiao had received a call from Qiao Rou an hour ago saying that Qiao Xi had also gone to Li City University.","Qiao Zhenguo was instantly infuriated. That was a formal donation ceremony. What right did Qiao Xi have to attend?","Hence, Qiao Zhenguo brought his family and angrily came to Li City University. The moment he entered, he saw Qiao Rou, whose face was pale and whose eyes were filled with tears.","He did not have time to think and was instantly angry. “Rou Rou, what’s going on?”","Old Madam Qiao also hurriedly rushed over and was extremely angry. “Do you even need to ask?! It’s definitely that little b*tch! Why is she here for Rou Rou’s donation ceremony?! She only knows how to bully Rou Rou. Where’s that little b*tch, Qiao Xi? Hurry up and come out!”","The entire venue was silent as everyone looked at one of the reporters.","That reporter was live-streaming the scene. He was also dumbfounded. There were millions of people watching the live-stream broadcast.","The Qiao family treated Qiao Xi so harshly in front of everyone. It was unknown how overboard they were behind the scenes.","Everyone’s heart ached even more.","Old Madam Qiao slammed her walking stick onto the floor, her eyes filled with sharpness.","“Qiao Xi, where are you? When you found out that Moling was here, you came over as well. Moling is your brother-in-law. You’re really shameless. You have utterly embarrassed the Qiao family! This little b*tch is as cheap as her mother!”","Old Madam Qiao gritted her teeth and looked fiercely at Qiao Xi, who was in the corner. She was instantly infuriated. “You dare ruin Rou Rou’s donation ceremony and bully her? Get lost!”","Qiao Xi’s expression was indifferent as she chuckled. “Old Madam, how am I embarrassing the Qiao family? You’re scolding me without asking why. Is this your upbringing?”","Old Madam Qiao’s face was red and she immediately choked. She did not know how to retort.","At this moment, she realized that everyone’s gazes were filled with disdain. Could it be that there was something going on here?","Old Madam Qiao was a little uneasy and could not help but look at Qiao Rou. “Rou Rou, tell me what happened.”","Qiao Rou’s face was pale as her body trembled.","Gu Moling lowered his head and clenched his fists silently.","He really could not say what had just happened.","At this moment, a strange voice sounded from the crowd. “Do you think Qiao Xi was willing to come? It was clearly Qiao Rou who asked the chancellor to invite Qiao Xi over. Your Qiao family has just entered but you started scolding Qiao Xi without any explanation. Is there any justice in this world?”","Old Madam Qiao was stunned and abruptly looked at Qiao Rou.","Everyone could not help but defend the injustice they had just witnessed. “The Qiao family’s upbringing is crooked, so Qiao Rou became the mistress. I think the elders of the Qiao family tacitly agreed to this! Xu Mei is a mistress, and Qiao Rou is also a mistress. The Qiao family harbors mistresses. What a shameless family!”","“Qiao Rou became a mistress and even invited Qiao Xi to attend her wedding. She wanted Qiao Xi to give her blessings. How could there be such a disgusting woman?!”","“The Qiao family dotes on their illegitimate daughter but abuses their first wife’s daughter. They abandoned Qiao Xi and don’t care about her life or death. People like the Qiao family will suffer retribution sooner or later.”","“That’s right, Young Master Zhang. I heard that your family and the Qiao family are working together. It’s better to quickly terminate the contract.. With the Qiao family’s character and upbringing, they’ll definitely play tricks during the collaboration. Be careful or you’ll suffer!”"]},{"number":335,"title":"Chapter 335 - Qiao Rou Is On The Trending Topics","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Mad curses entered Old Madam Qiao’s ears. She widened her eyes and cursed, “Qiao Xi, you actually dared to say those things about you and Gu Moling?”","As soon as she finished speaking, a group of reporters rushed in from the door and aimed their cameras at Qiao Rou.","“Qiao Rou is here!” someone shouted, and everyone rushed over.","“Miss Qiao Rou, did you invite your sister to the donation ceremony and wedding to show off your status?”","“As your younger sister, you seduced your elder sister’s fiance. Where’s your conscience?”","“The pure and innocent daughter of Qiao Corporation has now become a mistress everyone wants to beat up. Do you have any regrets? Or are you enjoying yourself?”","Everyone raised their cameras and bombarded Qiao Rou with questions.","Qiao Rou broke out in a cold sweat and trembled. As a celebrity, she was already used to the spotlight, but now, it was as if she had been stripped naked and thrown in front of everyone.","Qiao Rou remained silent as the reporters turned to look at Qiao Zhenguo and Old Madam Qiao.","“President Qiao, the Qiao family mistreated the first wife’s daughter and even threw Qiao Xi to the countryside. Was this Xu Mei’s intention? Is Qiao Xi really your biological daughter? As a father, why are you so heartless to your biological daughter?”","“Old Madam Qiao, since you accepted Xu Mei despite her being a mistress, does it mean that the Qiao family doesn’t care about mistresses ruining their reputation? Qiao Rou seduced her sister’s fiance. Do you know about this? Or perhaps you were the one who wanted to matchmake them?”","Faced with the reporters’ questions, Old Madam Qiao was instantly speechless.","Of course, she did not support mistresses and did not like Xu Mei too much, but Xu Mei was obedient. She was not as arrogant as Qiao Xi’s biological mother. Between the two, she naturally chose Xu Mei as her daughter-in-law.","Qiao Xi’s mother was so rich and had everything in her hands but she was unwilling to spend it on the Qiao family. She even left all the money to Qiao Xi after she died. She did not leave anything for the Qiao family at all. It was really too much!","“President Qiao, Old Madam Qiao, if you don’t answer, does it mean that you agree?”","Old Madam Qiao’s face was filled with embarrassment and anger. If it were not for the fact that there were so many reporters present, she would have rushed over and slapped Qiao Xi!","The Qiao family’s bodyguards hurriedly rushed over and chased the reporters and outsiders out. When Qiao Xi saw the Qiao family make a fool of themselves, she followed them out.","However, before she left, she saw Qiao Rou’s assistant rush in and shout, “It’s over! It’s over! The internet is filled with scandals about Miss Rou Rou. I can’t control it anymore!”","Everyone’s expression changed. They took out their phones to take a look. The dirt was indeed everywhere.","Qiao Rou was marrying her own sister’s fiance and even invited her to the wedding. She wrongly accused her sister of being a mistress. The release of this news shattered Qiao Rou’s image. For so many years, she was seen as a beautiful and gentle woman.","The number of her fans had also decreased rapidly, and there were criticisms on Weibo.","The netizens dug up all the dirt on Qiao Rou. She was violent in university and bullied other female celebrities...","Old Madam Qiao roared, “A bunch of trash! Hurry up and do public relations! Delete all these scandals!”","The assistant lowered his head and trembled. “Old Madam, it’s useless for us to do public relations now. You can shut up a few people but can you shut up the entire world?”","“You!” Old Madam Qiao was so angry that her heart ached.","Qiao Rou held her phone and widened her eyes. It felt as if her body had fallen into an ice cellar.","[Qiao Rou is the mistress.]","[Qiao Rou framed her sister, she’s a b*tch.]","[Qiao Rou’s image has collapsed!]","Several trending topics occupied the top spot. Even if the Qiao family spent a lot of money to remove the trending topics, it would only be a matter of time. One could not limit the behaviors of netizens.","Immediately after, a few endorsers called to request for their contracts to be terminated. All the products that Qiao Rou endorsed were taken off the shelves overnight. The companies released the news one after another and announced that they would terminate their contracts with Qiao Rou and never work with her again!","Qiao Rou felt dizzy and clenched her fists tightly. Her nails dug into her flesh.","“Dad, Grandma, I just wanted to invite Sister to the wedding. I had no ill intentions.. I didn’t malign Sister either. It’s all because of what Zhao Lili said...”"]},{"number":336,"title":"Chapter 336 - When Things Go Too Far, They Cant Be Turned Around","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","“I really don’t know how things ended up like this. It’s all my fault. I’ve let my sister down. I’m willing to die to atone for my sins. I didn’t want to implicate the Qiao family either, but my sister is so vicious. She doesn’t care about the Qiao family’s reputation at all!","Tears trickled down Qiao Rou’s face as she choked. “Today was supposed to be my donation ceremony with Brother Moling. Now, I’ve become the joke of Li City University...","“I’ve let my sister down. She can take revenge on me however she wants, but today’s a special occasion. My sister chose to expose this matter today. She didn’t even consider the Qiao family.”","Old Madam Qiao and Qiao Zhenguo were instantly infuriated when they heard this.","Rou Rou was right. It was fine if Qiao Xi wanted to take revenge on Rou Rou, but she chose to do it today.","Zhao Lili was spouting nonsense and had indeed wronged Qiao Xi.","However, today was Rou Rou and Moling’s donation ceremony. This was a good opportunity to build up their reputation, but it was all ruined by Qiao Xi.","This jinx should have been killed back then!","Old Madam Qiao burned with rage and shouted loudly at Qiao Xi, “Don’t go!”","Xue Yi frowned and was about to rush forward to argue when she was stopped by Qiao Xi.","Qiao Xi turned around and asked casually, “Old Madam, don’t tell me that you still want to scold me? Could it be that I have to remain silent even if I’m being wronged?”","When she said that, Old Madam Qiao was instantly speechless. However, for the sake of her reputation, she gritted her teeth and said, “Why not? Even if you want to lose your temper, you have to look at the situation! Today is Rou Rou and Moling’s donation ceremony. After today, Rou Rou and Moling’s names will be jotted down in Li City University’s records. This is the Qiao family’s honor, but you just had to create trouble. Have you ever considered the Qiao family?”","Xue Yi retorted, “You mean that no matter how Qiao Rou slanders Xi Xi today, she has to endure it? Xi Xi is clearly the victim. She was called a mistress and her reputation was at risk but she couldn’t expose Qiao Rou?”","Old Madam Qiao was extremely angry and blurted out, “That’s right!”","Qiao Xi was angered to the point of laughing.","Old Madam Qiao roared furiously, “Rou Rou is the pride of our Qiao family. Qiao Xi is her stepping stone. The donation ceremony is about to start. Qiao Xi, if you dare cause trouble again, I’ll absolutely not let you off!”","Xue Yi was so angry that she wanted to rush up and slap this old woman. She really did not understand how Little Six could tolerate the Qiao family’s arrogance with her character.","Unexpectedly, Qiao Xi smiled meaningfully. “A donation ceremony? I heard that Gu Moling and Qiao Rou each donated 40 million yuan. This building will also be named after the two of them, right?”","Old Madam Qiao snorted. “That’s right!”","Qiao Xi smiled. “Old Madam Qiao, let me remind you not to keep talking about this 80 million. When things go too far, you can no longer turn them around. Be careful not to suffer retribution.”","At this moment, Gu Moling walked in.","His face was gloomy as he looked at Qiao Xi. He was depressed. “Xi Xi, you’ve gone too far!”","Qiao Xi glanced indifferently at him.","Gu Moling knew that he was in the wrong, so his tone was a little gentler. “Whether Qiao Rou is the mistress or not, she’s still a donor. She should accept this honor with me. Our names will forever remain in Li City University. Xi Xi, let’s end this matter here!”","Old Madam Qiao sneered. “Moling abandoned you and chose Rou Rou. He has good taste! It’s wishful thinking for you to want to destroy Rou Rou. Before long, everyone will forget this matter and only remember what Rou Rou has done!","“Even if Rou Rou can’t become a celebrity, she’ll still be a famous entrepreneur. She’ll also be a philanthropist who donated 80 million to Li City University! No one will remember that she’s a mistress. Your plan will only affect her for a while.”","Qiao Xi looked at the extremely confident Qiao family and said slowly, “As you wish.”","Being a mistress did not violate the law. It was just a violation of one’s morals. It might be fine if she was scolded for a few days, but what if she embezzled a large sum of money?","Qiao Xi turned around to leave, but Gu Moling was stunned.","Qiao Xi had changed. In the past, she only had eyes for him, but this time, she did not even bother to look at him.","Such indifference was hard for the arrogant Young Master Gu to accept."]},{"number":337,"title":"Chapter 337 - This Girl Is Not Gentle At All!","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","“Moling? Brother Moling.”","Qiao Rou called his name softly, her eyes filled with confusion.","Gu Moling returned to his senses and recalled Qiao Xi’s words. He looked at Qiao Rou suspiciously. “Rou Rou, why would Xi Xi mention the 80 million? She said...”","Before Qiao Rou could answer, Old Madam Qiao grunted coldly. “It’s all because Qiao Xi is jealous of Rou Rou. Rou Rou saved all this money herself. What problem could there be?”","Gu Moling thought about it and felt that Old Madam Qiao was right. Rou Rou had taken on many endorsements over the years. Coupled with the company’s earnings, it was not strange for her to fork out 40 million yuan.","It was just that Xi Xi did not seem to be spouting nonsense. Did she really just casually say a few words out of anger?","“Brother Moling, don’t you believe in me?”","Qiao Rou’s eyes turned red, and she was about to cry.","Her body went weak, and her eyes were filled with sorrow. “Everyone’s scolding me now. They’re saying that I’m a mistress. They even think that I, an illegitimate daughter, couldn’t have so much money.","“I can’t compare to my sister, but this money is from my endorsement fees and salary. I couldn’t bear to spend it and saved it all... Brother Moling, that’s really my money!”","Seeing her cry, Gu Moling’s heart ached. “Rou Rou, stop crying. I’m not suspecting you. Qiao Xi must be spouting nonsense.”","He comforted her softly, saying, “Rou Rou, your body is weak. You should quickly go and rest. No matter what, we’re the ones who donated 80 million yuan. Chancellor Li will acknowledge our contributions.”","Qiao Rou immediately heaved a sigh of relief and nodded obediently.","She leaned into Gu Moling’s arms, her eyes filled with resentment.","The 40 million yuan was indeed not hers, but no one would know where she got it from because no one would think that she was related to that person.","She could donate 40 million to Li City University, but Qiao Xi could not. She had won in this aspect.","...","On the other side, Qiao Xi was lying on the rocking chair in the lounge and drinking tea comfortably. After fighting with Qiao Rou for a long time, her body was slightly tired. When she finally got to relax, she was feeling a little tired.","When Gu Zheng entered, she had already fallen asleep on the rocking chair.","He stopped in his tracks and quietly walked closer.","Gu Zheng bent down, and a faint fragrance entered his nose.","After he was poisoned, his sense of smell gradually deteriorated, so he almost could not smell it.","However, when they met at the Civil Affairs Bureau that time, he clearly smelled the light and elegant fragrance on Qiao Xi’s body. It did not smell like flowers or spices. It was a special fruit blend that made one’s mood lighter.","At this moment, Qiao Xi’s eyes were closed and her eyelashes were fluttering like fans. Her delicate skin was glowing under the sunlight, and her entire body was curled up like a baby.","Gu Zheng felt that Qiao Xi looked so gentle at this moment. She gave others the impulse to hug her.","He smiled and took off his jacket to gently cover her body. He also felt that it would be uncomfortable if she curled her body up like this, so he held her in his arms and adjusted his posture while stroking her hair.","Looking at her red and tender lips, Gu Zheng’s Adam’s apple moved. He lowered his head and kissed her gently.","Qiao Xi only felt a wave of heat approach her in her sleep and habitually opened her mouth to bite it.","She felt that it was quite soft, so she did not let go.","Gu Zheng: “...”","It was all an illusion. This girl was not gentle at all!","She could bite him so fiercely even when she was asleep. Qiao Xi was destined to not be gentle in this life.","Taking advantage of the moment when she let go, Gu Zheng hurriedly escaped. He saw the woman in his arms frown, and she clicked her tongue as if she was very dissatisfied.","Gu Zheng smiled.","What kind of feast was she dreaming about?","After a while, Qiao Xi slowly woke up. She looked at the unfamiliar surroundings and recalled that she was still in the lounge. Qiao Rou and Gu Moling would be holding a donation ceremony later!","Qiao Xi stood up and was about to leave when Gu Zheng pushed the door open and walked in.","She looked at Gu Zheng in confusion. “Why are you wearing a mask?”","Gu Zheng lowered his eyes and said calmly, “I don’t want to expose my identity.”","Qiao Xi felt that something was wrong.. If he did not want to expose himself, why was he still wearing it in the lounge? There must be something fishy going on."]},{"number":338,"title":"Chapter 338 - Your Mouth Is Swollen","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Qiao Xi rolled her eyes and quickly pulled off his mask—","Gu Zheng’s lips were slightly swollen with a clear bite mark.","Qiao Xi gasped. Before she slept, there were no teeth marks on Gu Zheng’s mouth. Such a small mark was definitely left by a woman.","Who exactly bit Gu Zheng when she was asleep?","Moreover, with Gu Zheng’s skills, it was impossible to attack him. That meant that Gu Zheng was willing.","Qiao Xi lowered her eyes as her heart ached.","Gu Zheng looked at the little girl in front of him who had her head lowered and was even sniffling. He immediately understood that she had misunderstood.","He had never seen someone getting jealous of themselves!","Gu Zheng lowered his eyes. “Mrs. Gu.”","Qiao Xi looked away angrily.","Gu Zheng smiled. “Did you have a sweet dream when you were sleeping?”","Qiao Xi did not understand and only replied aggrievedly, “I dreamt of eating roasted chicken! Why? Can’t I even have a dream?”","“Roasted chicken?” Gu Zheng snorted. “Think about it carefully. Who could bite me?”","Qiao Xi looked at him with slight doubt, then her eyes widened. She pointed at herself and asked in disbelief, “You mean I bit you?”","Qiao Xi was just about to retort. She was asleep, so how could she have pounced on Gu Zheng and bit his lips?","Gu Zheng, who was at the side, said unhurriedly, “Mrs. Gu, shouldn’t you change your habit of biting things in your sleep?”","Qiao Xi: “!!!”","What?","She felt as if she had been struck by lightning. Her mouth was wide open in shock, and she looked embarrassed.","Could it be that she had sleepwalked and pressed Gu Zheng down to bite him?","She did not know that she still sleepwalked, but the mark on Gu Zheng’s lips could be seen clearly.","Qiao Xi was extremely surprised. “Did I really sleepwalk?”","Gu Zheng nodded, his eyes looking a little aggrieved.","Qiao Xi was slightly guilty. She really did not know that she sleepwalked and even bit Gu Zheng.","“Did I really bite you? Does it still hurt?”","At this moment, the brothers standing outside the door clicked their tongues. Song Shijing was relatively calm. He was a calm person, after all, but Song Shiyu was different. He was holding it in until he almost suffered internal injuries.","However, for the sake of his remaining salary, he could not tell Young Madam that the president had secretly kissed her while she was asleep, so she bit him.","After hearing the president’s accusations, Song Shijing finally understood Song Shiyu. The president had indeed become much more shameless after knowing Young Madam.","Qiao Xi felt that Gu Zheng was slightly strange, and it caused her to be a little uneasy. Why was he still so happy after being bitten? He was actually still smiling. Was he laughing from extreme anger?","The man sat on the sofa and took a sip of tea. He suppressed his smile and asked calmly, “Mrs. Gu, what are you thinking about?”","Qiao Xi was slightly uneasy. “Does it hurt?”","Gu Zheng put on his mask, lowered his eyes, and sneered. “What do you think?”","Qiao Xi felt uneasy.","How could it not hurt?","Qiao Xi smiled in embarrassment and deceived herself. “It doesn’t hurt, right? I’m such a weak little woman. How could it hurt when I only bit you lightly?”","Gu Zheng looked up and sneered. “It’s okay. It doesn’t hurt. It’s not your fault.”","Qiao Xi was slightly surprised. “You don’t blame me anymore?”","‘Gu Zheng is letting me off so easily?’","Gu Zheng said softly, “Could it be that you think I’m a petty man, Mrs. Gu?”","Qiao Xi choked and smiled awkwardly.","‘That’s exactly what I think!’","However, she said something against her conscience, “Of course not! You’re the best!”","Qiao Xi was slightly guilty when she suddenly thought of something, so she explained loudly, “Gu Zheng, I bit you because I love you!”","Gu Zheng almost spat out the tea in his mouth.","Qiao Xi argued, “I bit your lips! Would I have bitten anyone else? It’s because I love you that I wanted to kiss you in my sleep. Of course, you can’t blame me!”","Gu Zheng: “...”","Hehe, he finally understood. Mrs. Gu’s IQ was high and low at times. When she defended herself, her IQ could exceed 280.","As soon as Qiao Xi finished speaking, she looked at Gu Zheng while trembling with fear. However, she noticed that Gu Zheng was still so calm and expressionless.","The man asked indifferently, “You found out about the 80 million yuan?”"]},{"number":339,"title":"Chapter 339 - The Enemy Of The Enemy Is A Friend","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Qiao Xi raised her eyebrows. “You investigated it too?”","Gu Zheng nodded. “Junior, do you think you can fool me by deleting the data?”","Qiao Xi chuckled.","Gu Zheng’s long fingers tapped on the table. “Then, you should know where the 80 million came from.”","Speaking of which, Qiao Xi was extremely puzzled as well. She asked in a light voice, “Gu Moling transferred the 40 million from the company. Even though it’s against the rules to move this huge sum of money, he’s the boss, after all, so it’s not strange.”","Xi Ling Corporation was established by her alone. Now that it was in Gu Moling’s hands, he allocated 40 million yuan. There was nothing wrong with it.","However, Qiao Rou’s 40 million...","Qiao Xi was puzzled. “Qiao Rou embezzled the money from Gu Yao’s account. How did she do it? Could it be that she knows the password?”","The password of the Gu family’s second young master’s account would definitely not be told to outsiders. How did Qiao Rou get this sum of money without being discovered?","Gu Yao had yet to realize that he lost 40 million yuan in his account.","Gu Zheng’s eyes were filled with coldness, and the words he said caused Qiao Xi to be dumbstruck.","“Of course, Qiao Rou doesn’t have the ability, but there’s someone who can help her.”","Gu Zheng sneered. “Madam Gu, Huang Lilan.”","Qiao Xi: “!!!”","Madam Gu?","Did Madam Gu help Qiao Rou steal money from her biological son’s account?","Was Madam Gu suffering from brain damage? She embezzled 40 million from her son and gave it to Qiao Rou, a stranger. She even wanted Qiao Rou to donate it to the university?","Gu Zheng sneered. “Do you want to know why?”","He said slowly, “Because she knows that you’re Gu Moling’s former fiancee and wants to use Qiao Rou to suppress you.”","Qiao Xi: “...”","She really did not understand Madam Gu’s thoughts. Did Madam Gu think that the enemy of her enemy was her friend, so she joined forces with Qiao Rou to deal with her?","Gu Zheng put down the cup and tapped his long fingers. “And this money wasn’t transferred to Qiao Rou directly. It should be...”","His eyes narrowed with mockery and disdain. “It was transferred to Lu Yan.”","Lu Yan?","Qiao Xi instantly came to a sudden understanding.","Actually, using Qiao Rou to deal with her was just one step of the plan. The real goal was to transfer the Gu family’s money to Lu Yan so that Lu Yan could become the head of the Gu family and completely replace Gu Zheng.","“Gu Zheng...” Qiao Xi’s heart ached.","Gu Zheng was calm. “It’s time to go out.”","“What?”","The man smiled. “To watch a show.”","...","On the other hand, Qiao Rou had put on makeup again. Her eyes were a little red, but she looked well.","No matter what, Qiao Rou and Gu Moling had already donated 80 million yuan. Li City University accepted it, and the construction of that building had begun. That professional equipment and instruments had also been ordered from overseas.","So what if she was a mistress? She was still someone who had donated to Li City University.","Everyone secretly looked at Qiao Xi and muttered in a low voice, “Eldest Miss Qiao is too pitiful. She was hurt by an adulterous pair and was wronged. Because she’s also in Li City University, she was even invited to participate in the donation ceremony. Isn’t this like stabbing a knife into her heart?”","“It can’t be helped! The chancellor has already accepted the money and even decided on the name of the teaching building. It’s called Rou Ling Building. Even if Qiao Rou is a mistress, this is an unchangeable fact.”","“Life’s tough for Eldest Miss Qiao.”","The few of them were discussing softly. The people on the stage did not hear them.","Qiao Zhenguo and Old Madam Qiao sat on the stage and looked at each other.","They were already prepared. As long as the donation ceremony ended, they would crazily spend money on the trending topics and push the topics of Rou Rou being a mistress off the list of trending topics.","Rou Rou had donated so much to Li City University and even bought many expensive instruments and equipment. She had done so much for the students of Li City University. No one would mention that she was the mistress anymore.","Old Madam Qiao heaved a sigh of relief. Those who accomplished great things did not care about trivial matters. It was normal for one to have some dirt on them. No one was perfect!","When Rou Rou became a famous entrepreneur in the future, the voices behind her back would gradually disappear. Who would still remember what happened many years ago?","Thinking of this, Old Madam Qiao smiled smugly. “Rou Rou, Moling, are you ready to give your speech? For Li City University, for the country, and for the students’ studies, you’ve donated such a huge sum.. You’re worthy of everyone’s praise.”"]},{"number":340,"title":"Chapter 340 - Clearing Her Name","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Qiao Rou smiled, and her pale face turned a little redder. “I’m prepared to give a speech, but Sister...”","“Why should we care about her?!” Old Madam Qiao frowned unhappily. “Zhenguo, look after Qiao Xi. Don’t let her cause trouble again!”","The leaders of Li City University took this donation ceremony very seriously. The instruments and equipment they were getting from Qiao Rou’s donation were very advanced and helpful to Li City University.","Moreover, she donated a special book that was previously lost for a long time. It had somehow made its way overseas. Qiao Rou and Gu Moling found that book and bought it at a high price to donate it to Li City University.","Just this matter alone was enough to clear Qiao Rou’s name.","Qiao Rou’s fans also stood up for her.","[Although Rou Rou’s love life is tainted, she’s kind-hearted and made great contributions to the country and the university. It’s reasonable for Young Master Gu to abandon Qiao Xi and choose her.]","[Qiao Rou is beautiful and kind-hearted. How can a petty woman like Qiao Xi compare to Qiao Rou, whose career is successful?]","The Qiao family could not hide the fact that Qiao Rou was the mistress, so they came up with a plan. Since Qiao Rou was already exposed, they would admit it openly.","It made everyone think that it was because Qiao Xi was too useless and Qiao Rou was too outstanding that Gu Moling liked Qiao Rou instead.","Qiao Rou was selfless. It was just that her love life was flawed. She should not be insulted by everyone.","Qiao Zhenguo reminded her, “Rou Rou, don’t care about the opinions of the people around you. The most important thing now is to hold the donation ceremony. When the time comes, I’ll naturally help you solve those problems.","“Qiao Xi only has her mind on love all day long, but you’re someone who cares about the big picture. You and she are worlds apart. Of course, Moling likes you more.","“It won’t be long before everyone forgets your mistake and only remembers your accomplishments.”","Qiao Zhenguo smiled, but his expression suddenly darkened. “As for Qiao Xi, I’ll deal with her and won’t let her stop you.”","Qiao Rou smiled proudly.","Then, Qiao Zhenguo brought a group of people to go look for Qiao Xi. Seeing that she was sitting alone in a corner, Qiao Zhenguo said softly, “Xi Xi.”","Qiao Xi raised her eyes. “...”","“I know that you find it unfair. You grew up in the countryside, while Rou Rou has always been by my side. The gap between the two of you is very big. Now that Rou Rou has donated so much money and even bought important equipment and instruments for the university, it’s not strange that Moling likes her. Everything else is all in the past, so stop fooling around.","“I promise you that I’ll find you a suitable blind date in a few days. Don’t think about Moling anymore.”","Qiao Xi’s expression was indifferent.","The people around Qiao Zhenguo also advised her, saying, “Xi Xi, your father is doing what’s best for you. Don’t cause trouble.”","“Today’s donation ceremony is very important to the Qiao family. You can’t ruin everything for your own selfish desires.”","“Rou Rou represents the entire Qiao family now. If the Qiao family is powerful, it’ll be good for you too. Don’t be stupid!”","Hearing everyone’s persuasion, Qiao Xi sneered. “Alright.”","Qiao Zhenguo looked at her in surprise. He did not expect his stubborn daughter to be so obedient this time.","Qiao Xi said indifferently, “Sister invited me to attend the donation ceremony, so why would I cause trouble? I’ll stay below the stage and watch.","“My sister is so outstanding, I can’t compare to her.”","‘I definitely can’t bring it upon myself to embezzle someone else’s money to donate it elsewhere.’","Qiao Zhenguo was skeptical. “Alright, then I’ll accompany you in case you do anything stupid.”","Qiao Xi did not refuse and just nodded.","She would not create trouble. Someone else would settle the score with them.","The donation ceremony attracted media from all over the country. Many official news outlets were rushing to report this matter.","Although Qiao Rou had snatched her sister’s fiancee, she had also contributed to the country by donating a large sum of money to the university and getting the lost book.","Moreover, the Qiao family had long done public relations and spent a lot of money to bribe many reporters. Hence, these people would not make things difficult for Qiao Rou.","The book Qiao Rou bought was called ‘Investiture Of The Gods’. This book was written by a scholar in ancient times. However, it later fell into the hands of the public and went overseas.. Now that it could return to the country, it naturally attracted a lot of attention."]},{"number":341,"title":"Chapter 341 - Song Shijing Is Here","paragraphs":["“Investiture Of The Gods? How much did Qiao Rou spend to buy this book? She’s really rich!”","“That’s not a matter of money. She did it for the sake of the country and Li City University, so there’s a reason why the Qiao family and Gu Moling like Qiao Rou more. Qiao Rou is indeed more likable than Qiao Xi.”","After the leaders of Li City University expressed their gratitude to Qiao Rou, they handed her a gold-plated trophy.","“Miss Qiao Rou, thank you very much for your donation. Li City University is proud of you! The Rou Ling Building donated by Miss Qiao and Mr. Gu is currently under construction. After that, the facilities and equipment in the building will be available for the students’ use.”","There was thunderous applause.","Hearing everyone’s praise, Qiao Rou smiled.","Yes, she was a mistress, but so what? Was it wrong for Brother Moling to like an outstanding woman?","Now, the Qiao family’s public relations team had already made it seem that Qiao Xi was too useless, so Gu Moling hated her. Qiao Rou was too outstanding, which was why everything happened the way it did.","It was wrong for Qiao Rou to be a mistress, but she had donated 40 million yuan, after all. There was nothing to criticize anymore.","When the donation ceremony was about to end, Qiao Rou picked up the microphone and smiled.","“As a student of Li City University, I’m very proud. Although I’m in the entertainment industry, I still hope to do my best to contribute to my alma mater. I’ve indeed done something wrong. I’m very sorry, but I’m even more sorry for my sister. I hope you can forgive me.”","Her burning gaze landed on Qiao Xi as she waited for her response.","Now that the entire Li City University was backing Qiao Rou, could Qiao Xi still continue to create trouble?","Qiao Xi was silent for a short while, and her expression was indifferent. “Sister, I forgive you.","“Dad is right. I’m not outstanding enough, so the entire family, including my fiance, likes you more. In the end, it’s because I’m too poor and can’t compare to you.”","Qiao Rou’s eyes were filled with delight.","Qiao Xi finally lowered her head. She finally knew that she could not compare to her!","This woman should have realized this a long time ago. She was just utterly lousy. Apart from her identity as the first wife’s daughter, she had nothing else. She should have been abandoned. She deserved it!","Qiao Rou smiled proudly. “Sister, I never thought that you were bad, but everyone likes outstanding people. I donated a building this time—”","“Miss Qiao.” At this moment, a serious voice interrupted Qiao Rou.","Song Shijing walked in slowly with documents in his hand.","He ignored everyone’s gazes. “I’m sorry, everyone. I didn’t expect the ceremony to be nearly over. I’m late.”","As Gu Zheng’s special assistant, Song Shijing represented Gu Zheng. Everyone became nervous. Gu Moling stepped forward and said respectfully, “Assistant Song, you’re here.”","Song Shijing glanced at Gu Moling coldly and sneered. “I have something to ask Miss Qiao Rou in person.”","Everyone was confused. Why was Song Shijing looking for Qiao Rou?","Could it be that Qiao Rou and Gu Zheng were related?","Qiao Rou was stunned for a moment and smiled happily.","Did President Gu send his special assistant here to praise her for her generosity? Would he look up to her or even like her?","She had donated such a large sum of money to Li City University. It was not strange for President Gu to personally thank her.","Qiao Rou glanced proudly at Qiao Xi. From today onward, she would be ranked in high society. She could completely trample on Qiao Xi then.","Gu Moling’s lips curled into a smile. It had been the right choice to choose Rou Rou.","It was an unprecedented honor for Rou Rou to be looked up to by the president. Assistant Song was even here to thank her.","However, Song Shijing’s next words left everyone dumbfounded.","“This matter is too serious, so our president came personally.”","President Gu was here?","Everyone gasped.","Old Madam Qiao also stood up excitedly. “Rou Rou is simply our family’s lucky star! She actually obtained the favor of Young Master Gu Zheng. Qiao Xi will never be able to compare to her!”","Qiao Rou smiled shyly. “Assistant Song, thank you for your appreciation. Can I invite my sister to the stage at this time?”","Song Shijing sneered in his heart. This b*tch was really bullying Young Madam all the time.."]},{"number":342,"title":"Chapter 342 - Cant Bring Trouble To My Family","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Qiao Rou bit her lip. “Sister, I’ve let you down... I hope to make it up to you. All the women in Li City want to be favored by President Gu. Come on stage. Maybe President Gu likes simple women like you. Come on up, okay?”","Qiao Xi was angered to the point of laughing.","She was simple?","Qiao Rou was just trying to show off her success and trample on her. Her intentions were too obvious.","She wanted to tell everyone that although they were sisters, there was a world of difference between them. One was noble and outstanding, while the other was lowly.","Before Qiao Xi could answer, Song Shijing said, “Miss Qiao Rou, it’s alright.”","Qiao Rou smiled disdainfully. It seemed that Song Shijing looked down on Qiao Xi too.","She smiled smugly in her heart, but she looked troubled. “Assistant Song, don’t misunderstand my sister. She’s very good to me, but unfortunately—”","“I didn’t misunderstand.” Song Shijing frowned and sneered. “Miss Qiao Rou, why do you insist on letting Miss Qiao Xi go on stage?”","Qiao Rou was stunned. “This...”","“You want her to show her face in front of President Gu while he praises you?” Song Shijing asked.","Then, he curled his lips in disdain.","“But I never said that the president is here to praise you.”","“Miss Qiao Rou, it’s enough for you to be embarrassed alone. Why must you drag Miss Qiao Xi along? Do you want to drag Miss Qiao Xi along to take the blame for you?”","...","The venue was silent for a few seconds. Everyone moved away from Qiao Rou in panic.","What?","Song Shijing said that Qiao Rou had offended President Gu?","Qiao Rou’s heart skipped a beat, and her pale lips trembled slightly. “Assistant Song, did I hear wrongly? How did I offend President Gu?”","Her eyes widened abruptly. “Did my sister say something bad about me? There was indeed a misunderstanding between us, but President Gu and I—”","Song Shijing interrupted her coldly, “Do you need others to tell you what you’ve done?”","Everyone was really puzzled. Could it be that President Gu was also interfering in someone else’s family matters? Even if Qiao Rou was a mistress, this did not seem to have anything to do with President Gu!","No matter what, today was Qiao Rou’s donation ceremony. Why did President Gu have to embarrass Qiao Rou in public? Was it too much?","Old Madam Qiao and Qiao Zhenguo were trembling with fear. They hurriedly stepped forward and bowed. “Assistant Song, it must be a misunderstanding. Our Rou Rou has always been sensible. How could she have... offended President Gu?”","Song Shijing sneered. “You’re Qiao Rou’s father and grandmother? It seems that you’re both involved in this too?”","Everyone was dumbfounded. What was going on?","Qiao Zhenguo asked in fear, “May I know what Rou Rou has done? Please tell me.”","Song Shijing was silent for a while, then he sneered. “If the two of you don’t know about this, then it must be Miss Qiao’s own plan? Don’t worry, family members shouldn’t be blamed. Our president has always been fair. Whoever makes a mistake will be held responsible. You won’t be implicated in this matter.”","As soon as he finished speaking, Song Shijing clapped his hands and the police rushed in.","Everyone gasped. What exactly happened? President Gu even got the law-enforcement officers over?","Qiao Rou’s face was pale. She took a few steps back in fear and hid behind Gu Moling. “Brother Moling, I didn’t offend President Gu. Believe me...”","Gu Moling’s face darkened. He did not believe that such a gentle person like Rou Rou would offend a big shot like President Gu. There must be a misunderstanding.","Gu Moling took a deep breath and stood up. “Assistant Song, I’m Gu Moling from the Gu family. Qiao Rou is my fiancee. There must be a misunderstanding in this matter. Please tell us what happened, Assistant Song.”","No one could turn on their cameras wherever Gu Zheng went, but the reporters had forgotten to turn off the live-stream broadcasts. Even so, no one stopped them.","Since President Gu did not stop them, it meant that they were allowed to broadcast the scene. The reporters heaved a sigh of relief.","At this moment, a law-enforcement officer walked forward with a serious expression. “Miss Qiao Rou, you’re suspected of embezzling a large sum of money. The evidence is conclusive. Please cooperate with us for an investigation.”","The entire venue was silent for a few seconds. Everyone was dumbfounded.","What? Qiao Rou embezzled a large sum of money? It caused President Gu to personally come and question her?"]},{"number":343,"title":"Chapter 343 - Qiao Rou Was Captured","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Gu Moling was also shocked. “Did Assistant Song make a mistake? Rou Rou is the daughter of the Qiao family. Why would she embezzle such a large sum of money? There’s no need for that!”","“Young Master Gu is being kept in the dark about it!”","Song Shijing said, “Sorry to trouble you, Officer Li.”","Officer Li walked in front of everyone and said seriously,","“Miss Qiao Rou...”","“Stop talking!” Qiao Rou shouted. An unprecedented fear overwhelmed her heart. She no longer cared about her image and rushed over. “I didn’t do it! I didn’t do it!”","Qiao Rou’s eyes were red, and her voice was hoarse. “Assistant Song, you’ve misunderstood. I...”","“Misunderstood? If it’s a misunderstanding, why are you so nervous, Miss Qiao?” Song Shijing gestured to Officer Li. Then, he looked at Qiao Xi, who was not far away, and then back at Qiao Rou.","“Miss Qiao, are you saying that I’ve misunderstood? If I didn’t have evidence, I wouldn’t have come here so rashly. You embezzled 40 million from my second young master’s account without his permission. Do you think we wouldn’t find out about this?","“Our second young master doesn’t lack 40 million yuan, so he won’t even realize that he’s missing this amount of money from his account. But our president won’t allow anyone to bully his younger brother and snatch away his assets.”","Song Shijing’s words were like a thunderclap in everyone’s hearts.","Qiao Rou’s face was as pale as paper, and her eyes were filled with horror.","Everyone asked in disbelief, “Assistant Song said that Qiao Rou embezzled Second Young Master Gu’s money?”","“Gu Yao is indeed not lacking in money. The Gu family dotes on him, and Gu Zheng also dotes on his younger brother. Let’s not talk about 40 million, even 400 million is nothing to him. Losing a sum of money like that is nothing to him.”","“But how did Qiao Rou steal the money?”","At this moment, someone reminded them, “Think about it carefully. Isn’t the figure 40 million familiar?”","“Didn’t Qiao Rou donate 40 million yuan to the university? She and Young Master Gu donated 80 million yuan in total. Now, President Gu is saying that Qiao Rou stole 40 million yuan from Young Master Gu Yao’s account.”","“It seems that Gu Moling’s money came from an unknown source as well! What an adulterous pair!”","Everyone’s cold gazes landed on Qiao Rou.","Qiao Rou held her breath, her mind in a mess.","When had Gu Moling ever suffered such humiliation? He looked at Qiao Rou fiercely.","“Rou Rou, where did you get your money from?”","“I don’t know... I don’t know!” Qiao Rou’s eyes were empty as she repeated, “That’s my own money. My manager can testify for me. She said that the money is mine. I didn’t know that the money belonged to Young Master Gu. I didn’t know.”","Gu Moling took a few steps back, feeling that the woman in front of him was very unfamiliar.","Song Shijing smirked. “Officer Li, let’s arrest her.”","Officer Li went forward and handcuffed Qiao Rou.","Qiao Rou wanted to resist, but her body was so stiff that she could not move. She could only cry silently. She was so weak that it seemed like a gust of wind could blow her over.","“I really didn’t know! Don’t... Don’t arrest me! I’m innocent!”","Qiao Zhenguo wanted to save her, but because it was a live broadcast, he did not dare to disobey the police.","After Qiao Rou was captured, the atmosphere became awkward.","“Qiao Rou stole Gu Yao’s money and donated it to the university to clear her name. Now that the truth is out, shouldn’t she return the money to Young Master Gu Yao?”","“It’s fine that the Qiao family indulged their illegitimate daughter and even let her be a mistress, but now, they actually did something illegal. Is the Qiao family blind? They treat a scourge’s illegitimate daughter as treasure!”","“This illegitimate daughter is really shameless! First, she accused Eldest Miss Qiao of being a mistress. When she was slapped in the face by others, it turned out that she was the mistress. Then, she stole someone else’s money and donated it to suppress Eldest Miss Qiao. She said that Eldest Miss Qiao isn’t worthy of Gu Moling, so he chose her instead.”","“I’m dying of laughter. In the eyes of the Qiao family, Eldest Miss Qiao is useless for not fighting back. Meanwhile, a scheming b*tch like Qiao Rou is the apple of their eye!”","“Eldest Miss Qiao is so pitiful! Just now, she said that it’s because she’s not outstanding enough that her dad and grandma like her younger sister more. My heart aches for her.”","“There’s one thing Eldest Miss Qiao is indeed inferior to Qiao Rou—shamelessness.”"]},{"number":344,"title":"Chapter 344 - Ive Given Up Hope On The Qiao Family","paragraphs":["Before Qiao Rou got into the car, her ears were filled with insults. She was so angry that she almost fainted.","B*tch! I won’t let you off!","On the other side of the stage, the chancellor looked embarrassed.","He really did not expect that the money Qiao Rou donated was obtained illegally. If that was the case, this money could not be used anymore. However, the university had already accepted the money and the teaching building had already begun construction.","The chancellor said awkwardly, “Moling, I’ll refund half of this money to you. Qiao Rou’s name...”","Needless to say, everyone understood what he meant. How could a thief’s name be jotted down on Li City University’s records?","Gu Moling’s face was gloomy. He could feel that everyone’s eyes were filled with mockery. They were all mocking him for abandoning the daughter of a rich family and choosing a scheming illegitimate daughter.","At this moment, his mind was in a mess, and he stared coldly at Qiao Xi.","“Xi Xi.”","Qiao Xi raised her eyes. “Young Master Gu, you should be thinking about how to save your fiancee. Why are you looking for me?”","Gu Moling knew that today’s incident had caused him and the company a lot of negative effects. The losses would be even more immeasurable.","He frowned and forcefully suppressed his anger. “Xi Xi, you knew about this since a long time ago?”","Qiao Xi sneered and nodded.","Gu Moling’s heart ached. He questioned, “Then why didn’t you tell me? If I had known that Rou Rou’s money was stolen, I...”","Old Madam Qiao and Qiao Zhenguo looked fiercely at Qiao Xi.","“Yes, you knew about it so why didn’t you say anything? Did you deliberately want to watch our Qiao family make a fool of ourselves?”","Old Madam Qiao slammed the table with vicious eyes. “Bastard! If you had told us, the Qiao family wouldn’t have made a fool of ourselves in public?!”","Qiao Xi was not annoyed and smiled meaningfully. “Old Madam Qiao, I remember bringing it up.”","Old Madam Qiao’s expression darkened.","Qiao Xi’s words were sonorous. “I reminded you not to talk about this sum of money. Gu Moling transferred 40 million from the company, but you don’t know where Qiao Rou’s 40 million came from at all.”","Gu Moling instantly felt dizzy.","Yes, Qiao Xi had indeed said that.","Qiao Xi sneered. “You’re blaming me for not telling you? Have you ever given me a chance? I reminded you that one time, yet you said that I was jealous of Qiao Rou and was spouting nonsense to slander her. Since you thought that I had wrongly accused Qiao Rou, then I had nothing else to say. Now, you’re blaming me. Isn’t this a little unreasonable?","“Old Madam Qiao, I’ve already given up hope on the Qiao family.”","Old Madam Qiao’s body trembled as she collapsed onto the chair weakly.","Gu Moling stood on the spot in a daze as if he had been struck by lightning.","Qiao Xi had told them before, but they didn’t believe her.","“Moling, this building...” the chancellor said awkwardly.","At this moment, Gu Yao said loudly, “Wait, let me say something!”","The chancellor’s heart jumped. Qiao Rou stole Gu Yao’s money and donated it to the university. The university had already accepted it. Would this man take his anger out on Li City University?","At the thought of this, the chancellor hurriedly said respectfully, “Young Master Gu...”","Gu Yao hurriedly ran up and glanced at Gu Moling coldly. “It’s just a building. Qiao Rou donated my money, so it’s considered my donation. You don’t have to return the money.”","When the chancellor heard this, he was instantly extremely excited. “Young Master Gu, the teachers and students of Li City University will forever thank you. If you don’t mind, can I take a photo of you and put it on the university’s website?”","“Of course, but I have another question.”","Gu Yao turned around and looked at Gu Moling in disdain. “If I donate to the university, will my name be next to this bastard’s name?”","The chancellor choked.","Actually... that was the case.","Thinking about it, Gu Yao and Gu Moling had donated the same amount of money to build the teaching building. Of course, their names would be next to each other.","He could not use the name Rou Ling Building anymore. He had to change the word ‘Rou’ to ‘Yao’, which would become ‘Yao Ling Building’.","Gu Yao felt disgusted at the thought of him and Gu Moling’s names together.. “I don’t want to be associated with this man!”"]},{"number":345,"title":"Chapter 345 - The Romantic Yao Xi Building","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Gu Moling’s face darkened. Gu Yao was humiliating him! He was the president of Xi Ling Corporation, after all, while Gu Yao was just a rich second-generation heir. What right did he have to look down on him?!","“After transferring 40 million yuan of the company’s liquid assets, will the senior figures in the company let him off? He even cheated with his sister-in-law. How shameless! Is someone like him worthy of the surname Gu? It’s embarrassing to have my name next to his!”","“Er...” The chancellor asked helplessly, “Young Master Gu, what do you think we should do? ”","After all, Gu Moling had donated 40 million yuan to the university. He could not just ignore him.","Gu Yao thought for a few seconds. After all, the Gu family had too much money to spend. If he did not spend it, the money would all end up in Lu Yan’s pocket, so spending money was a good thing.","“Gu Moling’s 40-million donation will be canceled! The scumbag and b*tch were supposed to make the donation. Now that Qiao Rou isn’t donating anymore, why should he donate? I’ll fork out 80 million yuan myself!”","Gu Moling’s face darkened. “Gu...”","However, before he could speak, the chancellor rushed over warmly. “Young Master Gu, thank you so much! On behalf of the entire university, I thank you for your selfless contribution!”","Gu Moling immediately swallowed his words.","They were going too far!","Gu Yao smiled proudly and looked at Gu Moling in disdain. “You’d better quickly close the gap of 40 million in the company. That company was founded by Qiao Xi. You’re squandering the company’s funds like this. Are you even a man?”","“Hurry up and change the name of your company, Xi Ling Corporation. It sounds so uncomfortable. Why don’t you call it a sl*t corporation?”","Being humiliated by Gu Yao in public, Gu Moling’s face alternated between red and white.","The chancellor asked, “Young Master Gu Yao, will the teaching building be named after you?”","Gu Yao thought about it. “Gu Yao Building sounds a little strange.”","The chancellor said, “Then we’ll call it...”","“Why don’t we add another person’s name?” Gu Yao smiled slyly. “Just add Qiao Xi’s name to it. It’ll be called Yao Xi Building.”","The chancellor nodded. “Sounds good! It’ll be called Yao Xi Building! Qiao Xi, come over quickly!”","Qiao Xi who was sitting at the side: “???”","Yao Xi Building?","She looked at Gu Zheng, who was beside her. Gu Yao might get beaten up after this.","However, the silly Gu Yao did not feel that something was wrong at all. He only thought that Qiao Xi had been bullied by Qiao Rou and wanted to stand up for her.","Didn’t Qiao Rou brag that she had donated a building? Then, he would use Qiao Xi’s name. If Qiao Rou knew about this, she would definitely vomit blood from anger!","Second Young Master Gu chuckled. “Qiao Xi, come quickly!”","Qiao Xi: “...”","At this moment, Gu Zheng chuckled. “Gu Yao has good intentions. Go ahead.”","That made sense. Why would Gu Zheng be jealous of his younger brother? Moreover, Gu Yao was good to her because of Gu Zheng, so Qiao Xi stood up and went on stage.","The chancellor was extremely excited. “Teacher Xi Xi, thank you very much. Unfortunately, Qiao Rou’s name is on the appreciation trophy. I can’t give you the trophy now, but we’ve already customized a new trophy. It’ll be sent to your office soon.”","Qiao Xi nodded.","Gu Moling trembled.","A mocking laugh sounded from the crowd. “Is Gu Moling regretting it so much now? When he was with Qiao Xi, his career was thriving and his family was harmonious, but he insisted on choosing an illegitimate daughter. Now, his reputation and company have been affected. He’s utterly embarrassed, right?”","Gu Moling gritted his teeth and glared fiercely at Qiao Zhenguo and Old Madam Qiao before leaving.","“Moling...” Qiao Zhenguo wanted to ask him to stay, but before he could finish, Gu Moling had already walked far away.","Qiao Xi could not help but smile when she heard the curses of the crowd. She was happy just because Gu Moling and Qiao Rou were embarrassed.","However, the words that followed changed. “But I think even if Gu Moling didn’t abandon Qiao Xi, it’s impossible for him to befriend Second Young Master Gu.”","Someone was puzzled. “What do you mean?”","“Don’t you understand? Second Young Master Gu is taking such good care of Qiao Xi. It’s obvious that he likes Qiao Xi! If he’s just an ordinary friend, how could he donate so much money for her?! Moreover, he even named the teaching building ‘Yao Xi’.. It’s really too romantic.”"]},{"number":346,"title":"Chapter 346 - Second Young Master Gu Likes Qiao Xi?","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Everyone sighed. So that was how it was!","“Yeah! Second Young Master Gu definitely likes Qiao Xi!”","“Second Young Master Gu is a year older than Qiao Xi. The two of them are about the same age. Qiao Xi is good-looking and talented. Although Second Young Master is a little mischievous, he’s rich and handsome. Moreover, I’ve never heard of any rumors about him. I heard that he has never had a girlfriend. The two of them are compatible together!”","“Gu Moling was blind to abandon Qiao Xi. Who knew that Second Young Master Gu would take a liking to her? Second Young Master Gu has been single for many years and has been chaste for the sake of waiting for Qiao Xi to appear!”","Gu Yao: “?”","Damn! Was there a mistake?!","Qiao Xi and him?","Gu Yao was stunned, then his eyes were filled with horror.","‘Stop talking nonsense. Are you trying to kill me?!’","After the donation ceremony ended, Qiao Xi returned to Gu Zheng’s side. His thin lips parted slightly. “Are you happy?”","She was holding a gold-plated trophy in her hand. “Of course, I’m happy to have dealt with that adulterous pair!”","Gu Zheng chuckled. “Let’s go.”","After the two of them got into the car, Qiao Xi turned on her computer and logged into Black Tide’s account.","Gu Zheng looked up. “What are you doing?”","“Of course, we can’t let them off so easily.”","Qiao Xi’s fingers quickly tapped on the keyboard as the corners of her mouth curled into a smile. Then, she closed the laptop and leaned back in the seat to rest.","...","At the Gu family’s old residence.","Gu Yao counted the money he had spent in the past few days with his fingers. After thinking about it, he had only spent 90 million yuan in the past few days. 80 million of it was donated to the university.","Gu Zheng had so many assets that he could not spend them all even if he worked himself to death!","Second Young Master Gu frowned and suddenly thought of something. How did that b*tch Qiao Rou steal his money?","Although he did not manage his account, he had hired a professional team to help manage it. How could no one notice that he had lost 40 million yuan for no reason?","Gu Yao remained calm.","At this moment, Madam Gu, Huang Lilan, and Lu Yan walked in. Gu Yao pressed the remote control and pretended to be watching TV.","Lu Yan was gentle. “Ah Yao.”","Gu Yao looked up and smiled innocently. “Mom, Brother Lu Yan.”","The sharp-eyed Gu Yao immediately saw the luggage behind Lu Yan, so he asked in confusion, “Brother Lu Yan, are you moving here?”","Huang Lilan said with a smile, “Ah Yao, no matter what, Brother Lu Yan is Sister Qingyun’s child. He’s the legitimate young master of the Gu family. Letting him stay outside won’t give others a good impression of the Gu family, so after your father discussed it with the Lu family, he decided to let Lu Yan move back to the Gu family. When the old master’s birthday comes, he’ll announce his identity in public.”","Gu Yao’s heart jumped, but he still looked calm. “Oh.”","He suddenly stood up and asked in surprise, “Brother Lu, your watch looks a little familiar. I think Qiao Rou bought one before?”","Lu Yan remained calm. “This watch was casually bought. Who’s Qiao Rou?”","Gu Yao narrowed his eyes. That day, he did see Qiao Rou buy a man’s watch. At that time, he thought that it was for Gu Moling, but he did not see Gu Moling wearing it. Instead, it was Lu Yan who was wearing the same watch.","Could it be that Qiao Rou’s money...","Gu Yao smiled foolishly. “She’s a bad woman! Brother Lu Yan, don’t keep in contact with her!”","Lu Yan nodded slowly.","Qiao Rou was indeed a bad woman, but she was still useful.","With Qiao Rou’s help, he would obtain Qiao Xi sooner or later.","At the police station.","Qiao Rou was extremely nervous and sobbed weakly. “Dad, Grandma, please save me! I didn’t know that the money was Gu Yao’s... I never cared about the money. It was my manager who told me that the money was my salary, so I wanted to donate it. Why would I steal someone else’s money?”","Xu Mei shed tears of heartache. “Rou Rou has been obedient and sensible since she was young. You must believe her! How could she have done such a stupid thing? Her manager must have deliberately harmed her. Rou Rou must have been deceived by someone!","“We’ve already repaid the 40 million yuan. Rou Rou has also paid the price. Are they still going to send Rou Rou to jail?”","Old Madam Qiao sighed. “Moling isn’t answering his phone.. He must hate Rou Rou and the Qiao family now. Even if we say that it’s the manager’s fault, no one will believe us!”"]},{"number":347,"title":"Chapter 347 - Two Million? Who Are You Looking Down On?!","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","At this moment, Qiao Zhenguo’s face darkened. “I think there’s someone who can help us.”","Qiao Rou’s eyes lit up with anticipation.","Qiao Zhenguo said helplessly, “Black Tide... She’s a top hacker in the country. If she’s willing to help us, this matter will be resolved.”","Xu Mei gritted her teeth.","Black Tide?","That b*tch took advantage of the situation last time and asked for the Qiao family’s shares. She did not know how much it would cost to ask Black Tide for help this time.","The money all belonged to Rou Rou. How could they give it to an outsider?","Even if they looked for Black Tide, they could only give her two million at most. Anyway, how could Black Tide not consider the Qiao family’s status?","...","Qiao Rou was sitting in the living room eating fruits when a message suddenly popped up on her computer. It instantly entered the hacker network. Someone had sent a private message to Black Tide’s account.","Gu Zheng smiled. “Business is good.”","“It’s all to earn money! How else can I support you?!”","She then clicked on Xu Mei’s order.","[Customer Requirement: Help Qiao Rou clear her name.","[Cost: 2 million.","[Note: Help my daughter clear her name as soon as possible. If you don’t succeed in two days, don’t even think about getting this two million yuan!]","Gu Zheng sneered. Madam Qiao was really funny!","Two million was nothing to Qiao Xi. There were many people who wanted to do big business with her, but she did not even have the time to accept their orders.","Qiao Xi swallowed the apple in her mouth. “Two million? She’s looking down on me! Previously when she asked me to help, Qiao Zhenguo directly gave me the shares. This time, Xu Mei is only offering me two million!”","She paused for a moment, then smiled. “Actually, there’s nothing good about shares. After all, the Qiao family has been ruined by Qiao Rou. It’s uncertain if they can continue operating. As expected of the Qiao family’s beloved daughter!”","Qiao Xi smiled craftily as she suddenly had a good idea.","...","Xu Mei knew that no one would believe that this was all done by Qiao Rou’s manager. How could Qiao Rou not have participated in it at all? Hence, she had to find a top hacker and provide some strong evidence.","She had to prove that Qiao Rou did not have the money. Her manager had to do something to help Qiao Rou recover.","The only person who could do this was Black Tide, so Xu Mei could only ask for help.","Moreover, Black Tide was someone who cared about money. Once she saw that the reward was two million, she would definitely accept the order. Hence, Xu Mei was not anxious.","At this moment, Xu Mei’s phone rang. She quickly picked it up and heard a cold female voice. “Is this Madam Xu Mei?”","“Yes, are you Black Tide’s assistant? Why didn’t Black Tide call me directly?”","“Miss Black Tide asked me to convey her message.” The female voice smiled meaningfully.","“Miss Black Tide said that you’re looking down on her by offering her two million yuan. She’s a top hacker in the country. Could it be that you think she’s only worth two million yuan? Miss Black Tide can easily get an order of five million yuan. She won’t lower herself to do such low-paying jobs.”","The call was immediately hung up after that.","Xu Mei’s expression darkened.","After being humiliated, she was so angry that she lost her mind. She had never been wronged like this before. She clicked on Black Tide’s chat window and cursed.","“So what if it’s only two million? Do you think you’re so rich?! You’re just a stupid geek who plays on the computer! How much more do you want? Rou Rou is already so pitiful. Can you bear not to help her? You’re a b*tch! You want the money? Go die!”","Qiao Xi clicked on the voice message and heard Xu Mei’s roar. She was not angry in the slightest and only smiled coldly.","Gu Zheng frowned. “Are we just letting it go?”","“How is that possible?” Qiao Xi raised her eyes to look at Gu Zheng, then begged gently, “Senior, can you help me?”","The corners of Gu Zheng’s mouth twitched. This girl was definitely up to no good.","An hour later, all the members of the hacker network received Mo Yuan’s order—","[No one can take on the Qiao family’s job.]","Mo Yuan’s order instantly spread throughout the entire hacker network. All the members received this news.","The hacker organization had two major parties. One was Dark Net Organization, while the other was Star, which Qiao Xi was in. The two parties were black and white, and they were like fire and water.","Once this news spread, the people from Dark Net were puzzled.","“What’s Mo Yuan doing? He’s not letting anyone take on the Qiao family’s job? Although Mo Yuan is an international top hacker, we’re members of Dark Net. Why should we listen to him?”"]},{"number":348,"title":"Chapter 348 - Boycott The Qiao Family Online","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","The leader of the Dark Net asked in confusion, “Did Mo Yuan say why?”","“I heard that the Qiao family offended Black Tide.”","The leader frowned deeply. “Pass down my orders. Whoever dares to take on the Qiao family’s order is going against me. They actually dare to offend Black Tide! They have to pay the price!”","Everyone knew that Black Tide was the treasure of all the big shots in the hacker network.","Hence, the leaders of the two major parties released the news at the same time. No one was allowed to take on the Qiao family’s order. Everyone knew that Black Tide was the favorite of the hacker big shots. They would not offend the big shots in the industry just to take on a job.","Xu Mei found some famous hackers in the industry through her connections, but what made her angry was that when these people heard that they were going to be helping Qiao Rou clear her name, they all refused. Xu Mei sat on a chair in the police station and was so angry that her face looked ferocious.","At this moment, Qiao Zhenguo walked over and sighed. “Rou Rou... won’t be able to come out for a while.”","“My Rou Rou! Is there any way?”","Qiao Zhenguo looked troubled. “We can only look for Black Tide. We’ll get the manager to take the blame for Rou Rou. Since the money has been returned, we don’t have to go to jail. At most, our reputation will be affected. It doesn’t matter if a manager’s reputation is good or not. Our Rou Rou’s reputation can’t be affected at all.","“We have to find Black Tide to help us alter the evidence as soon as possible.","Qiao Zhenguo took a deep breath. “We have to prove that Rou Rou didn’t steal this money. Otherwise...","“Fortunately, I saved Black Tide’s contact number. I’ll call her immediately.”","Xu Mei’s face turned pale.","Black Tide had humiliated her so much, but in the end, she still needed that b*tch’s help?","Before Xu Mei could refuse, the call was connected.","Qiao Xi leaned against the sofa and unhurriedly turned on the voice changer. Her voice was cold as she said, “Mr. Qiao, what’s the matter?”","“Miss Black Tide, do you still remember who I am...” Qiao Zhenguo was very respectful.","“Then I’ll be straightforward. My daughter was framed, so we want to ask you—”","“Mr. Qiao, take a guess at why I remember you.” Qiao Xi did not listen to him and interrupted him impatiently.","Qiao Zhenguo did not understand. Although he was annoyed, he still had to show some respect to Black Tide. After all, whether he could save Rou Rou depended on Black Tide.","He suppressed his voice. “Miss Black Tide, please enlighten me.”","“Why don’t you...” Qiao Xi smiled meaningfully. “...ask Madam Qiao, Xu Mei?”","Suddenly, she seemed to have thought of something. “I’m sorry, I was wrong. Madam Xu Mei isn’t Madam Qiao. After all, both of you aren’t married yet.”","Qiao Zhenguo abruptly turned around and looked fiercely at Xu Mei.","Xu Mei panicked and lowered her head guiltily.","Qiao Zhenguo pretended to be calm. “Miss Black Tide, you... What do you mean? Rou Rou...”","“So what if it’s only two million? Do you think you’re so rich?! You’re just a stupid geek who plays on the computer! How much more do you want? Rou Rou is already so pitiful. Can you bear not to help her? You’re a b*tch! You want the money? Go die!”","A sharp female voice came from the phone, scaring Qiao Zhenguo.","Qiao Xi said slowly, “Mr. Qiao, does it sound familiar?”","Qiao Zhenguo was stunned for a moment, his mind in a mess.","“I really pity you, President Qiao. You’re under so much pressure but you married a shrew.”","Qiao Xi changed the topic. “Maybe you like women like her. This is your family matter. I can’t interfere, but...”","Qiao Zhenguo’s heart trembled.","Black Tide’s voice was extremely cold. “But I can’t take this lying down! Mr. Qiao, is Xu Mei looking down on me by offering two million yuan? Does your Qiao family think that two million yuan is enough to bribe me? Or do you think Black Tide is worth this price? I don’t lack this money. Moreover, since Madam Xu Mei scolded me so severely, I have no reason to help you.”","Qiao Zhenguo’s hand that was holding the phone trembled slightly. “Miss Black Tide, you’ve misunderstood. This...”","Before he could finish, Qiao Xi hung up.","Qiao Zhenguo held his phone and was stunned for a moment. He looked at Xu Mei fiercely and roared, “You stupid woman! Do you still want to save Rou Rou? You offered Black Tide two million to help us? How dare you?!”"]},{"number":349,"title":"Chapter 349 - I Want Shares","paragraphs":["Xu Mei explained in a panic, “Zhenguo, I wanted to save some money. I didn’t know the market price and thought that two million was enough. I didn’t expect hiring a hacker to cost so much money. I... I did it all for you!","“Actually, it’s okay. Even if we can’t get Black Tide, we can get someone else. Didn’t Moling leave us a few hackers’ contact details? I don’t believe that only Black Tide can help us!”","Qiao Zhenguo calmed down. When he thought about how Black Tide was not showing him any respect, he was also angry. Since that was the case, he would not look for Black Tide again to avoid being humiliated by her.","The two of them picked up their phones and made a few calls. However, whenever the other parties heard that they were Li City’s Qiao family, they all hung up rudely.","When they contacted the last person, Qiao Zhenguo could not help but say, “The offer price for this order is already very high. Why aren’t you accepting it?”","The other party snorted in disdain. “Mr. Qiao, you offended Black Tide and the entire hacker network. Do you think anyone will accept your order?","“Instead of wasting time on us, why don’t you quickly apologize to Black Tide?!”","Qiao Zhenguo’s face was pale. Xu Mei asked anxiously, “Zhenguo, what’s going on? They...”","Smack!","Qiao Zhenguo raised his hand and slapped Xu Mei hard.","“You jinx! Of all the people you could offend, you just had to offend Black Tide! Listen to what you’re saying. You’re just a shrew in the market! How did I marry a woman like you?! If Yunqiu were still around, she would definitely be able to handle all this trouble!","“Previously, it was Yunqiu who helped me manage the company, discuss business, meet clients, and do public relations. I didn’t have to worry about anything. What do you know? You only know how to spend money to create trouble for me! This time, you’ve offended Black Tide. You might offend someone else next time. Do you want to kill your daughter?”","Xu Mei widened her eyes in disbelief. They were filled with sorrow and anger.","Yunqiu? It had been so many years, yet Qiao Zhenguo still remembered that b*tch. He even compared her to that b*tch.","Before Xu Mei could retort, Qiao Zhenguo waved his hand in disgust. “Get lost! I don’t want to see you!”","Qiao Zhenguo suppressed his anger and calmed down before calling Black Tide again.","...","Qiao Xi looked at the caller ID and waited for a while before answering the call unhurriedly.","“Miss Black Tide, I apologize on behalf of Xu Mei. I’ve already reprimanded her. She’s a shrew. I hope you won’t stoop to her level. Rou Rou needs your help. As long as you agree, the price can be negotiated.”","Qiao Zhenguo said obsequiously, but there was silence on the other end.","He waited anxiously. After a long time, he heard a cold laugh.","Qiao Zhenguo was on edge. He was so nervous that his palms were sweating.","Black Tide said slowly, “Mr. Qiao, do you think I lack money?”","Qiao Zhenguo’s heart skipped a beat as he explained in horror, “Miss Black Tide, that’s not what I meant. As long as you can help Rou Rou, our Qiao family will definitely repay you in our next life!”","“Next life? Mr. Qiao, are you joking with me?”","Qiao Xi mocked. “What’s the point of talking about your next life if you owe someone a favor in this lifetime? Not to mention, a wicked family like yours might not have a next life.”","The atmosphere became awkward.","Qiao Zhenguo gritted his teeth. He heard Black Tide’s mockery but did not dare to retort.","Qiao Xi lay on the sofa and turned on the loudspeaker. “President Qiao, I’m a practical person. I don’t like empty talk. Do as you deem fit.”","Qiao Zhenguo gritted his teeth. “Miss Black Tide, you want...”","“The shares.” Qiao Xi went straight to the point. “Since Xu Mei offended me, I want all the shares in her hands.”","“Why would Xu Mei have...”","“You don’t want to give them to me?” Qiao Xi’s voice suddenly became icy-cold as she spoke firmly.","“After your first wife died, all the liquid assets fell into Xu Mei’s hands. Xu Mei bought 6% of Qiao Corporation’s shares with this money. Are you trying to deceive me?”","Qiao Zhenguo widened his eyes in disbelief.","Impossible! How did Black Tide know about this? Old Madam Qiao and Moling did not know this secret, so how did Black Tide know?"]},{"number":350,"title":"Chapter 350 - Let Her Be The Scapegoat","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","“President Qiao, I only have one request. I want Xu Mei’s shares! If you don’t agree, I won’t care about Qiao Rou’s matter and you can forget about finding someone else to take on the job.”","Qiao Zhenguo was just about to open his mouth to refuse, but when he heard Qiao Xi mention Qiao Rou, his mind instantly buzzed.","Miss Black Tide just wanted shares, so he agreed!","As long as he could save Rou Rou, everything would be fine.","Although 6% of the shares was a lot, it was nothing compared to the wealth Qiao Rou had. Moreover, they still had a lot of Yunqiu’s assets so this wouldn’t affect them.","“President Qiao, I want Xu Mei’s shares. Is that clear?”","Qiao Zhenguo looked up at Xu Mei.","Xu Mei shuddered. She had only heard a few words, but she knew they were talking about the shares.","No, what right did Black Tide have to get her shares?!","Black Tide, this b*tch! How dare she?!","“Zhenguo, I don’t agree. No...”","Qiao Xi laughed with ridicule. “Alright, then save Qiao Rou yourselves...”","“You have to!” Qiao Zhenguo roared angrily. He gritted his teeth and shouted, “Stupid woman, it’s all because you offended Black Tide that you caused the entire hacker community to not dare to accept our Qiao family’s order. If we can’t clear Rou Rou’s name, the Qiao family will be finished!”","Xu Mei’s face was deathly pale. Her nails dug into her palms, causing her to tremble in pain. She had never felt such despair and anger before because she had always stood on the victor’s side. Back then, she forced Yunqiu to hand over her shares and give up her position as Madam Qiao. She had never thought that one day, she would be despised by others.","“Black Tide! You b*tch! You want to kill me! You...”","“You still dare to scold her? You shrew!” Qiao Zhenguo raised his hand and gave Xu Mei a slap.","Then, he said respectfully into the phone, “Miss Black Tide, don’t worry. I’ll definitely hand over the shares I promised you. As for Rou Rou...”","“Of course, I can save Qiao Rou, but the matter has blown up too much. It’s not that easy to clear her name. We have to find a scapegoat.” Qiao Xi paused for a moment and said indifferently, “Otherwise, how can we explain why Qiao Rou donated money of unknown origin?”","The moment Qiao Zhenguo heard the word ‘scapegoat’, he thought of Qiao Xi and blurted out, “I have another daughter...”","“You mean Qiao Xi?”","Qiao Xi was not annoyed, and her voice was still calm. “Qiao Rou wrongly accused her of being a mistress. It’s all over the news yet you still want to push the blame to her. Do you think anyone will believe you? President Qiao, don’t think that only the Qiao family has brains. You shouldn’t treat others as fools. But I have an idea...”","Qiao Zhenguo was instantly delighted. “Miss Black Tide, feel free to tell me.”","Qiao Xi’s voice was calm, but each and every word pushed Xu Mei into a sea of fire. “Why don’t we let Mrs. Xu Mei be the scapegoat? For the sake of your daughter’s future, I believe Mrs. Xu will agree. Mrs. Xu Mei was the one who stole money to donate to Qiao Rou. This conclusion sounds more realistic. Moreover, Mrs. Xu Mei is a mistress. The news of her mistreating Qiao Xi has already spread. Her reputation has long been ruined.”","Xu Mei’s body stiffened, and she felt as though her blood was flowing in reverse.","Qiao Xi asked slowly, “President Qiao, what do you think of my idea?”","She leaned lazily against the sofa and closed her eyes slightly, recalling the scene back then.","The Qiao family was invited to a banquet held by a family.","Qiao Rou ran around and accidentally broke the little master’s toy. Then, everyone in the Qiao family helped her cover up the truth and blamed it on her.","This was what they said—","“Xi Xi, your sister has always been obedient. Everyone likes her, so her reputation can’t be ruined. But you’re different. You didn’t have a biological mother to educate you. Even if you make a mistake, they won’t be able to bear to criticize you.”","Hence, she became a scapegoat and was pushed to the ground by the little master. The Qiao family hugged Qiao Rou and comforted her, but no one cared about whether she was in pain or not.","Later, when she came back from the countryside, they said, “Xi Xi, Rou Rou and Moling are so compatible. Moreover, your status is not good enough for the young master of the Gu family. Only Rou Rou, who has been pampered since she was young, is worthy of Moling.. You have to be understanding.”"]},{"number":351,"title":"Chapter 351 - Setting Up A Trap","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","“Anyway, your reputation has already been ruined. It doesn’t matter if others misunderstand you. But Rou Rou is our Qiao family’s lucky star. Her reputation can’t be ruined. As long as you give Moling to Rou Rou and pretend nothing happened, everything will be settled.”","Hence, Qiao Xi wanted Xu Mei to have a taste of taking the blame for others.","“Mrs. Xu, now that your reputation has been ruined, shouldn’t you feel honored to sacrifice yourself for the Qiao family and your daughter? Or would you rather see your daughter get jailed and the Qiao family’s company face bankruptcy than sacrifice yourself?”","Xu Mei’s face was pale, and she was trembling all over. Her eyes were filled with fear. “Zhenguo, I’m your wife. I represent the Qiao family. If I bear this crime, then the Qiao family...”","Just then, Black Tide’s voice slowly rang out. “President Qiao, for Qiao Rou’s sake, you were willing to abandon your elder daughter. Xu Mei is just your lover and not the true Madam Qiao. Don’t you want to save your daughter?”","Qiao Zhenguo widened his eyes and suddenly reacted. “That’s right. Xu Mei hasn’t married me. She’s not Madam Qiao and can’t represent the Qiao family. Miss Black Tide is right! Xu Mei, only you can bear this responsibility.”","“Rou Rou is your biological daughter. Are you going to watch her reputation go down the drain?”","Black Tide imitated Xu Mei’s tone. “Yes, Qiao Rou is your own flesh and blood. As her mother, don’t you want to help her? If you don’t take the blame for her, her life will be ruined. You’re too cruel!”","Xu Mei’s pupils constricted as she exclaimed in horror, “No! No...”","No, why should she take the blame?","Qiao Xi knew that as long as Qiao Zhenguo listened to these words, it didn’t matter whether Xu Mei was willing or not. She couldn’t escape.","Back then, when her family asked her to take the blame for Qiao Rou, they were very confident. Why was Xu Mei showing such a big reaction when it was her turn?","Qiao Xi hung up the phone in a good mood.","At this moment, Gu Zheng was flipping through a document. Qiao Xi looked over curiously. “What are you looking at?”","Gu Zheng replied indifferently, “You want to read the tender document?”","Qiao Xi had a look of admiration on her face. “As expected of President Gu. You’re still so diligent after returning home. If you’re not rich, who else can be?”","“I’m sorry, you might have misunderstood.” Gu Zheng smiled and tapped his fingers on the document. His eyes narrowed slightly. “I’m not doing this for work. I want to set a trap.”","Setting up a trap?","Qiao Xi leaned closer and looked at the document before muttering to herself, “This plot of land is to develop a hot spring villa. There’s a natural hot spring surrounded by mountains and lush vegetation there. It’s far away from the clamor of the city and is a good place for the people of Li City to go on vacation. Have you taken a fancy to this plot of land?”","Gu Zheng shook his head. “The Lu family has taken a liking to it.”","Qiao Xi frowned. “But the current person in charge of the Lu family is Old Master Lu, Miss Lu Qingyun’s father. You...”","“It has nothing to do with me.” Gu Zheng’s eyes darkened.","Qiao Xi’s heart ached. “You’re right. Old Master Lu is also a fool. He was biased toward Lu Xiang back then and is still targeting you now. He clearly knows that you are...”","Qiao Xi paused and looked at Gu Zheng’s expression. She really didn’t want to hurt Gu Zheng, so she changed the topic. “Are you bidding against the Lu family this time?”","Gu Zheng nodded.","Qiao Xi continued, “Then are you confident in obtaining this plot of land?”","The man smiled meaningfully. “Mrs. Gu, I do want to bid, but I don’t intend to take this plot of land.”","Qiao Xi came to a sudden realization. Gu Zheng’s wealth was comparable to that of a country. Who would dare compete with him for the things that he took a fancy to? But the Lu family was different. As long as it was something that Gu Zheng took a fancy to, they would definitely want to interfere.","As the Lu family wanted to hide the fact that Gu Zheng was Lu Qingyun’s biological son, they had to suppress Gu Zheng. As long as Gu Zheng bid for it, the Lu family would fight him for it.","Gu Zheng did not want this plot of land at all. He only wanted to raise the price.","“However, ten billion is still worth it. After all, this plot is rich in resources and the scenery is pleasant. It’ll definitely not be a loss if it’s developed into a hot spring villa.”","“That’s right..” Gu Zheng smirked."]},{"number":352,"title":"Chapter 352 - Drive Qiao Rou Out Of The Qiao Family!","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Qiao Xi’s eyes were filled with doubt.","Gu Zheng smiled faintly and said indifferently, “What if there’s a huge ancient tomb underground?”","Qiao Xi suddenly trembled.","If there was a huge ancient tomb underground, the country would take back the right to develop the land and seal off the area. They would only compensate the Lu family based on the initial valuation of the land. By then, the Lu family would lose billions.","In the end, the Lu family would not get anything and even lose a huge sum of money for nothing.","Song Shiyu sighed.","Why did this damned man tell Young Madam about this? How could a gentle woman like Young Madam like such a scheming man?","Unexpectedly, Qiao Xi suddenly looked up with little red hearts in her eyes. “Senior, you’re too amazing! If that’s the case, the Lu family will suffer a double loss and will definitely be angered to death! So, who will the Lu family send to compete with you this time?”","Gu Zheng smiled. “Guess?”","Needless to say, it must be Lu Yan!","The next morning.","The news of Qiao Rou accusing her sister of being a mistress and then getting humiliated after being exposed for embezzling 40 million yuan spread throughout Li City.","Last night, Qiao Xi created some evidence to prove that Qiao Rou didn’t steal the money. Instead, it was her manager who transferred the money to Xu Mei. In other words, this money had nothing to do with Qiao Rou.","Hence, the police released Qiao Rou. She originally planned to sneak home, but as soon as she appeared, a group of reporters swarmed over.","When the reporters saw Qiao Rou, they rushed over and asked lots of questions. Qiao Rou’s head almost exploded.","“Miss Qiao Rou, may I ask if the money has anything to do with you? Is your manager taking the blame for you? She probably doesn’t have the ability to move Second Young Master Gu’s assets around.”","“What does this have to do with your mother? Is she the mastermind?”","“Miss Qiao Rou, how are you feeling now that your manager and your mother have helped you out of your situation?”","Being surrounded by the crowd, Qiao Rou couldn’t move an inch and was extremely flustered.","A reporter stuffed a microphone in front of her. “Miss Qiao Rou, you embezzled 40 million yuan and even stepped on your sister in public. Was it your mother, Xu Mei, who ordered you to do this?”","Seeing that Qiao Rou didn’t respond for a long time, the reporter stared at Qiao Zhenguo and Old Madam Qiao.","“President Qiao, Old Madam Qiao, I heard that Miss Qiao Xi was driven out of the Qiao family because she stole 1,000 yuan. Is this true or are you trying to frame her?”","Everyone immediately pointed their cameras at the two of them.","One of the reporters’ words were sharp. “Everyone knows that the Qiao family’s company and assets were left behind by Miss Qiao Xi’s birth mother, Ms. Xia Yunqiu. Ms. Xia Yunqiu gave all her assets to Miss Qiao Xi in her will, so there shouldn’t be anything wrong with her taking her family’s money, right? Qiao Xi merely took her own money, yet she was chased out of the house by all of you, whereas Qiao Rou took over something that wasn’t hers and even embezzled 40 million. However, you guys have nothing to say about that?”","Old Madam Qiao immediately refuted, “These two things can’t be linked!”","The reporter wasn’t polite with her and said indignantly, “Even if Miss Qiao Xi stole the money back then, she only took 1,000 yuan and had to pay such a huge price when you abandoned her in the countryside. A young girl who had no relatives was left to suffer so much. Now that Qiao Rou embezzled 40 million yuan, how are you going to deal with her? Are you going to chase her to the countryside and let her fend for herself?”","“That’s right! President Qiao, Old Madam Qiao, both of you are so heartless toward the first wife’s daughter but you haven’t done anything to the illegitimate daughter who made a big mistake. You’re too biased! Are you driving Miss Qiao Xi away on purpose so that you can take all her property and assets?”","Old Madam Qiao’s face was ashen. “You...”","“Back then, you said that the Qiao family’s rules were strict and would absolutely not tolerate thieves. You even said that you would sever ties with Qiao Xi. Now that Qiao Rou stole 40 million, the Qiao family should immediately chase her out of the house!”","Faced with everyone’s questioning, Old Madam Qiao shouted angrily, “Don’t talk nonsense. Rou Rou didn’t steal anything. Her manager did it. It has nothing to do with her!”","The reporter snorted in disdain.. “Old Madam Qiao, do you think we’re all idiots? Everyone knows who did it. Don’t think that just because Qiao Rou found someone else to take the blame that everyone will think this matter has nothing to do with her!”"]},{"number":353,"title":"Chapter 353 - The Situation Got Out Of Control And Qiao Rou Went Crazy!","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","“I repeat, Rou Rou has nothing to do with this! If you continue to spout nonsense, I’ll sue you for defamation!” Old Madam Qiao’s voice was sharp.","Upon hearing this, the reporters were enraged.","“I knew it! Qiao Rou is a mistress and framed Qiao Xi. Now, she’s even using someone else’s money. She’s done so many horrendous things, yet she can’t admit to any of it?”","“Children who cry have sweets to eat, but you can’t keep repeating mistakes. Don’t think that by just shedding a few tears everything will be over!”","Old Madam Qiao’s face alternated between red and white.","The reporters were filled with righteous indignation. “Qiao Rou maligned Qiao Xi, yet all of you instantly determined that it was Qiao Xi’s fault and even asked her to clear Qiao Rou’s name. What kind of education is your Qiao family imposing on your children?! Not only do you not dote on the legitimate eldest daughter but you even dote on a scourge and a jinx!”","“Because of the shameless mistress, the first wife died without reason and her only daughter was abused! President Qiao, don’t blame me for not reminding you. For treating a scourge like a treasure, the Qiao family will be defeated by her sooner or later!”","Then, the crowd threw a plastic bag at Qiao Rou.","Smack! It hit Qiao Rou’s head and a strong stench instantly spread out.","Qiao Rou froze for a few seconds and then screamed, “Ah!!!”","The plastic bag was filled with stinky tofu and it hit Qiao Rou right on the head. The stinky tofu slowly fell down her hair.","After someone made the first move, everyone else became furious as well. They splashed milk tea and mineral water at her for as long as they could.","Qiao Rou screamed, while Old Madam Qiao quickly pulled her into the police station.","She sobbed uncontrollably. “Why?! Why are they doing this to me? I’m innocent...”","The stench filled the air, and the police covered their mouths in disdain.","Qiao Rou was innocent? Who would believe her?","Did she think that by changing the evidence, the others wouldn’t know the truth? There was no way one could hide the truth!","Qiao Rou looked at the stinky tofu stuck to her body and screamed crazily, “Quick! Quickly call Black Tide! Didn’t she say that everything would be settled? Why are there still people looking for trouble with me?”","As soon as they got home, they hurriedly called Black Tide.","After they got through to Black Tide, Qiao Rou’s voice could be heard. “Black Tide! Didn’t you say that everything would be settled? We gave you the shares you wanted, so why did things turn out like this?”","Black Tide replied indifferently, “Miss Qiao Rou, my job was to help you change the evidence and successfully release you from the police station. As for whether others believe you or not, I can’t control that. After all, your vicious and wretched image has already left a deep impression on everyone. You can’t control other people’s thoughts, and I don’t have that ability either.”","Qiao Rou slammed the phone on the floor and shouted, “Useless! Get lost! Get lost!”","Just then, the assistant walked in nervously. “President Qiao, all of Miss Qiao’s contracts and endorsements have been canceled. The company’s projects have been suspended as well. Many projects have been taken away by the Li family.","“The eldest daughter of the Li family posted on Weibo, saying that... back then, Miss Qiao Rou smashed her favorite toy and made Qiao Rou take the blame. She knows about this and will definitely not let... Miss Qiao Rou off.”","Qiao Rou suddenly picked up the cup on the table and smashed it on the floor. She then stepped on the broken phone.","Why? Why was the whole world going against her?!","It was all because of that b*tch!","She wouldn’t give up just like that. Sooner or later, she would kill Qiao Xi to vent the hatred in her heart.","...","In Moling Corporation.","The shareholders were gathered together, and their eyes were filled with anger. Now, everyone knew that Gu Moling had secretly transferred 40 million, so these people were all dissatisfied with him.","“Xi Xi was the one who founded the company. After she left, the company lost more than half of its orders. It’s all thanks to Xi Xi that the company has what it has today!”","“Some people really have no self-awareness. They couldn’t possibly think that they’re very formidable, right? They abandoned an outstanding woman like Xi Xi and actually chose a piece of trash. They’re truly blind!”","Gu Moling’s expression was ugly, but he did not dare flare up.. He lowered his eyes dispiritedly."]},{"number":354,"title":"Chapter 354 - I Thought You Were Crazy!","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","“President Gu, we’re all shareholders of the company. I’ll make it clear to you today. Either you invite Xi Xi back and let her take charge of the company, or we’d rather lose money by choosing to sell our shares. We’re all ready to quit!”","Everyone echoed, “Gu Moling! Qiao Rou caused the company to lose 300 million yuan of assets. How are you going to compensate us?”","Gu Moling’s face was covered in stubble, and his mind was in a mess.","Ever since he got together with Rou Rou, everything had changed.","Rou Rou said that she was not targeting Xi Xi, but everything she did was to harm Xi Xi. Could it be that he had really misjudged her?","...","Longwan Residential.","After Qiao Xi hung up the phone, the butler walked over. “Madam, the president said that President Li is holding a birthday banquet tonight. He asked if you would like to come along?”","Qiao Xi asked, “Don’t we usually receive an invitation for this sort of thing? Why did you only tell me now?”","The butler quickly explained, “The president knows that you had a conflict with Miss Li previously, so... he didn’t tell you. If you don’t want to go, I’ll go tell the president now.”","So that was how it was!","Qiao Xi remembered that she didn’t have any conflict with Miss Li at that time. It was only because Qiao Rou wanted her to take the blame that Miss Li attacked her. She actually didn’t hate Miss Li.","However, she didn’t expect that Gu Zheng would reject the Li family’s invitation because of this matter. Although Gu Zheng was an indifferent person and didn’t care about social interactions, Old Master Li was a famous businessman in Li City, after all. If he rejected, it would give the Lu family a chance to sow discord between the two parties.","Seeing that she did not reply, the butler thought that she was in a dilemma. Hence, he comforted her by saying, “Madam, don’t think too much. It doesn’t matter if you don’t want to go. The president doesn’t care about the Li family at all.”","At this moment, Qiao Xi’s phone rang. It was an unknown number.","After Qiao Xi answered the call, an unfamiliar female voice sounded out from the other side. “Is this Qiao Xi?”","Qiao Xi was stunned for a moment. She didn’t seem to recognize this person. “I am. Who is this?”","“Li Xing’er.” She went straight to the point. “Can you come to my grandfather’s birthday party tonight? I have something to say to you.”","Qiao Xi was slightly surprised.","Miss Li was the one who pushed her back then. Why was she inviting her now?","Qiao Xi couldn’t help but be curious and agreed to Miss Li’s request. She turned to the butler and said, “Tell Gu Zheng that I’ll go.”","Gu Zheng wasn’t the slightest bit surprised. After he finished his work, he invited a professional makeup team to help Qiao Xi dress up.","Qiao Xi’s skin was good to begin with, and light makeup was enough to show off her beauty.","Gu Zheng asked, “Are you sure you want to go?”","“Miss Li called to invite me over, so how could I not show her some respect?”","After Qiao Xi finished speaking, her face was full of confusion. “Why do you think Miss Li invited me? What happened before was that Qiao Rou set me up and pushed the blame to me in front of everyone, so I was punished by the Li family. It has already been so many years since this small matter of ours happened. Moreover, we don’t have much interaction, so it feels a little strange.”","“Don’t be afraid. No matter what happens, I’ll always be by your side.” Gu Zheng’s voice was calm.","Qiao Xi wasn’t afraid, and she only felt curious.","She put on her gown, and the birthday banquet would start in two hours. She stood in front of the mirror and looked at herself.","Gu Zheng looked up. “Mrs. Gu, you seem to have been looking at yourself in the mirror for a long time. Is there anything wrong with the gown?”","Qiao Xi chuckled. “There’s nothing wrong. It’s too perfect.”","Gu Zheng smirked. “I thought you were crazy!”","Qiao Xi: “...”","This bastard really had a sharp tongue. He ruined her good mood.","Gu Zheng took a sip of tea. His Adam’s apple moved, and his eyes darkened. “This is not good. Change it.”","Qiao Xi had a puzzled expression as she looked at herself in the mirror. She was simply too beautiful!","“There’s nothing wrong with it! The gown’s pretty good!”","Gu Zheng frowned and said hoarsely, “It’s not good.”","Qiao Xi was furious when she heard this. “What do you mean it’s not good? This gown of mine is just right. It’s very light, low-profile, and doesn’t lose its essence. Don’t cause trouble for no reason!”","She was an internationally renowned designer. How could the clothes she chose not look good? Gu Zheng was doubting her professional standards!"]},{"number":355,"title":"Chapter 355 - An Apology Gift","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","The man was silent for a long moment before he slowly walked up to her. He touched her exposed shoulder and said with difficulty, “This exposed part makes it not good.”","The gown had a tube top design. Although it covered other areas well, her round shoulders were exposed.","Qiao Xi was just about to retort when Gu Zheng’s large hand tightly hugged her waist and pulled her into his embrace.","A messy kiss fell, going down her neck as he kissed her collarbone. The numbing sensation made Qiao Xi’s body stiffen.","She kept retreating, but Gu Zheng continued to press her against the wall.","The man’s eyes were burning as he looked at her affectionately. He panted slightly and smiled. “Do you still think this gown is good?”","Qiao Xi was stunned for a moment before she suddenly reacted. She didn’t even have to look to know that there was definitely a red mark on her collarbone and shoulder at this moment. If she were to wear this gown out, then she would be too shy to see anyone.","The Li family was holding a birthday banquet. If she attended the banquet like this, they would definitely chase her out.","“Mrs. Gu, change it.” Gu Zheng planted a kiss on the corner of her lips. The kiss carried a strong sense of longing and gentleness.","Qiao Xi immediately rushed to the mirror. These marks couldn’t be removed in a short period of time, and it was difficult to cover them with makeup, so she could only change into a gown that didn’t reveal her shoulders.","...","The Li family’s mansion.","Today was Old Master Li’s 70th birthday. He and his wife had established their company together a few years ago. They had been conscientious all these years and were known as a long-standing couple in the circle. The couple’s relationship was very good, so they were well-respected.","After greeting some of her friends, Madam Li turned around and saw her daughter standing at the side, looking worried. She went up to comfort her, saying, “Xing’er, don’t worry.”","Li Xing’er held a jewelry box in her hands. She opened it and took a look before closing it again, still feeling a little uneasy.","“Mom, do you think Qiao Xi will forgive me?”","“Although the Qiao family was the one who made Qiao Xi take the blame that time, it’s still a fact that I pushed her. I remember that she was in a lot of pain and her hand was injured. I’m only apologizing to her now after ten years. Will she accept it?”","There was a purple crystal bracelet in the jewelry box. It shone mysteriously under the lights, and there was a hollow pendant hanging in the middle. The craftsmanship was complicated, and one could tell that this bracelet was expensive.","Madam Li tapped her forehead lightly and rebuked, “It’s all because you were too impulsive back then and pushed her without understanding the situation. If she doesn’t forgive you, there’s nothing you can do about it.”","Li Xing’er frowned. “I feel very guilty. She wasn’t the one who broke it, yet I pushed her. No matter what, I have to apologize. Besides, this gift was custom-made for her and her name is engraved on the pendant. If she doesn’t accept it, I’ll throw it away.”","At this moment, a servant rushed in. “Eldest Miss.”","“What’s wrong?”","The servant was very anxious and said while trembling in fear, “I don’t know what’s going on, but everyone is saying that you’ll be giving a present today.”","Li Xing’er was a little embarrassed. “What’s wrong with giving gifts? I’m just apologizing to Qiao Xi. There’s nothing to be ashamed of!”","The servant shook her head. “No, that’s not what I meant. It’s a rumor that after the birthday party begins, the ladies of each family will put on a performance. You’ll be giving a prize to whoever’s performance is the most wonderful.”","Li Xing’er: “!!!”","‘F*ck! What f*cking nonsense is this? I’ll rip that person’s mouth off!’","Grandpa and Grandma loved lively activities, so they had prepared many musical instruments for the various young ladies to show their talents. However, they never said that they were giving away a prize.","Moreover, her present was for Qiao Xi, and Qiao Xi’s name was engraved on it. How could she give it to someone else?","Madam Li frowned and said, “Xing’er, let’s go and see who started the rumor.”","...","In the banquet hall of the Li family’s mansion.","Yao Mengqing was wearing a high-end gown. Her exquisite face and impressive figure instantly attracted the attention of many men.","At this moment, she was talking to a middle-aged man. The two of them were smiling happily.","Li Xing’er recognized this man to be a famous musician in the country.. He had composed many musical scores and was the disciple of an internationally renowned composer."]},{"number":356,"title":"Chapter 356 - I Can Smell The B*tch From A Mile Away!","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","The famous musician was standing beside Yao Mengqing. Everyone could not help but lean over. “Mr. Zhao, you’re here. We’ve been hearing a lot about your reputation. It’s really great to be able to meet you now. Have you heard about Miss Li giving away a gift?”","Madam Li narrowed her eyes.","Zhao Qinghui pretended to be calm. “I don’t care about what’s going on outside. Miss Li giving away a gift has nothing to do with me. It’s better to give the young people a chance. Miss Yao, the lady beside me, has a lot of potential.”","Everyone looked at Yao Mengqing. She was quite good-looking, but the news that the Yao family had offended Xue Liang had already spread.","Zhao Qinghui had long been dissatisfied with Xue Liang pressuring the Yao family and provoking Xue Liang time and again. However, Zhao Qinghui was a senior, after all. If Xue Liang attacked him, wouldn’t he be seen as an inhumane person?","“Miss Yao, you can’t give up on music just because of others’ opinions. I’ve seen your violin skills before. Who can compare to you in terms of performance?”","Yao Mengqing pretended to be shy. “Mr. Zhao, you’re too kind. I just like music and have never thought of getting a gift for it. Moreover, Xue Liang’s younger sister will be here today. I...”","Before she could finish, Zhao Qinghui snorted.","Everyone instantly whispered. Could it be that Xue Liang’s younger sister did not know music? Xue Liang had been in the art circle for so long. Other than having extremely high attainments in art, he was also incomparable to others in music.","Li Xing’er frowned. Yao Mengqing and Zhao Qinghui were both hypocritical people putting on a pretense. They were mocking Qiao Xi for not knowing music and even wanted to snatch the precious violin.","However, her gift was for Qiao Xi and had nothing to do with Yao Mengqing. So what if Yao Mengqing could play the violin better than Qiao Xi?","Li Xing’er was about to retort when she was stopped by Madam Li.","Madam Li reminded her in a low voice, “Let’s take a look at the situation first. Don’t be rash.”","Li Xing’er knew that her mother was considerate of the overall situation, so she calmed down and nodded obediently.","...","At the reception area.","Qiao Xi and Gu Zheng got out of the car while the butler went to deliver the birthday gift. The two of them ignored the surprised gazes of everyone and entered the hall arm in arm.","The two of them had just entered when Madam Li came forward with a smile. “Miss Qiao.”","On the other side, Yao Mengqing held a glass of wine and slowly approached Li Xing’er. “Hello, Miss Li.”","Li Xing’er glanced at her in disdain.","The smile on Yao Mengqing’s face vanished abruptly. If the Yao family did not urgently need the Li family’s help, she would not have tried to strike up a conversation with the rash and brainless eldest daughter of the Li family!","Seeing Li Xing’er look at Qiao Xi who was not far away, Yao Mengqing instantly had a plan. “Miss Li, do you know Xi Xi?”","Li Xing’er looked at her impatiently and replied angrily, “Does it have anything to do with you?”","Yao Mengqing had always been popular in high society because of her sweet appearance. This was the first time she was being treated like this. She forcefully suppressed her anger and smiled awkwardly. “Miss Li, perhaps you don’t know that Xi Xi’s husband and I are good friends. We’ve met a few times. I heard that you and Xi Xi have a conflict?”","Li Xing’er was about to leave when she heard these words. She suddenly stopped in her tracks and turned around with narrowed eyes. “Miss Yao, where did you hear this?”","Yao Mengqing looked troubled. “Actually... I was also present at your birthday party. If I remember correctly, it was Xi Xi who smashed your favorite toy. She refused to admit it and only confessed after the elders of the Qiao family persuaded her.”","“Miss Li, Xi Xi was still young at that time. She lost her biological mother when she was young. No one taught her not to touch other people’s things. Maybe she accidentally smashed it after she saw that you got a new toy. I’ll apologize on her behalf.”","Li Xing’er sneered.","If she did not know that Qiao Xi had been wrongly accused, she would have easily fallen into Yao Mengqing’s trap. She would think that Qiao Xi had invited Yao Mengqing to persuade her. She would recall those unpleasant memories from back then, causing her to be dissatisfied with Qiao Xi.","What did Yao Mengqing mean? Was she trying to drive a wedge between her and Qiao Xi? Was she trying to use her to deal with Qiao Xi? She could smell this b*tch from a mile away!","She snorted. At this moment, the butler walked over. “Miss, Madam wants to invite you over.. The banquet is about to start.”"]},{"number":357,"title":"Chapter 357 - A Sincere Apology","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Li Xing’er glanced at Yao Mengqing and said with a fake smile, “Miss Yao, you must want to know what my gift is, right?”","Yao Mengqing’s face turned pale, and her heart thumped.","Li Xing’er sneered. “Well, that’ll depend on whether you have the ability.”","...","The banquet was about to start, so Madam Li brought Qiao Xi into a guest room.","Qiao Xi did not know what the mother and daughter of the Li family intended. One called to invite her over while the other looked mysterious. However, it seemed that the two of them did not have any ill intentions.","Just as she was thinking about it, Madam Li took out a gift box. “Miss Qiao, please accept it.”","Qiao Xi had a puzzled expression as she asked unhurriedly, “Madam Li, I don’t have much contact with the Li family. The Li and Gu families don’t have many business dealings either. I don’t accept gifts for no reason. I can’t casually accept things from the Li family.”","Madam Li’s face turned slightly red as she explained helplessly, “It’s because Xing’er misunderstood you and thought that you smashed her toy. Because of that, she pushed you down in public.”","Qiao Xi frowned. To be honest, she really did not want to recall that memory. “Didn’t the Li family punish Miss Li? Everything...”","“Miss Qiao, actually, I only found out the truth a few days ago. It turned out that Qiao Rou framed you and even got the Qiao family to force you to confess. Xing’er and I know that we wronged you back then and made you suffer.","“Although it has been ten years since this incident, it still concerns your reputation, so we plan to restore your reputation at today’s banquet. This gift was prepared for you by Xing’er. I hope you like it. If you don’t accept it, Xing’er will blame herself.”","Gu Zheng, who was outside the door, heard everything clearly. Before he could say anything, Song Shiyu muttered, “Tsk! The Li family makes it sound so easy. They’re just apologizing? I think they...”","Song Shijing glared at him. “Don’t spout nonsense. The Li and Gu families don’t have any business dealings with each other. If they didn’t mean it, they wouldn’t be bothered to announce this at the birthday banquet they’re hosting. Wouldn’t it be easier to just post it on Weibo?”","Madam Li did not know that Gu Zheng was standing outside.","“Miss Qiao, I know that it’s been ten years since the incident. Perhaps you’ve forgotten or perhaps you have lingering resentment in your heart and don’t want to forgive us. However, Xu Mei announced that you stole and damaged property, so you were chased to the countryside. If you don’t clarify this matter, you’ll have this stain in your life.”","Qiao Xi remained silent and just sized up Madam Li.","Her eyes were clear and extremely sincere without a trace of hidden emotions. She felt guilty from the bottom of her heart and was worried that this matter would affect Qiao Xi.","Back then, even though everyone thought that Qiao Xi had smashed something, the Li family still punished Li Xing’er, who pushed someone in public. This meant that the Li family was sensible and magnanimous.","Qiao Xi said indifferently, “There’s no need. Isn’t it too formal to clarify things at the banquet?”","Madam Li’s eyes were sincere. “Xing’er has already told her grandparents about this matter, and Old Master has agreed. Moreover, it was our Li family who made you suffer back then. You don’t have to think too much. We just want to clear your name. You don’t have to feel pressured.”","Seeing that she was silent, Madam Li continued, “Qiao Rou hasn’t gone to look for trouble with you these few days. Actually, Xing’er has already warned her. If she still dares to look for trouble with you, Xing’er won’t let her off.","“There’s another person. The daughter of the Yao family... seems to be a little dissatisfied with you.”","Qiao Xi smiled with disdain. “Yao Mengqing? I know about that.”","...","The banquet officially began. Everyone raised their glasses and wished the two elders a long life.","After a while, Madam Li chose the pipa among the instruments and casually played a piece.","Old Master Li liked all kinds of musical instruments, so his family had a lot of them in their collection. This time, for the birthday banquet, they brought out all kinds of musical instruments. There were both Chinese and foreign musical instruments, so they planned to have a talent show.","Many musicians were invited to the banquet this time. Everyone was gathered together, playing and singing. The scene was very lively. After the performance ended, someone said, “I heard that Miss Yao participated in an international violin competition?”","Everyone looked at Yao Mengqing."]},{"number":358,"title":"Chapter 358 - Who Are You?","paragraphs":["Yao Mengqing was not shy. She smiled generously. “Yes, I participated in an international competition three years ago and won the championship as expected.”","Qiao Xi hissed and whispered in Gu Zheng’s ear, “If I remember correctly, I participated in the same international violin competition three years ago.","“Back then, it was Fourth Brother who registered me, but my skills were not as good and I did not enter the finals. I didn’t pay attention to who was the final champion. So, Yao Mengqing was the champion that year?”","The person who brought this up continued, “May I have the honor of performing a song for you, Miss Yao?”","Qiao Xi glanced at that person indifferently. It was him... The musician, Zhao Qinghui. This person had always caused trouble for Fourth Brother.","Yao Mengqing smiled and was not shy at all. “I’m just the champion of one of the competitions. There’s nothing to brag about. If Old Master Li doesn’t mind, I’m willing to perform a song to celebrate his birthday. I wish the two of you health and happiness.”","Old Master Li smiled affectionately and agreed.","Yao Mengqing walked over and picked up the exquisite violin. Just as she was about to play—","Suddenly, Yao Mengqing raised her eyes to look at Qiao Xi and she said meaningfully, “Xi Xi, if I remember correctly, you participated in that violin competition as well. If my standard has dropped, don’t laugh at me, alright?”","Qiao Xi smiled calmly with a composed expression.","So, that was how it was. Yao Mengqing had lost her reputation at the auction, so she wanted to take this opportunity to take revenge on her and let her have a taste of being mocked.","Yao Mengqing raised her head and placed the violin properly. She raised her arm elegantly, forming a beautiful angle. In order to perform, she even wore a dress that was suitable for playing the violin. Her beautiful figure was outlined, and it did not affect her performance.","Qiao Xi sat at the side and took a sip of red wine before looking at Yao Mengqing with interest.","If Yao Mengqing could become the champion, she must be extraordinary. It was a great thing for the Yao family to be able to make Old Master Li happy. Yao Mengqing could even take the opportunity to trample on Qiao Xi. It was killing two birds with one stone.","According to Yao Mengqing’s character, she would not have asked to perform. Someone had to recommend her. That person was Zhao Qinghui.","Qiao Xi looked at Zhao Qinghui. If she remembered correctly, he was the judge for the violin competition three years ago.","Yao Mengqing played a melodious and cheerful violin tune. This tune had high requirements for the performer, but she played very fluently, making everyone intoxicated in the tune.","Five minutes later, the last note sounded and there was thunderous applause.","“Awesome! The daughter of the Yao family is really talented and good-looking!”","“I didn’t expect Yao Mengqing to be so accomplished in music. I’m fascinated by her. If she can enter the music industry and develop her career there, she’ll definitely have some achievements!”","“It’s just that Miss Yao and Miss Qiao had a conflict. I’m afraid she won’t be able to enter the music industry anymore.”","Yao Mengqing was not dissatisfied at all and smiled elegantly. “Everyone, you’ve misunderstood. I’m very close to Xi Xi, so I won’t become enemies with her over a violin. I don’t think she’ll use Mr. Xue to deal with me either.”","As soon as she finished speaking, Zhao Qinghui snorted. “Mengqing, some people are just jealous of you because you’re talented and good-looking. That’s why they keep targeting you. Don’t ruin your future because of outsiders’ comments.”","In an instant, everyone present could hear a pin drop.","Everyone looked at Zhao Qinghui, then at Qiao Xi. They were clearly aware in their hearts that the person Zhao Qinghui was talking about was Qiao Xi, and there was no doubt about this.","Yao Mengqing was in a dilemma. “Mr. Zhao, don’t say that...”","“What can’t I say?” Zhao Qinghui looked at Qiao Xi and asked sarcastically, “Miss Qiao, what do you think?”","Qiao Xi put down the cup in her hand and slowly raised her eyes to meet Zhao Qinghui’s eyes.","Zhao Qinghui said disdainfully, “Why aren’t you commenting on Mengqing’s performance today? Isn’t it very exciting? I wonder if you can play this song with your skills?”","The air seemed to have frozen over.","After a while, Qiao Xi slowly raised her eyes and said word after word like a bolt from the blue, “May I know who you are?”","!!!","Zhao Qinghui’s expression froze.."]},{"number":359,"title":"Chapter 359 - Isnt This Considered Bullying?!","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Li Xing’er could not help but burst into laughter and said with a chuckle, “Mr. Zhao has been talking for a long time but Qiao Xi doesn’t know him at all. He’s famous in the music industry, so naturally, many people have heard of him, but few ordinary people have.”","Qiao Xi’s casual words instantly crushed Zhao Qinghui’s dignity to the floor.","Mr. Zhao had always been arrogant and disdained to be associated with others. However, this young lady had never heard of him.","Zhao Qinghui’s expression was gloomy. Yao Mengqing took the opportunity to speak.","She looked surprised. “Xi Xi, why don’t you... know Mr. Zhao? He was also a judge back then!”","Judge?","Zhao Qinghui was the judge for the violin competition three years ago. It was no wonder he admired Yao Mengqing so much. She was the champion!","Seeing everyone’s adoring gazes, Zhao Qinghui’s expression softened a little. He suddenly thought of something and snorted.","“It’s normal that you haven’t seen me before, Miss Qiao. After all, only those who entered the finals could see me. If I remember correctly... you didn’t enter the finals back then.”","Everyone gasped.","It turned out... Back then, Qiao Xi and Yao Mengqing had participated in the violin competition together. One won the championship while the other did not even enter the finals.","This was simply the difference between heaven and earth!","Yao Mengqing smiled smugly, then looked at Gu Zheng. However, Gu Zheng did not even bother looking at her.","Yao Mengqing clenched her fists and gritted her teeth.","Ah Zheng would find out sooner or later how outstanding she was, while Qiao Xi was just a piece of trash. She was not even worthy of carrying her shoes.","Violin was a musical instrument that required talent. Many daughters of rich families spent a lot of money to learn it, but they were still useless. It was even rarer for them to obtain results in competitions. Since she became the champion of such a prestigious competition, it would be equivalent to her winning a ticket to the upper class society.","Zhao Qinghui looked at her disdainfully. “Miss Qiao, you’re also a violinist. Why don’t you comment on Miss Yao’s performance?”","Qiao Xi’s gaze was indifferent. “Mr. Zhao, I didn’t even enter the finals and didn’t manage to see you. What right do I have to comment on the performance of a champion?”","Back then, she did not enter the finals and did not care whether or not she could win the championship. However, it was absolutely impossible for Yao Mengqing to use this matter to trample on her.","Moreover, what was the reason she did not enter the finals back then? This might not be a matter of skills at all. Perhaps there were still some secrets that had not been unearthed.","She had learned how to play the violin from Fourth Brother. Many of her picky brothers gave her a thumbs up and thought that if she entered the music industry, her future would definitely be bright.","If Yao Mengqing was only at this standard, then there was certainly something amiss with her being the champion.","Hearing her words, Zhao Qinghui instantly raised his head arrogantly. “Miss Qiao, you don’t have to belittle yourself. I’m sorry that I didn’t get to hear you perform. No matter what, you were competing against Mengqing, after all. Now that three years have passed, why don’t we compete again and see who has improved more?”","Old Master Li frowned unhappily.","Today was his birthday. He only took out his treasured musical instrument for everyone to enjoy themselves, but this Zhao Qinghui kept mocking Miss Qiao. Wasn’t he taking this too seriously?","Anyone with discerning eyes could tell that he was making things difficult for Miss Qiao. Old Master Li was about to help Qiao Xi out of this predicament when he saw his granddaughter shake her head at him.","Looking at Qiao Xi’s calm appearance, Li Xing’er had a feeling that Qiao Xi’s violin skills would definitely be better than Yao Mengqing’s.","Qiao Xi was silent for a moment before she suddenly sneered. “Mr. Zhao, you’ve already said that Miss Yao is the champion and I didn’t even enter the finals. Now that you’re asking me to compete with Miss Yao, isn’t it... a little too much?”","Everyone remained silent.","Everyone present knew that Qiao Xi was Gu Zheng’s woman. Whether the Gu family acknowledged her or not, she had Gu Zheng as her backer.","Zhao Qinghui was humiliating Qiao Xi. Was he not afraid of offending Gu Zheng?"]},{"number":360,"title":"Chapter 360 - Prove The Rumors Wrong","paragraphs":["Zhao Qinghui sneered. “Miss Qiao, there’s no need to be humble. You were young back then, but you had already displayed your talent in playing the violin. Three years is enough for you to learn something. Your standard might not be as good as Mengqing’s, but even if you can’t play well, we won’t laugh at you. We’ll even help you improve. Or are you looking down on me, Miss Qiao?”","Everyone had different expressions after hearing this.","The greatest taboo in the music industry was disrespecting one’s seniors. Zhao Qinghui was a famous musician in the country. He could be seen on all major programs. If others found out that Qiao Xi looked down on this senior, they would definitely curse her to death!","Qiao Xi smiled indifferently and turned to look at Gu Zheng. “Ah Zheng, should I perform?”","Everyone’s gaze landed on Gu Zheng.","Yao Mengqing’s heart pounded violently as her body trembled.","Gu Zheng slowly looked up, his cold eyes scanning the crowd before finally landing on Yao Mengqing. “You want to compete with my wife?”","Everyone gasped and looked at Yao Mengqing.","Yao Mengqing choked and suppressed the trembling of her body. She revealed a smile that she thought was beautiful and said gently, “President Gu, this isn’t a competition. It’s just that I’ve never heard Xi Xi play before and want to see it for myself. Although Xi Xi is your wife, everyone is saying that she’s useless. I just want everyone to see that Xi Xi is not completely clueless. She knows how to play the violin.","“I also heard that Old Madam Li likes the violin very much. If Xi Xi can play it well, she can also perform well in front of Old Madam Li. That’s a good thing.”","Her words were very appropriate and there was nothing wrong with them.","Everyone discussed softly.","When they came to attend the birthday banquet, they had heard that Gu Zheng would be attending the banquet with his wife. They had never heard of Gu Zheng’s marriage, so they were all very curious about who this Mrs. Gu was. Who knew that she was actually the legendary country bumpkin, Qiao Xi?","“Miss Yao is right. Qiao Xi’s reputation is indeed bad. Even though it’s all the Qiao family’s fault for abandoning her in the countryside and not nurturing her according to the standards of a noble daughter, it’s a fact she grew up in the countryside.”","“Maybe it’s because of Qiao Xi’s identity that President Gu is hiding his marriage. Otherwise, why didn’t he announce it?”","Gu Zheng’s expression was cold.","He had never thought of hiding it from anyone. Qiao Xi was the one who did not want to announce it.","However, it was a good thing that things had come to this. He could not force Mrs. Gu, so he took this opportunity to get her to take the initiative to announce it.","Qiao Xi blinked. “Miss Yao, you’re really gossipy! You keep hearing rumors. I’m very curious about what you’ve heard?”","Yao Mengqing lowered her head awkwardly. “Uh...”","“That you don’t have the manners and talent of a socialite!” the woman beside Yao Mengqing blurted out.","“The women here are all daughters of rich families. We’ve been living in luxury since we were young and learned how to play musical instruments. You grew up in the countryside, so it’s inevitable that you smell like dirt. Mengqing is also doing all this for your sake. She knows that you’re ignorant and incompetent, so she wants to help you prove the rumors wrong!”","Qiao Xi smiled. “Oh... I see! Then I really have to thank Miss Yao!”","Yao Mengqing heaved a sigh of relief. “Xi Xi, you’re Ah Zheng’s wife and I’m his friend. It’s only right that I help you. There’s nothing to thank me for.”","Zhao Qinghui said sarcastically, “Mengqing has already given you a chance. Miss Qiao, if you don’t dare to perform on stage, that’ll really be too disappointing. No wonder you didn’t even enter the finals back then.","“Mengqing, why don’t we forget about it? I think Miss Qiao doesn’t seem too willing...”","“Mr. Zhao, it won’t happen. Xi Xi is very outstanding...” Yao Mengqing pretended to be worried and hurriedly spoke up to defend her, but it was just a few casual words.","If Qiao Xi did not perform on stage, then it would solidify her reputation of being ignorant and incompetent. Moreover, she would never be able to raise her head in front of Yao Mengqing again.","Under the tense atmosphere, Qiao Xi finally nodded. “Alright..”"]},{"number":361,"title":"Chapter 361 - Mrs. Gus Performance Is Average?","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Qiao Xi slowly walked up to the stage. “Everyone knows that I didn’t enter the finals before this. Moreover, I haven’t played the violin much in the past three years, so my standard is still the same as it was three years ago. If I don’t perform well, I hope Mr. Zhao and Miss Yao won’t be disappointed and save me some dignity. Is that alright?”","Zhao Qinghui smiled disdainfully. “Miss Qiao, don’t worry. I’m a judge. Everything I say represents professional judgment. There’s no doubt about that.”","His words were ambiguous. He did not say that he would not criticize Qiao Xi. He only knew how to give professional comments. Even if he said harsh words, it was because of his professionalism in music and not because of her.","Moreover, he was very sure that Qiao Xi’s standard was absolutely not comparable to Yao Mengqing’s.","Yao Mengqing lowered her head with a proud smile. After the birthday banquet ended, the entire Li City would know that Qiao Xi was uneducated and useless!","What right did a woman like her have to be Mrs. Gu? Only she, Yao Mengqing, had the right to be by Gu Zheng’s side and be his only woman!","Qiao Xi picked up the violin and thought for a few seconds. Then, she elegantly raised her head, revealing the beautiful angle that was formed. Instantly, beautiful notes spread from her fingertips.","Everyone held their breaths.","Everyone closed their eyes and quietly felt the beautiful music. Sometimes, it felt like they were riding a small boat and swimming in the ocean. Other times, it felt like they were lying on the grass and counting the stars in the sky. The melodious music flowed into everyone’s hearts like flowing water, filling them with faint sorrow.","At this moment, someone reacted. “Qiao Xi’s performance is... very good!”","“Yes! It’s really good. Miss Qiao hasn’t played in three years, yet she can still perform so well. She’s really a genius!”","“However, she’s still a little inferior to Miss Yao.”","Yao Mengqing played a happy and relaxing tune. Playing such a genre on a day like this could easily bring up the atmosphere of the venue, but such a sad tune was more suitable for a quiet concert.","Zhao Qinghui frowned and said unhappily, “It’s alright, but this standard isn’t enough to participate in the international competition. It’s normal that Miss Qiao didn’t enter the finals back then. You indeed don’t have the qualifications.”","Yao Mengqing curled her lips. “Mr. Zhao, Xi Xi plays very well! Maybe it’s because you have higher expectations, but she’s not as useless as the rumors say.”","As soon as she finished speaking, she turned to look at Gu Zheng and said shyly, “Ah... President Gu, what do you think? What do you think of Xi Xi’s performance?”","Gu Zheng leaned lazily against the chair and slowly looked up.","For some reason, everyone felt suffocating pressure.","Gu Zheng looked at Qiao Xi and replied casually, “It’s average.”","Yao Mengqing looked up in surprise.","Ah Zheng said... Qiao Xi’s performance was very ordinary?","Qiao Xi’s playing skills were indeed inferior to hers. No wonder Ah Zheng did not take her seriously. It seemed that he would hate her very soon.","Originally, these few people thought that Qiao Xi’s performance was not bad. Now that Gu Zheng had spoken, they all shut up.","Zhao Qinghui was emboldened. “President Gu, you also think that Miss Qiao’s performance is average?”","Gu Zheng’s expression was indifferent as he glanced at him coldly. He only sneered and did not answer him. He looked like he was sick of talking to him.","Yao Mengqing said gently, “President Gu, Xi Xi hasn’t played for three years. It’s normal for her progess to have deteriorated a little”","At this moment, the woman beside Yao Mengqing immediately said obsequiously, “Miss Yao, you haven’t played in three years but you’re still so outstanding.”","Yao Mengqing smiled shyly. “I’m different from Xi Xi.”","Their words instantly flattered Yao Mengqing and pressed Qiao Xi to the floor.","Yao Mengqing looked at Qiao Xi proudly. She finally won against Qiao Xi today. There would be a day when Ah Zheng would detest Qiao Xi and abandon her. She believed that that day would not be far away.","Qiao Xi was not aware of the discussion below the stage and was just immersed in playing. Every note was infused with her emotions.","As soon as Yao Mengqing finished speaking, the sad tune suddenly became enthusiastic. It was as if they were at a concert and listening to the world’s best performance.","Everyone was stunned.","The smile on Yao Mengqing’s face gradually vanished."]},{"number":362,"title":"Chapter 362 - Breathtaking","paragraphs":["“Miss Qiao is the one playing this?”","“Oh my God! She can actually play such a famous tune. It seems that the performance just now was just to immerse herself in the atmosphere.”","In the notes of the violin, everyone could hear sorrow and despair. Then, the tune became joyful again. It was like the peaceful and prosperous era when the country was prosperous.","If Yao Mengqing’s tune was a happy and relaxed tune, then Qiao Xi’s tune was a heroic tune that was filled with the sentiments of the country. Although there were no words, it could make others feel deep emotions.","When the last note sounded, Qiao Xi lowered her arm and bent down slightly, her eyes filled with coldness.","Everyone held their breaths, unable to break the silence.","Everyone was immersed in the music. It was as if they had gone on a journey to look at the mountains and rivers. The flames of war raged before they witnessed the peaceful era today.","After a while, someone came back to their senses. It turned out that the song had already ended, but they still could not calm down for a long time. It was as if they had just watched a grand concert.","The applause was thunderous as everyone praised her excitedly. “I didn’t realize that the song had ended. I was too immersed in the music. Miss Qiao, you’re really awesome!”","Old Master Li stood up as well. His face was red as he clapped excitedly. “Although I’ve never heard this piece, I know that the person who created this piece must be a genius. Miss Qiao, you were able to play such a difficult piece without making a single mistake. You’re really awesome!”","After Old Master Li finished speaking, the venue erupted in applause.","Qiao Xi glanced indifferently at them, then her gaze landed on Yao Mengqing and Zhao Qinghui. She asked casually, “Miss Yao, Mr. Zhao, my performance has ended. Do you think I have the ability to prove those rumors about me being ignorant and incompetent wrong?”","Yao Mengqing choked and bit her lip.","Zhao Qinghui’s face alternated between red and white. A moment later, he gritted his teeth and said, “Miss Qiao’s performance was indeed very good...”","“If even you think it’s good, Mr. Zhao, then I should be qualified to compete with the champion, right? At least I didn’t lose my dignity here.”","Li Xing’er applauded again. “Miss Qiao, you haven’t played the violin for three years. It means that you were even more outstanding than now. You were already so capable back then. If Mr. Zhao still criticizes you, it only means that Mr. Zhao’s expectations are too high.”","Someone echoed, “Why do I feel that Miss Qiao’s standard is better than Miss Yao’s?! As expected of Xue Liang’s younger sister!”","“Who spread the rumors? They even said that Miss Qiao is ignorant and incompetent? Then what’s Yao Mengqing?”","“Yeah, who was it who spread these rumors? Before we came to the banquet, we never heard of such rumors. Yao Mengqing was the one who said it herself. I think she just wanted to step on Miss Qiao. Unexpectedly, she’s much better than her.”","Yao Mengqing’s pupils constricted abruptly as her body trembled.","Qiao Xi looked at Yao Mengqing and said casually, “Miss Yao, did you just say that my performance was very average?”","Everyone looked at Yao Mengqing with anger. She did say that Qiao Xi’s performance was average, but everyone thought that Qiao Xi was playing and could not hear their comments at all. Unexpectedly, she actually heard it.","Yao Mengqing stammered, “I-I...”","She suddenly thought of something and abruptly looked up at Gu Zheng with a confident smile. “I didn’t say anything. Yes, yes... Ah Zheng was the one who said it. He said that your performance was average, so...”","“Is that so? Gu Zheng said that my performance was average?” Qiao Xi seemed to be lost in thought.","Everyone was nervous to the point of breaking out in a cold sweat. Qiao Xi actually dared to call President Gu by his name?","Qiao Xi frowned. “Gu Zheng, did you say that my performance was average?”","Everyone held their breaths as they looked at the scene in front of them with fear. Gu Zheng might flare up in the next second, so they could not be implicated.","Yao Mengqing could not help but be stunned. She did not expect that Qiao Xi would start questioning Ah Zheng in front of everyone.","According to Ah Zheng’s character, he would definitely not pay attention to Qiao Xi, but it could be said that he was saving her some dignity.","Actually, Qiao Xi was not suitable to be Mrs. Gu at all because she did not know Ah Zheng.. She had no right to be his woman!"]},{"number":363,"title":"Chapter 363 - Whats The Secret Behind It?","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Yao Mengqing was sure that she was the only one who understood Gu Zheng the most. At this moment, she should step forward to show Ah Zheng her concern and let him know her feelings for him.","Yao Mengqing thought about it and said gently, “Xi Xi, don’t blame Ah Zheng. Maybe it’s because his standards are too high. Actually, Mr. Zhao and I both think that you play very well. As long as you practice hard, Ah Zheng will take a liking to you sooner or later.”","Yao Mengqing secretly curled up her lips into a proud smile. “Ah Zheng and I grew up together. I know him very well. He’s very picky about things and people. He won’t like even such a perfect tune. He’s not targeting you, but his requirements are too high. Although you’re his wife, you can’t let him change for you. Just get used to it.”","Everyone gasped.","In that case, President Gu did not like Qiao Xi and even found her a little annoying. Otherwise, why would such perfect music not satisfy him?","Li Xing’er could not sit still anymore. “Gu—”","Before she could finish, Gu Zheng raised his eyes indifferently. His eyes were filled with disdain and ridicule. He looked at Yao Mengqing and chuckled. “Xi Xi, I said your performance was average. Are you angry with me?”","Gu Zheng’s voice was gentle, but it still maintained a dignified air. Everyone could hear the affection in his voice, especially when he said ‘Xi Xi’. It was filled with President Gu’s gentleness and love, making everyone dumbfounded.","Yao Mengqing’s heart thumped. Impossible! Ah Zheng was clearly helping her. How could he be so gentle to Qiao Xi? This was definitely an illusion!","Earlier, he said that Qiao Xi’s performance was very ordinary, which meant that he liked the tune she played more.","B-But... Why was she still so nervous? Her heart seemed to skip a beat.","Gu Zheng’s voice was magnetic as he said slowly, “I watched the international violin competition three years ago too. Xi Xi, this time, your performance was not even half as good as your performance three years ago, so it can only be said to be average.”","Everyone was instantly stunned. Then, they realized what Gu Zheng had just said. They were extremely shocked!","President Gu said that the performance this time was not even half as good as her performance from three years ago?","The performance this time had already made them forget about everything else. If that was the case, just how stunning was her performance from three years ago?","“Miss Qiao said that she hasn’t played the violin in three years, so her standard has dropped. It looks like she’s not lying!”","“That’s not a problem. After all, President Gu has seen Miss Qiao’s performance back then. After listening to her performance now, he naturally finds it very ordinary. Miss Qiao has not practiced for three years, so it’s normal for her to be a little weak.”","“President Gu, your expectations are too high, but we all think that the performance this time was perfect!”","“Miss Yao was the champion back then. She has been practicing all these years but can’t compare to Miss Qiao, who hasn’t played for three years. How embarrassing! She still has the cheek to mock others with such standards?”","“Wait!”","At this moment, something suddenly flashed through Li Xing’er’s mind. She did not have the time to think and blurted out, “That’s not right! If Qiao Xi is better than Yao Mengqing after not practicing for three years, then why didn’t Qiao Xi enter the finals when she was at her peak? Moreover, Yao Mengqing even won the championship?”","Huh? That was right.","This was a little strange!","Everyone looked at Li Xing’er, whose face was overcast with anger. “According to President Gu, Qiao Xi performed better three years ago, so why didn’t she enter the finals?!”","“Yao Mengqing has been practicing for so long but still can’t compare to Qiao Xi, who’s already unfamiliar with the violin. However, she became the champion back then! What exactly is going on?”","...!","Yao Mengqing’s face was pale as if she had been struck by lightning.","Li Xing’er’s words had reminded everyone of the incident. No wonder when they heard Qiao Xi’s performance just now, they kept feeling that something was wrong! So that was the reason!","“That’s right! Back then, Miss Yao’s violin skills might not even be as good as they are now. Back then, even President Gu was full of praise for Miss Qiao. Why didn’t Miss Qiao enter the finals?”","“Who were the judges for the semi-finals?”","“I remember that the judge who had the right to veto and the right to advance contestants was... Zhao Qinghui!”"]},{"number":364,"title":"Chapter 364 - Music Is An Art That Normal People Dont Understand","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","“Could it be that in the semi-finals, everyone performed very well and was even better than Miss Qiao? But President Gu said that Miss Qiao performed even better back then. President Gu can testify for Miss Qiao. Whose performance could’ve been more exciting than hers?”","“Then how did those people enter the finals back then? And how did Yao Mengqing get the championship title? Mr. Zhao, can you explain?”","One could hear a pin drop.","Everyone knew what was going on and looked at Zhao Qinghui in disdain.","Qiao Xi smiled meaningfully. “After everyone’s reminder, I finally remember that something was off back then! All of you are right. The current Miss Yao can’t even compare to me, whose skills have already regressed. Is it because she has regressed more, or is it because there was a conspiracy in the finals back then?”","Yao Mengqing broke out in a cold sweat, her eyes filled with horror.","Zhao Qinghui frowned and cleared his throat. “Of course, the competition back then was fair and transparent, but I wasn’t the only judge in the violin competition. I couldn’t take the lead. Moreover, our evaluation of the contestants was based on many aspects. At that time, Miss Yao was indeed very outstanding. Be it her stage presence or her performance itself, she was very mature. Perhaps the judges at that time liked her a lot.”","Zhao Qinghui lectured everyone like an elder.","“Music is an art that only experienced musicians can understand. As for ordinary people, they’re just simply listening to music. It’s not enough for them to give comments.”","These words meant that although Qiao Xi’s performance sounded good on the surface, it actually did not contain any meaning. It could only make outsiders praise her endlessly, but it could not get her the praise of professionals.","Qiao Xi pretended to be innocent. “Gu Zheng, Mr. Zhao said you’re a layman! It doesn’t count if you say my performance is good!”","Everyone was trembling with fear. Zhao Qinghui was so nervous that he broke out in a cold sweat.","However, he was a celebrity in the music industry, after all. President Gu was a businessman. The comments he gave did not represent professionals at all.","Gu Zheng’s expression was calm as he said indifferently, “I’m indeed not a professional. As a famous musician, Mr. Zhao is naturally more experienced.”","Yao Mengqing’s expression softened. It seemed that Ah Zheng still cared about her.","She admitted that she was inferior to Qiao Xi in today’s performance. Everyone liked Qiao Xi’s performance, but everyone present was an amateur. They did not know music, so they liked Qiao Xi’s music that did not have any soul or emotions.","Mr. Zhao was a famous musician, so when he said that she played better, it meant that her playing skills were professional while Qiao Xi was just an amateur.","Hearing Gu Zheng’s words, Zhao Qinghui heaved a sigh of relief.","“President Gu is right. Miss Qiao’s performance was indeed astounding. I was also very puzzled that she did not enter the finals back then, but this has nothing to do with Miss Yao’s performance. Back then, we all agreed that Miss Yao’s performance was more emotional and mature. She deserved to be the champion!","“Speaking of which, let me invite Miss Yao to attend next month’s concert. At that time, the two of us will perform on stage together.”","After Zhao Qinghui finished speaking, he looked at Qiao Xi with eyes that were filled with disdain. “The matter from three years ago is already over. Miss Qiao, please don’t cling to the past and train hard. You’ll have a chance in the future.”","Everyone looked at Yao Mengqing in envy. It was a great honor to be able to perform with Zhao Qinghui. With Yao Mengqing’s looks, she might even be able to enter the entertainment industry. At that time, she would be superior to everyone in high society.","“But I still think Qiao Xi is more outstanding! It’s fine that Zhao Qinghui doesn’t like her, but why did he keep forcing her to perform? She has already given a great performance, yet he’s criticizing her. Isn’t this a little too much?”","Zhao Qinghui did not care at all. “I was just commenting as a professional musician. Although I’m a little harsh to Miss Qiao, it’s also for her own good.. I hope she can improve in the future and not give up on playing the violin. Miss Qiao, could it be that you think I’m deliberately targeting you?”"]},{"number":365,"title":"Chapter 365 - She Can Be The Judge","paragraphs":["Hearing Zhao Qinghui’s words, everyone was instantly angry. “You...”","However, one thing was right. Everyone present was not a professional. No one could compare to Zhao Qinghui in terms of music. Moreover, he was clearly biased toward Yao Mengqing. He was just short of telling everyone that he wanted to avenge Yao Mengqing by targeting Qiao Xi.","Qiao Xi was not annoyed in the slightest and just smiled lightly. “As long as Mr. Zhao is happy, it doesn’t matter who everyone likes. It’s fine as long as Miss Yao is happy.”","Yao Mengqing suppressed her anger and forced a smile.","This time... she had won, so it did not matter. Qiao Xi could say whatever she wanted.","Zhao Qinghui was a famous musician. He represented the highest level of music. Who could retort him? If he said that Qiao Xi’s performance was emotionless, then it meant that she was emotionless!","Zhao Qinghui nodded in satisfaction. “I still have to ask, do you have any objections to the competition’s results back then? If you don’t...”","At this moment, a man suddenly stood up and shouted, “Wait!”","The man had European features, fair skin, and light blue eyes. His Chinese was a little awkward, but he said anxiously, “Miss Qiao, please wait a moment.”","Qiao Xi turned around. The person hurriedly bowed to Old Master Li. “I’m sorry, Mr. Li. For the sake of ensuring fairness in the international violin competition, I might have to take up a little of your time.”","Old Master Li nodded without hesitation, then the man quickly said, “Miss Qiao, I’m really grateful that you performed such a stunning piece. In fact, you’re not even at the level of a contestant. You’re more than qualified to be a judge for the competition.”","As soon as he finished speaking, the banquet hall fell silent. Everyone was dumbfounded.","Zhao Qinghui and Yao Mengqing’s expressions were very ugly.","She could be a judge for an international competition?","Yao Mengqing’s face was pale. She bit her lip so hard that her nails dug into her palms.","The woman beside Yao Mengqing was indignant. “Nonsense! Mr. Zhao said that Mengqing’s standard is higher and she’s fully deserving of being the champion. You said that Qiao Xi can be a judge. Could it be that you’re denying Mr. Zhao’s professionalism?","“Or are you looking down on the champion of the international violin competition?”","The atmosphere was tense. Everyone was staring at the few people in front of them with burning gazes. Something big was going to happen today!","Speaking of which, who was this foreigner? Why did he deny Mr. Zhao’s comments and praise Qiao Xi for being good enough to become a judge?","With Mr. Zhao’s ego, he would definitely not be able to take this lying down and would definitely compete for supremacy.","The man frowned, then looked at the woman beside Yao Mengqing. “Miss, please don’t instigate a fight. I’m not looking down on the champion of the international violin competition.”","The woman beside Yao Mengqing was Lin Weiwei from the Lin family, Lin Jie’s younger sister. She knew that Yao Mengqing and Gu Zheng had grown up together, so she had always been by Yao Mengqing’s side as her lackey. It was all for the sake of helping Yao Mengqing when she married into the Gu family and became Mrs. Gu.","Unexpectedly, Qiao Xi became Mrs. Gu first. Her dream of attaining riches was shattered, so she naturally felt resentment.","Lin Weiwei looked disdainful. “If you’re not looking down on her, then what are you doing?”","The man said without hesitation, “I’m just looking down on Miss Yao Mengqing. I’m not looking down on the champion!”","Lin Weiwei was instantly speechless, and her face turned pale.","Being mocked in public, Yao Mengqing’s face alternated between red and white. She was so angry that her entire body was trembling. She suppressed the anger in her heart.","The man continued to attack. “Zhao Qinghui, as a judge for the international violin competition, you secretly manipulated things and oppressed an outstanding contestant like Qiao Xi. What explanation do you have? What right do you have to be a judge?”","Lin Weiwei roared and retorted, “Shut up! Who do you think you are?! Do you have the right to speak here? Sister Mengqing is the champion! You have no right to say anything!”","If Qiao Xi really became a judge, wouldn’t it be equivalent to slapping Yao Mengqing’s face? Moreover, it would be equivalent to announcing to the world that Yao Mengqing’s victory back then was a conspiracy!"]},{"number":366,"title":"Chapter 366 - Unveiling The Scheme","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","If news of this got out, where would Zhao Qinghui place his dignity?","Yao Mengqing’s body went soft, and she fell into Madam Yao’s arms.","Madam Yao frowned. “Mister, no matter who you are, you humiliated Mengqing like this and even questioned the fairness of the international violin competition! Please apologize to my daughter immediately! Otherwise, our Yao family will immediately sue you for slander!”","At this moment, Old Madam Li suddenly stood up and rubbed her eyes. She asked in disbelief, “Y-You’re... Mr. Morper?”","The man smiled. “Yes, Old Madam. I didn’t tell you my identity in advance. I’m really sorry, but you still recognized me.”","Gu Zheng, who was sitting at the side, smirked.","Madam Yao had never heard of Mr. Morper before. She immediately shouted, “I don’t care who you are! You have to pay the price for slandering my daughter!”","As soon as she finished speaking, Li Xing’er widened her eyes as well. “Mr. Morper, why are you here in Li City? Shouldn’t you be preparing for the upcoming violin competition in the United States?”","Li Xing’er’s words enlightened everyone.","“Could this Mr. Morper, the founder of the international violin competition?”","“That’s right! It’s him! 15 years ago, Mr. Morper founded the violin competition. Although Mr. Morper’s violin skills are not the best in the world, he discovered many violin geniuses and promoted the development of the violin.”","“That’s right! Mr. Morper has a pair of sharp eyes. He can accurately discover the strengths and weaknesses of every contestant. He’s a true master of music!”","“Do all of you still remember? Mr. Morper said earlier that Zhao Qinghui is deliberately targeting Qiao Xi. He also said that Yao Mengqing isn’t qualified to be the champion. Meanwhile, Qiao Xi’s standard is enough to make her a judge for the violin competition, so...”","The words that followed were self-evident. Everyone understood and looked at Yao Mengqing.","Madam Yao choked and looked at Yao Mengqing in horror.","Yao Mengqing bit her lip tightly. The anxiety and shame in her heart mixed together, making her almost unable to breathe.","She never expected that the man in front of her would be the founder of the violin competition... Mr. Morper.","Mr. Morper was very enthusiastic. “Miss Qiao, may I represent the violin competition to invite you to be a judge for this year’s competition?”","This was explosive news!","Yao Mengqing was proud and arrogant just because she was the champion. She even wanted to step on Qiao Xi. Little did she know that Qiao Xi’s standard was enough for her to be a judge.","Now that Mr. Morper had appeared, it proved that Zhao Qinghui had deliberately eliminated Qiao Xi three years ago and given Yao Mengqing the position of the champion. This was a conspiracy!","Not only that, but Mr. Morper was now even inviting Qiao Xi to be a judge. This was equivalent to humiliating Yao Mengqing and Zhao Qinghui.","Qiao Xi did not need to compete for the championship three years ago at all. The title of champion was nothing to her. She could be a judge who had the qualifications to decide who the champion was!","“Deliberately eliminating Qiao Xi and stopping her from becoming the champion was for naught! She can already be a judge!”","“Look at Yao Mengqing’s smug look just moments ago. In the end, all she did was slap herself in the face, no?”","Qiao Xi smiled lightly. “Mr. Morper, I’m inexperienced and don’t have the qualifications to be a judge. However, I appreciate your kind intentions. If I have the chance, I can be an appraiser. It’s just a suggestion, and I won’t be participating in the competition.”","“Alright! It’s good enough that you’re willing to be an appraiser, Miss Qiao. I completely agree!” Mr. Morper agreed without hesitation. He turned around and saw Zhao Qinghui.","Morper’s eyes turned cold. “Mr. Zhao, the violin competition was supposed to be fair and transparent. Because of your participation, we lost such an outstanding contestant. The international violin competition won’t let you off so easily!”","“Miss Yao Mengqing, we’ll take back your trophy and announce that your title as the champion is invalid. Whether you won the championship through shady means or not, the title of champion won’t be yours.. I hope you can understand.”"]},{"number":367,"title":"Chapter 367 - Yao Mengqing Is Going To Do Evil Things Again","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","“I hereby announce that the champion of the violin competition from three years ago is revoked! No one won that competition!”","Morper announced loudly. Actually, in his heart, Qiao Xi was undoubtedly the champion. It was just that Qiao Xi might not care anymore.","Zhao Qinghui’s legs went weak, and he almost fell to the floor. He had to support himself on the chair to steady himself. His eyes were filled with defeat.","Yao Mengqing widened her eyes in horror. She was about to explain when she saw the disdainful gazes of everyone. She could only suppress her anger and lower her head.","‘Qiao Xi! I won’t let you off!","‘One day, I’ll return all the pain and humiliation you gave me. I’ll let you have a taste of it!’","The Li family came forward to mediate the situation. “Someone! Help Mr. Zhao to the lounge. The banquet will continue.”","...","The banquet was very lively. No one mentioned the incident just now. Everyone had a tacit understanding that mentioning this matter would undoubtedly humiliate Yao Mengqing even further and make the Li family feel disgusted.","Li Xing’er pulled her sister to the side and complained, “How shameless! I really want to chase Yao Mengqing out! Is she really a daughter of a rich family? Which noble daughter could do such despicable things?”","The younger sister blinked and said in a low voice, “Look, Yao Mengqing is going to create trouble again!”","Li Xing’er turned around and saw Yao Mengqing holding a wine glass. She was walking toward Qiao Xi with a group of people.","“Miss Qiao, I’m very sorry. I really didn’t know that Zhao Qinghui deliberately made the decision to eliminate you. If you had participated in the competition back then, this championship would’ve been yours! I’m indeed not worthy!”","Yao Mengqing raised her glass with a gentle expression. “Miss Qiao, this glass of wine is my apology. Can you... forgive me?”","Madam Yao chimed in, “Miss Qiao, Mengqing didn’t know anything. It was all Zhao Qinghui’s doing!”","Lin Weiwei also said, “Sister Mengqing and President Gu are good friends! If you don’t forgive her, won’t you be making things difficult for President Gu too? It’s not a big deal anyway. It’s just a matter of words.”","Li Xing’er was angry. These people were shameless. Even if Yao Mengqing, this b*tch, was apologizing, why should Qiao Xi forgive her? Moreover, everyone knew what was going on. Zhao Qinghui would not have done it for no reason. He must have done it for Yao Mengqing.","Wasn’t it too late to pretend to be innocent now?","Seeing that Qiao Xi did not reply after a long time, Yao Mengqing’s eyes instantly welled up with tears as she choked. “Xi Xi... If you’re unwilling to forgive me, I won’t blame you. Boo-hoo...”","“Qiao Xi! You’re too heartless! It’s already been three years, yet you’re still unwilling to let this go! Sister Mengqing has already apologized to you. What else do you want? Can’t you tell that she’s very guilty now? This isn’t her fault at all. What else do you want?”","Yao Mengqing hurriedly stopped her. “Wei Wei, don’t say anymore. It’s normal for Miss Qiao to be dissatisfied. It’s my fault. I shouldn’t have fought for the championship. If I knew that Xi Xi was also participating in the competition, I wouldn’t have hesitated to give the championship to her.”","“You want to beg Xi Xi for forgiveness?”","At this moment, a cold voice sounded.","Gu Zheng leaned lazily on the sofa and swept his cold gaze across the crowd.","His eyes were deep as he gently took a sip of red wine. His lips were also stained with some red.","Gu Zheng sneered. “Shouldn’t you show some sincerity if you want Xi Xi to forgive you? Yao Mengqing, what should you call Xi Xi?”","Everyone was puzzled. Yao Mengqing had just called Qiao Xi ‘Miss Qiao’ and also called her ‘Xi Xi’ intimately. Could it be that there were other titles?","Gu Zheng said slowly, “Since you know that we’re married, shouldn’t you call her Mrs. Gu?”","Yao Mengqing’s heart stopped.","Li Xing’er smiled. “Yes! Yao Mengqing, you know that President Gu and Mrs. Gu are married, but you keep calling her Miss Qiao instead of Mrs. Gu.","“You keep saying that you’re President Gu’s good friend, but you keep calling her ‘Miss Qiao’. Are you doing this on purpose?","“Do you think we won’t know that you’re not acknowledging Mrs. Gu’s identity? That’s too laughable!”"]},{"number":368,"title":"Chapter 368 - Pretending To Faint Again","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","The matter of Gu Zheng and Qiao Xi’s marriage had never been made public, but there were also some people who knew the inside story. Hence, everyone present guessed that Qiao Xi was Mrs. Gu.","However, Yao Mengqing already knew that Qiao Xi and Gu Zheng were married. Why did she still insist on calling her ‘Miss Qiao’?","Moreover, when Old Madam Li wanted to call Qiao Xi ‘Mrs. Gu’, it was Yao Mengqing who called her ‘Miss Qiao’ first. She interrupted Old Madam Li and led everyone to call Qiao Xi ‘Miss Qiao’.","Yao Mengqing looked at the crowd’s disdainful and mocking gazes and felt a sense of shame.","Her face was pale as she resisted the fear in her heart. Her voice trembled. “I... I’m not doing it on purpose. I’m just used to it.”","Li Xing’er snorted. “Who are you kidding? I think you’re just denying it on purpose.”","Qiao Xi pretended to be surprised, then she smiled meaningfully. “Miss Li, you’re right. Miss Yao knew that I’m Mrs. Gu a long time ago, but she has always addressed me as ‘Miss Qiao’. Moreover, you came to our house several times without an invitation and even asked to stay there. Although you didn’t succeed, it’s clear you actually want to...”","Qiao Xi specially emphasized the word ‘our’. She did not say anything else, but everyone understood what she meant.","“Hah! Yao Mengqing wants to be a mistress. She wants to stay in Longwan Residential as a friend and pretend to be President Gu’s friend. Actually, she has always wanted to interfere in the relationship between Mrs. Gu and President Gu.”","“Isn’t she just a b*tch?”","“No wonder she and Zhao Qinghui put on an act just to mock Mrs. Gu for not entering the finals back then. Who knew that she would shoot herself in the foot?”","“Zhao Qinghui kept forcing Mrs. Gu to perform because he wanted to step on her and highlight how good Yao Mengqing’s violin skills are.”","Everyone sneered. “Unfortunately, Yao Mengqing won the championship back then because of a conspiracy. Mrs. Gu is the true champion!”","Yao Mengqing’s blood froze when she heard the mocking laughter around her.","Her legs went weak, and she did not know how to explain herself. Her voice trembled as she choked. “Xi Xi, I... I treat both President Gu and you as friends. I really don’t mean anything else.”","“Miss Yao, please call me ‘Mrs. Gu’,” Qiao Xi said coldly.","Yao Mengqing instantly choked. Her face was as pale as paper, and she was about to break down.","Lin Jie finally could not take it anymore. “Qiao Xi! Don’t go too far!”","Qiao Xi said casually, “Miss Yao, what are you afraid of? Is calling me ‘Mrs. Gu’ so difficult for you?”","Everyone’s burning gazes landed on Yao Mengqing.","Even though Yao Mengqing and President Gu were once a couple, that was all in the past. Now that Qiao Xi was the real Mrs. Gu, why was she pretending to be aggrieved?","Moreover, Yao Mengqing had always said to the public that she was President Gu’s friend. She had never said that the two of them were a couple. Now that President Gu was married, she ran over to disgust Qiao Xi and pretended to be weak. She was really a b*tch.","Yao Mengqing was about to break down.","She had never been so embarrassed before because she was the beloved daughter of the Yao family and Gu Zheng’s childhood sweetheart. In Li City, many people would suck up to her and no one would make things difficult for her, much less attack her like this.","However, because of Qiao Xi, everyone was criticizing her. Their gazes were filled with ridicule and disdain. How could she raise her head in high society in the future?","“Mrs.... Mrs. Gu...” Yao Mengqing said with difficulty. She instantly felt dizzy and fainted.","“Mengqing!” Lin Jie hurriedly supported her, looking worried. “Mengqing! Mengqing! Madam Yao, I’ll send Mengqing to the hospital!”","Then, Lin Jie raised his eyes and glared fiercely at Qiao Xi. He then carried Yao Mengqing horizontally and left the hall.","Yao Mengqing collapsed weakly in Lin Jie’s arms, her body still trembling.","She gritted her teeth and suppressed her trembling.","It was all Qiao Xi’s fault! Qiao Xi had harmed her!"]},{"number":369,"title":"Chapter 369 - The Jewelry Exhibition A Few Days Later","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Yao Mengqing hid in Lin Jie’s arms and revealed a vicious smile. Then, she looked up weakly.","“Ah Jie...”","Lin Jie said gently, “Mengqing, you’re awake?”","“I-I just...” Yao Mengqing’s tears trickled down. “Take me to the waiting room. We’re not going to the hospital anymore. I really don’t wish to ruin their relationship, nor do I want to be a mistress. How should I explain it so that they’ll believe me?","“I just think that Xi Xi’s identity isn’t worthy of Ah Zheng. He’s such an outstanding man. He’s handsome and rich. Only the most outstanding woman has the right to be his wife.","“But Xi Xi is just a young girl from the countryside. She’s not gentle nor talented. How is she worthy to be Mrs. Gu?","“Although Xi Xi is very good, she’s not suitable for Ah Zheng. Who knew that everyone would misunderstand me and think that I have ulterior motives?”","Lin Jie was angry. “It’s all Qiao Xi’s fault. She’s jealous of you. It’s because she’s useless that she keeps targeting you! Mengqing, don’t be sad. The jewelry exhibition will be held in a few days. I heard that Qiao Xi has signed up as well. It’s impossible that she’s able to design anything good!”","Yao Mengqing suddenly recalled that when she first met Qiao Xi, she had given her 16 sets of gowns. She had tampered with the gowns, but she did not expect that Qiao Xi would figure it out right away.","She was suddenly slightly perturbed. Previously, she had heard the two Song brothers say that Qiao Xi was Gu Shan. Could it be that this was true?","After a moment of silence, she heaved a sigh of relief. What was there to be afraid of? So what if it was true? Even if Qiao Xi was Gu Shan, she might not necessarily be good at designing jewelry.","However, it was different for her. She had international brands for both jewelry and fashion. Many of her products were in short supply, but she had never heard of Qiao Xi’s brand.","So what if Qiao Xi could play the violin well? In terms of jewelry and clothes, Qiao Xi was definitely not her match.","She was an internationally renowned designer. She was a young, beautiful, and talented independent woman. How could a woman like Qiao Xi, who relied on men to survive, compare to her?","“Xi Xi has also registered, so... she has works to display?”","A sinister look appeared in Yao Mengqing’s eyes, then she smiled bitterly. “Xi Xi... Why is she doing this to me? Why must she interfere in what I want to do?","“I’ve been involved in design since I was young. This isn’t something that can be learned in a day or two. It also requires talent. It’s not a simple industry.","“Xi Xi doesn’t know anything about design at all. She still wants to participate in this competition? She probably knows that I signed up, so... Why don’t I forfeit, then? I don’t want others to say anything else.”","Lin Jie’s heart ached. Mengqing was really kind. Qiao Xi treated her like this, but she was still thinking about Qiao Xi.","“What Qiao Xi wants to do has nothing to do with you. You’ve already tolerated her enough. If she steels herself to participate in the design competition, she’ll only be mocked.”","Lin Jie sneered. “Mengqing, you can’t let her win anymore. She’s participating this time, and the competition will be broadcasted live. At that time, everyone will know that Qiao Xi is useless. You’re the most outstanding woman!”","Yao Mengqing lowered her eyes and smiled sinisterly.","...","In the Li family’s banquet hall.","When the birthday banquet was about to end, Old Master Li stood up. “Everyone, please wait a moment.”","Everyone stopped in their tracks.","Old Master Li said, “Everyone would have heard that ten years ago, Xing’er pushed Mrs. Gu on her birthday. Now, Xing’er already knows that she misunderstood Mrs. Gu back then, so she wants to clarify this matter in public.”","When everyone heard that the eldest daughter of the Li family wanted to apologize to Mrs. Gu, they were instantly dumbfounded.","Back then, Xu Mei chased Qiao Xi to the countryside because she thought that Qiao Xi had offended Li Xing’er and stole her things.","However, no one knew that the person who offended Li Xing’er was Qiao Rou, and it was Qiao Xi who took the blame.","Now that the truth was out, everyone had no choice but to think that it was Xu Mei who schemed and framed Qiao Xi back then. She found an excuse to chase Qiao Xi to the countryside and used that opportunity to seize the assets left behind by the first wife.","After the banquet ended, the guests left one after another.","Qiao Xi and Gu Zheng were in no rush to leave. They sat in their seats and chatted. When they turned around, they saw Li Xing’er walking over.","She was slightly nervous and uneasy. “Qiao Xi, I...”"]},{"number":370,"title":"Chapter 370 - The Young Lady Apologizes","paragraphs":["Qiao Xi raised her eyes. “Hello.”","Li Xing’er’s face was full of shame, and her ears were red. She moved closer and said helplessly, “I-I have something to tell you.”","The few women who came with Li Xing’er gently pushed her and whispered something in her ear. Qiao Xi understood their purpose for coming.","Gu Zheng understood and stood up to go to the other side.","Seeing that there were only the two of them left, Li Xing’er said shyly, “Qiao Xi, I’m sorry.”","Qiao Xi thought that the young lady in front of her was quite cute, so she smiled. “There’s nothing to be sorry about.”","Li Xing’er instantly became nervous. “I know it was my fault at that time. I caused you to be chased to the countryside. It’s okay if you’re unwilling to forgive me, but I still want to apologize to you.","“Even if you weren’t involved, Xu Mei would have found another excuse to chase me away. You can’t be blamed for this,” said Qiao Xi.","Li Xing’er said anxiously, “But if not for that incident, you wouldn’t have lost your reputation in public, and the Qiao family wouldn’t have...”","“Actually, I benefited from a disaster. If I had continued to stay in the Qiao family, I might not even be able to live till now. It’s because I left the Qiao family that I got a new life.”","Qiao Xi said indifferently, “I have my grandfather and a few brothers. I’m a hundred times happier than I was in the Qiao family. If I hadn’t left at that time, I might have missed this opportunity.","“Actually, I should be thanking you.”","Li Xing’er widened her eyes. “Really?”","If it were not for Li Xing’er calling her about the banquet, Qiao Xi would have forgotten about it. She only remembered that there was a young lady who got a diamond crown on her birthday. However, her senior also gave her a diamond crown after that. It was considered a happy ending.","Li Xing’er stared at Qiao Xi and noticed that there was no resentment on her face at all. Instead, she was full of smiles. She could not help but be surprised. “Qiao Xi, I pushed you down back then. I remember that your hand even bled. Have you really forgiven me? I thought you would at least want to push me down too?”","An indescribable feeling arose in Qiao Xi’s heart.","After leaving the Qiao family, she had always been doted on by her brothers and sisters. Everyone doted on her. No matter what she liked or wanted, they would try their best to satisfy her and would not quarrel with her.","This was the first time she had encountered a young lady like Li Xing’er. Qiao Xi found it very interesting that she was apologizing so much out of embarrassment.","Li Xing’er quickly said, “You can’t forgive me so easily!”","Qiao Xi was silent for a short while before she said casually, “Alright, then I’ll forgive you if you give me a gift.”","...","On the other side, Gu Zheng watched the two young ladies standing together and chatting.","After a while, Qiao Xi turned around and walked toward him.","“Are you done?”","“Yes.” Qiao Xi nodded.","Gu Zheng’s expression was calm as the corners of his lips curled up. “What gift do you want?”","Qiao Xi smiled lightly. “A diamond crown!”","Gu Zheng understood. “So she was the young lady you were envious of back then.”","Qiao Xi nodded, and the two of them got into the car. Song Shiyu was driving, but Qiao Xi suddenly felt her stomach hurt.","...","That night, the Li family called all the major jewelry companies and asked them to customize a diamond crown. It did not matter how much it cost. Most importantly, it had to be unique.","Li Xing’er said generously, “Don’t try to save any money! Other than diamonds, you have to embed some gems too. It has to look good. I’m giving it to someone!”","The designer nodded. The eldest daughter of the Li family was their God of Fortune. How could they dare to be negligent? They immediately chose suitable accessories and prepared to draw the design drafts overnight.","At this moment, the door to the reception room was pushed open.","“I’m sorry to disturb you so late at night. That wedding ring...”","When Li Xing’er heard this voice, she frowned and turned around. It was indeed that scheming b*tch.","Qiao Rou was extremely nervous. Her eyes were lowered as she leaned slightly against Gu Moling. She appeared extremely weak and delicate.","The designer also knew about the recent news in Li City. They knew that the couple consisted of a scumbag and a b*tch. However, the couple had already paid the bill. If they did not design the wedding ring on time, they would have to compensate for the breach of contract.","The designer could only suppress their disgust and smile. “Miss Qiao, this is your wedding ring..”"]},{"number":371,"title":"Chapter 371 - Encounter","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Qiao Rou smiled gently. “Moling, look. Do you think it looks good?”","Gu Moling’s expression was serious. His eyes were dark, and he looked tired.","He was uninterested and replied perfunctorily, “Yes.”","At this moment, Li Xing’er turned around and asked, “You’re getting married soon?”","They both looked up.","These few days, Qiao Rou had been in a very bad mood. When she heard someone interrupt them, she was instantly angry. However, when she saw Li Xing’er’s face, she suppressed the anger in her heart.","It was the eldest daughter of the Li family!","Didn’t this woman push Qiao Xi before? Back then, she had only broken a toy but it caused Li Xing’er to push Qiao Xi down in public. She should hate Qiao Xi very much!","Qiao Rou walked forward warmly. “Miss Li.”","Li Xing’er curled her lips. “Qiao Rou, what a coincidence!”","Qiao Rou said gently, “I didn’t expect to meet you here, Miss Li. It’s really my honor.”","Li Xing’er raised her eyebrows and said with a face full of mockery, “Since you’re getting married, send me an invitation too. I’ll go and support you.”","Before Qiao Rou could answer, Gu Moling became overjoyed. “It’s our honor.”","Although the Li family was not the richest family in high society, Old Master Li was a big shot in the business world decades ago. He could be said to be the mentor of many famous people and had connections all over Li City. Now that Moling Corporation was in a slump, if the Li family could help him...","From what Miss Li said, she was very close to Rou Rou?","Li Xing’er did not say much. She instructed the designer a few words and stood up to leave.","Watching her leave, Qiao Rou smiled proudly. “Brother Moling, although my sister is smarter than me and can help you manage the company, I’m not bad either. I can help you expand your network and help you when you’re in trouble...”","Gu Moling’s expression softened a little.","...","On the other side, Qiao Xi returned to Longwan Residential. The moment she returned, she took out the diamond crown and admired the dazzling lights.","Gu Zheng was sitting in the study reading documents. Just as he was about to flip the page, Qiao Xi rushed in with a face full of joy and almost tripped.","The man looked up. “Be careful.”","She ran excitedly to Gu Zheng and forgot about the strange feeling in her stomach. She kissed him on the cheek and smiled slyly.","Gu Zheng’s body stiffened.","Qiao Xi held the diamond crown in her hand. “Gu Zheng, thank you for the gift. I like it very much.”","Diamond crown? Hadn’t she already thanked him? Why was she still so excited?","However, how could Gu Zheng miss this opportunity? His voice was low and magnetic. “You’re thanking me just like this?”","Qiao Xi smiled shyly and swayed her body. She recalled that the two of them had not eaten dinner yet, so she stammered, “Why don’t I-I...”","Gu Zheng smiled.","He did not care that Qiao Xi treated kisses as an antidote, but he did not expect that every kiss from her would have a purpose. For the sake of various delicacies, she would just give him a simple kiss.","The man reached out and pulled her into his embrace, his thin lips landing on hers. Qiao Xi moaned, and all her words were drowned in this intense kiss.","Suddenly, Qiao Xi’s body froze as an intense pain came from her abdomen. Her eyes abruptly widened.","Before Gu Zheng could notice anything unusual, his scorching kiss landed on her lips. He gasped slightly and hugged her tightly with both hands. However, the next second, Qiao Xi abruptly pushed him away...","“Wait!”","Her face was pale as she abruptly stood up and rushed into the bathroom.","Gu Zheng looked at his empty embrace, then at the bathroom. He heard the door close, which was followed by her retching.","After a moment.","Gu Zheng frowned and walked toward the bathroom.","What was wrong with her? She was kissing him just now, so why was she suddenly nauseous? Had she caught a cold?","Gu Zheng was a little worried.","...","At this moment, in the bathroom, Qiao Xi was sitting on the toilet while panting.","No wonder...","Her stomach had been aching today. It turned out that she was on her period. It was just that she did not expect the pain to be so sudden and intense.. Logically speaking, there were still a few days left, so she did not pay much attention to it."]},{"number":372,"title":"Chapter 372 - Not That Aunt","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","It was just that the lychee ice wine at the banquet today was too delicious, so she drank a few more glasses of it. Unexpectedly, her stomach started aching and her entire body was trembling from the pain. Her stomach was also uncomfortable, and she vomited everything she had just eaten.","Most importantly, this was Gu Zheng’s study. Usually, only Gu Zheng went in and out of the bathroom here. There were no sanitary towels here at all!!!","Qiao Xi sat on the toilet bowl with a dispirited expression and thought about what to do.","Her period this time was very heavy. If she did not have a sanitary pad, she would not be able to walk out of this door. However, there were no sanitary pads here...","Qiao Xi gritted her teeth and called out tentatively, “Gu Zheng~”","“...” When Gu Zheng heard her voice, his heart skipped a beat. He could sense that Qiao Xi was slightly nervous and her voice was trembling a little, which made her sound slightly weak.","Qiao Xi cleared her throat and said gently, “Senior, can you do me a favor?”","The man was a little puzzled.","He was supposed to attend an important meeting today, but for the sake of attending the birthday banquet, he temporarily canceled it. However, he still had to do what he had to do. Hence, Gu Zheng had been working since he came back. He had just written down the last line when he heard Qiao Xi’s strange voice.","He thought about it for a few seconds, but the person in the bathroom could not wait anymore. A shy and trembling voice sounded.","“Gu Zheng~”","“...” The corners of the man’s mouth twitched slightly. “Mrs. Gu, you don’t have to be so... polite with me.”","Qiao Xi whimpered. “Ah Zheng, I’m your junior and also your wife. If I beg you for help, you won’t refuse, right?”","Gu Zheng was worried. What was wrong with her? Was she really sick? Or did she encounter some trouble in her job at the university?","Even if she encountered something, there was no need to say it through the bathroom door. As long as she said it, he could help her solve it.","He was just about to ask when he heard Qiao Xi say in a hesitant voice, “My... My relative is here.”","Gu Zheng asked in confusion, “Which relative?”","Qiao Xi said shyly, “Ah! It’s... Aunt Flo.”","Gu Zheng was puzzled. What was there to be embarrassed about when her aunt came?","That was not right! Where did she get an aunt? Her mother had already passed away many years ago, and she did not have any other siblings. Could it be that someone from Xue Liang’s family had come? It was possible for that person to be her aunt.","Gu Zheng said, “Alright, I understand.”","Qiao Xi instantly heaved a sigh of relief. Gu Zheng had indeed figured it out with just a few words. There was no need to say anything else, so she asked happily, “Gu Zheng, have you really agreed to help me? Do you know what to do?”","Gu Zheng smiled.","What kind of favor was this? There was no need to beg him for such a small matter considering they were husband and wife. As long as she said a word, he could go and pick up her aunt himself.","The man nodded. “No problem.”","Senior was really good!","Qiao Xi was extremely excited and said anxiously, “Then, go quickly!”","Gu Zheng asked casually, “Where is she?”","...","Qiao Xi instantly choked, and the smile on her face instantly vanished. Her doubts carried a trace of confusion as she asked in disbelief, “What are you talking about? Who are you referring to?”","Gu Zheng’s expression did not change as he replied indifferently, “Didn’t you say that your aunt is here? Where is she now? I’ll go get her.”","Qiao Xi: “...”","Damn! She had forgotten that Gu Zheng never came into contact with women. How could he know what Aunt Flo referred to?","Could it be that Gu Zheng did not understand her at all and thought that her aunt was here?","She just wanted a sanitary pad. Why was it so difficult?!","Gu Zheng put on his jacket swiftly. “You’re not feeling well, so just wait at home. Since she’s your aunt, it’ll be better if I pick her up myself. It won’t look good if the chauffeur goes. You—”","“Gu Zheng!” Qiao Xi hurriedly interrupted him as waves of helplessness arose in her heart. “My aunt isn’t here. Argh! You don’t understand what I mean.”","The man’s face was filled with confusion, then he heard Qiao Xi say shyly, “The aunt I’m talking about isn’t a real person... It’s the Aunt Flo that visits women once every month...”","Gu Zheng stood on the spot and was instantly petrified."]},{"number":373,"title":"Chapter 373 - How Many Girlfriends Do You Have?","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Before Gu Zheng could speak, Qiao Xi said with a trembling and shy voice, “Do you understand now? I’m asking you for a favor because I want to ask if you can help me get... sanitary pads?”","Gu Zheng: “...”","The corners of the man’s mouth twitched. “Where?”","Qiao Xi replied anxiously, “There’s a pink box under the cabinet in my room. Just take one.”","Gu Zheng did not hesitate at all and went to her room. A few minutes later, he returned to the study. “There’s none left.”","“Huh?” Qiao Xi was instantly stunned! It couldn’t be so coincidental, right?!","“Really? I usually put them in that box? Not a single one is left? Why are they all gone? What a coincidence, haha...”","She laughed dryly, looking very awkward. Gu Zheng also realized that things were troublesome now.","However, before he could speak, Qiao Xi begged. “Gu Zheng...”","The corners of the man’s mouth twitched slightly. He felt the veins on his forehead jump. He suddenly had a bad feeling.","Immediately after, Qiao Xi suddenly said in a flirtatious tone, “Dear Senior~ Cutie Ah Zheng, can you help me buy some? There’s a supermarket nearby. You can drive there and come back. It’ll be quick!”","Gu Zheng thought for a moment. “Why don’t we get Song—”","“No! We can’t get Song Shiyu to go!” Qiao Xi interrupted in horror.","“It won’t be good for him to do this kind of thing! Besides, Song Shiyu is too talkative. If news of this gets out, I won’t be able to live in Longwan Residential anymore! I’ll be very embarrassed as Mrs. Gu!”","Qiao Xi retorted righteously, “If you get Song Shiyu to buy it, I’ll ignore you! I want you to buy it! Are you going or not?!”","Gu Zheng was stunned for a few seconds before sighing helplessly. “...”","He knocked on the bathroom door, then pushed the door open a crack. He closed his eyes and walked in, then placed a box on the sink beside him.","The man turned his face away to hide his red cheeks. His voice was hoarse. “Wait, I’ll be back soon.”","Qiao Xi’s face was red as she hummed softly. After he left, Qiao Xi reached out to take the box. She opened it to see that it was her phone and some wet tissues.","He was probably afraid that she would be afraid alone. She would feel more at ease with her phone.","Qiao Xi was slightly touched.","...","Longwan Residential was surrounded by high-end supermarkets. They needed membership cards, and the prices were high, so there were not many customers.","After Gu Zheng entered, he walked straight to the sanitary pad section and encountered difficulties.","President Gu, who could guide the way in business wars, was now stumped by the issue of choosing sanitary napkins.","W-Which one should he buy?","At this moment, the shop assistant walked over. “Hello, Sir. May I help you? This is for night use and also for day use. What’s the length you’re looking for? If you’re not too sure, why don’t you buy one of all kinds? Using them up shouldn’t be a problem.”","Gu Zheng nodded and looked at the shelves in front of him. He then said a shocking statement, “Then get them all for me.”","The shop assistant was stunned for a few seconds before her eyes widened. Buy them all?","She looked terrified and asked in confusion, “How many girlfriends do you have?”","He was living in Longwan Residential and was so handsome. He was really a domineering president in real life. He must have many women by his side!","...","Ten minutes later, Qiao Xi tidied herself up and walked out of the bathroom.","Gu Zheng had already instructed the butler to boil chicken soup and prepare red date ginger water. She felt warm after drinking a cup.","When Qiao Xi saw Gu Zheng, her face instantly flushed red as she said with embarrassment, “Gu Zheng, when you went to buy that, no one laughed at you, right?”","Gu Zheng suddenly recalled the shop assistant’s words and was stunned for a few seconds. He replied indifferently, “No.”","Qiao Xi observed his expression and asked probingly, “You won’t be unhappy, right? I didn’t have a choice either! I can’t let others buy it for me!”","Actually, she was a little pleased when she ordered Gu Zheng to buy sanitary pads. She had always thought that it was very amusing to have a guy do that, but after thinking about it, this matter might be unprecedented for Gu Zheng.. It was more troublesome than any business war."]},{"number":374,"title":"Chapter 374 - Who Said That President Gu Doesnt Know How To Be Romantic?","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Qiao Xi smiled in embarrassment. She did not expect Gu Zheng to raise his eyes in confusion. “Why would I be unhappy?”","“I... I told you to buy that...”","“I was just doing you a small favor. What’s there to be unhappy about?” Gu Zheng said casually, “But there’s something I don’t understand.”","Qiao Xi raised her eyes. “Hmm?”","“You weren’t feeling well. You should have known that your period had arrived when you were going to the bathroom. Why didn’t you tell me immediately?” Gu Zheng asked.","Qiao Xi’s face flushed red as she stammered, “I-I was thinking of another way to deal with it. I didn’t want to trouble you.”","The man turned his face away. “Let me know if something like this happens again in the future.”","His expression was unnatural, and his ears turned red. “We’re husband and wife. You don’t have to be shy. I’ll help you. I won’t be unhappy.”","Qiao Xi muttered to herself, “But I asked you to buy that, and you...”","“We’re both adults. We’re husband and wife. There’s nothing to hide. Besides, menstruation is a normal physiological phenomenon in a woman’s body. I don’t think it’s embarrassing to buy sanitary pads for you. As long as you need something, I’ll get it for you.”","Gu Zheng looked at his watch and said indifferently, “It’s getting late. You should rest early.”","Qiao Xi’s lips trembled slightly, and her heart was moved.","Who said that President Gu did not know how to be romantic? Just a few words were enough to make a woman fall for him1 Moreover, he had a handsome face and was so passionate. Which woman could take it?!","Many chauvinistic men hated buying sanitary pads for women. They even thought that women on their period were dirty, but Gu Zheng was different. He thought that everything was normal and even very considerately prepared red date water for her. He gently told her to rest as well.","Qiao Xi returned to her senses from being touched and was about to return to her room when she saw the empty room beside her filled with a few large boxes.","She looked at the words on the boxes and was silent for a moment. Her eyes widened.","“...” Damn! Could it be that Gu Zheng bought all the sanitary napkins from the supermarket?","...","The next day.","Gu Zheng was sitting on the sofa and reading some documents. It was about the bid.","Everyone in Li City knew that this plot of land would belong to either Gu Zheng or Lu Yan in the end. According to the estimates of the professionals, the development of this plot of land would bring about huge benefits, so the starting price was as high as two billion.","Song Shiyu handed the documents he had prepared to Gu Zheng and asked curiously, “President, when I came out of Longwan Residential this morning, I saw several boxes in a room. What’s in them?”","Without thinking, Gu Zheng blurted out, “Sanitary pads.”","Song Shiyu: “?”","He asked in horror, “What? The boxes are filled with sanitary pads? President, when did our company start such a business? Are you selling sanitary pads?”","Gu Zheng frowned and said impatiently, “I went to the supermarket to buy them.”","Song Shiyu was dumbfounded.","Did he hear wrongly? Why did the president buy so many sanitary pads?","Since his salary had already been deducted multiple times, Song Shiyu had nothing to worry about. He immediately asked slyly, “President, are you... crazy?”","Actually, the manager of the finance department knew very well that although the president said he would deduct Assistant Song’s salary, he would never really do so. That was why Assistant Song was so arrogant.","Gu Zheng paused for a moment, and a smile appeared in his eyes.","Song Shiyu’s heart skipped a beat, and he could not help but take a step back. “President, that’s not what I mean. I just want to ask why you bought so many sanitary pads. Are they all for Young Madam?”","Gu Zheng took a deep breath and felt annoyed. He suddenly regretted making Song Shiyu his assistant.","He snorted. “You can use them!”","Song Shiyu’s mouth fell open. “...”","“President... let me off this once. I don’t need... sanitary pads!”","After a while, Song Shijing walked in.. Seeing Song Shiyu who was on the verge of tears, he ignored him and reported respectfully, “President, Lu Yan has raised the price to three billion.”"]},{"number":375,"title":"Chapter 375 - The Winner Is Still Unknown","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Gu Zheng smiled indifferently. “Release the news and let them know that I’m also bidding for this plot of land.”","Song Shijing nodded. “The news has spread, so the Lu family is the only one competing with you now.”","Gu Zheng had a good reputation in Li City. Gu Zheng had his own principles when it came to doing things. He never violated other people’s interests. When everyone heard that President Gu liked this plot of land, they initially wanted to bid for it to give to him.","However, now that Lu Yan was also competing for this plot of land, everyone naturally did not dare to participate in the competition between these two big shots.","Gu Zheng said casually, “Add another billion.”","Song Shijing was shocked. “Four billion? If Lu Yan gives up, then we...”","“He won’t.”","Gu Zheng was certain. “Hasn’t he always liked to snatch things from me? He won’t give up this time and continue bidding.”","“Yes!” Song Shijing nodded.","...","Two days later.","Qiao Xi did not leave the house and had also heard about Gu Zheng and Lu Yan bidding for a plot of land. In just a few days, it went from two billion to six billion.","The entire Li City was talking about this. Everyone was very curious about who this plot of land would eventually belong to.","The Lu family knew very well that the location and environment of this plot of land were very good. Even though the price had already increased to six billion, it was still a guaranteed win. That was why they insisted on fighting for it.","More importantly, if Lu Yan could take over this plot of land and build a tourist resort, Lu Yan would completely stabilize his position in Li City. His status would definitely not be lower than Gu Zheng’s. He could also return to the Gu family in a justifiable manner and become the head of the Gu family.","Now, all the wealthy families in Li City knew about the relationship between Lu Yan and the Gu family, but no one had confirmed it. Everything was just a guess.","Unexpectedly, the price soared to eight billion—","“Young Madam.” The butler walked over. “The chairman called to invite you and the president back.”","Qiao Xi chuckled. The Gu family finally could not sit still anymore.","When she arrived at the Gu family’s old residence, Qiao Xi had just entered when she bumped into someone she did not want to see.","Lu Yan was gentle like jade. “Miss Qiao.”","Qiao Xi’s expression was distant. “Mr. Lu, aren’t you going to work? Why are you always guarding the Gu family’s old residence? Could it be that you think you can get that plot of land just by asking the Gu family to step forward?”","Before Lu Yan could say anything, the Lu family said arrogantly, “No matter what, that plot of land belongs to our Lu family! Tell Gu Zheng to stop embarrassing himself!”","Qiao Xi glanced coldly at them and replied with disdain, “Heh! We’ll see about that!”","Lu Yan’s face was still gentle. He smiled and did not say anything.","Qiao Xi said slowly, “There’s nothing Ah Zheng can’t get. Previously, when Mr. Lu and Gu Zheng were bidding for that island, you also lost to him. This time, it won’t be an exception.”","At the mention of that island, Lu Yan’s smiling face instantly cracked.","At first, the Lu family wanted to use that opportunity to attack Gu Zheng, but they did not expect Gu Zheng to be too powerful. They were not his match.","Lu Yan calmed down and said indifferently, “Miss Qiao, it’s still unknown who’ll win. Don’t jump to conclusions.”","Qiao Xi raised her eyes proudly. “It’s already eight billion now. If the Lu family has the ability, then continue to raise the price. In short, Ah Zheng has a lot of money. He has enough to play with you for a few days.”","Lu Yan narrowed his eyes.","Qiao Xi walked past the crowd and directly entered the door. The butler at the side lowered his voice and said, “Young Madam, the chairman seems to have invited you over regarding that plot of land.”","Qiao Xi’s voice was indifferent. “I know.”","The butler was furious. “It’s really unfair. Since it’s a bid, they should just rely on their own ability. He’s inviting the president back just to force him to give up on the plot of land!”","Qiao Xi asked, “In that case, Chairman Gu has already sent someone to tell Gu Zheng to give up on bidding for it?”","“Yes! Actually, the Gu family had already called to warn the president not to compete anymore, but the president never agreed. I didn’t expect that even you, Young Madam, had to come. The chairman must be using his identity as the president’s father to stop the president from bidding in front of the elders of the Gu family!”","Qiao Xi sneered. “No wonder Lu Yan is so confident!”"]},{"number":376,"title":"Chapter 376 - A Child Learns From His Father","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Although Qiao Xi already knew Gu Zheng’s plan, her heart still ached when she saw how determined Gu Weiming was about forcing Gu Zheng.","Gu Zheng was clearly Lu Qingyun’s biological son, but he was abandoned by everyone. In order to pave the way for Lu Yan, they completely ignored Gu Zheng’s feelings.","No matter what, Gu Zheng was Gu Weiming’s biological son. He was his first son, but in order to give Huang Lilan a formal status, he made the Gu family’s legitimate child become an illegitimate child. Gu Zheng had been cursed his entire life.","Now, he was still unwilling to let Gu Zheng off and wanted to use him to the extreme.","Qiao Xi’s expression was icy-cold, and her eyes were filled with rage.","Just then, her phone rang. Song Shijing said anxiously, “Young Madam, come over at once!”","...","20 minutes ago.","In the study of the Gu family’s old residence.","Gu Zheng sat lazily on the sofa. The butler reminded him while trembling, “President Gu, the chairman will be here soon. Y-You...”","‘You’re a junior, after all. You can’t just sit on the sofa leisurely when your father is here, right?’","“Huh?” Gu Zheng raised an eyebrow, his face calm.","The butler’s hair stood on end as he said carefully, “Please get up and welcome him.”","Gu Zheng looked indifferent. “Why should I welcome him? Doesn’t he know the way?”","The butler broke out in a cold sweat and stammered, “The chairman... This...”","“If I don’t pick him up, can’t he come over?”","As soon as he finished speaking, there was a rush of footsteps from outside. Gu Weiming roared and casually raised the vase beside him to smash it at Gu Zheng.","“Bastard!”","Gu Zheng turned around nimbly and the vase fell to the floor, shattering into countless pieces.","Gu Weiming roared, “Traitor!”","Gu Zheng sneered. “Father, you still like smashing things so much. Why don’t I send a few more vases over so that you can smash everything?”","The butler lowered his head in fear.","Gu Weiming clutched his chest and roared, “I’m your father! Are you really talking to me like this? As my son, it’s fine if you don’t welcome me. But I’ve already entered the house and you’re still sitting there. You have no manners at all!”","Gu Zheng leaned lazily against the sofa and did not even look at him. “Everyone says that a child learns from his father. If my father says that I have no upbringing, shouldn’t he reflect on himself?”","Gu Weiming choked: “...”","He was so angry that his entire body was trembling. He did not know when this son of his had completely escaped his control.","He had originally planned to give Gu Zheng a small slice of the pie. The assets of the family had nothing to do with him at all, but Gu Zheng had taken away the power of the Gu family. He even became a famous business magnate in Li City.","Although the Gu family was deeply rooted in Li City, they would definitely have to pay a painful price if they became enemies with Gu Zheng.","No matter what, the Gu family belonged to Lu Yan!","Gu Zheng had occupied his time here long enough. It was time to return it to Lu Yan!","Gu Weiming sat opposite Gu Zheng and said in a commanding tone, “I called you over because I have something serious to tell you. Quickly give up the bid and give that plot of land to Lu Yan!”","The air instantly fell silent.","Gu Zheng’s slender fingers tapped on the table. His expression was calm, and his eyes were slightly gloomy. It was impossible to tell if he was happy or angry. Then, his thin lips parted slightly. “Why should I?”","Gu Weiming frowned. “You’re unwilling?”","Gu Zheng sneered. “Heh, the son you like is really as useless as you.”","“Gu Zheng! Are you crazy? How dare you talk to me like this?” Gu Weiming slammed the table and roared crazily.","“I don’t care how all-powerful you are outside! I’m your father! Everything you have now belongs to the Gu family! You have to do whatever I ask you to do! You have no right to refuse! Even if you have any dissatisfaction, you have to bear with it!”","“Heh.”","Gu Zheng looked up with eyes filled with ridicule. “Father? Are you worthy?”","“You...”","“Do you want to tell me that because I’m an illegitimate child, I have to give everything to Lu Yan?” Gu Zheng took a sip of tea, his eyes calm.","“Chairman Gu, do you think I don’t know the truth? I just want to see what the Gu and Lu families are up to. Do you think I’m easy to bully?”"]},{"number":377,"title":"Chapter 377 - Gu Zheng Was Beaten Up?","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Looking at Gu Zheng’s gaze, Gu Weiming’s back broke out in a cold sweat. He was actually afraid!","Impossible!","How could Gu Zheng know about this?","However, it did not matter. Even if he knew, there was no evidence to prove his identity. He could only watch helplessly as Lu Yan became the head of the Gu family.","Now that the entire Li City knew that he was the illegitimate child, as long as the Gu family and the Lu family were on the same page, they would naturally be able to keep it a secret.","The Lu family did not care about Lu Qingyun’s life or death, nor did they care who Lu Qingyun’s child was. No one would believe what Gu Zheng said.","Gu Weiming cleared his throat and calmed down. “Listen to me! You have to give that plot of land to Lu Yan!”","Gu Zheng’s face was filled with mockery as he slowly curled his lips. “Father, have you forgotten that I’m the head of the Gu family? If I give up the bid, the entire Gu family’s reputation will fall. Do you think it’s appropriate?”","“You can’t represent the Gu family, so why would you implicate the Gu family?”","Gu Weiming pretended to be dignified. “Moreover, you’re already the head of the Gu family. You don’t lack money, so it doesn’t matter if you give some to Lu Yan.”","Gu Zheng raised an eyebrow. “What if I’m unwilling?”","“Bastard!” Gu Weiming was burning with anger. He raised the walking cane beside him and hit Gu Zheng hard.","“Do you dare to not agree? Gu Zheng, don’t think that I can’t do anything to you just because you’re the person in charge! You’re just an illegitimate child. In terms of status, you’re not worthy to be the head of the family!”","Gu Zheng’s expression was calm as he gritted his teeth. “I’m afraid I can’t let you have your wish.”","Gu Weiming was instantly infuriated when he heard that. Even though the Lu family was here, Gu Zheng was still so stubborn. He was so angry that he threw his walking cane on the floor and left in anger.","After Gu Weiming left, an elder of the Gu family, Jiang Feng, came forward and sighed helplessly. “President Gu, you know that the chairman has a bad temper, but you still insist on going against him. Why are you doing this for a plot of land?”","Gu Zheng lowered his eyes.","Seeing that he was silent, Jiang Feng could only turn around and leave.","After he left, Gu Zheng slowly looked up. “Song Shijing.”","Looking at the wound on Gu Zheng’s back, Song Shijing’s heart ached. He knew that the president did it on purpose, but he did not expect the president to be so hard on himself.","Gu Zheng was calm. This pain was nothing to him. He had already experienced it when he was young.","He curled his lips. “It’s just eight billion, and it seems Lu Yan won’t be able to endure it anymore. In that case, let’s continue bidding. I really want to see him go crazy.”","Song Shijing nodded. He was about to leave when Gu Zheng called out to him.","“Come here, help me up.”","Song Shijing looked at the man in front of him in confusion. He was tall and upright. If he had not heard how badly the president was scolded just now, he would have suspected that the president was not beaten up at all.","Gu Zheng gritted his teeth and said, “This old fellow is quite vicious!”","...","At this moment, Qiao Xi received a call from Song Shijing. “Madam, come over quickly! President was beaten up by the chairman. His old injuries are acting up again, and his back is bleeding!”","When Qiao Xi picked up the call, she casually pressed the speaker button. Immediately after, Song Shijing’s words echoed in the entire Gu family’s living room. Hence, everyone in the Gu family knew that Gu Zheng had been beaten up.","Qiao Xi was anxious. “How’s Ah Zheng? I’ll go over right now!”","Song Shijing said in a sad tone, “His back is bleeding. The president is very sad. The chairman is his father, after all. However, the chairman is forcing him to give up that plot of land for someone else. I really don’t understand what kind of spell the young master of the Lu family has cast on the chairman.”","Qiao Xi was also very cooperative. She hugged her phone and cried. “My husband! You’re so pitiful! Even your biological father doesn’t care about you! Everyone knows that Gu Corporation can venture into tourism and expand their territory if they get that land, but Chairman Gu insists on letting Lu Yan have it. If Gu Zheng really gives it to Lu Yan, how will he answer to the company?!”","Song Shijing: “...”","He admitted that he could not compare to Young Madam in terms of acting.. He almost believed her words."]},{"number":378,"title":"Chapter 378 - Mrs. Gu, You Dont Have To Work So Hard In The Future","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Hence, the two of them started a scene while over the phone. “Young Madam! The president is already injured. Now that he was beaten up by the chairman, his injuries are even more serious. Moreover, the chairman won’t let the president off. Quickly come and see him!”","Immediately after, everyone saw Qiao Xi’s body go weak. She almost fell to the ground, and surging tears flowed from her eyes.","She shed tears aggrievedly and rushed over as if she was going to die. It was as if she was going to see her husband for the last time.","At this moment, a group of businessmen was gathered in the living room to discuss business with the Gu family. When they heard Qiao Xi’s cries, they could not help but be surprised. “Did I hear wrongly? Chairman Gu asked President Gu to give that plot of land to Lu Yan?”","“Everyone knows that if we give up this plot of land, all of Gu Corporation’s previous investments will be in vain. As the president of Gu Corporation, of course, President Gu wouldn’t do anything to harm the company’s interests1”","“President Gu is unwilling to yield, so Chairman Gu hit him? This... Isn’t this too much?! President Gu IS the one who built the Gu family’s glory today. Apart from this old residence, everything in the Gu family belongs to President Gu!”","Everyone lowered their eyes and remained silent, their hearts stirring.","...","Qiao Xi rushed into the courtyard and went straight to Gu Zheng’s room. She pushed the door open and cried.","“Hubby! How are you feeling? It’s all my fault! I should have been by your side. How could I let you suffer such a vicious beating alone? Does it hurt? Boo-hoo...”","Gu Zheng had just laid down when Qiao Xi pushed the door open and rushed in, causing him to cough a few times.","Although Qiao Xi was pretending, she was still sad to see Gu Zheng hurt. “You’re bleeding. It must be very painful! Song Shijing, quickly apply medicine to Ah Zheng’s wound! Boo-hoo...”","Song Shijing: “...”","The corners of Gu Zheng’s mouth twitched. “Stop crying.”","Liang Pingchuan was right. Little Six was a natural-born actress. She could not control her desire to perform when she had the chance. He had only suffered a small injury. Why did Qiao Xi’s tears make him seem like he was about to die?","Qiao Xi looked up with tears in her eyes. “Hubby, my heart aches for you~”","Gu Zheng closed his eyes and took a deep breath. “Mrs. Gu, if I were really seriously injured, I might’ve vomited blood from your collision just now!”","Qiao Xi was silent for a moment, then suddenly nodded. “You’re right! Vomiting blood would have a better impact!”","Gu Zheng: “...” Sigh! Mrs. Gu had gone mad.","After crying, Qiao Xi said aggrievedly, “Ah Zheng, I heard that you were injured, so I immediately rushed over. Look at how much I care about you!”","Gu Zheng replied casually, “Yes.”","“I was crying while running just now and almost fell. I’m so tired!”","Gu Zheng said coldly, “It’s only about ten minutes from the Gu family’s living room to this room. Could it be that you’ve been crying the entire time?”","Qiao Xi instantly choked as her face turned red. “I was just worried about you! I cried while running and ended up getting lost, so I was delayed on the way here. I was so tired that I couldn’t breathe!”","Gu Zheng lay on the bed and said casually, “If you had come a little later, my wound would’ve already healed. Mrs. Gu, you don’t have to work so hard and put on performances like this in the future.”","Qiao Xi pouted and quickly changed the topic. “Ah Zheng, are you still in pain?”","Gu Zheng glanced at her indifferently. “What do you think, Mrs. Gu? Let me remind you that my chest and back are injured. If you don’t want to expose me, please get up from my body, okay?”","Qiao Xi smiled in embarrassment. She almost forgot that Gu Zheng was pretending to be injured, so she quickly got up from his body and touched his strong chest.","Gu Zheng took a deep breath and closed his eyes, ignoring her.","After a while, footsteps came from outside.","Qiao Xi’s eyes darkened. The only people who would come to Gu Zheng’s room were probably people from the Gu family or the Gu family’s distinguished guests.","Earlier, when she was in the hall, she did not see Madam Gu or the Lu family. Hence, Qiao Xi guessed that Huang Lilan was with the Lu family. The footsteps outside probably belonged to them.","At this moment, the door was pushed open.. Lu Yan and Shen Ying were behind Madam Gu."]},{"number":379,"title":"Chapter 379 - Among These People, Shes The Most Shameless!","paragraphs":["Madam Gu was very enthusiastic. “Ah Zheng, I heard that you angered your father the moment you came back. Your father is old and can’t handle provocation. Don’t always go against him. As a son, you should listen to your father.”","When Qiao Xi heard Madam Gu’s words, she was instantly infuriated. She only felt a storm surge in her heart, and her eyes burned with anger.","Madam Gu was really a smiling tiger! Among these people, she was the most shameless one!","Qiao Xi snorted coldly, then squeezed out a few drops of tears as she said sorrowfully, “Ah Zheng, I advised you not to go back to the old residence. Look! When you came back, your father beat you up and your mother started criticizing you as soon as she entered.","“Most people know that Madam Gu is your mother, but those who don’t might even think that Lu Yan is Madam Gu’s biological son. Why is she siding with outsiders?!”","Huang Lilan gasped. “Qiao Xi, I’m talking to Ah Zheng. What does it have to do with you?”","Qiao Xi took a few steps back in horror and said aggrievedly, “I’m sorry, Madam Gu. I just feel sorry for Ah Zheng. Logically speaking, as Ah Zheng’s mother, you should first express concern over his injuries after knowing that he was beaten by the chairman. How could you bear to blame him?”","Huang Lilan was instantly furious. “This is the Gu family’s matter. What does it have to do with you?! Didn’t Weiming already make himself clear? As long as Ah Zheng gives that plot of land to Lu Yan, everyone will get a happy ending. Why is he still unwilling, then? He deserves to be beaten up!”","Qiao Xi was angered to the point of laughing.","She glanced indifferently at Lu Yan and asked in disbelief, “He deserves it?”","“So, it’s because of that plot of land that the chairman hit Ah Zheng?” Qiao Xi cried. “Madam Gu, you’re actually forcing your biological son for an outsider?”","Huang Lilan was extremely angry and said without thinking, “So what? Qiao Xi, you should persuade Ah Zheng as well. Weiming and I are doing this for his own good. Gu Corporation has already reached its peak and there’s no more room for development. Why don’t we give a portion of the resources to Lu Yan? It’ll also be good for the Gu family’s reputation.","“Moreover, our Gu family has always owed the Lu family. This is a good opportunity to make it up to Lu Yan. When that time comes, everyone in Li City will say that Ah Zheng is kind and benevolent. How good would that be?!”","Qiao Xi glanced at Gu Zheng who was lying on the bed. His expression was calm, and his eyes were deep as if he hadn’t heard Huang Lilan’s words.","However, Qiao Xi’s heart was still bitter. Why did Gu Zheng have to give in to Lu Yan? It was clearly Lu Yan who snatched away the identity that originally belonged to Gu Zheng. Now, he even wanted to snatch away the Gu Corporation that was founded by Gu Zheng.","Qiao Xi was silent for a moment before raising her eyes to sweep everyone with her cold gaze. She said in a meaningful tone, “Everyone in Li City knows how important that plot of land in the northern suburbs is to Gu Corporation. For the sake of this plot of land, Gu Corporation even made detailed plans and investments. If the Lu family has also made so many preparations, then let’s compete fairly!","“Gu Zheng and Lu Yan are not related, so why should he give up such an important plot of land to Lu Yan? Could it be that Young Master Lu doesn’t have any money anymore? If you don’t have the ability, don’t attempt to take on the challenge. You should just take the initiative to give up. Why are you forcing Gu Zheng to give up? Is there something wrong with you?!”","Lu Yan’s expression was calm, but Huang Lilan roared, “Qiao Xi! Shut up!”","“What’s wrong? Am I wrong? If I remember correctly, Young Master Lu and Gu Zheng are both about the same age. How can Gu Zheng have such wealth and why doesn’t Young Master Lu have any?","“Madam Gu and Chairman Gu are willing to beat and scold their biological son in order to help Young Master Lu bid for that plot of land. What kind of spell did Young Master Lu cast on the two elders? Why did they start scheming when they realized they can’t win?”","...","Song Shijing gasped. Young Madam was really awesome!","Huang Lilan had been Madam Gu for so many years, and no one in the entire Gu family dared to provoke her. Now that she was ridiculed by Qiao Xi, her breathing instantly quickened as she held back her anger. “Y-You! This has nothing to do with you!”","“I’m Gu Zheng’s wife. How does this have nothing to do with me? I just want to remind you that Gu Zheng is your biological son.. What’s Young Master Lu’s relationship with you?”"]},{"number":380,"title":"Chapter 380 - Bid 15 billion","paragraphs":["Qiao Xi looked at Lu Yan and raised her eyebrows, her face filled with ridicule. “I have to say that Young Master Lu is indeed capable. Even though you’re not capable of much, Chairman Gu dotes on you as if you’re his biological son. With just a word, you can get anything you want.","“It’s just that I pity my husband. Although he’s the eldest son of the Gu family, he had to start from scratch. He’s been in the business world for so many years.”","“You, you...” Huang Lilan was so angry that the corners of her mouth twitched.","Anger had muddled her mind. She suddenly rushed over and raised her hand to slap Gu Zheng.","Qiao Xi stood in front of Gu Zheng and held her wrist tightly. She said in a cold voice, “Madam Gu, your son, Gu Zheng, is already injured. Are you still going to beat Gu Zheng up for Lu Yan?”","Qiao Xi’s gaze was gloomy and cold, causing Huang Lilan’s entire body to tremble. She was strong and calm. Meanwhile, Huang Lilan shouted, “Qiao Xi! Let go of me! Who do you think you are? Do you dare speak to me like this?! Guards!”","With Huang Lilan’s order, the bodyguards rushed in. She pointed at Qiao Xi angrily. “Chase this b*tch out! Ah Zheng! Don’t blame me for not showing you any respect! Your wife is really too arrogant!”","Everyone lowered their heads. No one dared to go forward to persuade her.","Qiao Xi’s expression was indifferent, and she was not afraid in the slightest. She said casually, “Madam Gu, I was wrong. I shouldn’t have said that about you. You must have your own reasons for forcing your biological son for an outsider.”","Huang Lilan instantly choked and was about to retort when she saw Qiao Xi’s eyes turn red. She revealed a sad expression and cried, “Madam Gu, you’re Gu Zheng’s mother. Everything you’re doing is for the sake of the overall situation. I know all of this. I’ll persuade Gu Zheng to give up this plot of land.”","Huang Lilan immediately swallowed the words that were about to come out of her mouth. Why did Qiao Xi suddenly change?","Before she could figure it out, she heard Qiao Xi say—","“Ah Zheng has earned so much money. He doesn’t need that plot of land in the northern suburbs. Li City is so big. Even without this plot of land, there are other places. There’s no need for him to compete for a plot of land that others will target.","“However, it’s different for Young Master Lu. If Ah Zheng doesn’t give it to him this time, he might not be able to recover from this setback and might even completely lose his confidence!","“I’ll persuade Ah Zheng to give this plot of land to Young Master Lu. Otherwise, Young Master Lu’s only chance of success will be gone. That’ll be too tragic.”","Huang Lilan’s pupils suddenly constricted.","Qiao Xi sighed. “Ah Zheng, actually, Young Master Lu is quite pitiful. He isn’t capable, and he doesn’t have anyone to rely on. Why don’t we just let him have it? What do you think?”","Huang Lilan burned with rage, and she was angered to the point that her entire body trembled. “Qiao Xi! Qiao Xi...”","Qiao Xi watched as Huang Lilan’s face alternated between red and white. She felt delighted.","At this moment, Lu Yan suddenly smiled. “Madam Gu, don’t be so angry. Miss Qiao is President Gu’s wife, so it’s normal for her to speak up for him.”","He looked at Qiao Xi with eyes that were filled with gentleness. “Since it’s like that, then I’ll have to thank you first, Miss Qiao.”","Qiao Xi was speechless. Lu Yan was really shameless. It turned out that he did not say anything earlier because he wanted Madam Gu to stand up for him while he stayed out of it.","Now, he was smiling even more proudly as if he was sure that the land was his.","How shameless!","When Huang Lilan heard Lu Yan’s voice, her expression softened. She glanced at Qiao Xi with disdain and put on the attitude of an elder. “Ah Zheng, I’m doing this for your own good. This plot of land is useless to Gu Corporation. Why don’t you give it to Lu Yan?”","Then, her voice turned cold. “I don’t care if you’re willing or not, but you have to give up that plot of land! Your father is so angry that he’s sick. You’re unfilial!”","With that, she snorted. “Ah Yan, Ying Ying, let’s go!”","Lu Yan walked to Qiao Xi’s side and smiled. “Miss Qiao, we’ll meet again if we’re fated.”","After everyone left, Song Shijing went up to him and asked, “President, the Lu family is offering 10 billion now. Do you want to raise the price?”","Qiao Xi also looked at Gu Zheng. This plot of land would be Lu Yan’s in the end, but whether or not they raised the price depended on Gu Zheng.","Gu Zheng was calm as he said casually, “Increase the price. I’ll pay 15 billion..”"]},{"number":381,"title":"Chapter 381 - The Lu Familys Tea Party","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Even Song Shijing, who had been through a lot, could not help but be shocked. “But...”","Gu Zheng tapped his finger on the page of the document and said meaningfully, “The game I’ve set is about to end. This is probably the last bid.”","...","At the Gu family’s old residence.","Old Master Lu and Gu Weiming were drinking tea together while Lu Xiang was sitting at the side.","Old Master Lu’s expression darkened. “I heard that Gu Zheng raised the price to 15 billion today? If Lu Yan wants to get it...”","Bang!","Gu Weiming slammed the teacup down and roared, “I told him to give up a long time ago! How dare he disobey me?”","Lu Xiang said weakly, “Brother-in-law, Ah Zheng is young and has a bad temper. You can’t always scold him. Try to persuade him. If Ah Yan wants to return to the Gu family rightfully, he has to take this plot of land. Can you bear to see your child wandering outside?”","Old Master Lu’s expression was gloomy. “Yes! Lu Yan is the child of the Gu family and also Qingyun’s son. It’s only right for him to inherit the Gu family’s assets. Gu Zheng is just an illegitimate child. What right does he have to occupy the position of the head of the Gu family? Now, he dares to fork out 15 billion to make things difficult for Lu Yan. What about in the future? If Lu Yan returns to the Gu family, will he still be able to live a good life?”","Everyone knew what was going on. Gu Weiming also pretended to be a gentleman. “I’ve let Qingyun down. Of course, the Gu family will be handed to Lu Yan to manage.”","Lu Xiang sighed. “However, the Lu family’s company isn’t doing well now. 15 billion is too much for us. I’m afraid this plot of land...”","Jiang Feng, who was standing at the side, lowered his eyes and remained silent.","If Lu Yan was really Miss Qingyun’s biological son, it meant Gu Weiming still had a conscience. It meant he still remembered his first wife who died young. However, all of them knew Lu Yan and Gu Zheng’s true identities.","It was just that it would be really hard for Gu Zheng to uncover this secret.","Besides, Gu Zheng had to give this plot of land to Lu Yan. No matter what, this plot of land would ultimately belong to Lu Yan!","Although he did not understand President Gu’s intention, since President Gu had already spoken, he had to follow the plan. Hence, Jiang Feng went forward and said, “Chairman, Mr. Lu, I have an idea.”","Gu Weiming had always trusted Jiang Feng. After all, he was a veteran of the company. Without hesitation, he said, “Tell me.”","Jiang Feng cleared his throat. “Before this, we’ve looked for professionals to evaluate that plot of land. The scenery is pleasant, and there’s also a natural hot spring. Even if we get it at 15 billion yuan, it’ll be a profitable deal. More importantly...","“Not long later, you’ll officially announce that Young Master Lu Yan is your biological son. You’ll let Young Master Lu return to the Gu family rightfully and inherit the Gu family. If the young master doesn’t have any results before that, it won’t be convincing.","“Now, the entire company is filled with Gu Zheng’s people. If Young Master Lu Yan doesn’t have any achievements, why would those people be willing to follow him? At that time, it might cause a commotion in the company.","“If Young Master Lu Yan can win this plot of land and let the Lu and Gu families develop it into a tourist resort, he’ll have the capital to compete when he returns to the Gu family.”","Gu Weiming nodded thoughtfully. “Jiang Feng is right. This plot of land won’t only be a huge benefit to Lu Yan but also a ticket for him to return to the Gu family. So, no matter how much money we spend, we have to take this plot of land! Lilan and I still have three billion yuan. After all, we’re Ah Yan’s... Anyway, we won’t let Ah Yan lose to Gu Zheng!”","Old Master Lu nodded in satisfaction. “Weiming, I’ve always thought highly of you all these years. It’s just that you were a little unwilling to marry Qingyun back then. I didn’t like that daughter either, but the matter has already passed. The most important thing now is to let Lu Yan return to the Gu family. As for Gu Zheng... he has nothing to do with our Lu family.”","Gu Weiming nodded. “Yes, Father-in-law.”","Old Master Lu had already made his stand clear. The Lu family did not admit that Gu Zheng was from the Lu family at all. Lu Qingyun’s biological son could only be Lu Yan. There would be no one else.","Gu Zheng would always be an illegitimate child!"]},{"number":382,"title":"Chapter 382 - Sister Qiaos Show Time!","paragraphs":["“Chairman! Chairman!” At this moment, someone rushed in.","“Something big has happened. There are a lot of... rumors online! They’re saying... They’re saying that you forced your biological son and even... beat up your own son for an outsider. They’re claiming you’ve seriously injured President Gu. They’re all saying... that you can’t differentiate between family and friends. They’re accusing you of helping outsiders.”","Gu Weiming slammed the table and stood up abruptly. “Nonsense! This bastard! It must be his doing! I’ll settle the score with him now!”","...","In the evening, Old Madam Gu woke up, and Qiao Xi went to visit her.","She had only been sitting for a while when her phone rang. Song Shijing said anxiously, “Young Madam! Come over at once! The chairman went to the president’s room angrily with a cane!”","Qiao Xi’s heart trembled, but her expression remained calm. She stood up and left the old madam’s residence. She walked around the living room and squeezed out a few tears before running over while crying.","Before she reached the door, she heard Chairman Gu’s angry roar.","“You were the one who spread those rumors, right? Look at how those people on the internet are scolding Lu Yan and me! You’ve really grown capable! You actually used such despicable methods!”","Gu Zheng’s expression was indifferent. “It wasn’t me.”","The rumors were spread by Song Shiyu and Song Shijing, not him.","Gu Weiming was so angry that his face turned red. He had even received a few calls just now. They were all from his company. They were calling to persuade him not to be so muddle-headed.","He could not lose the entire Gu family for a groundless son.","Ignoring whose son Lu Yan was, his ability was far inferior to President Gu’s. Why would he offend the Gu family’s God of Fortune, Gu Zheng, for Lu Yan?","There were also some people who directly threatened Gu Weiming. If the Gu family supported Lu Yan, they would cut off all contact with the Gu family from today onward. This was because the Gu family had their glory and wealth today all because of Gu Zheng.","Gu Weiming was infuriated. Nonsense, it was all nonsense!","Qiao Xi stood outside the door and gathered her emotions. When it was time for her to make an appearance, she must make the scene bigger. It would be best if the matter blew up even more.","There was a series of crashing sounds from inside. Then, Gu Weiming roared, “You jinx!”","Qiao Xi’s heart shook.","Back in the Qiao family, the Qiao family would also call her a jinx.","Gu Zheng was a jinx? How laughable. If it were not for Gu Zheng, would everyone in the Gu family be living so comfortably? Everything they ate and used was earned by Gu Zheng. Now, the chairman was actually calling Gu Zheng a jinx?","When Qiao Xi heard the sound of footsteps coming from afar, she took a deep breath and directly rushed in, letting out an urgent scream. “Ah! Chairman! No!”","This scream spread throughout the entire backyard, and everyone heard it clearly.","Qiao Xi directly rushed to Gu Zheng’s side and stopped the punishment that was about to land on him. “Chairman! Stop hitting him! Ah Zheng is still injured. If you’re really angry, hit me!”","Gu Weiming was shocked by Qiao Xi’s scream and was stunned for a few seconds. Then, Qiao Xi rushed to Gu Zheng’s side and held onto the cane tightly as she screamed.","“Chairman! You’ve already hit Ah Zheng today. His back is bleeding. If you hit him again, he’ll die! Boo-hoo... I know you don’t like Ah Zheng, but he’s your son and the head of the Gu family. If he really dies, what will the Gu family do?”","Gu Zheng cooperated. “Cough, cough...”","Qiao Xi pretended to be nervous. “Hubby! What’s wrong? Hang in there!”","“Chairman! I know you want Ah Zheng to give that plot of land to Lu Yan. We’ll give it to him, alright? Ah Zheng, quickly agree!”","Gu Zheng’s face turned pale.","Coincidentally, the Gu family was having a small banquet today. The guests were all partners of the Gu family. There were also some wealthy families and relatives of the Gu family present.","Jiang Feng had brought the guests into the inner courtyard and ‘coincidentally’ arrived at the backyard. He also happened to hear Qiao Xi’s words.","Although he had long heard that Lu Yan was a child of the Gu family, he did not expect Gu Weiming to beat Gu Zheng for Lu Yan.."]},{"number":383,"title":"Chapter 383 - Its A Pity Youre Not Joining The Film Industry","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Qiao Xi burst into tears. “Chairman, no matter what, Ah Zheng is your biological son. Are you going to beat your biological son to death for Lu Yan? Isn’t it just for a plot of land? We’ll just give it to him!”","Gu Zheng pursed his lips tightly and remained silent.","At this moment, Jiang Feng brought everyone to the inner courtyard. They all overheard Qiao Xi’s words.","Unexpectedly, Gu Weiming actually wanted to kill Gu Zheng for Lu Yan?","Qiao Xi cried loudly, “Chairman, I really don’t understand why you would be so vicious to your own son for Lu Yan! If you really kill Gu Zheng, you’ll definitely go to jail!”","Gu Weiming reacted and immediately roared, “You... Shut up!”","Qiao Xi cried without a care. “Ah Zheng, if you’re beaten to death, I’ll suffer the same fate with you!”","Everyone’s hearts trembled when they heard that. They muttered, “Chairman Gu has lost his mind from anger...”","“How exactly isn’t President Gu a part of the Gu family? What right does the Gu family have? Are they qualified to say that?”","“A father wants to kill his son for an outsider? I’ve never heard of such a thing!”","Gu Weiming did not notice the people outside. When he heard Qiao Xi’s cries, he spoke without thinking, “Gu Zheng is my son. Since I gave him life, I have the right to take it back!”","Qiao Xi cried sorrowfully. “Chairman! On the account that Ah Zheng has earned so much wealth for the Gu family, please let him off! I know that you don’t like him because he’s too capable. He’s even surpassed you and makes Lu Yan seem useless, but...","“But he’s your son, after all. If you want to kill him, why don’t you kill me first?! If it can appease your anger, I’m willing to endure all of this!”","The corners of Song Shijing’s mouth twitched. ‘Young Madam, it’s a pity that you’re not joining the film industry.’","However, Young Madam was right. Gu Weiming just thought that the president was too outstanding, causing the Gu family and Lu Yan to look like trash.","At this moment, Jiang Feng walked over. “Young Madam, you’ve misunderstood the chairman. He’s just angry. After all, Young Master Lu is not capable enough. He still needs President Gu’s care in the future. Why would the chairman kill President Gu?”","Qiao Xi looked up innocently. “I see! So the chairman doesn’t want to kill Ah Zheng. I’m really too happy about this!”","Gu Weiming was so angry that his entire body was trembling.","Qiao Xi comforted Gu Zheng softly, saying, “Ah Zheng, it’s okay. The chairman doesn’t want to kill you. Didn’t the chairman and Madam Gu come looking for you just now? They hope you can give that plot of land to Lu Yan, don’t they?","“You have so many resources in your hands, so you don’t lack this plot of land. However, Young Master Lu’s ability is limited. If he doesn’t get this plot of land, how will he have the chance to stand out? Why don’t you just give it to him?”","Gu Zheng remained silent.","Qiao Xi was anxious. “Ah Zheng! Say something! Promise me that you’ll give this plot of land to Lu Yan. Although he’s inferior to you in everything, he’ll complain about you relentlessly! He’ll get the chairman and Madam Gu to beat and scold you. Just agree!”","Chairman Gu was so angry that his eyes were bloodshot. “You...”","Before he could retort, everyone’s angry voices came from outside.","“Chairman Gu, Lu Yan obtaining this plot of land won’t prove anything. Since it’s a bid, it should be a fair competition. Why do you have to play such tricks?”","“Lu Yan is incapable and only knows how to complain. He even instigated the chairman to beat President Gu to death. In order to achieve his goal, he’s unscrupulous. Who would dare to do business with such a person? It’s fine that he doesn’t have the ability, but he’s also so sinister. He’s really disgusting!”","“Who said that Lu Yan doesn’t have any ability? Isn’t he quite good at complaining?”","Everyone was indignant. “President Gu, isn’t it just a plot of land? Since he wants it, let him have it. Our family has a plot of land in the southern suburbs and we’re about to auction it. As long as you want it, I’ll give it to you at the lowest price.”","“Chairman Gu, you’re forcing President Gu to give the land to Lu Yan. Is this what a father should do?”","Gu Weiming’s pupils constricted.","Wait! When did this group of people appear?","He turned around and saw everyone’s angry gazes. His heart skipped a beat.","It was over... Could it be that they had heard everything?"]},{"number":384,"title":"Chapter 384 - Scheme","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","These people all knew that he was the one who was forcing Gu Zheng to give up that plot of land?","At first, he only wanted Gu Zheng to get rid of the rumors and not ruin the Gu family’s reputation. However, he did not expect this group of people to hear the truth with their own ears.","Those who could attend the Gu family’s banquet were either rich or noble. Even if Gu Weiming was dissatisfied, he could not stop the crowd from talking.","Gu Zheng’s face was pale, and his eyes were deep. He slowly said, “Father, I’ll give up on the plot of land.”","Lu Yan had obtained this plot of land, but his reputation in Li City was completely ruined.","Gu Weiming’s expression was gloomy as he suppressed his anger. “Gu Zheng, don’t be arrogant. Although we have to pay a small price for it, as long as we can get this plot of land, it’ll bring us huge benefits. Lu Yan will soon become the most successful entrepreneur. No one will remember this small stain. He’ll completely replace you.”","Gu Zheng raised an eyebrow. “I’m looking forward to it.”","Looking at Gu Zheng’s indifferent expression, Gu Weiming was burning with anger. “Ah Zheng, I’m your father. When I was all-powerful in the business world, you didn’t even know how to walk. I’m sure you can’t compare to Lu Yan!”","Gu Zheng sneered. “Father?”","Gu Weiming thought that Gu Zheng had given in. Unexpectedly, Gu Zheng said slowly, “Although I was young back then, I’ve never heard that you were all-powerful in the business world. Is it because you’re old and don’t have a good memory? You should quickly go to the hospital for a check-up. If you die, who will Lu Yan complain to in the future?”","Qiao Xi: “...” Wow! Ah Zheng was being so savage!","Gu Weiming gritted his teeth. “You! Very good! We’ll see!”","After he finished speaking, he left angrily. Qiao Xi had a disdainful expression on her face as she stood up and closed the door heavily.","Gu Zheng’s expression was calm. Qiao Xi could not help but ask, “Gu Zheng... The chairman probably didn’t call you back just for that plot of land, right? Is there something else?”","Gu Zheng smiled and rubbed her head. “Smart.”","“Even if he wants that plot of land, he can go to your company or use money to support Lu Yan! There should be a more important matter for him to get you to come back...”","Qiao Xi paused for a moment and continued, “Chairman Gu wants to officially announce Lu Yan’s return to the Gu family.”","Gu Zheng nodded without changing his expression.","Qiao Xi thought for a moment. “Huang Lilan wants to take this opportunity to push all the responsibility to you. After all, she rose to her current position before Eldest Miss Lu passed away, so she has always been mocked as a mistress. She has no way of defending herself.","“If Lu Yan returns to the Gu family as Eldest Miss Lu’s biological son, Huang Lilan will admit Lu Yan’s identity and announce that the Gu family’s heir is Lu Yan. She’ll also cry in public and take this opportunity to push the blame of Eldest Miss Lu’s death on you.”","Silence filled the air.","“Heh.” Gu Zheng tapped his long fingers and said casually, “It’s indeed like this.","“Why else would my father invite so many people over for no reason?”","Qiao Xi’s heart ached. “Then what should we do? Can we prove your identity?”","If the Lu and Gu families were to testify against Gu Zheng together, coupled with his identity as an illegitimate child, it might really be difficult to explain.","Moreover, everyone knew that Huang Lilan only had the right to enter the Gu family with the ‘illegitimate child’, Gu Zheng. After that, Eldest Miss Lu passed away. It was very likely that the illegitimate child had said or done something that caused Eldest Miss Lu’s death.","After that, the Lu family would also appear to slander Gu Zheng and bury the true cause of Eldest Miss Lu’s death forever.","Qiao Xi gasped. “Eldest Miss Lu has already passed away for so many years, yet the Lu family still wants to use her?”","Gu Zheng’s eyes were deep. “When she was alive, she was treated as a chess piece who was married into the Gu family. She has been dead for more than 20 years but they still won’t let her off.”","The man narrowed his eyes. “Huang Lilan has always been very popular in high society. She’s also known as kind and gentle, so many people have even forgotten that she’s a mistress.”","Hah, gentleness was just her disguise. This time, she would reveal her true colors.","The grudges between them had to be settled slowly."]},{"number":385,"title":"Chapter 385 - The Gu Familys Birthday Banquet","paragraphs":["On the other side, Gu Weiming returned to his room angrily. Huang Lilan hurriedly went forward. “Weiming, what should we do?! So many people are saying that Ah Yan is inferior to Ah Zheng...”","“What’s there to say?! As long as Ah Yan can win, nothing else matters!”","Gu Weiming’s eyes turned gentle. “Lan Lan, it’s been hard on you. Don’t worry, I’ll officially announce Ah Yan’s identity soon. At that time, you won’t have to bear that bad reputation anymore.”","Huang Lilan nodded excitedly. “Weiming, I’m not aggrieved. As long as I can be with you, I’m willing to pay any price. Moreover, Lu Qingyun was too boring. It’s normal that you didn’t like her. It’s only right that we’re together!”","“For the sake of the Lu family, you didn’t chase her out of the house and even got scolded by a scumbag. However, when Ah Yan comes back, no one will scold you anymore. It’s just that...”","Huang Lilan’s face darkened. “It’s just that Ah Zheng is so confident. Does he have any evidence? If he can prove that he’s Lu Qingyun’s...”","Gu Weiming frowned, and his heart could not help but tremble. However, this uneasiness quickly dissipated.","“So what if he has evidence? Can he beat our two families alone?","“Besides, the ‘evidence’ he found might all be fake. Even if he took it out, it would have no authenticity. He has power and influence. If he wants to forge evidence, it’s just a matter of giving out the order. Who will believe him?”","Gu Weiming looked proud. “The Lu family will prove that Lu Yan is Lu Qingyun’s son. The Lu family won’t even admit Gu Zheng’s identity. So what if he has evidence?”","Huang Lilan pretended to be sad. “Actually, I don’t want to treat Ah Zheng like this either. After all, I’m his mother in name. It was the Lu family who’s unwilling to acknowledge his identity. You can’t blame me for this.”","“Don’t think too much. Gu Zheng is a lunatic! He’s as crazy as his mother. Anyway, we have Ah Yan and Ah Yao. After we snatch the family’s assets back, we’ll chase Gu Zheng out of the house!”","Huang Lilan nodded and revealed a sinister smile.","Why did the Lu family despise Lu Qingyun so much? It was because she was crazy and blind!","How could noble families tolerate lunatics in their families? If news of it got out, outsiders would think that the entire family carried such genes. It would ruin the entire family’s reputation.","Actually, Gu Weiming used to like Gu Zheng a lot. After all, he was his eldest son. However, he gradually realized that Gu Zheng and Lu Qingyun had the same strange illness. It was then he started to hate this child.","Hence, the Lu and Gu families were unwilling to expose this secret lest it affected their families. As for the reason behind Lu Qingyun’s death, no one cared.","...","Two days later.","It was Chairman Gu’s 55th birthday. The big shots in the business world all came to congratulate him.","In the evening, all the guests had arrived.","The Gu family’s old residence was very spacious and had many servants. Every table was served by servants and there were even people guiding the guests. The entire courtyard was very lively.","Many people did not know about the farce from a few days ago, nor did they know that the Lu and Gu families were close.","Hence, when everyone saw the Lu family appear in the Gu family, they were dumbfounded.","“Am I seeing things? Did I really see Lu Xiang just now?”","“Old Master Lu is here too? This... What’s going on between the Lu and Gu families?”","“It can’t be, right? Back then, Eldest Miss Lu died in the Gu family for no reason. Didn’t the Lu family say that they had nothing to do with the Gu family? Moreover, Lu Xiang said that Eldest Miss Gu committed suicide. It was Madam Gu who became the mistress and went out with Chairman Gu every day. That was why Eldest Miss Lu committed suicide.”","Someone reminded, saying, “Shh! Don’t spout nonsense. Be careful not to let Chairman Gu hear you.”","The person retorted, “Did I say anything wrong? Eldest Miss Lu’s body was weak, so Madam Gu stayed in the Gu residence openly. That’s why she got depressed and committed suicide not long after”.","“It’s also because of this that the Lu family and the Gu family cut off all ties. Old Master Lu doesn’t allow Chairman Gu to go to the Lu family, nor does he allow Gu Weiming to pay his respects to Eldest Miss Lu.”","“Old Master Lu would rather not do business with the Gu family than let Chairman Gu pay his respects. The Lu family is really loyal..”"]},{"number":386,"title":"Chapter 386 - The Real Cause Of Eldest Miss Lus Death","paragraphs":["Everyone was confused. “Then why is the Lu family here?”","Qiao Xi almost couldn’t help but laugh.","Song Shijing explained at the right time, “Ever since the Lu family cut off ties with the Gu family, people in high society have been saying that the Lu family is loyal and true.","“They said that Old Master Lu regretted marrying his daughter to Chairman Gu. They also said that the Lu family and the Gu family were enemies and that they wanted to avenge Eldest Miss Lu’s death.","“Actually, the Lu family only did this to cover up the real cause behind Eldest Miss Lu’s death, as well as to preserve Gu Weiming and Huang Lilan’s reputation.”","Qiao Xi was shocked. “You mean Eldest Miss Lu didn’t commit suicide but was killed?”","“The president didn’t find any proof of that either.”","Qiao Xi suddenly thought of something. Her grandfather and Eldest Miss Lu knew each other very well. He had written many notes about treating Eldest Miss Lu.","If she could find Grandpa, would she be able to find out the real cause of Eldest Miss Lu’s death and find some clues that point to her killer?","Qiao Xi was furious. “Old Master Lu conspired with Gu Weiming and Huang Lilan to kill his own daughter. What’s the reason behind it? Isn’t Eldest Miss Lu his biological daughter?”","Furthermore, after Eldest Miss Lu died, the Lu family pretended that they cared about her and used her death to gain a good reputation.","...","At seven in the evening, the banquet officially began.","The Lu family’s appearance surprised everyone.","Old Master Lu even brought a young man with him. That person was talking and laughing with the Gu family. He looked to be very intimate with them.","Qiao Xi raised her eyes to size up Lu Yan, and her eyes narrowed.","Lu Yan also noticed her gaze and smiled at her. He raised his wine glass and toasted her. He acted as though he was very familiar with Qiao Xi.","A few years ago, the Lu and Gu families’ strengths could be said to be on par. However, the Lu family was far inferior to the Gu family now. It was just that the two families had a special relationship.","If it were not for that incident back then, the Gu and Lu families would have been very close. Now that 20 years had passed, could it be that Old Master Lu had let go of his past grudges?","If the Lu and Gu families worked together, coupled with President Gu’s ruthless methods, which noble family in Li City could compete with them?","Someone could not help but ask curiously, “Old Master Lu, this is...”","Old Master Lu replied frankly, “My grandson, Lu Yan.”","Everyone was slightly puzzled.","Grandchild? Then why did he take the Lu family’s surname?","Old Master Lu only had two daughters. His eldest daughter, Lu Qingyun, died 20 years ago. How could his second daughter, Lu Xiang, have a son who was already an adult?","Just then, someone shouted, “President Gu, you’re here!”","Everyone looked in the direction of the voice.","The group of people who were surrounding the Lu family earlier also hurriedly went forward. It was because Gu Zheng was too dazzling. He was the center of everyone’s attention wherever he went.","Many guests present at the birthday banquet were also here because of Gu Zheng. They wanted to take this opportunity to interact with Gu Zheng and help their companies develop well in the future.","Lu Xiang’s expression darkened. “What’s so good about an illegitimate child?! How ignorant! In the future, the entire Gu family will belong to Ah Yan!”","Old Master Lu snorted. “It’s all because of his identity as the eldest son of the Gu family. Gu Weiming will announce Ah Yan’s identity today. At that time, these people will know who to suck up to. One is a legitimate child, while the other is an illegitimate child. They’ll be able to differentiate between the two!”","Lu Xiang bit her lip.","She was still unconvinced. Why did he have to pretend to be that b*tch’s biological son if he wanted to inherit the Gu family’s assets? What right did that b*tch have? She just temporarily occupied the position of Mrs. Gu!","However, if Lu Qingyun knew that her biological son was being treated as an illegitimate child and would be despised by others for the rest of his life, she would probably be in pain!","...","At this moment, Gu Weiming was thinking about announcing Lu Yan’s identity today and was delighted. “Ah Zheng.”","Gu Zheng lowered his eyes and ignored him.","Seeing him like this, Gu Weiming was instantly infuriated. “What’s with your attitude? I’m your father, yet you’re treating me like this? How rude!”","“Chairman Gu, Ah Zheng didn’t do anything. Speaking of which, you’re the one who went too far with him, right?” Qiao Xi said casually, “You almost killed Ah Zheng for Mr. Lu.. Could it be that he still has to be grateful to you? Should he thank you for the beating?”"]},{"number":387,"title":"Chapter 387 - Time To Reel In The Net","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Gu Weiming glared at her fiercely, then roared, “Gu Zheng! Don’t think that you’re the only son in the Gu family! There’s Gu Yao, and now, there’s also Lu Yan. He’s the future heir of the Gu family!”","Gu Zheng raised his eyes indifferently and sneered. “Heh, whatever.”","He looked at the time and muttered to himself, “It’s time.”","...","At eight in the evening.","The Lu and Gu families were chatting happily, shocking everyone. The scene in front of them seemed to have returned to more than 20 years ago when the two families had just united through marriage.","The guests discussed in low voices. “Did you see the young man beside Old Master Lu? The Gu family treats him very well!”","“It looks like the Gu family is very close to him. President Gu, on the other hand, isn’t well-liked.”","“What exactly is going on? Although President Gu and Chairman Gu don’t have a good relationship, President Gu is still the head of the Gu family. It’s really strange that Chairman Gu is being so close to another young man.”","Everyone also noticed that something was off.","Someone lowered their voice and said, “Have you heard? President Gu... didn’t take that plot of land in the northern suburbs!”","“That’s impossible! Who else but President Gu has the right to get that plot of land? Who dares to snatch something from President Gu? Even if there’s a fight over it, how could anyone’s wealth be compared to President Gu’s?”","“That person is right in front of us. It’s Lu Yan...”","Everyone was dumbfounded.","Where did Lu Yan come from? He could actually snatch that plot of land from President Gu?","Moreover, both the Gu and Lu families seemed to take this young man very seriously. Things were probably going to change...","At this moment, Gu Weiming reeked of alcohol. His face was red and full of smiles. He staggered to the stage and raised the microphone. He said loudly, “Thank you for coming to my birthday banquet. I have something important to announce today. I believe everyone is very curious about why Old Master Lu and the second miss of the Lu family are here.”","Everyone looked up, expecting his explanation.","One could hear a pin drop.","Gu Weiming cleared his throat and said formally, “Before announcing this matter, I want to thank my father-in-law, Old Master Lu, and Second Miss Lu. I want to thank them...”","Halfway through, he suddenly choked and continued, “Thank you for helping me raise Qingyun and my child.","“Ah Yan, come to your father.”","Bang!","The air was eerily quiet.","Everyone looked at each other in disbelief.","Gu Weiming said that the Lu family raised his and Lu Qingyun’s child?","Lu Yan was the child of Gu Weiming and Lu Qingyun. He was the child of the Gu family’s respected marriage back then!","Everyone was shocked and could not help but look at Gu Zheng. The legitimate heir was back. Then what should Gu Zheng, the ‘illegitimate child’ who had always been the head of the Gu family, do now?","Businessmen valued benefits above all else. Regardless of whether someone was a legitimate child or not, as long as they had the ability, they would be qualified to be the heir. Now that Lu Yan had obtained that plot of land while Gu Zheng lost, it meant that Lu Yan, the legitimate child, was not inferior to Gu Zheng.","Amidst the waves of sighs, Gu Zheng’s expression was calm as he secretly snapped his fingers.","The fish had taken the bait. It was time to reel in the net.","Lu Yan went on stage and stood beside Gu Weiming. The father and son looked very similar. The people below the stage were stunned for a moment. No one knew who was the one who started clapping.","Then, a group of people began to clap and congratulate them. It was a good thing that the Gu family’s legitimate child could be acknowledged as a member of the Gu family. However, it was a troublesome matter for Gu Zheng.","Gu Weiming nodded in satisfaction, his eyes filled with pride.","“While everyone is here, I announce that from today onward, Gu Corporation’s shares and assets will be handed to my son, Lu Yan. He’s the only heir of the Gu family!”","The voice was spread to every corner of the hall through the microphone. Everyone could not help but tremble. Then, they looked at Gu Zheng.","A big businessman who had worked with the Gu family for many years tried to persuade Gu Weiming. “Chairman Gu, it’s indeed a good thing that you have a wife and found your child from many years ago, but you can’t rush the matter of choosing the heir.”","“The Gu family’s heir now is President Gu. If it weren’t for President Gu, Gu Corporation wouldn’t have risen so quickly in just a few years. If you change the heir now, won’t it be...”","Everyone also tried to persuade him. “That’s right, Chairman Gu. Let’s discuss this matter again.”","“If Gu Corporation loses President Gu, the consequences will be very serious. Why don’t we find another position for Lu Yan first? He’s still young, after all...”"]},{"number":388,"title":"Chapter 388 - Double Happiness","paragraphs":["Countless voices of objection were heard. Everyone did not care who was in charge of the Gu family. They only wanted to ensure that their interests were not violated. Although Lu Yan was the legitimate son, only Gu Zheng could help everyone earn money.","Gu Weiming’s expression did not change as he said calmly, “Everyone has a point. Ah Zheng is indeed very capable, but he’s seriously ill and doesn’t have the energy to manage the company or the ability to be the heir of the Gu family.”","He sighed and frowned. “Ah Zheng suddenly gave up on that plot of land in the northern suburbs after increasing the bid to 15 billion. As the head of the Gu family, he made such a serious mistake. He should reflect on himself.”","Bang!","Everyone widened their eyes. President Gu gave up on that plot of land?","Everyone in Li City knew that that plot of land was a fat piece of meat. Whoever could get it would receive endless benefits. President Gu was about to get it, but he suddenly gave up?","Gu Weiming pretended to be serious. “Ah Zheng made such a serious mistake that caused Gu Corporation to suffer some losses, so it’s still uncertain whether he’s qualified to be the heir.”","Gu Zheng sat quietly on the chair, looking relaxed.","Song Shijing called out to him, “President.”","Song Shiyu snorted. “Brother, what are you worried about?! The Gu family relied on the president to enjoy their current wealth and status. Without the president, the building will collapse and everything will disappear!”","Gu Zheng smirked.","Although Song Shiyu was usually muddle-headed, he was still quite clear-headed when it came to important matters.","Gu Weiming smiled proudly. “The northern suburbs is a project that the Gu and Lu families will be developing in the next five years. Lu Yan won it for 15 billion yuan. His ability is obvious. Moreover, he’s more qualified than Gu Zheng to be the heir. I believe he’ll lead everyone to a better future.”","Old Master Lu also stood up and said, “Ah Yan is the child of Qingyun, my daughter. She had outstanding business talent since she was young. Ah Yan is very similar to Qing Yun when she was young. I believe that he’ll definitely be able to make a name for himself in the future.”","Speaking of Lu Qingyun, everyone was very impressed.","When Eldest Miss Lu was young, she was also a genius in the business world. Unfortunately, she fell seriously ill and eventually committed suicide due to depression. Otherwise, there would definitely be another goddess in the business world today.","If Lu Yan was Lu Qingyun’s child, he would definitely have some talent in doing business. With the support of the Lu and Gu families, he would definitely have some achievements.","Looking at the current situation, Gu Zheng was alone and helpless. Both families thought highly of Lu Yan. It was really unknown who would be the heir.","Everyone looked at each other in confusion.","For Lu Yan, the Gu and Lu families reconciled and were providing him with resources. Even an ordinary person could receive rich returns.","Meanwhile, President Gu was unattainable. There were too many people who wanted to work with him, while Lu Yan was still inexperienced. If they followed him now, they would be able to be the founders of the company in the future. Naturally, they would have more than enough money to spend by then.","Everyone was hesitant.","“Chairman Gu...”","At this moment, someone pushed open the door to the banquet hall in a panic.","The person was a higher-up of Gu Corporation. His eyes were filled with panic as he staggered in. “Chairman Gu! Chairman Gu!”","Gu Weiming frowned. “Where are your manners?! Why are you shouting?”","“Chairman Gu, that plot of land...” The higher-up was panting. After taking two deep breaths with difficulty, they said impatiently, “The state staff came to investigate that plot of land...”","What?","Everyone was stunned for a moment. Gu Weiming stood up abruptly, his eyes filled with surprise.","The state staff had gotten involved? If they looked into that plot of land, it might become a major development area. At that time, the country might even give out a development fund. Then, the price of that plot of land might double.","Gu Weiming was wild with joy. “Ah Yan! You’re indeed the lucky star of the Gu family. You only spent 15 billion to bid for this plot of land but you’ve already received the country’s attention. Our Gu family will let you develop it in the future. This is really a double blessing!”","Old Master Lu also chuckled. “Ah Yan is really awesome. He’s countless times better than that illegitimate child.”","Everyone looked at Gu Zheng carefully.."]},{"number":389,"title":"Chapter 389 - 15 Billion Down The Drain","paragraphs":["Old Master Lu was still not satisfied, so he mocked coldly, “Our Ah Yan was born through a legitimate marriage. His luck is naturally different. An illegitimate child is too shallow. He was unwilling to part with just 15 billion dollars and immediately chose to give up. If the Gu family is really handed to him in the future, it’ll be destroyed by him sooner or later!”","He kept calling him the ‘illegitimate child’. Although he did not say his name, everyone knew who he was talking about.","At this moment, the air in the banquet hall seemed to have frozen. Everyone held their breaths.","Gu Weiming’s face was full of affection. “Ah Yan, don’t worry. I’ll do my best to help you. This plot of land is yours, and the position of heir is also yours!”","“Chairman Gu!!” The higher-up from just now interrupted anxiously, their forehead covered in sweat. “No! It’s not...”","Gu Weiming frowned unhappily. “What are you saying? Don’t you know how to speak? I said that Ah Yan is the heir of the Gu family, but you dare to retort? Ah Yan has the right to develop this land. Who dares to look down on him?”","“I’m not done yet. This plot of land can’t be developed!” The higher-up looked troubled. “So the 15 billion yuan has gone down the drain!”","The crowd fell silent.","Could not be developed? These words echoed in everyone’s minds. Then, they realized the seriousness of the matter.","They had bought a plot of land for 15 billion yuan. If they could not develop it, how were they going to earn money? It would be equivalent to wasting their money.","Gu Weiming’s face darkened. “What? Stop talking nonsense. How is that possible?! We’ve already done the procedures. The rights to develop this plot of land belong to Ah Yan. The contract clearly states that Ah Yan is the owner of that plot of land!”","“But, but...”","The higher-up gritted their teeth and said something that stunned everyone.","“That’s right, but a huge ancient tomb was discovered under that plot of land...”","Bang!","Gu Weiming staggered as if he had lost all his strength. He quickly sat back down.","“No, that’s impossible.”","Seeing that things had come to this, the higher-up did not need to hide anything anymore and blurted out—","“The country has already sent professionals to survey the area. There’s a huge ancient tomb underground, so the plot of land has been sealed up. The archeological team will come to Li City tomorrow to excavate the site. This plot of land can’t be developed. Moreover, it’s already owned by the country.”","According to the country’s laws, as long as a major ancient tomb was discovered, the land would belong to the country. It was illegal to privately occupy or excavate the land. The treasures left behind from history belonged to the country, so it was even more impossible to develop and destroy the ancient tomb.","So... the 15 billion yuan was really wasted?","Old Master Lu almost vomited blood.","“Nonsense! How could there be an ancient tomb underground? That’s just a rumor!” Old Master Lu shouted in disbelief.","The higher-up had been working in the Gu family for many years and was also angry. They pointed at Old Master Lu and scolded, “You still have the cheek to say that about me?! If your Lu family wanted to snatch that plot of land, Gu Corporation wouldn’t interfere. However, Gu Corporation has already spent more than four billion yuan this time. Now, it’s all gone to waste. Four billion yuan! That’s all our company’s money. Don’t I have the right to voice out?”","Lu Yan’s gentle mask cracked. “I have no objections if the country wants to take back that plot of land, but I’m the owner of this land, after all. Even if the country wants to take it back, they have to compensate me for my losses.”","Gu Weiming hurriedly nodded. “Yes, if it can’t be developed, then we can forget about it. But the 15 billion yuan...”","“It’s not like that! This plot of land was won from an auction!”","The higher-up hurriedly interrupted them and said unwillingly, “That plot of land’s valuation is only two billion. According to the country’s law, Mr. Lu will only be paid two billion as compensation. As for the remaining 13 billion yuan, it has nothing to do with the country. That’s the additional cost of Mr. Lu has to bear for choosing to bid for it.”","...!","Gu Weiming almost fainted.","Lu Yan also took a deep breath. He quickly reacted and turned to look at Gu Zheng.","At this moment, President Gu was sitting lazily on the sofa. He swirled the wine glass in his hand and raised it toward him with a victorious smile.","He was so confident that victory was in his hands.","A storm brewed in Lu Yan’s mind as if he had been struck by lightning. His expression gradually became terrified.","No wonder, no wonder!","It turned out that Gu Zheng had long known about this, so he deliberately set up a trap for him!"]},{"number":390,"title":"Chapter 390 - Gu Zheng Is More Like Eldest Miss Lus Child","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Lu Yan hurriedly took out his phone and called his assistant with trembling hands.","After a moment, he hung up the phone. He gritted his teeth and said hatefully, “I’ll look for the corresponding person in charge and try... to minimize the losses.”","Old Master Lu’s blood surged, and he almost fainted.","15 billion was gone just like that?","Everyone was surprised that Mr. Lu was so capable earlier. He could snatch this plot of land from President Gu and was about to take away President Gu’s identity as the heir.","Unexpectedly, there was an ancient tomb underground.","President Gu was so lucky. He gave up on the bid, so he incurred no loss. However, Lu Yan was unlucky. Before he could even do anything to the land, he had already lost 13 billion yuan.","The Lu family’s company was already in a precarious situation. Now, they had to bear a heavy loss. Moreover, Gu Weiming himself lost more than four billion yuan as well. This would cause quite a big impact.","All the senior executives of Gu Corporation had gloomy expressions. “You have the cheek to say that this is Eldest Miss Lu’s son? He wouldn’t have been so rash. Since you wanted to bid for this plot of land, didn’t you do a survey beforehand? You blindly followed and watched as others bid, so you wanted to join in as well. Great! Now, you’ve implicated us!”","“Chairman Gu, your son doesn’t have any talent in business at all.”","Gu Weiming and Old Master Lu’s faces were livid, while their eyes were filled with viciousness.","Just then, someone from the crowd said, “Say... why did President Gu suddenly give up on the bid?”","Everyone was stunned.","“Could it be that President Gu knew something so he gave up on the bid?”","“Yes!” Everyone suddenly reacted.","“No one can compete with President Gu for what he wants. He must have heard the news, so he gave up on that plot of land. Lu Yan thought highly of himself and thought that President Gu was afraid. Little did he know that he fell into a trap. How laughable!”","Lu Yan’s face was pale. He was so angry that his entire body was trembling. His gaze could kill.","“I don’t think Lu Yan is Eldest Miss Lu’s son at all. On the contrary, President Gu is the one who’s extremely talented in business. He’s more like Eldest Miss Lu’s biological son. Actually, I’ve long suspected it. Do you think President Gu is Eldest Miss Lu’s son?”","With that said, everyone fell silent.","Huang Lilan was instantly alarmed as she looked at Gu Weiming in horror.","Gu Weiming’s face darkened. He was about to flare up when he was stopped by Lu Yan.","At this moment, someone advised Gu Weiming nicely, “Chairman Gu, the truth is right in front of us. Lu Yan made a mistake in his judgment and caused irreparable damage to the Gu and Lu families. He can’t compare to President Gu...”","“I think we should be more careful about the decision regarding the heir. Chairman Gu, you should consider it carefully before making a decision!”","At this moment, Old Master Lu slammed the table. “Weiming! You can’t do this. When the Gu family was in danger, it was the Lu family who took action. That’s how the Gu family got to enjoy their current status!”","“Ah Yan is your legitimate child. He has already acknowledged his ancestors. Are you going to hand the Gu family to an illegitimate child?”","Everyone lowered their heads.","That was right. Back when the Gu family was in trouble, it was with Eldest Miss Lu’s help that they survived.","Although President Gu did not rely on the Gu family to succeed, if he became the heir, Eldest Miss Lu’s soul in heaven wouldn’t be at peace.","Qiao Xi’s gaze was slightly cold.","Gu Zheng could clearly hear the ridicule in Qiao Xi’s heart.","‘The Lu family is really shameless! They clearly know that Lu Yan is the illegitimate child while Gu Zheng is Eldest Miss Lu’s son, yet they’re still using Eldest Miss Lu’s kindness to suppress Gu Zheng!","‘The Lu family was ungrateful and caused Eldest Miss Lu’s death. Now, they even want to deal with Eldest Miss Lu’s biological son. They want Ah Zheng to bear the reputation of being an illegitimate child. The Lu family is utterly heartless!’","Gu Zheng smirked as warmth flowed through his heart.","Actually, he did not care about what others thought of him. As long as she was on his side, he would have the world.","Gu Weiming pretended to be sad. “Father-in-law, it’s all my fault. I’ve let Qingyun down. I was careless back then, but this has nothing to do with Ah Zheng. He didn’t kill Qingyun. He doesn’t know anything about this!”","Everyone nodded affirmatively.","Everyone knew that Lu Qingyun committed suicide because of depression after being provoked by Huang Lilan.","At that time, Gu Zheng was still young and did not know who Lu Qingyun was. Hence, Eldest Miss Lu’s death definitely had nothing to do with him.. This matter could only be blamed on Gu Weiming and Huang Lilan."]},{"number":391,"title":"Chapter 391 - Another Secret","paragraphs":["Chapter 391: Another Secret","Translator: Henyee Translations","Editor: Henyee Translations","“Something’s not right here...”","Someone said in confusion, “Since Eldest Miss Lu’s death is related to Huang Lilan, why are Huang Lilan and Mr. Lu so close? Moreover, the Lu family is also very enthusiastic about Huang Lilan.”","“That’s right! Huang Lilan is a mistress and the murderer who caused Eldest Miss Lu’s death. If it weren’t for her bringing her illegitimate child into the house, Eldest Miss Lu wouldn’t have died of depression. Now, the Lu family keeps talking about Eldest Miss Lu, but they’re talking and laughing with her murderer?”","Everyone’s expressions were gloomy and indignant.","Eldest Miss Lu only committed suicide because of Gu Weiming.","Now, it was fine if the Lu family forgave Gu Weiming for Lu Yan’s sake as he was his biological father, but how could they forgive Huang Lilan, the mistress?","Wouldn’t Eldest Miss Lu have died in vain?","Huang Lilan took a few steps back in horror. Tears welled up in her eyes, and she looked very aggrieved.","“Actually, there’s another secret,” Lu Xiang said calmly. She picked up the microphone, and her voice was filled with helplessness.","“Back then, Madam Gu and Brother-in-law accidentally had Ah Zheng. However, Madam Gu knew that Brother-in-law had a family, so she didn’t want to ruin his family. She was prepared to leave with the child, but...”","Lu Xiang paused for a moment and looked at Gu Zheng sarcastically. “However, when Gu Zheng found out that he was the young master of the Gu family, he secretly ran to the Gu family and accidentally found out about the hospital my sister was in. He caused a scene in the hospital and forced my sister to suffer from depression.","“At that time, my father, my brother-in-law, and I all saw it. Madam Gu cried and complained about that child, but that child was like a demon. He forced my sister and my brother-in-law to admit his identity. He even wanted to be the heir of the Gu family.","“My sister was already seriously ill to begin with, and it was because of him that she ended up committing suicide.”","Lu Xiang’s eyes were filled with sorrow as she looked at Gu Zheng. “President Gu, my sister’s death was caused by you. Do you think you’re qualified to be the heir? That’s a life that you took! What right do you have to compete with Ah Yan?","“You’re really a demon!”","Boom!!!","Everyone even forgot to breathe as they looked at Gu Zheng in shock. Their eyes were filled with disbelief.","The next second...","Clap! Clap!","Gu Zheng clapped under everyone’s burning gaze. His eyes were slightly cold and filled with mockery. He asked slowly, “Second Miss Lu, are you done?”","Lu Xiang looked at him hatefully.","Gu Zheng said indifferently, “You can continue.”","Everyone gasped. Could it be that there was another secret?","She had exposed President Gu’s ugly secret in public but instead of stopping her, he was letting her continue?","Lu Xiang did not expect Gu Zheng to be so calm and collected. Immediately after, she revealed a pained expression and complained, “Gu Zheng! Back then, you caused my sister’s death, causing her to die of depression. However, you don’t have a trace of regret toward the Lu family. You’re really...”","Lu Xiang stretched out her finger and trembled from anger.","Originally, it was just about the ownership of the inheritance. But now, they were talking about what had happened 20 years ago. Everyone got to watch a good show here today!","All these years, everyone thought that Eldest Miss Lu committed suicide because of Huang Lilan’s appearance and her depression. They thought everything happened because of Huang Lilan.","Who would have thought that Lu Xiang would expose the truth at this time? It turned out that Eldest Miss Lu committed suicide because of President Gu?","Huang Lilan was not a mistress. In order to not ruin someone else’s family, she even wanted to leave this city?","Back then, President Gu was only six years old. In order to be the young master of the Gu family, he caused a scene in front of Gu Weiming and Lu Qingyun, forcing Gu Weiming to admit his identity? This was too scary!","Gu Zheng opened his cold eyes and smiled meaningfully.","“Madam Jiang, are you saying that the Lu family saw that scene with their own eyes?”","Although Lu Xiang was married to President Jiang, their relationship had always been poor. They didn’t even appear in public anymore. Back then, she was so proud that she stole Lu Qingyun’s fiance. Now, she was so regretful and angry.","Everyone knew this very well, so they never called her ‘Madam Jiang’ or ‘Second Miss Lu.’ Gu Zheng’s words hit Lu Xiang’s weak spot.","Lu Xiang gritted her teeth in hatred. “Of course, we all saw it. At that time, my father and I were accompanying my sister in the hospital. If you hadn’t suddenly barged in and brought a few reporters with you to deliberately anger my sister, how could my sister’s old illness have relapsed?”"]},{"number":392,"title":"Chapter 392 - The Truth?","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations| Editor: Henyee Translations","Lu Xiang cried and shouted, “Those reporters said that since my sister couldn’t","help the Gu family flourish and it looked like she wouldn’t be able to live for","long, she should quickly give up her position to someone else. They even said","that since Chairman Gu already had a six-year-old son, Chairman Gu would","bring his son home sooner or later!","“But my sister was the first wife of the Gu family! You’re just an illegitimate","child, yet you brought a group of unscrupulous reporters to force my sister to","give up her position! You’re so vicious!","Everyone frowned and pitied Eldest Miss Lu.","They imagined the scene of Eldest Miss Lu being seriously ill and hospitalized,","only for a group of people to suddenly rush in one day and scold her for not","being able to have children. Those people even wanted to force her to give up","her position. No woman could calm down.","Huang Lilan hypocritically squeezed out a few tears. “Actually, I’ve always been","unwilling to say it. I’d rather be the scapegoat for the rest of my life, but Ah","Zheng, you can’t be so willful anymore. How can you compete with Ah Yan for","the position of the heir? You’ve already caused the death of his biological","mother, yet you still want to snatch his identity as the heir? Ah Zheng, you","can’t be so greedy!”","Gu Weiming accused loudly, “Gu Zheng, the Lu family didn’t pursue the matter","because of your mother. Don’t you know how much harm you’ve caused the Lu","family and your mother?","“If you weren’t so greedy, this tragedy wouldn’t have happened.”","The guests were all very regretful. “Eldest Miss Lu was really too pitiful. If this","matter was really caused by President Gu, he indeed shouldn’t be fighting for","the position of the heir.","“Although Eldest Miss Lu committed suicide, President Gu indirectly caused","her death. He was only six years old back then! He was already so vicious when","he was young. It’s too scary. President Gu should apologize to the Lu family”","Gu Weiming and Huang Lilan’s supporters berated him.","“That’s right, you should apologize! You have to apologize to everyone you’ve","hurt","“Madam Gu has been criticized for so many years for you. As a mother, she has","already done her best. You should be responsible for your mistake!”","At this moment, Eldest Miss Lu and Huang Lilan were both pitiful in the eyes","of everyone else. Huang Lilan had never thought of destroying someone else’s","family. It was all an accident. The culprit was Gu Zheng. He was too greedy and","caused a tragedy.","After the incident happened, Huang Lilan could not bear to see her child be","scolded. Hence, she tacitly admitted that she was a mistress and was","misunderstood for 20 years.","Old Master Lu sighed helplessly. “Back then, I thought that your mother","instigated you to do that. Because you were young and insensible, I didn’t","blame you. But I didn’t expect you to be so savage.”","Lu Xiang choked. “President Gu, you’re so powerful now and our Lu family","don’t dare to offend you. However, no matter what, I have to tell the truth","today!","Gu Zheng sneered and said casually, “The truth?”","Lu Xiang retorted, “What do you mean? Am I not telling the truth? If it weren’t","for Ah Yan, we would never have said anything about this. You’re indeed going","overboard","Gu Zheng slowly looked up and glanced at Lu Xiang sarcastically. He did not","even bother talking to the woman in front of him.","Old Master Lu’s heart skipped a beat. He knew that Gu Zheng was not a kind","person. Otherwise, he would not have achieved his current accomplishments","by himself. Could it be that he had evidence?","old Master Lu’s tone softened a little. “Ah Zheng, I know you’re uncomfortable","about having the inheritance suddenly taken away from you, but you made a","mistake back then and caused Ah Yan to lose his biological mother. You can’t","deny this.","“I won’t bicker about the past. 1 just want my dead daughter to be able to smile","in the afterlife. There’s no doubt about Lu Yan’s identity. He has to return to","the Gu family and become the heir.","Hearing his words, the corners of Gu Zheng’s mouth curled up again.","Qjao Xi could not help but say, “Old Master Lu, Ah Zheng and Madam Jiang are","discussing the past. Ah Zheng has never doubted Lu Yan’s identity!”","Qjao Xi smiled meaningfully. “Ah Zheng didn’t suspect a single thing. Why are","you in such a rush to explain? Could it be that you’re guilty, or is there","something wrong with Lu Yan’s identity?","Everyone immediately reacted.","Yes! President Gu had not said much all this while. He had never expressed his","doubt about Lu Yan’s identity.."]},{"number":393,"title":"Chapter 393 - Wanting To Cover Up The Incident","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations| Editor: Henyee Translations","Old Master Lu was indeed acting very strange. Why was he so anxious to","explain that Lu Yan was Lu Qingyun’s child?","It sounded like he was trying to hide something!","Lu Xiang’s face was pale. Her father was too rash. She hurriedly interrupted,","“Gu Zheng, my father doesn’t mean anything else. He’s just afraid that you’l","make an issue out of Ah Yan’s identity because you definitely won’t admit that","you previously hurt my sister.”","Qjao Xi blinked and put on an innocent expression. “Madam Jiang, why should","he admit something that he has never done?","“Who do you think you are? Do you have the right to speak?”","Qjao Xi was extremely surprised. “T’m Ah Zheng’s wife, so why don’t I have the","right to speak? The Lu family is really overbearing. They don’t even let me","speak. Are they guilty of something?!”","“You..” Lu Xiang was instantly speechless. She was so angry that her whole","body was trembling","Gu Zheng waved his hand indifferently. “Madam Jiang, your performance is","over. T’ve already lost interest.”","Suddenly, the bodyguards in the banquet hall stood up abruptly and","surrounded the entire banquet hall","The Lu family and Gu Weiming were flustered. “Gu Zheng, what are you","doing?","The door of the hall closed tightly, and the atmosphere instantly became tense.","Gu Zheng sat on the chair casually, but the aura he exuded made everyone feel","unprecedentedly oppressed.","The man’s thin lips moved slightly. “Unraveling the truth”","Gu Zheng, what do you mean? I knew it. You’re unwilling to admit what you","did in the past, huh? Do you think my father and I would joke about my sister’s","death? The Lu and Gu families have not been in contact for so many years","because of my sister. Do you think we’d lie?","Lu Xiang explained in a panic. She did not believe that Gu Zheng could produce","any evidence.","Gu Zheng knocked on the chair with his long fingers and raised an eyebrow.","“Are you that confident, Madam Jiang?","Lu Xiang gritted her teeth, and her eyes were filled with viciousness. No matter","what, she had to let Gu Zheng bear the crime of indirectly killing Lu Qingyun","today.","She wanted to see with her own eyes Lu Qingyun’s son being forced to give up","his position and apologizing to the mistress’ family. Nothing could make her","happler than this.","Even though that b*tch, Lu Qingyun, was dead, it could not offset the hatred in","her heart. She wanted Lu Qingyun’s son to suffer endless pain too.","“Heh.","A moment later, Gu Zheng sneered and said in a low voice, “Madam Jiang, do","you really think I don’t have any evidence?","Lu Xiang’s expression froze. She calmed down and retorted, “What evidence?","With your current status and power, it’s too easy for you to fabricate evidence.","As long as you say a word, someone will testify for you and even take the blame","for you!","“You must be thinking of saying that the doctors and nurses in the hospital can","testify for you and say that you didn’t hurt my sister.","“But everyone, think about it carefully. He’s Gu Zheng!”","Lu Xiang pointed at Gu Zheng and said righteously, “He’s the richest man in Li","City. He’s the master of Li City. He has power and influence! If he wants to","fabricate evidence, he just needs to spend money to get a few people to come","over, then this matter will be resolved. Not to mention a few doctors and","nurses, he can even bribe the entire hospital!","Lu Xiang’s face was filled with anger, but her heart was filled with smugness.","“You must have bribed people to testify for you and slander us. You’re a rich","and powerful person, so naturally, many people will be at your beck and call!","Am I right?!","Lu Xiang’s reprimand enlightened everyone. Their eyes were filled with disdain","when they looked at Gu Zheng.","Second Miss Lu was right. 20 years had passed and the Lu family had not said","anything. There was no need for them to fabricate the truth now. If Gu Zheng","wanted a witness, it would only take him a word.","In comparison, the Lu family’s words were more believable. President Gu","seemed to be quibbling after saying too much.","Gu Zheng looked up and glanced at her disdainfully as if he had already","expected this. It was as if he was looking at a clown. He said indifferently,","“Madam Jiang, you’re too naive. I don’t necessarily need to get witnesses to","prove something. There are other ways to get evidence.”","Lu Xiang’s face was pale.","Huang Lilan also looked terrified. No way... No one saw her when she went to","the hospital to agitate Lu Qingyun. It was impossible that she had left any","evidence behind. The surveillance footage in the ward had also been deleted..."]},{"number":394,"title":"Chapter 394 - What Else Can I Say If You’re Trying To","paragraphs":["Accuse Me?","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","It was impossible for Gu Zheng to have evidence. Even if he had power and","influence, he could not find the surveillance footage that had been deleted.","Huang Lilan calmed down, and her eyes were filled with tears.","“Ah Zheng, it’s already come to this point, yet you’re still unwilling to admit","your mistake? It’s my fault. I didn’t educate you well. You caused Eldest Miss","Lu’s death, and the Lu family didn’t pursue the matter. I only hope that you","won’t compete with Lu Yan anymore. Why won’t you listen? Why do you have","to..”","Gu Zheng sneered and slowly stood up. There was a thick air of dignity aroune","him that made one shiver.","He narrowed his eyes and glanced at Lu Xiang and Huang Lilan with disdain.","Then, the corners of his mouth curled up as he nodded. “That’s right. I can’t us","witnesses to be my evidence.","“Hence, I don’t have witnesses as my evidence.”","With that, Gu Zheng waved his hand behind him.","Song Shijing walked out from behind the bodyguard and said respectfully,","“President.”","Lu Xiang saw the USB drive in Song Shijing’s hand and her heart jumped.","Gu Zheng curled his lips. “Lu Xiang, Huang Lilan... Guess what’s inside?”","Gu Zheng curled his lips. “Lu Xiang, Huang Lilan. Guess what’s inside?”","Huang Lilan took a step back. “It’s just a USB drive Gu Zheng, did you fake an","audio recording? Tm your biological mother, so I won’t harm you. Don’t put up","a fight anymore!”","Lu Xiang hurriedly chimed in, That’s right, Gu Zheng! It’s useless for you to","forge evidence. You have power and influence. This kind of thing isn’t difficult","for you.","Song Shijing ignored the crowd and went backstage of the banquet hall with","the USB drive.","Gu Zheng raised an eyebrow. “You two are wrong. It’s not an audio recording”","Huang Lilan’s expression softened a little. “Ah Zheng, as long as you apologize,","the Lu family will forgive you. Ive already been bearing the blame for you for","so long, so you should bear it yourself now. The Lu family already knows the","truth, so what’s the point of hiding it?","“You’re the richest man in the country now. You have power and influence.","Even if the matter is exposed, no one will say anything. How would they dare","to offend you? This won’t affect your career at all","Huang Lilan tried hard to persuade him before squeezing out a few hypocritical","tears.","Gu Weiming also said, “Ah Zheng, you’ve already grown up. What right do you","have to make your mother bear the infamy for you? Ever since your mother","entered the family, she has been called a mistress. It’s time for her to clear her","name.","“You’re now powerful. It doesn’t matter if you have some dirt on you.”","“But Lilan.” Gu Weiming frowned. “She doesn’t have any shares or status.","We’re the only ones who have been criticized by others for the past 20 years.","Can you bear to see her be despised by others for the rest of her life? As long as","you admit to this incident, your mother will be innocent.","“Lu Yan has already acknowledged his ancestors, while Lilan and Lu Yan have a","good relationship. The Lu family won’t bicker with you about the past on the","account of your mother as long as you apologize and give up your position as","the heir. But you still won’t agree? What else do you want?”","Qjao Xi was angered to the point of laughing. If Gu Zheng had really done what","they claimed, then it was understandable for him to admit it, but they were","clearly framing him.","From the perspective of the Gu family, Gu Zheng was in a high position and","had great authority. It would not matter even if he had a stain on his","reputation. However, it was different for Huang Lilan. She had no authority or","power, so she could not bear such a crime. Why could Gu Zheng not take the","blame for his biological mother?","However, was that b*tch Huang Lilan worthy of being Gu Zheng’s biological","mother?","Huang Lilan continued, “Ah Zheng, be good. Are you trying to force me to my","death?","“Madam Gu, why aren’t you letting Ah Zheng take out the evidence? Why do","you have to make him admit to something he didn’t do?","At this moment, Qjao Xi’s aura was fully released as she slowly walked up the","stage.","She raised her head high and observed Gu Weiming’s and Huang Lilan’s vicious","faces. “You’re pushing all the blame to Ah Zheng. Do you still have any shame?","“Shut up! You don’t have the right to speak here!” Old Master Lu fiercely","slammed the table and pointed at Qjao Xi as he cursed. Gu Zheng was about to","cave into the pressure and confess, yet this b*tch appeared!","Qjao Xi was not angry when she heard this, and she smiled indifferently. “Old","Master Lu, what’s the rush?! Are you not letting me speak because you’re","feeling guilty about something?","Lu Xiang’s expression changed. “Qjao Xi, this isn’ta place for you to speak.","You’re Gu Zheng’s wife, so of course, you have to protect him and defend him..","There’s no meaning to your actions!”"]},{"number":395,"title":"Chapter 395 - Surveillance Footage From 20 Years Ago","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","“I want to protect Gu Zheng.” Qjao Xi was frank.","Huang Lilan gritted her teeth. “You don’t have evidence, so what you say","doesn’t count!”","Qjao Xi smiled meaningfully. “Madam Gu, there’s indeed no audio recording in","our hands, but we have the surveillance footage. I think you would recall","something at the mention of this!”","Huang Lilan’s heart skipped a beat as she subconsciously looked at Old Master","Lu.","Impossible!","How could Gu Zheng have the surveillance footage? At that time, the Lu family","had already sent someone to delete it. They even found a top hacker to delete","It was guaranteed that it could never be restored.","That person was a top figure in the Dark Net Organization. At that time, he","promised that only the hacker Mo Yuan had the ability to recover the footage.","No one else but him had the ability to do so.","However, Mo Yuan was a mysterious figure who was hard to reach out to. Even","if one had money, they would not be able to hire him.","Moreover, she heard that Mo Yuan and Gu Zheng had a grudge against each","other and they lost contact. It was impossible for Mo Yuan to help Gu Zheng","recover the surveillance footage.","This was impossible! Everything was fake!","Qjao Xi was definitely scaring her. How could the surveillance footage be","restored? This was Gu Zheng’s usual method of destroying his opponents","psychological defenses so that they would expose themselves.","Huang Lilan heaved a sigh of relief.","What was there to be afraid of? It was all a cover! If Gu Zheng really had","evidence, he would have taken it out a long time ago. Why did he have to wait","until now? He was clearly bluffing so that everyone would believe that he was","wronged.","On the other side, Song Shijing had arrived backstage.","Huang Lilan was sure that Gu Zheng did not have any evidence, so she","pretended to be sad and continued acting. “Ah Zheng, how did you become like","this? It’s my fault. I shouldn’t have taken the blame for you, causing you to be","so irresponsible!”","Everyone whispered, “I heard that Madam Gu doesn’t like her son very much","and has always scolded President Gu. A mistress is indeed vicious. Even a","vicious tiger won’t eat its cubs, but she treats her son so cruelly.”","“But is there a possibility that President Gu was too naughty and mischievous","when he was young, so that’s why Huang Lilan treated him that way? She","didn’t want him to go astray, so she beat and scolded him to warn him?","President Gu made use of reporters to provoke Eldest Miss Lu when he was just","six years old. He even forced Chairman Gu to admit his identity. Such a child","was too scary.","Song Shijing had already inserted the USB drive, and the big screen suddenly lit","up.","Huang Lilan and the Lu family were standing on stage with their backs facing","the big screen, so they did not see the contents of the video.","Huang Lilan’s eyes were filled with tears. “Ah Zheng, everyone already knows","about what happened in the past. Don’t keep putting up a fight. It’s useless.","Apologize and admit your mistake at once. It’s a good thing for you too. You”","“Look!” A surprised shout from below the stage interrupted Huang Lilan’s","words.","The entire banquet hall erupted.","This must be the surveillance footage!”","“Look, there’s the time stamp up there! Is this.. the surveillance footage from","20 years ago? Is this the hospital?”","A ward was indeed shown on the video. Although the image was a little blurry,","one could still clearly see human faces and hear voices.","Lu Qingyun was the eldest daughter of the Lu family and the first wife in the","Gu family. Hence, when she was hospitalized, the Lu family had arranged the","most luxurious ward for her. It had a full set of facilities, and the surveillance","cameras were also of the latest model of that time.","However, why were there surveillance cameras in the ward? The hospital did","not have the right to install surveillance cameras in the ward to monitor","patients. This did not make sense.","However, everyone did not care about this because someone appeared on the","screen right at that moment.","Huang Lilan!","At this moment, Huang Lilan, who was on the stage, did not understand what","was going on. She was still crying aggrievedly and leaning against Gu Weiming","weakly, complaining about how unfilial and selfish Gu Zheng was.","However, the Huang Lilan in the surveillance footage appeared arrogant. She","walked straight to Eldest Miss Lu’s bed and slammed a few sheets of paper on","her face","On the stage, Huang Lilan was still looking at Gu Zheng and begging, “Ah","Zheng, admit your mistake! I know you hate me and blame me for always","hitting and scolding you when you were young. However, I only hit and scolded","you when you did something wrong. You killed Eldest Miss Lu but you never","regretted it. That’s why T’m punishing you!","“Tm a woman too. When I think of Eldest Miss Lu’s death, I feel heartbroken","“Lu Qingyun! You b*tch! You’re about to die, so why don’t you just divorce","Weiming?! If you can’t have children, what’s the point of occupying the","position as Madam Gu?"]},{"number":396,"title":"Chapter 396 - Are You Worthy Of Gu Zheng’s Filial Piety?","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor Henyee Translations","The woman’s roar sounded from the surveillance cameras and interrupted","Huang Lilan’s hypocritical performance.","Why did this voice sound so familiar","Huang Lilan immediately swallowed the words in her throat and suddenly","turned around. When she saw the scene in the video, her face turned pale.","Everyone looked up and was equally dumbfounded.","“Lu Qingyun, you’re about to die. You won’t have the chance to have children","anymore. If the Gu family doesn’t have an heir in the future, you’ll become the","greatest sinner!","“You useless woman! You can’t help the Gu family, but I’m better than you. I","have an outstanding son. It’s because of you that he can’t acknowledge his","ancestors. Iadvise you to be sensible. Im the one Weiming likes. Hurry up and","die. Give me the position of Madam Gu!","These words were like knives stabbed deeply into Lu Qingyun’s heart.","Everyone stared at the surveillance footage. The woman’s face was pale, and","her beautiful face was filled with sorrow. Everyone’s hearts ached when they","saw this.","In the surveillance footage, a group of reporters suddenly rushed in with","microphones and cameras aimed at the seriously ill woman.","Eldest Miss Lu, will you give up your position to Madam Huang?","I heard that you and Mr. Gu are in a business marriage and your relationship","isn’t genuine. Now that Mr. Gu has found his true love, can you fulfill their","wish to be together?","“Madam Huang has already given birth to Mr. Gu’s child. The child is innocent","If the child can’t acknowledge his ancestors, he’ll have to wander outside for","the rest of his life. Eldest Miss Lu, you should at least think about the child,","right?","At first, everyone was still worried about Lu Qingyun’s serious illness.","However, later on, they increasingly went overboard as they continued to","accuse Lu Qingyun of breaking up the unlucky couple. She could not even give","birth to a child herself yet wanted to occupy the position of Madam Gu.","After the reporters left, Huang Lilan crossed her arms and said arrogantly, “Lu","Qingyun, whether you give way or not, the position of Madam Gu is mine! I","even want to snatch your son away and make him suffer in my hands. You","btch! Hurry up and die","The last sentence caused the sick Lu Qingyun to break down completely!","At this moment, Huang Lilan’s face was pale and her body was trembling.","How could Gu Zheng have the surveillance footage? The hacker the Lu family","found back then said that only Mo Yuan could recover it. It was impossible for","others to do it. Wait..","Now was not the time to think about this. It was time to explain herself.","Huang Lilan’s psychological defense completely collapsed. She screamed","crazily, “No! It’s not true! I didn’t do it!","She glared fiercely at Gu Zheng and shouted, “Gu Zheng! To protect yourself,","you actually fabricated a video to frame your biological mother! You unfilial","son!”","“Unfilial? Qjao Xi raised her eyebrows. “Madam Gu, do you think you’re worthy","of Gu Zheng’s filial piety?","Everyone gasped.","Qjao Xi sneered. “Madam Gu has been hitting and scolding Ah Zheng since he","was young. She even often locked him in a small dark room and refused to give","him food or water. Are you worthy of Gu Zheng’s piety, Madam Gu? Which","biological mother would abuse her biological son like this?","“Madam Gu, when it comes to forgery, I have some opinions on that.”","Qjao Xi’s expression was calm. “Eldest Miss Lu has been dead for 20 years.","There’s even a time stamp on the surveillance footage. These reporters can also","look into it. Even high-end technology won’t be able to produce such realistic","surveillance footage.","“You’ll probably say that it’s all edited. That’s possible, but the words said","match your mouth movements in the footage exactly. Moreover, your actions","at that time were clearly a provocation.”","Qiao Xi’s words directly destroyed all of Madam Gu’s excuses.","Huang Lilan was stunned on the spot and felt weak all over","No! There must be another excuse!","“You’ve misunderstood. That’s not what I meant.”","Huang Lilan thought for a long time and gritted her teeth. She braced herself","and said, “T did it all for Ah Zheng. It was Ah Zheng who asked me to do that.","He used his life to threaten me and said that if I didn’t do that, he didn’t want","to live anymore. I was put in a very difficult position back then. I couldn’t bear","to hurt Eldest Miss Lu, but I also couldn’t watch my son die. That’s why I","rushed to the ward and said those words to Eldest Miss Lu!","Huang Lilan cried aggrievedly. I was forced to do it! Ah Zheng, you were the","one who said that Eldest Miss Lu sent someone to hurt you. I couldn’t take it","lying down either, so I said those words. Why is everyone blaming me now?"]},{"number":397,"title":"Chapter 397 - You Promised Me That You Wouldn’t Die","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Everyone’s eyes were filled with confusion.","Lu Xiang’s face darkened as she hurriedly explained, “Madam Gu, you have a point. So many years have passed—”","“There’s another video!”","Someone shouted, and everyone’s eyes landed on the big screen again. “This? The person in the video is President Gu when he was six years old?”","Everyone felt as though their eyes were burning.","The child who slowly walked into the ward was Gu Zheng. He was so calm.","‘What was Gu Zheng doing in Eldest Miss Lu’s ward? Was it really as Huang Lilan had said? Did he want to hurt Eldest Miss Lu?","However, Eldest Miss Lu, was not against his arrival. She struggled to sit up and said gently, “Ah Zheng, you’re here.”","Gu Zheng was small, but his eyes were filled with deep sorrow.","In the years before, he had been living with Huang Lilan. After enduring Huang Lilan’s beatings, scoldings, and destruction, he had already lost his childlike nature and developed a cold and heartless character.","However, in front of Lu Qingyun, he was a little flustered and at a loss. His eyes were filled with worry. “They said you’re sick. Is it serious?”","Lu Qingyun’s gray eyes were a little more colorful. “Good child, did you come to see me because you learned that I was sick?”","The young Gu Zheng lowered his eyes. “I heard that... my mother made you angry. They even said you were going to die.”","Lu Qingyun’s eyes were red. She said gently, “Good child, come to me.”","Gu Zheng walked to the bed obediently. Lu Qingyun struggled to get up and opened her arms to hug him. “This has nothing to do with you. Good child, I don’t know why I feel so close to you when I see you. Don’t always show a cold expression, okay? Smile more, alright?”","‘These words instantly made the young Gu Zheng’s eyes turn red. The usually cold and heartless child suddenly choked. “You... Can you not die...”","Lu Qingyun was silent for a while, her eyes filled with loneliness. She held back her tears and gently rubbed his little face. She smiled sadly. “Alright, I’ll try my best to live.”","The scene changed. Ten days later, Lu Qingyun’s body was lying on the hospital bed. It was already stiff, but her face was still so beautiful.","Gu Zheng was curled up in a corner, biting his fingers and sobbing softly. His tears kept flowing, but he was the only one crying in the ward. Everyone else was laughing, and his mother, Huang Lilan, was laughing especially hard.","After everyone left, Gu Zheng leaned forward and hugged Lu Qingyun’s cold body. He held her hand tightly. “You promised me that you wouldn’t die. You lied to me...”","Looking at the surveillance footage, Qiao Xi’s eyes turned red while her heart ached. She felt as if something bitter was about to surge out of her throat.","This scene also moved the guests present. Those noblewomen shed tears.","“How unexpected. President Gu and Eldest Miss Lu actually had such a deep relationship.”","“Eldest Miss Lu was already diagnosed with depression then and had to endure the torture it brought upon her. However, she was so gentle when facing President Gu. It’s obvious that Eldest Miss Lu liked President Gu a lot!”","“The surveillance footage can’t be faked. Huang Lilan clearly ran to the hospital to agitate Eldest Miss Lu, but she pushed all the responsibility to President Gu! She didn’t hesitate to sacrifice her son to clear her name!”","Everyone stared at Huang Lilan in disdain.","“Why is Huang Lilan still pretending?! She was the one who found those reporters. If she hadn’t gone to the hospital to agitate Eldest Miss Lu, she wouldn’t have died!”","“She was the one who went to agitate Eldest Miss Lu first! She was the one who caused Miss Lu’s death, but she pushed the blame to her son! How can there be such a disgusting woman?!”","“She even said that she beat and scolded President Gu because he caused the death of Eldest Miss Lu, but she was clearly the one responsible for Eldest Miss Lu’s death. Doesn’t Huang Lilan know that? If she really wanted to atone for her sins, she would have killed herself to apologize to Eldest Miss Lu in","the afterlife!”","Everyone cursed her.","Huang Lilan’s body went soft and she almost fell to the floor. She looked at them in horror while shouting crazily, “The video is fake! Gu Zheng is framing me!”","“Madam Gu, the evidence is right in front of you. Are you still going to deny it?”","“Old Master Lu, Second Miss Lu, now that the truth is out, shouldn’t you apologize as well?”"]},{"number":398,"title":"Chapter 398 - The Surveillance Camera Was Installed By Eldest Miss Lu Herself","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor:","Henyee Translations","Apologize to Gu Zheng?","Old Master Lu’s expression changed. He was an elder. How could he apologize to a junior?","Before the Lu family could speak, the people below the stage were indignant. “Why would Old Master Lu apologize? The Lu family and Huang Lilan are clearly in cahoots. They conspired to kill Eldest Miss Lu, which is why they’re so close. Maybe the Lu family let Huang Lilan kill Eldest Miss Lu!”","Old Master Lu widened his eyes abruptly and retorted, “Nonsense! How could I harm my own daughter?”","“Then tell me, where was the Lu family when Huang Lilan broke into the ward with the reporters?”","The person said word by word, “Don’t tell me that you weren’t there at that time. According to what I know, Eldest Miss Lu was in Li City’s most luxurious private hospital. There would be dozens of security guards at the entrance of the hospital and more security guards patrolling outside the ward. How","could they have let these people in?","“However, not only did Huang Lilan manage to barge in but she also brought a group of reporters to agitate Eldest Miss Lu. Eldest Miss Lu was so angry that she became severely depressed. Even so, the Lu family did not appear and no one came to stop them either?”","“That’s right! Miss Lu Xiang, didn’t you say that when President Gu provoked Eldest Miss Lu, you all saw it with your own eyes? However, President Gu and Eldest Miss Lu were clearly very close, so you’re all lying! That’s why we have reason to suspect that Eldest Miss Lu’s death was caused by all of you!","“Otherwise, why are you so close to a mistress? And why did you malign President Gu?”","Old Master Lu’s expression darkened as he clenched his fists.","Lu Xiang’s body trembled. She could not explain herself and could only cry out, “Gu Zheng! You’re framing us! This is all fake! You’re simply too sinister!”","“So what if he appeared in the footage? It’s fake! He’s so rich. He must have found some top technical personnel to fake the surveillance footage!”","Lu Xiang gritted her teeth and shouted, “My sister was killed by you! Gu Zheng, you devil!”","Old Master Lu knew that the Lu family was already in the middle of the storm. He absolutely could not admit to this matter and could only bite the bullet to retort. Moreover, Huang Lilan was on the same boat as them. They had to speak up for Huang Lilan and deal with Gu Zheng together.","If Huang Lilan could get rid of this scourge, Gu Zheng, it would definitely be a great thing for the Lu family.","Old Master Lu sneered. “I never installed any surveillance cameras in the ward, so where did this surveillance footage come from? Gu Zheng, you faked this, right? Otherwise, why don’t you tell me where the surveillance footage came from?","“Surveillance cameras are not allowed in hospital wards. How could our Lu family allow others to install a surveillance camera in my daughter’s ward? Hence, the footage is all fake!”","The atmosphere instantly became serious.","Everyone was also confused. The videos they saw just now did not look like they were fake, but Old Master Lu insisted that there were no surveillance cameras installed in the ward. Who was telling the truth?","“Old Master Lu, the truth is that you don’t care about your daughter.”","Gu Zheng smirked, his eyes filled with mockery. “Old Master Lu, you don’t know the story behind this surveillance camera?”","Everyone widened their eyes and waited anxiously for Gu Zheng to continue.","Who was the one who installed this surveillance camera? Was it the Lu family or the Gu family?","Or.","Unexpectedly, Gu Zheng said slowly, “Eldest Miss Lu installed it herself.”","‘What? Lu Qingyun installed it?","Lu Qingyun was a seriously ill woman. Why would she install a surveillance camera in the ward?","“Unfortunately, the surveillance camera broke the day before she died, so her death was not recorded.”","Old Master Lu gasped, his eyelids trembling.","“From the surveillance footage, we can clearly see that Second Miss Lu and Eldest Miss Lu were not on good terms. Old Master Lu never appeared even once when his daughter was seriously ill and about to die.”","“L really don’t understand why the Lu family keeps saying that they love Eldest Miss Lu. If they really cared about her, why didn’t they come to visit her? Where was the Lu family when she was bullied?”","Old Master Lu’s face darkened. He refused to be outdone. “What right do you have to say that the surveillance footage was installed by Qingyun? Do you have evidence?”","Gu Zheng’s long fingers tapped on the table, then he pointed to the bottom of the video. There was an inconspicuous name on it. “That! Is that evidence enough for you?”"]},{"number":399,"title":"Chapter 399 - Mo Yuan Is The Evidence","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Everyone stared.","Mo Yuan?","Gu Zheng’s voice was low. “Everyone can see it. This is the surveillance footage that Mo Yuan recovered. I also have the video of Eldest Miss Lu buying the surveillance camera. Do I need to show it to everyone? Old Master Lu, what other evidence do you want?”","Everyone was shocked.","Mo Yuan!","Rumor had it that he was a top hacker and would not easily investigate things on behalf of others. No matter how much money one gave him, it was impossible to bribe him. Unless he was willing, no one could force him. Most importantly, he would never fake a video.","Back then, there was a rich man who asked Mo Yuan for help in falsifying evidence. He had already offered Mo Yuan a price of 100 million yuan, but Mo Yuan did not even bother to reply to him with a punctuation mark. The other party continued to increase the price, causing Mo Yuan to directly acquire","the other party’s company.","From then on, Mo Yuan’s name resounded throughout the world.","Aman who could not be bribed with money had produced such powerful evidence this time. It was enough to prove the authenticity of the evidence.","The corners of Old Master Lu’s mouth twitched.","Everyone nodded. If it was really Mo Yuan, then everything must be real.","Gu Zheng smiled meaningfully. He held a glass of red wine in his hand as he took a sip. He said casually, “If you think there’s not enough evidence, Old Master Lu, I still have a lot. I can show them all to you.","“However, on the account that you’re Eldest Miss Lu’s father, I’ll save some dignity for you. I don’t want to go too far either. If we take out all the evidence, the Lu family might not even have the face to live anymore. What do you think?”","Old Master Lu glared fiercely at Gu Zheng. He gritted his teeth and finally swallowed his anger.","Gu Zheng was the same as Lu Qingyun. They were both crazy!","Everyone could also see the look of embarrassment and restraint on Old Master Lu’s face. After President Gu took out the evidence Mo Yuan gave, no one in the Lu family dared to retort anymore.","This meant that President Gu’s evidence was real.","Qiao Xi said in a timely manner, “Actually, Old Master Lu and Miss Lu Xiang didn’t really like Miss Lu Qingyun. I heard that Lu Xiang and Eldest Miss Lu are half-sisters. Miss Lu Xiang and Huang Lilan are so close because...”","What was it? Suddenly, everyone came to a realization!","“Lremember now. Back then, Eldest Miss Lu’s fiance was originally President Jiang, but for some reason, the person who married President Jiang in the end was Lu Xiang. In the end, Eldest Miss Lu married President Gu?”","“Say, Eldest Miss Lu was seriously ill. Why do you think she had to install a surveillance camera in her ward?”","Everyone was terrified and asked in disbelief, “Could it be that it was because she thought she’d be killed at any time? Was that why she installed a surveillance camera behind the Lu family’s back? That was her way of leaving evidence behind.”","“Then how did Eldest Miss Lu die? If she committed suicide, it was surely because of Huang Lilan. However, not only did the Lu family not blame Huang Lilan but they’re also very close to her? I suddenly think...”","Although that person did not finish their sentence, everyone knew what they meant.","Old Master Lu was so angry that his whole body was trembling. No one had ever confronted him like this in public without leaving him with any dignity.","Even though he was going against Gu Zheng, he was Gu Zheng’s grandfather, after all. However, Gu Zheng did not know when to stop. He was unfilial! Such a junior could not be spared!","1","However, both parties were in a deadlock now. If he continued to retort, with Gu Zheng’s character, he would definitely take out the remaining evidence. If the matter blew up, the Lu family’s business would definitely be affected.","Old Master Lu suppressed his anger and sighed helplessly. “I didn’t know that Qingyun installed a surveillance camera in the ward. I misunderstood President Gu regarding the previous incident. I’ve let Qingyun down too. I didn’t know that she was in trouble.”","Lu Xiang gritted her teeth and refused to apologize to Gu Zheng. If she really apologized to Gu Zheng, then all her previous arrangements would be in vain.","Most importantly, the Lu family would not be able to use the excuse of Gu Zheng causing Eldest Miss Lu’s death to deal with him in the future. The Lu family would have no excuse to do anything to Gu Zheng after this!","She had been planning this for so long, but Gu Zheng ruined everything with just surveillance footage!","“Second Miss Lu, are you unwilling to apologize?” How could Qiao Xi let this vicious woman off? She asked her directly.."]},{"number":400,"title":"Chapter 400 - Wouldn’t It Be More Fun To Let The Dogs Fight Each Other?","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","“Then why don’t you explain why you said that you were on good terms with Eldest Miss Lu but didn’t visit her when she was seriously ill and instead got so close to Huang Lilan, the person who caused your sister’s death?","“Now that the truth is out, it’s clear Huang Lilan was the murderer who indirectly caused Eldest Miss Lu’s death. Could it be that Second Miss Lu still wants to keep in contact with Huang Lilan and defend her?”","Everyone looked at Lu Xiang in disdain.","Who said that Huang Lilan was innocent and kind-hearted? Who said it was all Gu Zheng’s fault? It was Eldest Miss Lu’s biological sister, Lu Xiang!","Lu Xiang knew that Huang Lilan was the one who caused Lu Qingyun’s death, but she was not angry at all. This was because she already knew the truth. She also wanted Lu Qingyun to die. Even if no one else did anything, she would have killed Lu Qingyun herself sooner or later.","Lu Xiang’s face darkened. Faced with everyone’s questioning and disdainful gazes, her body kept trembling,","No, no!","The good reputation that she had painstakingly built could not be ruined just because of Huang Lilan!","Lu Xiang looked up again and glared fiercely at Huang Lilan.","Huang Lilan’s heart skipped a beat as her eyes were filled with horror. “Lu Xiang, what are you doing—”","“You caused my sister’s death!” Lu Xiang interrupted Huang Lilan with a roar. Then, she accused, “I really didn’t expect you to be the murderer who caused my sister’s death. My sister was so beautiful and kind, but you were actually so heartless, You lied to me. You said that all of this was Gu Zheng’s idea!”","With that, she pushed all the blame to Huang Lilan.","The corners of Qiao Xi’s mouth curled up.","To announce Gu Zheng’s true identity and find the culprit who killed Eldest Miss Lu required a lot of evidence. It was not the time yet, but they only needed a video to deal with Huang Lilan.","They did not even need to do anything, Wouldn’t it be more fun to let the dogs fight each other?","Lu Xiang’s sharp nails dug into her palms as her eyes turned red. “I... I was deceived by Huang Lilan. She said that President Gu provoked my sister and made it sound so convincing. At that time, my father and I were busy with the company’s matters and neglected to take care of my sister, so we believed","Huang Lilan’s words.","“My father and I are in the wrong. It was our fault for not protecting my sister well. For the past 20 years, I’ve been blaming myself every day. However, I didn’t expect that Huang Lilan was not only a mistress but she also deceived our Lu family. She’s simply too much!”","Lu Xiang heaved a sigh of relief. In this situation, she could only push all the responsibility to Huang Lilan to clear the Lu family’s name.","Huang Lilan could not believe it. “Lu Xiang, you...”","Qiao Xi smiled and looked at the man at the side. “Mr. Lu.”","Everyone’s eyes landed on Lu Yan.","Qiao Xi’s eyes were filled with provocation. “Mr. Lu, don’t you want to say something?”","Huang Lilan’s heart jumped. She had a bad feeling about this.","Qiao Xi said slowly, “You’ve seen the surveillance footage too, right? As Eldest Miss Lu’s biological son, don’t you want to say anything after learning the truth of your mother’s death?","“Just listen to what Huang Lilan is saying. She was the one who caused Eldest Miss Lu’s death, but you seem to be very close to Huang Lilan? If Eldest Miss Lu finds out that her son is so close to her murderer, I don’t know how sad she’ll be!”","Lu Yan’s expression was indifferent, but Huang Lilan felt as if she had been struck by lightning.","“Qiao Xi! What are you trying to do? Shut up!”","Qiao Xi ignored him and said indifferently, “Am I wrong? Doesn’t everyone find it strange? Mr. Lu’s mother was killed by Huang Lilan, but Mr. Lu isn’t sad or angry at all. If it’s not because Mr. Lu is known for being heartless, I would suspect that you’re not Eldest Miss Lu’s biological son","“But Madam Gu’s instead... Hiss!”","Qiao Xi blinked. “Madam Gu has been mistreating Gu Zheng since the beginning. She even helped Lu Yan fight for the inheritance. Could it be that she feels guilty because she caused Eldest Miss Lu’s death back then?","“Mr. Lu, it’s fine for you to fight for the inheritance, but you’re so close to the person who killed your mother. You’re heartless!”","Lu Yan’s eyes darkened.","Huang Lilan’s expression was ferocious. “Qiao Xi! Don’t try to drive a wedge between me and Ah Yan!”","Ah Yan was her biological son!","She had already endured not being able to acknowledge her biological son for 20 years. She could officially address each other as mother and son now, but Qiao Xi just had to label them as enemies and separate them.","‘This b*tch! I won’t let her off!’"]}]);
